window.FWN_BLACK_TECH_INTERNET_CAFE_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_BLACK_TECH_INTERNET_CAFE_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":401,"title":"Chapter 401 - The Female Dark Knight","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“The food in the shop is indeed delicious, but the quantity is limited!” Looking at the frustrated Jiang Xuan and his guards, Jiang Xiaoyue explained quietly with a guilty expression, “The shop doesn’t give anyone extra food!”","“It’s more than delicious!” Jiang Xuan commented with chopsticks in his hand. “A sip of Coke refreshed my mind; a mouthful of instant noodles purified my spiritual essence; one bite of the sausage energized my body; and the spicy sticks...”","“There’s more!” Zhen Yan looked at the milk tea in his hand, feeling stunned. “After one sip of this, I feel like the red flame energy in my body is much purer than before!”","Xue Ming, the other guard, held the small cup of milk tea in his huge, fan-sized hand and said in wonder, “There’s more! The Chilly Hell Scroll that I cultivate has a negative side effect on my body, and I have to take spiritual herbs to help me resist this effect but couldn’t remove the root cause. However, with one sip of this milk tea, the chilly energy in my body merged with this warm current. Now I feel none of the effect even if I don’t suppress it intentionally!”","“What?!” Zhen Yan almost stood up in shock","The Chilly Hell Scroll is very powerful, but its side effect is a big problem that even His Majesty can’t solve!","However, a cup of milk tea solved this problem!","How can the Deserted Sea Realm have such good stuff?!","Remembering the shop owner’s great strength, he sat back down before his butt left the couch.","Jiang Xuan stared at Mr. Fang with a serious expression. “Sir, can’t you make an exception? I can pay more for another bowl of instant noodles!”","Mr. Fang was unmoved while the people around them looked like they had anticipated this answer.","“Name your price!” Jiang Xuan said with a frown.","Seeing that Mr. Fang was still unmoved, Jiang Xuan walked to Jiang Xiaoyue and asked in a low voice, “Little sister... How can the shop owner do business like this? How come he refuses to sell more food?! You’re close to him; can’t you ask him to sell one more bowl to me?!”","“What are you talking about?!” Jiang Xiaoyue said sulkily, “Even I can only have one bowl!”","“What?!” It was a piece of painful news.","However...","Jiang Xuan asked in a deep voice, “What’s the background of the shop owner? Didn’t they mention a... senior?”","“Are they bluffing? They are, right?” Zhen Yan asked, “Could it be that there are seniors in this shop?!”","“Of course, we do.” At this topic, Jiang Xiaoyue got excited. “For example, the heavenly sword spirit that the shop owner just used comes from Senior No Name; the sword control technique comes from Senior Liquor Sword Immortal; Senior Nalan’s Sword 23 comes from the Old Sword Saint, and it can suppress space with one sword technique, trapping everyone inside!”","“Ugh...” They felt goosebumps all over their bodies. Jiang Xuan said in disbelief, “Can it... really suppress space?”","“Of course!” Jiang Xiaoyue snorted smugly, “Wherever the sword spirit of Sword 23 goes, nothing but the mind can move! People can only wait there to be butchered!”","Then, she showed them two moves from Saint Spiritual Sword Techniques.","They exchanged a look.","Could it be that such techniques really exist?!","After all, most of the cultivators could only create spatial arrays with the Law of Space. The more powerful people could build teleportation arrays, and the spatial techniques that could be used in battle were all extremely powerful.","Jiang Xuan was surprised that someone in this place could use the Law of Space in battle, and this guy was even a warrior!","“Humph! It’s not surprising for an ultimate master to suppress space,” Jiang Xuan said with a snort, “But I’m surprised that there are such people in this place!”","“It’s our fault that we didn’t pay a visit to the seniors when we arrived,” Jiang Xuan said, “Can you introduce us to them?”","– Half an hour later –","“You mean there are more powerful figures?!” Jiang Xuan exclaimed, “The master named Dante can even control time?!”","They all stood up, having never felt so shocked before.","“Yeah.” Jiang Xiaoyue was smug. “I’m playing Devil May Cry 3 too. Uncle Dante is so dashing!”","“Ugh...” They looked at each other, and then Jiang Xuan asked, “Can we meet this Senior Dante?”","...","– Three hours later –","The three people finally got online after waiting in line for so long. “I didn’t know people must wait in line to see Senior Dante!”","Under Jiang Xiaoyue’s guidance, they began the cheerful journey in Devil May Cry 3.","“Hey! Ha! Heha!”","On the screens, the three of them swung the big swords wildly.","“No! No! It’s not fun to fight this way.” Then, Jiang Xiaoyue showed them a fancy combo.","– A while later –","“Humph! I’ve finally reached that Demonic Horse Geryon too!” Controlling Dante, Jiang Xiaoyue was quite smug, and she said while showing off, “After this stage, I, too, can understand the Law of Time!”","“We can do this?!” Jiang Xuan and his guards looked at each other.","“By the way, Shu Mountain is very good too! I’ll show it to you later!” With great pride, Jiang Xiaoyue recommended the good stuff to them one by one as if she were showing the collections of her family.","The three men were at a loss for words.","What on earth had happened to the Deserted Sea Realm?!","Have we fallen behind or has the world changed too fast?!","...","– Meanwhile in the Nanhua Faction –","The Forbidden Place in the back mountain of Nanhua Faction was no longer there. After the reconstruction of the Nanhua Faction, a simple and quiet cottage appeared at the peak of the back mountain of the faction.","Standing in the courtyard, Shui Xianyun held her breath, and her pale face turned red.","“Devil Trigger!” With a shout, a big surge of black essence rushed out of her body, and tiny, dense scales grew on her crystal-like arms and neck. Even her pupils turned red.","Her smooth forehead slightly bulged while two black horns stuck out. A weird smile appeared on her face.","Then, her expression changed, and a ton of black essence flowed back into her body like a whale sucking in water. Pale-faced, she exhaled deeply and murmured, “This force is still difficult to control... After playing Devil May Cry for so long, I still can’t fully master it. It seems like I need to play it some more.”","– Meanwhile in Half City –","The fancy estate to the east of Heaven-Hiding Pavilion was the residence of a demonic woman; no one dared to venture inside to disturb her.","However, creepy laughter was always floating out of the mansion lately.","“Hahahahaha! It’s amazing that this shop has such a method to control the weird force in my body,” A charming voice came from the depth of the estate.","It was a snow-white building as grand as a palace.","– Inside the grand hall of the mansion that was luxuriously decorated –","“Aya... I’m no longer pretty in this form. I’d better change back...”","A huge green tail slowly shrank, and a human figure with beautiful curves gradually appeared in the grand hall. A pair of white, jade-like feet were revealed under the long green dress. While the fangs retracted into her mouth, her green eyes looked surprised.","Now she looked completely like a human.","“Humph!” Soon, two fangs showed themselves again, and her face returned to chilliness. “Tomorrow, I’ll learn the Devil Trigger combo from the shop owner. Soon, I will become the No.1 Dark Knight in this world!”","She yawned lazily and remembered that she must learn Orochi Divine Light. “I feel like I don’t have enough time to learn all this stuff...”"]},{"number":402,"title":"Chapter 402 - Entering the World Stage","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Hehe!” After leading her big brother and his two guards into the game and getting them on the path of ‘addiction’, Jiang Xiaoyue was quite happy. While she looked at Jiang Xuan who was engrossed in the game, she hummed while she skipped around, “Don’t need to go to school! Don’t need to go to school!”","“Aya!” she exclaimed when she skipped past Mr. Fang.","“Boss, why did you grab my collar?!” She looked back and glared at Mr. Fang in anger.","“Did I say that you don’t have to go to school?” Mr. Fang said solemnly.","“Ugh?!” Jiang Xiaoyue gaped and looked at Fang Qi in surprise.","“What do you mean by ‘Ugh’?!” Sitting on the couch, Mr. Fang looked serious, which was quite rare.","“I’m doing fine in the shop. Why should I go to school?” Jiang Xiaoyue snorted and said, “What’s so good about going to school? I can learn more here.”","“Of course, you can learn more in this shop than in school,” Mr. Fang said, “So you plan to watch the shop for me all your life?","“If you do, you must stay here while I go out and have fun,” Mr. Fang said.","“No!” Jiang Xiaoyue disagreed immediately while shouting, “I want to go out and play too!”","She got suspicious. After making several turns around Mr. Fang, she said in pleasant surprise, “Boss, do you plan to go out for fun?! I want to go too!”","Although she wouldn’t be able to eat the delicious snacks while being out to play, it was a bit boring sometimes to sit at the counter each day playing games and act as a cashier. Sometimes, she indeed wanted to go out and check around.","However...","“What does it to do with going to school?!” Jiang Xiaoyue said, “The Heavenly Academy is so far away! I might not be able to come back if I go there!”","It was difficult to make the journey back. She would have to cover the distance from the Heavenly Academy to the border where she had to be teleported to the Deserted Sea Realm through a special teleportation array. After which she must journey across the vast ocean to get to Dajin. One trip from the Heavenly Academy to Dajin would be tough.","It would be fine if she just went back home. However, if she went to school, she would have to do all kinds of boring and tedious homework. It was hard to say when she would get a chance to come back here.","“Please, I don’t want to go...” With a pout, the little girl grabbed Mr. Fang’s hand and begged and acted cute.","Mr. Fang was unmoved. “When I was your age, I was a Tri-Merit Student each year.”","[TL Note: In China, the ‘tri-merit’ student honor system tries to incentivize the students to obtain virtues of good morals, hard study, and sporting excellence.]","“Humph! What Tri-Merit Student?! You were still an elementary school student!” Jiang Xiaoyue ran to Jiang Xuan’s side after stomping her foot.","Jiang Xuan who was gaming saw Jiang Xiaoyue’s sulky face and said angrily, “Little Sister, did anyone bully you? Don’t worry; I’ll teach them a lesson for you!”","“It’s the damn, despicable boss!” Jiang Xiaoyue yelled, stomping her foot.","“Your boss...” Jiang Xuan was puzzled. “Weren’t you two on the same boat just a moment ago, and you even ditched me, your big brother?!”","“The boss told me to go to school! Sob...” Jiang Xiaoyue felt like crying. She had finally stopped her big brother from taking her home and making her to go to school, but now her boss betrayed her!","It was infuriating.","“Hahahaha!” Jiang Xuan was pleased. Despite my admiration for Brother Fang’s deep cultivation strength, powerful spiritual spells, and combat techniques, I thought he was unreasonable. But now, I know that I misunderstood him.","“Mr. Fang is a hero with a generous mind and great determination!” he quickly sang high praises of Fang Qi.","Then, he said, “I’ve just tried this Devil May Cry 3, and it’s indeed good. However, you’re still young, and there are many things that you can’t learn from the games, such as how to deal with people in society and life experiences. Besides, the elders in the Heavenly Academy will teach you according to your talent and interest and show you a system of detailed knowledge of everything. Tell me, Little Sister, how much of the blue flame of time in Devil May Cry 3 can you understand?”","Jiang Xiaoyue scratched her head in embarrassment. “It’s fuzzy. I can use it in the game but can understand nothing about it once I’m out of the game.”","“That’s what I mean,” Jiang Xuan said seriously. “You must start from the beginning. It’s not easy to understand a high-level law of nature.”","“Besides, the cultivation method of our Jiang Family is the result of hard efforts of many generations, and it’s the most fitting cultivation method for our bloodline; it is the origin of our Jiang Family, and we can’t just dump it just because.”","Jiang Xiaoyue seemed to have vaguely understood the reasons, but she just refused to go to school; she was on the verge of throwing a tantrum.","At this moment, she smelled the fragrance of spicy sticks.","Mr. Fang handed her a box of spicy sticks and said, “Eat some spicy sticks to calm yourself down.”","“Humph!” She averted her small face away from him.","Mr. Fang began eating with loud noises. “Wow... The spicy fragrance... The special flavor of the gluten and the crispness of the sesame seeds... It’s so tasty!”","A foodie, Jiang Xiaoyue couldn’t bear it anymore. “I want to eat! I want to eat!”","She wanted to grab the box of spicy sticks from Mr. Fang and eat everything herself.","“But...” While eating spicy sticks, she said with misery, “If I go to school, I can’t eat such tasty spicy sticks anymore!”","“I’ve decided,” Mr. Fang said with great passion, “My internet café will go out of the Deserted Sea Realm and enter the world stage!”","“!!!” Jiang Xiaoyue exclaimed in astonishment, “Boss, what did you say?!”","“I said that I plan to open internet cafés outside of the Deserted Sea Realm and enter the world stage!” Mr. Fang declared.","“Ahh!” Jiang Xiaoyue exclaimed, “Does it mean that I can play games and eat snacks after school?”","“Work hard on your sword control technique.” Mr. Fang said, “I think... it can be done.”","“Okay!” Jiang Xiaoyue finally relented. “Then, I’ll go to school reluctantly!”","Jiang Xuan wiped the sweat off his forehead in relief.","Also, he silently gave Mr. Fang a thumbs-up.","Mr. Fang finally coaxed the girl to agree to go to school!","At the same time, after hearing Mr. Fang’s declaration, he immediately asked, “Sir, you have a plan to open a branch?”","“Of course.” If there was no net, how could it be called the internet?","Mr. Fang began to imagine the scenario in which all the places in the world were connected by internet.","By that time, the big online games could be really called online games.","From the looks of it now, he still had a long way to go.","“Boss, when should we go out and open the branch?” Obviously, Jiang Xiaoyue couldn’t wait to begin.","Mr. Fang asked, “When will you go to that kindergarten?”","“Kinder...garten?!” Jiang Xiaoyue asked, “What is that? I’m going to the Heavenly Academy!”","“Ugh... Heavenly Kindergarten?” Mr. Fang scratched his head.","Jiang Xiaoyue was at a loss for words.","“In the spring of next year,” Jiang Xuan said, “The Heavenly Academy will start its new school year in the spring of next year.”","“Then, I’ll make some preparations and go there before spring.”"]},{"number":403,"title":"Chapter 403 - The Final Battle","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","After the schedule of Jiang Xiaoyue’s journey to the Heavenly Academy was determined, Jiang Xuan, who had nothing else to do, began playing games in the Origins Internet Café and became a regular customer of Mr. Fang’s shop.","At Jiang Xiaoyue’s recommendation, he mainly played Devil May Cry 3 and watched movies and TV Series such as Shu Mountain and Jade Dynasty in the meantime. From now on, a tall man and his two guards could be seen waiting outside the internet café before the shop was open each morning.","Although Half City, which was far away, was full of cultivators, there were many players of Devil May Cry 3. In addition, there were people putting lots of time and energy into the game since they wanted to become dark knights.","Besides playing Devil May Cry, Ning Bi also bought an electric guitar in her Qzone; it was a copy of Dante’s electric guitar.","She sent a message to Mr. Fang on QQ, [Sir, can you recommend to me some good songs that can be played on the guitar?]","[I want something more thrilling.] She added while also posting a screenshot in which a tall, brunette, fair-skinned beauty with green eyes wore a black long dress and was holding an electric guitar while canine teeth lightly pointed out of her mouth. She did have the feel of a guitarist in a band.","Mr. Fang touched his forehead and was at a loss for words.","At this moment, Ning Bi adjusted her electric guitar in Qzone and sang with self-complacency, “jung sing heung hei gwai ga dik seun hou; joi ta sang meng leui, fong fat dai dim hei heu...”","[TL Note: Translation – The clock bell chimes the signal to go home. In his life, there seems to carry a small sigh of regret.]","The song was nice to the ears when her elegant and aloof voice mingled with the sounds of the top-quality electric guitar made by the System.","On the other side, Shui Xianyun was alone in her courtyard.","She had bought the technique from the Wuwei Daoist Alliance and made two customized handguns, one black and one white. They had exquisite patterns on them, and they almost exactly looked like Dante’s two handguns.","On her back, she carried a meticulously-made big sword that was instilled with magical properties. On one side of the cross guard was a demon face, and on the other side was a human face, which was the same as the style of Dante’s sword.","The body of the sword was made with Deep Ocean Chilly Iron and created by the alliance of various factions using mimic techniques; The craftsmanship was reliable and trustworthy.","All kinds of spiritual artifact targets were randomly placed around her. Then, she copied Dante’s moves and fired both guns.","Crack! Crack...","A wave of intense gunshots rose.","Cross shooting!","Shooting backward and forward at the same time!","Then, she threw up a spiritual artifact target with her sword.","She condensed the spiritual essence in her body, and fierce blue flames appeared at the muzzles!","Spiritual Essence Bullets!","Crack! Crack...","She fired wildly.","Then, she leaped up and turned with her head facing the ground. While she turned, she fired repeatedly, and the bullets engulfed by pale blue light flew around as if a goddess were scattering flower petals. It was a beautiful sight as if many flowers were blooming and dancing in mid-air.","After withdrawing the guns, she stood still, looked dashing and cool.","Around her, the ground was covered by many bullet holes, the doors were shattered, and the plants were ruined. It was a dilapidated sight.","Then, she picked up the spiritual artifact targets from the ground.","They were as smooth as new; she missed them all!","Her clumsy marksmanship had reached a new height.","“...” Her face turned dark. Then, she quickly glanced around and felt relieved that no one saw her.","She heaved a sigh of relief.","“Senior Sister! Senior Sister!” At this moment, a voice came.","“...” Her face turned dark. “Why must she come here at this moment?!”","Crack! Crack!","Immediately, she shot each of the spiritual artifact targets at close range. When the Xichi Spiritual Master came into the courtyard, she saw Shui Xianyun who was in her white robe holding guns which still had smoke floating out of the muzzles.","“Senior Sister, you’re practicing your shooting skills?!” Xichi Spiritual Master looked around and saw that each spiritual artifact target had a bullet hole in the center. She quickly praised, “Excellent aim!”","With the aura of a master living beyond the mortal world, Shui Xianyun casually asked, “Junior Sister, what brought you here?”","“Senior Sister, have you forgotten that the shop owner will broadcast the last bit of Devil May Cry 3 this afternoon? He will be passing all stages!”","“Really?!” She immediately put things her away and got prepared. “Let’s go then!”","...","Each story would come to its end.","Devil May Cry brought the players fascinating battles and those fancy, stunning moves that could be used at lightning speed.","In the game, Fang Qi controlled Dante to defeat powerful bosses one by one. Following the steps of Dante and Vergil, Fang Qi traveled from the human world to the demon world.","The main character had noble and evil demon blood in his body; he was showy, elegant, and open-minded while remaining humane and kind. All these qualities made a deep impression in the players’ minds.","To pursue his father’s power, Vergil even broke the seal that his father had used to lock the demons and thus woke up the demons from deep slumber and opened the dimensional crack between the demon world and the human world.","Inside the portal to the demon world, horrifying demonic energy swept around in chaos.","The twins of the legendary dark knight chose different paths of life. One inherited their father’s strength while the other inherited their parents’ faith. Whenever the world lost its balance, and darkness threatened to envelop everything, a proud soul would always stand tall and go against the current of destruction even if the soul itself was born from darkness.","If the previous battles were only fights between brothers, this one was battle to the death.","All the players of Devil May Cry came early and took good seats in front of the big screens. Even though they were still far from clearing all stages, they didn’t mind watching the ‘stage-clearing video’ first.","In fact, while they played the game, many players focused their attention on fierce battles and the maniac study of the techniques, neglecting the plot. However, when they watched Mr. Fang play it, they could calmly experience the story.","This was the last battle between the brothers.","At this last stage, Vergil’s strength had grown so high that it could only be described as horrifying.","When he drew his katana... No, it couldn’t be called his drawing katana; no one saw him unsheathe it.","However, a horrifying saber light appeared before Mr. Fang’s Dante as if it had just crossed space and time!","“!!”","“What’s this saber technique?”","“How can he do this?!”","Many people in the audience exclaimed in astonishment.","Dimension Slash!","Vergil started the battle with such a horrifying move, and all the people in the audience felt a great pressure.","Different from Dante, Vergil was a dark knight, and he thought that using guns was an insult to him. He never used guns and only believed in using his sword. However, it didn’t mean that he couldn’t attack from the distance.","Dimension Slash was one of his range attach methods. Then, the audience saw something even more unbelievable.","The moment that Mr. Fang blocked the Dimension Slash, Vergil waved his hand, and the Yamato in his hand flew out like a beam of blue light!","“Sword control Technique?!”","“No. We should call it Saber Control Technique!”","“This guy is so awesome!”"]},{"number":404,"title":"Chapter 404 - The Beginning of the Special Chapter: Vergil’s Downfall","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Mr. Fang’s strength was more than enough to deal with the small demons and previous bosses and even show off some moves. However, he found that it was difficult to deal with Vergil even though he had leveled up most of Dante’s moves and skills to a high level.","“Hu...” Mr. Fang exhaled with some relief since he had worked hard in order to clear the game.","Fortunately, after the task of opening another branch shop started, the System had given him three days’ access to the Game Cultivation Room. Recently, after he did the livestream, he would go in the Game Cultivation Room and fight with Dante for a long time. As a result, he could better master some of Dante’s moves and skills and use them with more proficiency.","What is a battle? For many people, battles only meant killing, a way to show one’s strength, or protection.","However, in Devil May Cry, battles were more meaningful than that.","It was probably from this era on that the art of combat was presented before people!","The horrifying high speed left many ghost-like shadows on the screen. Like a ghost, Vergil moved as fast as his sword. When he sheathed Yamato and held the Force Edge with one hand, he turned into a blurry shadow and pierced through Dante like a flash.","Under Mr. Fang’s control, Dante shifted and dashed away. In the blink of an eye, he moved to another spot. Meanwhile, the spot that he was standing on before was attacked by many saber energies. Now, everyone realized that Vergil had attacked many times when he passed by Dante.","“The shop owner is so calm!”","“He would have been cut into pieces if he had been one second slower!”","The strike was so fast that the audience only knew what had happened in that instant just now!","After he missed the target, Vergil vanished after a blue light flashed.","Inside the portal leading to the demon world, endless demon energy surged up, and horrifying lightning bolts flashed in the crack in space.","In the next moment, a flash of saber light hacked down from the sky!","Then, with a crisp collision of weapons, Vergil vanished again.","Then came the second strike, the third...","Like thunderbolts, strikes came one after another from impossible angles. The moment that each of the struck fell, he vanished again and again.","The place was filled with dark demon energy, and the audience in front of the big screens saw only lightning-like saber energies hacking down; they couldn’t see any figures on the screens!","“Look at the shop owner!”","In exclamation, Fang Qi controlled Dante to pass through the lightning bolts casually as if he were wandering around. Whenever a saber light flashed, a sword light would appear as well. While the sword light and saber light collided and created many sparks, Dante remained intact!","“Oh my goodness!”","“Even Dante himself can’t fight better than this!”","“When did this kid achieve such proficiency with the dark knight’s combat skills?!” Even Nalan Hongwu was dazed.","“Excellent!” Lights flashed in Ning Bi’s eyes, proud that she could use this fancy combat style in the future.","At this moment, Vergil clearly changed his combat style after his last strike. When their weapons collided, a layer of blue sword light lit up around Vergil!","Summoned Sword!","When the circular sword array was launched, more than ten blue sword energies rotated around Vergil at a great speed, and their sharp blades threatened to shatter everything around them into pieces!","The audience was unprepared for this sudden change!","Meanwhile, Mr. Fang displayed and put up a fist technique pose.","“He changed to a fist technique?! What is this?!” Obviously, this was a fist technique that needed time to concentrate energy; he would be hit by his opponent’s Summoned Sword before he could launch his fist technique!","“Is it a mistake?!” All the people looked baffled.","Beowulf, a set of gauntlets, was transformed from a powerful demon which was a foe of Dark Knight Sparda; it contained horrifying strength. Before it was launched, the fist technique pose already condensed a layer of extremely powerful demonic energy before Dante.","Tink! Tink! Tink! Tink!","“It wasn’t a mistake! Absolutely not a mistake!”","“What do you mean?!” The new players of Devil May Cry 3 were even more baffled. “How come the shop owner received no damage?!”","“These fist techniques are heavy moves which gather so much power that they can block attacks in an area,” people like Nalan Hongwu and Song Qingfeng who were familiar with this game explained, “However, these moves are slow to use, which means that the shop owner blocked the attacks through prediction!”","Mr. Fang’s fist technique was not fast and seemed like he wasn’t trying to hit Vergil. However, it forced Vergil to retreat, and he took this opportunity to jump out of the battlefield with the help from the momentum of the fist technique.","Vergil looked unsurprised. With a flash of the Summoned Sword, the sword energies shot out from the circular sword array and formed another sword array. Instead of rotating around Vergil, this new sword array surrounded Fang Qi’s Dante!","“Vergil can even use sword arrays?!”","However, Mr. Fang instantly landed and kicked toward Vergil from mid-air as if he teleported himself.","“Look! Watch Mr. Fang!”","Mr. Fang controlled Dante to kick and step in mid-air many times like a demonic god that could fly. The Flame and Tornado Blades slashed out many ice and flame shadows. Even though Dante couldn’t fly, he moved in the air like a nimble swallow. In the blink of an eye, Vergil was struck more than ten times, and the circular sword array instantly disintegrated!","Of course, it was impossible to kill Vergil, who had a demon physique, with only about ten strikes. Suddenly, a shielding layer condensed from blue demonic energy appeared around him, and it blocked Dante’s strike like a tough, golden barrier!","Vergil suddenly vanished, and no one knew where he was. However, a Dimension Slash Storm swept all over the space!","The Dimension Slash which could leap through space instantly filled the whole portal to the demon world!","The audience saw that the saber light of the Dimension Slash filled the whole screen!","Except the collisions of the sword and the saber, it was hard to see the two figures in the battle; Vergil’s speed was so fast that it was horrifying to watch his moves.","Tink! Tink! Tink!","With a series of metal-colliding noises, Mr. Fang controlled Dante to calmly block the attacks.","While he blocked, he even mocked Vergil.","The audience watched Dante mock Vergil on the big screen. “At this moment, you are still mocking your big brother?!”","“Royalguard?!”","“Perfect block?!”","“What are these damn god-like plays?”","They had never imagined that one could look so awesome in a game!","Under Mr. Fang’s control, and since Dante’s strength grew more powerful, Vergil started to look weak and at a disadvantage.","While more and more wounds appeared on Vergil’s body, the portal connecting the demon world and the human world was about to close.","The battle finally came to an end. Covered in wounds, Vergil looked lonely, proud, and sad like a wounded wolf king.","Refusing his brother’s hand, he jumped from the cliff at the end of the portal that led to the demon world, falling into the abyss.","All his schemes and ambitions fell into the bottomless abyss in the demon world with him.","He left behind the Force Edge that his father had used to seal the demon world; Vergil spent all his life pursuing strength, but he left the object of his life-long pursuit to Dante at the end.","Vergil had witnessed his mother’s death while he was small and weak, which was why he had craved for great strength all his life.","However, it was enough for one of the twins to inherit this strength.","This unorthodox hero who was hungry for strength all his life had hidden his love for his twin brother deep in his heart, and it was only slightly revealed at this moment.","After this battle, Dante’s shop finally got its name: Devil May Cry.","[Beep! Congratulations for passing Devil May Cry 3. You unlocked the character, Vergil. The special chapter Vergil’s Downfall needs 25 crystals to activate.]","Right, after the players cleared the stage, they could choose to play the game from Vergil’s perspective.","At the beginning, the audience hadn’t understood the meaning of this announcement. When they did, they went into a cheer!","This meant that they could learn Vergil’s Dimension Slash, Summoned Sword, and other techniques!","The Vergil’s Downfall told the story about his experience after he fell into the demon world. After all, demons didn’t die so easily. In this story, he encountered his father’s foe. As the recovered emperor of the demon world and a proud demon, he battled to the death with his broken body."]},{"number":405,"title":"Chapter 405 - The New Year Party","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","The ending was sad, but it was what they had expected.","Compared to Dante who was more like a human, Vergil was a cold and proud demon, and the demon world was his home.","It was not only a story about the hero; it was also Vergil’s elegy.","Compared with Shu Mountain, this ending didn’t show any horrifying power such as Old Demon Youquan who covered the sky; that style and power better fitted with cultivators.","However, the power showed in Shu Mountain belonged to cultivators.","For most warriors, the battle styles showed in Devil May Cry 3 was probably more fitting for them.","“The concentrated mind can pierce boulders.”","Yes, concentration was the key. Although they didn’t have endless demonic energy to overpower their opponents, they could highly concentrate their minds and energy to deal great damage. For example, Vergil’s katana could cut through the Hell Vanguard and even chop the head of Beowulf, a powerful demon boss, into four pieces.","Under high-concentration, the strikes and slashes would be endowed with great power as soon as it was used. The damage alone wasn’t inferior to the spiritual artifacts and spells of the cultivators.","Besides, this game had created its own mature combat system. For example, there was the great ability of dodging and teleportation under the Trickster Style and the fancy moves under the Swordmaster Style and Gunslinger Style. The ranged attacks included things such as guns and Summoned Swords, and the Royalguard Style offered great defense such as perfect block and golden shield.","Including the Quicksilver Style and Doppelganger Style, this system was almost flawless except that it lacked flight abilities.","Of course, the two main characters could fly when activating their Demon Triggers. Since the players all possessed their own flight techniques, this tiny flaw was nothing in their eyes.","Then, Fang Qi tried the first scene of the Vergil Chapter, and he showed off Vergil’s sword arrays as well as strikes and slashes. Since they looked obviously more dashing than Dante’s moves, a large group of people gathered behind him to watch.","Different from the original version, the Vergil Chapter of the System Version had its own missions to accomplish. Since Vergil’s strength was very high at the beginning of the game, the whole process would be relatively shorter. In the Vergil Chapter, Vergil’s battle with Dante was only the prelude, and the main missions happened after he entered the demon world.","Obviously, this new chapter was warmly accepted by fans of Devil May Cry. As for the players of Devil May Cry in Half City, they preferred Vergil who was an unorthodox hero, so they all worked hard to pass the game to unlock the Vergil Chapter.","Meanwhile, Mr. Fang continued to earn red orbs in the game and tried to push all of the two characters’ techniques and skill to the max levels.","Two more characters appeared in the Game Cultivation Room. One was Dante who wore a red windbreaker and carried the big sword Rebellion on his back; he looked untamed and reckless. The other was blue-robed Vergil. With Yamato hanging on his belt, his eyes looked chilly.","While others learned from their masters or elders in their respective factions or families, Fang Qi found that his best teachers were these statue-like game characters.","In here, he fought each battle with his life.","Most of the time, Mr. Fang wouldn’t try to learn the ultimate techniques that were too deep for him since those moves would consume lots of his energy, and there was no guarantee that he could cast these techniques afterwards. In addition, he would be killed hundreds if not thousands of times each day if he tried.","With his current strength at the late stage Grand Ancestral Warrior Realm and the assistance of the Owner-Brand cigarettes, Mr. Fang now could use Sword God once.","When he launched Orochi Divine Light, he had borrowed strength from the godly weapon fragments; it wasn’t his own strength.","Since it wasn’t necessary for him to learn higher-level techniques, his top priority right now was increasing his cultivation strength. He focused on practicing simple and efficient moves and increasing the efficiency of playing games. After all, he could obtain lots of cultivation strength through playing games, and it couldn’t be neglected.","Soon, Dante’s surroundings began to change, and the scene shifted to the place before Dante’s shop.","They both held two guns. After the first gunshot, a series of rhythmic gunshots followed. Gunfire flashed on both sides, turning from orange to red. In the next moment, they began to fire bullets instilled with demonic energy!","The place looked as if it had just been bombed with huge bullet holes everywhere.","When the magazines went empty, two sword energies slashed out swiftly!","...","Meanwhile, due to the existence of Grand Theft Auto 5’s online mode, many players paid little attention to the plot in the offline mode. However, a group of artifact masters, who knew how to enjoy life and harbored a strong interest in powerful weapons and advanced technologies, played the game to the end.","Of course, for most of the players, the biggest attraction of this game was all kinds of novel things and lifestyles. When they were tired of playing other games, they would enter this game to drive around, take a drink, and enjoy the sunshine.","The civilian warriors of Jiuhua City naturally wouldn’t spend money to relax in this game. However, the major forces outside Dajin paid great attention to it after they learned that Dajin had derived their winning war strategy from this game to defeat their alliance.","The cultivators in Half City generally could afford this game. While the sales of Devil May Cry 3 shot up, the sales of Grand Theft Auto 5 continued to grow gradually as well.","The activation number of 3,000 seemed like a big target, but after a long while, the target was almost reached.","It showed that the people in this different world also liked games featuring entertainment.","It was hard to imagine that some people would be so lazy that they didn’t even want to play the relaxing Grand Theft Auto 5, but these people did exist.","Su Tianji peeled a spiritual orange that she had just picked from her orange tree. While stuffing one piece into her mouth, she clicked her mouse and began playing Plants vs Zombies again in her room.","From the looks of it, she wouldn’t stop until she passed the game.","Meanwhile, a large group of players gathered in Mr. Fang’s arcade room. They slammed on the buttons and pushed the joysticks wildly, fighting their rivals on the screen.","The fans of Jade Dynasty had reached the part in which the Beast God invaded the middle region of the continent. On the other hand, Wind and Cloud was coming to an end. It was late winter, and New Years was around the corner.","Mr. Fang was making plans for his vacation that could be covered in the business trip of opening a new shop next year when the system beeped, signaling that there was a new message for him.","[New Task: New Year Party.","Task Description: New Year is coming; please hold a new year party in the internet café","Task Content: The activities can be dancing, singing, a cosplay contest, or other activities that the Host chooses","Task Venue: The two shops and Qzone.","Task Props: New Year Gift Boxes (Big)*n; New Year Gift Boxes (Small)*n","Task Reward: Super Gift Box]","Mr. Fang: “...!!??”","“What on earth is this?!”"]},{"number":406,"title":"Chapter 406 - The Musical Festival and the King of Fighters Competition","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Mr. Fang looked at the task in embarrassment. “Can we talk about it? This is an internet café after all. Which internet café holds new year parties?”","Although this was another world, people also had the concept of years; they derived 12 months for each year according to the movements of the sun, the moon, and other stars. Therefore, there was the concept of a new year as well.","Since Mr. Fang discovered that Half City and Jiuhua City were in the same time zone, he didn’t have to worry about hosting several new year parties.","The other issue was shop upgrades.","A prompt appeared on the System Interface. [The income of crystals has provided enough energy for another shop upgrade; you can upgrade them again.]","When the Legend of Mir 2 went online, the computers in each of the two shops increased to around 2,000 in a short period, which was obviously a big strain on the energy.","But a long while had passed since the last upgrade.","There were 2,000 computers in Half City Shop, and Jiuhua City Shop had over 2,000 computers if one were to add the computers in the ordinary player’s zone and guild zone. Also, the popularity of the games had went from great to splendid. Now, the two shops were packed from day to night, so they made a lot of crystals.","With thousands of computers, even though it only cost two crystals for each hour per person, the income for one hour was almost 10,000 crystals, not including the sales of other stuff.","Including the activations of moves, TV Series, and all kinds of games as well as the sales of snacks, the total revenue had amounted to tens of millions of crystals in the last few months.","Of course, this was the amount that the System earned. However, Mr. Fang’s share had made him a millionaire already.","For ordinary civilians, this might be an astronomical number, but for the warriors and cultivators who must spend many crystals to cultivate each month, this income was quite normal.","Anyway, since Mr. Fang was now rich, he had been considering buying a high-end shop front.","While he received the task of upgrading the shops, he also got some new privileges. For example, he got one more percentage in profit sharing and unlocked the mode in which he could upgrade portions of the shops according to his own choices.","In this mode, the shop owner could plan the zones and the style of each zone by himself. At a closer look, Mr. Fang found that he could also unlock some advanced options such as utilizing the expanded shop space to use space folding abilities.","Another privilege that he got was that he could alter the computer time; he could alter it up to two hours.","Another thing he had to consider was the hiring of employees after the expansion of the shop space.","One employee was not enough for each shop. Previously, Mr. Fang had obtained the privilege of managing two employees, deciding the employees’ work hours, giving out special employee cards which contained free online time for each month.","The last upgrade was the activation of the digitized transferring between spiritual messages and network nodes in the shops; these services were only available to the membership customers.","After the activation, the customers with membership cards could access the shop’s internet to chat on QQ and watch the livestream on the big screen through the new communication jades, which meant that they could watch livestreams and join in on the fun wherever they were.","...","Meanwhile, the New Communication Jade Development Project that Mr. Fang had a share in achieved a new result.","Due to the many functions, the new communication jade used to have a big size. After some improvements, its looks improved into that of a jade amulet in the shape of a smartphone. The low-level communication jade could send pictures and text messages and conduct two-way calls. The high-level communication jade, like the one that Mr. Fang was holding, was a piece of white jade covered in dense engravings.","“This communication jade is a new product of our alliance.” Li Haoran handed Mr. Fang this communication jade with pride. “It can do all the things such as the shadow-condensing spell, shadow-recall spell, and sending messages and voice messages from hundreds of kilometers away! It can almost do anything.”","Shadow-condensing spell was just the name for taking pictures at the Wuwei Daoist Alliance, and the shadow-recall spell meant video-recording.","While Li Haoran introduced the functions, Mr. Fang tried it himself.","After he injected some qi into the jade, a two-dimensional illusion appeared in a layer of mist; it looked like the interface of a smartphone, but one must use essence or qi to control the mouse-like cursor on the interface.","“What do you think of it?” Li Haoran was a bit nervous while looking at his masterpiece. In fact, these functions were originally some low-level spiritual spells. To make this new communication jade, the Wuwei Daoist Alliance increased their levels by force and improved their effects before engraving them into the communication jade.","Since they were hand-made by artifact masters, and the processes were extremely complicated, there weren’t many of such communication jades around, and the one in Mr. Fang’s hand was definitely a high-end product.","“Excellent! Awesome!” Mr. Fang gave him a thumbs-up.","It was still early in the morning, but the two shops were full of customers, especially the members of the forces that were playing the Legend of Mir 2, who usually came here very early in the morning.","Even the usually idle Su Tianji didn’t lounge on the couch today; she got online first and then bought instant noodles and milk tea.","However, the moment that she walked to the counter today, she was greeted with lots of new announcements.","For example, there was the hiring of shop clerks and the new year party.","The new year party included the following activities.","[Cosplay: It is a basic activity. The customers who dress up as the characters in the games, movies, or TV Series will get one extra hour of computer time per day and can register for the Most Original contest.]","[Qzone Musical Festival: Anyone can enter this activity, and the gala will be held in Qzone.]","[Qzone the King of Fighters Competition: Anyone can register for this event, and it will be held in Qzone.]","[Qzone...]","While reading the many activities on the small blackboard, Su Tianji felt dazed. It’s just a celebration of the new year; how come there are so many weird activities?!","After all, she usually passed the first day of each year in seclusion cultivation and had never seen such things before!","Registering for any of the activities will get them one more hour of computer time per day.","[The participants who can get the top three places for any of the activities will each get a new year gift box (big). The higher the rankings, the higher quality the gifts will be.]","[The participants who get into the top 10 places will each get a few new year gift boxes (small); the number of gift boxes is determined by the placement.]","Then, she saw another announcement. [At New Year’s Eve, the shop won’t be closed. All the customers can continue playing online after midnight.]"]},{"number":407,"title":"Chapter 407 - A Strange Person Slipped In","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Well! You can’t even give me some rest during the new year holiday, Mr. Fang thought to himself about the System in contempt while he explained the events to Su Tianji and other customers.","The System Interface showed the following lines. [Host, please be ambitious and motivated.]","“Ambitious? Am I not ambitious enough?” Mr. Fang said unwillingly, “I cultivated hard each day, got all S rankings in all of Dante’s missions, defeated all opponents with one hand in the King of Fighters, became the best driver in Grand Theft Auto 5... I even play Vergil well despite the fact that I just began the game. Don’t you know how I obtained my high cultivation strength?!”","System: “The Super Gift Box contains luxurious new year gifts. It’s the host’s choice to do the task or not.”","Mr. Fang instantly brightened and got energetic. “When did I say that I wouldn’t do it?!”","Besides Su Tianji, the other customers who came over to buy instant noodles also noticed the new announcements.","Mr. Fang glanced at the calendar and found that there were about two weeks for registration and preparation.","“Sir, what’s this music festival?!” Su Tianji couldn’t take her eyes off of this activity. “Since it’s related to music and held in Qzone, I have traded several classic guzheng sheet music, and I am sure that I’ll get a good place in the competition!”","“Sir! The King of Fighters Competition! The King of Fighters Competition!” Song Qingfeng squeezed to the counter. “I want to register for the King of Fighters Competition!”","Nalan Mingxue asked, “Can we... register for all these events?”","“Of course,” Mr. Fang told them that this party was pure entertainment, and they could register for as many activities as they wished.","“Then, we will register for all the activities!”","“So do we! All of them!” Xu Zixin and Shen Qingqing also walked up.","“We do too!” Dong Qingli and Zhang Wanyu didn’t want to be outdone.","“Register me in the King of Fighters Competition!” Even Nalan Hongwu joined the fun. “And that... em... cosplay too!”","“I... I want to participate too!”","Using its advantage of flying, a black cloud flew above the crowd and arrived at the counter. “I want to attend it too!”","All the people looked at the black cloud in a daze. “Sir, can pets attend this party?”","“Who?! Who said that I’m a pet?!” Like a cat whose tail was stepped on, it leaped up and glanced around viciously. “I’m the supreme, almighty Demon Lord who swept across the Morning Star Sea Realm, unrivaled!”","“Ahahahah! Just you?”","“Demon?”","“Go away!” Mr. Fang looked disdainful. “You’re just a teleportation array. What can you cosplay as?”","“...”","Instantly, people crowded around the counter.","Meanwhile in the Half City Shop, customers were becoming enthusiastic about the party as well.","People from the Nanhua Faction sat on the couches after registration, waiting for their turns to get online.","Mo Xian had a cup of milk tea in her hand. “Who wants to attend the cosplay event? We will get one extra hour of game time if we attend that!”","“Me! Me! Me!” Yue Yan immediately answered, “I’ve sent a message to Senior Sister Lian and asked her to make a disciple robe of the Green Cloud Faction and a copy of the Tianya Sword. From now on, call me Lu Xueqi!”","“I’m Lu Xueqi!” Mo Xian glared at her.","“You are Elder Senior Sister Wen Min from Jade Dynasty! Lu Xueqi doesn’t wear black clothes like you do!” Yue Yan immediately changed the subject. “Oh, what’s your plan, Junior Sister Liu?”","Liu Ningyun chuckled, “I won’t fight with you; I’ve chosen someone else already.”","While some were fighting for different characters, Song Qingfeng and the others were well-prepared.","“Hahahaha!” Song Qingfeng was holding a brown tight-fitting uniform, and the image of a sun could be seen on the back.","Standing by him, Lin Shao was wearing a dark blue vest over a white shirt with a pair of red trousers. On the back of the vest was the image of a crescent moon. With his arms bent and lifted over his head, he shouted, “Tsuki wo miru tabi omoi dase!”","The initial pose before using Iori Yagami’s Desperation Move – Kin 1211 Shiki Ya Otome.","Besides them, most of the other customers were also getting prepared.","...","For cultivators outside of the Deserted Sea Realm, the cultivators living in the Deserted Sea Realm were backwards and had low cultivation strength.","To go out of the Deserted Sea Realm, they needed not only to cross vast oceans but to break through the ‘Heavenly Forbidden Zones’ which had existed since prehistoric times.","No one in this world knew about the origins of the Heavenly Forbidden Zones. People only knew that the ocean area east to the Morning Sea Area Realm was called the Nether Sea, and all the major factions listed it as the No.1 Forbidden Place.","The three saint factions called the westernmost area Taihuang Mountain, which meant ‘extremely deserted mountain’. The people of these three factions feared it so much that no one dared to venture inside.","The northernmost place was a bone-chilling icy land. If ordinary cultivators entered it, their spiritual essence would be frozen to ice. The mountain peaks covered in white snow concealed many fierce beasts that had lived there ever since the prehistoric times. In short, it was a bitter cold place that even Divine Palace Realm cultivators with extremely high cultivation strength couldn’t pass.","According to the legends, the only path leading to the blessed land existed in the vast ocean in the south. In the past, some cultivators came to the Deserted Sea Realm from outside, and they said that they came from Spiritual State.","According to the legends, it was a vast land with tall celestial mountains and abundant spiritual essence.","However, out of the cultivators who had sailed into the southern sea to look for that land, few had sent back messages.","However, this secret information was only known to the forces such as the three saint factions, which was why very few cultivators in the Deserted Sea Realm had the chance to communicate with the outside world. Since the teleportation array of the three saint factions had shut down thousands of years ago, the communication to the outside world was almost completely cut off.","For cultivators in the Deserted Sea Realm, the cultivators from the outside world were mysterious and mighty with special powers. However, for Jiang Xuan, the path in the southern sea was not as magical as it was told in the legends on the Deserted Sea Realm.","In their eyes, the Deserted Sea Realm was only a wasteland separated by Heavenly Forbidden Zones which seemed to have appeared due to nature, not worthy of their efforts to enter. To their surprise, the little princess of the Jiang Family had come to this place to play.","Knowing that she would return to Spiritual State to go to school in the coming spring, the young girl was quite reluctant to leave. When Mr. Fang was in the shop to watch everything, she went out to buy many special local stuff, such as new communication jades, handguns, and sniper rifles.","As for the new employees, the Half City Shop had had already solved this issue. Ruan Ning, Fang Qi’s warm-hearted neighbor, had gotten used to keeping an eye on the shop for Mr. Fang. Since she had hired someone to manage her own shop, she applied for the clerk position in the Half City Shop. With Zou Mo, there were two employees in the shop now.","-Meanwhile in Jiuhua City-","In the long line of people applying for the shop clerk position, a golden-robed young man greeted Mr. Fang.","Mr. Fang’s face twitched, and he wondered, Why did this guy who is on the blacklist sneak in here?"]},{"number":408,"title":"Chapter 408 - A Brand-New Outlook","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Gongzi Xiao, are you here to apply for this position too?” The Jiuhua City Shop was livelier than the Half City Shop since the latter had already hired the employees.","“Hahaha! Yeah! Yeah!” Xiao Yulv cupped his hands and said, “I excel in every game from Resident Evil, to Counter Strike, to Devil May Cry, to getting treasures in the Legend of Mir 2; I even know all the combos in the King of Fighters and how to play Fighting the Landlord.”","He patted his chest in confidence and said, “I just don’t believe... Auch!”","“Aunt, why are you pulling my ear?!” Before he could finish, he screamed again.","“What are you doing here?”","“To apply for the position!” Xiao Yulv waved his folding fan while pointing at the small blackboard. “I am perfect for this position, right?”","Fenghua said in surprise, “Weren’t you put on the blacklist by the owner?”","Xiao Yulv’s face twitched. “Who... who said that I can’t become a shop clerk just because the shop doesn’t serve me? Can’t I serve myself?!”","Su Tianji: “...”","Fenghua: “...”","Yuexin: “...”","His argument seemed indisputable.","The problem was...","The three of them looked at Xiao Yulv as if he were an idiot, wondering if he thought that Mr. Fang was a fool.","“Next!” At this moment, Xiao Yulv heard Mr. Fang’s yell.","“Hehe! It’s my turn!” Xiao Yulv scrambled to stand before Mr. Fang.","“Mr. Fang.” Xiao Yulv rubbed his hands with a fawning expression. “What do you think of me?”","Mr. Fang’s face turned dark. “What do you mean?”","He leaned over and beckoned at the next person in line before glancing at Xiao Yulv. “I didn’t call you up. As someone on my shop’s blacklist, you want to become a shop clerk here? Next! Next!”","“Wait!” Xiao Yulv yelled, “Please give me a chance...”","Mr. Fang rolled his eyes. “How can I give you a chance?”","After all, it’s the System who made the rules instead of me. If Mr. Fang made them, he might be able to change the rules and help this young man.","He asked the System while on the topic, “Is there any way that I can remove the customers from the blacklist?”","The System Interface showed, [Host, you don’t have this privilege yet. Please work hard to level up your privileges.]","Mr. Fang asked, “When will I have enough privileges?”","The System Interface displayed a textbox, [Please explore it by yourself.]","Mr. Fang looked embarrassed. “Then, can I employ people on the blacklist as shop clerks?”","The System Interface: [The people on the blacklist don’t get paid and can’t be served.]","Mr. Fang scratched his head. “But this job is serving others.”","The System was silent for a while before saying, [Okay.]","Mr. Fang’s lips twitched, and he gave Xiao Yulv a long look. “What... specialties do you have?”","“I’ve watched videos on the clearing of all stages for every game, and I know everything about games including the procedures, combos, and routines. Also, I did an in-depth analysis of the ingredients of all kinds of snacks...”","Hearing Xiao Yulv’s long speech, Su Tianji was even stunned. “Mr. Fang, can’t you give this kid a chance?”","Mr. Fang patted Xiao Yulv on the shoulder and gave a long speech as well. “The shop won’t be responsible for your residence, snack, and pay. You can’t play games when you work, must clean up the shop before you go, can’t make any mistakes when taking in money, and can’t be fooled when other people on the blacklist try to sneak in...”","Several minutes later, Mr. Fang finished speaking and took a drink of water.","“I still can’t play games?!”","“Do you want the job or not?”","“Ahh!?” he yelled at the top of his lungs.","“Depending on my mood, I will decide when you will be removed from the blacklist,” Mr. Fang added.","“I do!”","From now on, the despicable capitalist Mr. Fang found another target to exploit.","On the side, Su Tianji looked pleased, and she said encouragingly, “Work hard!”","With tears on his face, Xiao Yulv said, “Okay!”","Fenghua: “Congratulations, Junior Brother Xiao.”","“Thank you!”","Su Tianji comforted him, “You’re fortunate that you can observe and learn from the Senior!”","He nodded with force. “Right!”","“Good. Go and prepare a bowl of instant noodles for me.”","Xiao Yulv: “...”","She was indeed his blood-related aunt; she didn’t go easy on him and instantly asked him to do work for her.","Since Jiang Xiaoyue would soon set off for the Spiritual State, so the shop needed another clerk. Mr. Fang read the application forms of the candidates one by one.","“Zou Long...”","“Wang Xiang...”","“Yu Zhiwei, born in a home of scholars and can write poems and draw. Familiar with the plots of games including Resident Evil, Diablo, and the Legend of the Sword and Fairy...”","“This name is familiar...” Mr. Fang thought for a while and then slammed his hand on the desk. “She is the owner of the bookstore that is selling my official Diablo novels!”","It seems that we have some good candidates with talent this time... Mr. Fang scratched his head and made the decision. “It’s overkill for her to manage a bookstore; it’s better for her to work in the internet café...","“Now that we have enough employees, it’s time to upgrade the shops.”","...","Origins Internet Club had altogether two shop fronts in Jiuhua City with more than 1,000 computers in each shop. There was a total of 3,600 computers in Jiuhua City. With this expansion, the computers were enough for not only customers of Dajin but the elite disciples from the nearby forces as well.","The Half City Shop was separated into two floors, and only spatial expansion technology was used; the space-folding technology wasn’t used this time.","After entering the shops, people would think that they had entered another world.","Both shops have a big area set aside for big guilds. The whole place was paved with wooden floors and had wide corridors. The posters of Dante, Li Xiaoyao, and the Liquor Sword Immortal were placed on the walls in the game zone. In the movie and TV series zone, the posters had characters such as Xuan Tianzong and Zhang Xiaofan on them.","There were also some smaller zones for customers to experience robotic civilization and magic civilization. With the robotic style corridors and walls that seemed to contain flowing flames, one could get different experiences in one shop.","Of course, it didn’t mean that the customers could only do one thing in a certain zone. However, when they had the choice, most of the customers would gather in the zone that fitted their tastes.","The corridors were lined with pots of rare and exotic plants where their deep-green leaves emitted faint fragrances, keeping the air inside fresh all the time.","The lounge area was more spacious. After their computer time was up, the disciples and elders from different major factions and forces would gather here to talk about things like spiritual spells, combat techniques, game experiences, and how to kill bosses.","By now, the new employees had come to their posts.","The whole Origin Internet Club got a brand-new look.","“Hello, everyone. I’m Yu Zhiwei.” She was a serene and graceful woman in plain clothes.","“Hello, everyone. I’m Xiao Yulv.” As usual, Gongzi Xiao waved his folding fan, presenting a dashing figure before the customers.","“Tomorrow is the last day before the new year,” the Royal Princess asked, “Gongzi Xiao, what do you think of the cosplay event? What’s your plan?”"]},{"number":409,"title":"Chapter 409 - You’re All Talented","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","According to the rules of the cosplay competition, the winner wouldn’t just be based on the votes; the characters who were harder to cosplay would receive extra points for the difficulty level.","Mr. Fang had written down the details and the rules on the small blackboard.","“I’ve made a good plan for it. As for the specifics...” Xiao Yulv waved his folding fan and said proudly, “May I keep them secrets for now?”","“Okay. It seems that you’re confident in taking a high ranking in the competition.”","“Gongzi Xiao, congratulations!” Mu Donglai cupped his hands. “It has been a long time since I last saw you, and you have become an internet café manager! Would you like to play the King of Fighters with me today? I’ve been waiting to play one round with you.”","While his face twitched, Xiao Yulv said, “This... maybe later!”","...","“It’s you, Ms. Yu! I heard that the Diablo 2 Official Novel was written by Ms. Qingqing and edited and published by you, right?” The Royal Princess was obviously very interested in the first official novel. “I read your work and was enthralled! I wonder if you guys have plans to publish an official novel for the other games?”","“Ugh...” Yu Zhiwei said, “You have to bring this question to the boss!”","Beside them, Jiang Xiaoyue patted her forehead as if she had just remembered something. “Right! Official novels!”","She immediately said to Yu Zhiwei, “Sister Yu, I want to buy several sets of the official novel.”","“Why? Xiaoyue, didn’t I give you a hard-cover set as a gift?” Yu Zhiwei asked curiously.","“The boss said that I would make many new friends in the Heavenly Academy, and he told me that we could give each other gifts to bond better!” Jiang Xiaoyue popped out her chest and stood taller. “If I don’t show them the book, how would they know what level of power that Lord of Terror Diablo has?”","Mr. Fang stroked his chin and said, “I think that’s what little kids do nowadays, right?”","...","The new year party was held on the second day after the two shops changed into their new looks.","Despite its warmer climate, Jiuhua City had the last snowfall of the year today.","As a southern city, its snow wasn’t as heavy as that in Half City. However, the flurry of snowflakes added to the holiday atmosphere in the shop.","For most of the cultivators and warriors with high cultivation strength, they didn’t celebrate the coming of a new year. Even for their birthdays, they only celebrated them once every ten years. Oblivious to the passage of time, the cultivators usually spent all their time on hard cultivation despite the extreme weather.","However, this new year was different from before.","Outside the Jiuhua City Shop, a young man wearing brown uniform over a white T-shirt walked out of Lingyun Academy; there was the image of a burning sun printed on the back of the uniform.","“Look! It’s Kyo Kusanagi!” The moment that he appeared, some disciples of Lingyun Academy instantly exclaimed.","The passersby were even more astonished.","“My Goodness! It’s Iori Yagami!” Walking beside Kyo Kusanagi with his hands in pockets, a red-haired young man saw the glances from the passersby. Instead of being timid by the gazes, he laughed hysterically without caring.","“Young Master Song! We’re indeed more talented! We didn’t get into top 3 in the Diablo individual competition, but we’ll take all the top 3 places this time!” Walking with Kyo Kusanagi and Iori Yagami was a young man wearing a golden broom-like hairstyle, black boots, a pair of jeans, and a black vest.","Then, he punched out and copied Benimaru Nikaido’s tone while shouting, “Pumpkin Punch!”","The baffled passersby who didn’t know anything wondered, How come these people’s hair colors are all over the place?","“No idea... They look quite bad-*ss...”","“Is it another trend of Lingyun Academy?” They remembered that the zombie outfit was once popular in the academy, and the students walked on the streets as a large group of zombies.","“Hey! Hey! Young Master Lin! Young Master Song! Look over there!”","They saw a tall and thin demon with ram horns strolling on the street.","“Mephisto?!”","Beside Mephisto was a woman with spiked red hair and sharp claws on her back.","The passersby all backed away from them.","“F*cK!? Andariel?!”","When they arrived at the door of Jiuhua City Shop, their eyes almost popped out.","In front of the shop, Wesker and Jill were talking animatedly; Ling and the Baiyue Clan Master laughed together; the Ghost King Faction Master and Daoxuan Daoist were in a deep talk.","Inside the shop, the scene was even more shocking. An alien from Grand Theft Auto 5 sat on the couch in the lounge area with a bowl of instant noodles; beside it sat Michael in a formal suit.","“Ouyang Family Master?!” Song Qingfeng froze when he saw the Michael who was even fatter than the original robust character.","Then, he looked back and saw another Mephisto walking in!","He was followed by a Baal!","Shortly, another Mephisto walked in!","The two Mephisto looked at each other and then each bought a bowl of instant noodles before sitting on the couch to enjoy the food.","“F*ck!” Song Qingfeng and the others were so stunned that their eyeballs almost popped out.","A thick layer of snow had accumulated on the street outside the Half City Shop; frost even condensed on the shop’s glass door.","The shop wasn’t open yet, and a group of people was waiting outside the door.","The people standing at the outmost of the group wore black robes and called themselves disciples of the Ghost King Faction.","“Boss Black Demon, how come the shop is not open yet?” A scholarly-looking man who wore a pale green robe asked.","“Lord Jin, should we shout and see if the owner is awake?” A cultivator wearing the black disciple robe of the Ghost King Faction from Jade Dynasty walked over.","The white-robed scholar’s face twitched, and he said, “Call me Green Dragon!”","Black Demon said solemnly. “Call me Ghost King Faction Master!”","The moment he said it, a green figure landed from the sky while yelling in anger, “Where’s the Ghost King Faction Master?!”","“Pu!” Seeing the newcomer, Black Demon almost spat out a mouthful of blood. Immediately, he put a piece of black gauze around him. “There’s no... no Ghost King! I’m Mr. Ghost!”","With long black hair fluttering in the wind and a green dress flapping in the snow, the newcomer looked like a lively green butterfly; her charming face looked noble and cold.","The others almost thought that Biyao had resurrected.","[TL Note: In Jade Dynasty, the Ghost King Faction Master is Biyao’s father.]","“Ms. Ning... Ning Bi...”","“Call me Ms. Biyao!”","“...”","“Hohoho! Hahaha!” A white figure landed from the sky. With a white cloak, white hair, and long eyebrows, the Reincarnation King who had been sent flying by that big demon came back as the White Brow Spiritual Master.","Then, a wave of dazzling sword light came down from the sky.","The Water Moon Master, Lu Xueqi, Elder Senior Sister Wen Min, Wan Jianyi, and the others all landed one by one.","Duan Yue walked over. “Xichi Spiritual Master? Good to see you!”","“I’m Water Moon Master! Did you mistake me as someone else?!”","Duan Yue: “...”","Meanwhile, wearing crude cotton clothes, Mr. Fang walked down with an Erhu in his arms.","He glanced around and saw three beauties at the counter, two big and one small. They were white-clothed nine-tailed demon fox Little White, loli version of Zhao Ling’er, and... You Ji who was wearing a gauze veil.","Mr. Fang frowned. “Where’s the other shop clerk? How come he’s late on his first day of work?!”"]},{"number":410,"title":"Chapter 410 - Blinded by the sight","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","According to the rules for the cosplay competition, the participants couldn’t transform their faces with an illusion spell. Of course, they were allowed to transform their bodies with the transfiguration spell.","At this moment, a werewolf walked toward the counter.","Meanwhile, two out of three girls at the counter turned and pointed at ‘You Ji’ who was sitting between them and said, “Gongzi Xiao said that he is ill today, and his little sister will do his work for him today.”","“Oh...” Mr. Fang waved his hand. “Tell him to report to me next time.”","Then, Mr. Fang saw the werewolf walking toward the counter and muttered in a muffled voice, “Old Xiao has a little sister? I’ve known him for a long time without hearing him mentioning it.”","‘You Ji’s’ face beneath the veil turned dark.","Mr. Fang who had just turned to pour himself a cup of milk tea paused his steps.","The loli version of Zhao Ling’er, who had been sipping Coke, and the nine-tailed demon fox Little White looked at ‘You Ji’ in alarm. “Who is she?!”","“What? Kid Xiao has a little sister?” An elegant and beautiful woman wearing a light and fluttering dress walked over with graceful steps. She had auspicious clouds surrounding her, and the thin gauze decorating her white dress fluttered even though there was no wind. She looked like a fairy walking out from a roll of painting.","“Ling Long?!” Everyone stared at her, recognizing that she was the woman who had suppressed the Beast God more than 10,000 years ago in Jade Dynasty.","Jiang Xiaoyue looked at the outfit on ‘Ling Long’ before glancing down at her own cosplay and exclaimed, “How come she brought her own special effects?”","Seeing that people were all staring at ‘Ling Long’, ‘You Ji’ tried to take this opportunity to slip away.","“Stop!” ‘Ling Long’ who had her own special effects stared at ‘You Ji’ and said with a snort, “How come I don’t know that Kid Xiao has a little sister?”","As Xiao Yulv’s aunt, it was impossible that she didn’t know he had a little sister. She instantly plucked off the veil from ‘You Ji’.","“Xiao! Yu! Lv!” Mr. Fang instantly stared back at him.","Hearing Mr. Fang’s shout, all the people including ‘Mephisto’, ‘Daoxuan Daoist’, and the ‘Liquor Sword Immortal’ looked toward them.","The atmosphere instantly froze in silence.","“Ahhhh!” Xiao Yulv finally let out a shrilling howl.","“Pu!” Jiang Xiaoyue spat out Coke all over the counter.","All the people were at a loss for words.","“Well done!” Mr. Fang patted him on the shoulder and said meaningfully, “When we grade the difficulty of cosplays, you’ll get many extra points for sure!”","Xiao Yulv blushed and instantly took back his veil and put it back on.","“However,” Mr. Fang leaned over and said, “Your familiarity with the female role reminds me of the incident where two Fenghuas...”","The people all stared at Xiao Yulv with a strange look on their faces.","“Hahahaha! 1,000 years ago, the Liuyun Daoist Palace had a rare genius named the Thousand-Face Godly Master who could change into any person he wanted. Few people knew his real look.” Daoxuan Daoist said with a laugh, “Today, we couldn’t even recognize Nephew Xiao even though he sat among us; it seems that he has inherited and mastered this transformation technique!”","“Alliance Master Lan, you’re right.” The Ghost King Faction Master, who was dressed like a scholar, nodded in agreement. “It’s our fortune that we can see the Thousand-Face Technique from 1,000 years ago!”","“Ahem!” ‘You Ji’ finally raised his head. “Right. I’m...”","Before he could finish his words, he felt a gust of cold wind sweeping toward him. Immediately, he sat back down and shrank his neck. “Ahem. Thank you for your compliments, Seniors.”","The people thought that this interlude was over when a yellow ball flew down from upstairs while screaming, “Auch! How come your Jiuhua City is so cold as well?! Will someone open the door to the room upstairs and get me a quilt!?”","“...”","One minute later, people gaped at the big Smirking Face Emoji sitting on a couch, shivering inside a quilt. It glanced around and yelled, “Who told you that I can’t cosplay?!”","All the people in the area stared at it. “What are we seeing here?!”","They were almost blinded by this sight!","“Pu!” Even Mr. Fang spat out his drink.","“Hahahaha!”","“Awe... Awesome!”","“I... I have stitches on my sides! Hahaha!”‘Iori Yagami’, ‘Kyo Kusanagi’, ‘Ling Long’, and the others laughed so hard that they couldn’t straighten their backs.","Jiang Xiaoyue was laughing so hard that she rested her upper body on the counter.","Xiao Yulv: “Bro, you’re... old but sensational!”","They all cosplayed people or monsters; none of them had thought about cosplaying an emoji!","Meanwhile, a <img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f60f.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F60F;\"> Emoji sat on the couch and calmly sipped its milk tea, seeming oblivious to the other’s ‘admiring gazes’ and hiding its fame.","The players came into the shop one by one. Today’s events were divided into two parts. The King of Fighters Competition was held during the day while the new year music festival and other entertainments would begin at 11 PM and continue into the early morning of the second day.","Ever since Orochi Divine Light was shown on the livestream, the number of the King of Fighters players had grown tremendously. Now, most of the players bought the King of Fighters in Qzone, and some rich ones even copied Mr. Fang and opened their own arcade shops.","That was why the King of Fighters Competition was such a popular and grand event.","A special audience stand was prepared in Qzone for the King of Fighters Competition.","Different from the Diablo 2 Competition, the King of Fighters Competition was using a platform system to sieve through the players. In Qzone, the competition ground was divided into several areas with platforms built.","All the participants had three chances to fight, and the participants with the highest scores would enter the finals.","Under the bright illumination of lights, the audience stand was full of customers from both shops. Obviously, many people wanted to take this chance to have some fun since they would have two more hours of computer time today.","“Now, let’s welcome the participants!” Ning Bi, wearing her green long dress, had a microphone in her hand. Mr. Fang had invited her to host this event.","Her fluttering green dress and sweet smile stunned many people.","“F*ck?!”","“Biyao?!”","“Such a good cosplay!”","Meanwhile, some people sat in the lounge area and watched the events’ livestream on the big screens while they waited for their turns to get online during the night.","“So... Gongzi...” Mo Donglai had a thin layer of sweat on his face. “Ms. You Ji, what do you think of the situation? Who do you think will get good rankings in the King of Fighters Competition?”"]},{"number":411,"title":"Chapter 411 - E-Sports in this Otherworld","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Sitting sedately beside Xiao Yulv, the werewolf opened his wolf muzzle, and a foul odor permeated the air. “Old Xiao, what do you think about that Song Qingfeng? He played the game the longest; do you think he has the potential to get first place?”","“I’m familiar with the King of Fighters.” Xiao Yulv regained his confidence when talking about the game. “This game requires cleverness, which means that having played the longest doesn’t equal high skills. Besides, there are several others who have played the game as long as he has.”","“Duke Nalan is both experienced and talented. Do you think he has the potential to be the champion?” Mu Donglai asked again.","Xiao Yulv shook his head and pointed out, “Old Duke indeed has great battle experience and strength, but he doesn’t have any advantage in Qzone.”","Mu Donglai asked, “I heard some players in Half City Shop excel in the King of Fighters. Do you think they will take the top places?”","Xiao Yulv waved his hand and said, “They are mostly women and are thus insignificant in this game.”","Hearing his words, Mu Donglai looked at Xiao Yulv’s outfit up and down and was at a loss for words.","“Watch the match! Watch the match!” The big werewolf sitting beside them also looked embarrassed.","– On the big screen –","“We’re now broadcasting the King of Fighters Competition live! I’m Biyao and one of the hosts of this event!”","“I’m Little White, the other host of the event.” The camera turned to the temporary hosts. Biyao and the nine-tailed demon fox Little White stood together with microphones in their hands, looking quite professional.","Little White suddenly seemed to find that something was wrong with her microphone, and she glanced at the microphone in Biyao’s hand.","Then, she turned her microphone around without showing any emotions on her face.","“Let’s continue with the topic.”","“Right now, our first group of contestants is in position.”","On the big screen, many contestants went onto the platforms wearing their cosplay costumes. On the left, a guy wearing Chris’ costume from Resident Evil had begun choosing his characters.","Beside him sat a Wesker who also began choosing characters after casting a glance at him.","On the other side, a girl wearing Athena’s costume chose Athena as her character.","Beside her was a girl wearing Lin Yueru’s costume","Then, three Li Xiaoyaos ran up.","...","– In the lounge area of the Jiuhua City shop –","A purple-robed old man and an old Daoist wearing a white robe and a jade belt sat on a couch, each with a cup of milk tea in their hands.","Beside them, Li Longyuan pointed at the big screen and said, “Master, this is the competition that this shop is hosting. They held such competitions before. This time, they gave a special name to this competition—E-Esports.”","At this moment, the camera turned to the players who used Athena and Terry. ‘Athena’ pushed the joystick wildly, and Athena on the screen moved nimbly, hitting Terry so hard that the latter hammered his hand on the joystick in frustration.","Li Longyuan explained, “This game requires the players to have good reflexes and judgment. Compared with chess, you must move swiftly in the game. The moment your mind falls behind, you’ll be overwhelmed by your rival’s storm-like attacks. More importantly, when you reach a high level in the game, you can unlock the fighter’s fist techniques and spiritual spells.”","“Of course, the shop also offers battles in virtual reality mode besides these, allowing you to fight through puppets,” Ling Wanyin added, “They are more realistic!”","The old Daoist wearing white robe and the jade belt said with a nod, “The E-Sports mode enriches cultivators’ battle experience without causing casualties, which means that the major factions won’t suffer from unnecessary losses of their talented disciples in practice battles. Very good!”","“Indeed.” The purple-robed Daoist said, “The grandmasters here can even mimic the laws of nature of the outside world and use them in the virtual reality world?”","Li Longyuan said in a low voice, “The sunlight in the Taixi Faction that we saw from our factions was in fact the technique named ‘Orochi Divine Light’ from the King of Fighters...”","Instantly, the purple-robed Daoist and the white-robed Daoist widened their eyes. “What!? Then, why did you recommend Devil May Cry 3 to us?! We died hundreds of times in that game!”","They pointed at the big screen and said, “Is this the King of Fighters you mentioned? Are you sure?!”","Li Longyuan and Ling Wanyin said, “We’re sure.”","“I didn’t know that!” The purple-robed Daoist took out his communication jade and said, “No wonder the Wuwei Daoist Alliance refused to attend the Cultivation Realm Conference!”","The white-robed Daoist said, “Their stuff is indeed much more precious than ours!”","“But we can’t just dump the Cultivation Realm Conference that we inherited from our ancestors,” the purple-robed Daoist said with a frown.","“Maybe we can change the Cultivation Realm Conference into...”","They said simultaneously, “Cultivation Realm E-Sports Competition!”","They laughed. “This way, our two factions will get out of the current crisis very soon.”","“I think we can unite with the top force from the other shop that Longyuan just mentioned,” the purple-robed Daoist said while clapping his hands and laughing.","“Good idea!” The white-robed Daoist warmed up with this topic and got excited. “Then, the whole world will know about our Cultivation Realm E-Sports Competition!”","“But...” Li Longyuan said in worry, “We will need the support of the shop owner. After all, only he has been holding the E-Sport Competitions...”","“He does his business, and we hold our competition; we don’t interfere with each other.” The White-robed Daoist said with a snort, “When we held our Cultivation Realm Conference, we never interfered with the other factions’ internal competitions among disciples!”","“I think Longyuan has a point,” the purple-robed Daoist said. “After all, the E-Sports Competition can only be held in this shop.”","Solemnly, they discussed this issue while sipping milk tea. “We’ll hold a world-scale Cultivation Realm Conference which is much grander than before; the elites from all over the world will gather together and compete with each other!”","“It will be a much-anticipated glorious event!","“Hahaha! This E-Sports is excellent!”","They continued sipping red bean milk tea with straws.","Meanwhile, new contestants appeared on the screen. Seeing the contestants of the King of Fighters Competition fiercely fighting on stage, some young men who were familiar with the moves couldn’t remain on their seats.","An Iori Yagami jumped onto the platform.","“Look! Iori Yagami!”","Under everyone’s gaze, Iori stretched and launched several of Iori’s moves with energy, “Guoooo... Shine! Guoooo... Shine!”","[TL Note: Guoooo... Shine(Japanese) means Guooooh... Die]","Then, he got off the platform with his hands in his pockets and took a seat.","“Wow!”","“Iori Yagami! Iori Yagami!”","The fans of the King of Fighters cheered wildly.","“Hehe! It’s my turn!” On the other side, Kyo Kusanagi and Benimaru Nikaido also jumped onto the platform.","“Hehehe... I didn’t expect this, but the main characters are all on stage now.” ‘Biyao’ handed her microphone to Little White and walked up to the platform. “It seems that I must show my moves too.”","“Humph!” With a snort, a beautiful girl with waist-length hair walked up; she wore a pure white uniform and a pair of tight-fitting trousers","“Chizuru Kagura?!”","“Go! Go! Junior Sister Liu!” The disciples from ‘Green Cloud Faction’ cheered enthusiastically.","“F*ck! Look at that Iori Yagami! He took down three opponents with one!”","“This Kyo Kusanagi is awesome!”","“Look at that Chizuru Kagura!” Behind ‘Chizuru Kagura’ on the platform, Chizuru Kagura on the screen used a combo of 27 moves.","“F*ck! She took her opponent from full HP to zero!”","The atmosphere of the competition and in the shop instantly reached the highest point!"]},{"number":412,"title":"Chapter 412 - How can she lose?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Excellent! Excellent!” The purple-robed Daoist sitting in the lounge area clapped his hands in appreciation. “These people look very powerful!”","The old Daoist in the white robe said with a nod, “The red head (Iori Yagami) and the golden head (Benimaru Nikaido) look extraordinary! Good presence!”","“Okay! Since Ms. Biyao has entered the competition, I will host the event alone.” On the big screen, the camera turned to the green-clothed Biyao.","“Random characters! She chose all her three characters randomly!” The audience heard the exclamation from host ‘Little White’. “It seems our Biyao is very sure of herself!”","“Now look at our Iori Yagami! He has fought his way out and always took down all three opponents with Iori Yagami alone!”","On the big screen, Iori Yagami had just finished a match. While looking back, he stuck his fingers into his hair and laughed, “Haha... Hahaha... Hahahaha!”","It was Iori Yagami’s trademarked hysterical laughter.","The bullet comments flooded the screen.","“Awesome!”","“This Iori Yagami looks quite like the original character!”","“Excellent cosplay!”","“Hahahaha! I’ll give my vote to this Iori Yagami!”","“...”","Sitting in the lounge area, two ‘Mephistos’, ‘Michael’, and the ‘alien’ gaped at the bullet comments. “They can do this?!”","The camera turned to other contestants who had excellent performances so far.","“The contestant ‘Kyo Kusanagi’ has won 15 matches straight! 15 matches! My goodness!” The host’s voice came from the big screen. “The contestant ‘Chizuru Kagura’ has won 9 matches consecutively! The contestant ‘Biyao’ has won 8 matches consecutively! Oh! What am I seeing?! At Arcade Machine No. 10, two ‘Lu Xueqis’ are battling with each other! Two ‘Lu Xueqis’!”","“Indeed?!” The audience was dazed by the sight. Sitting on the left seat was a white-clothed ‘Lu Xueqi’ with fluttering long hair and a cold pretty face; on the right seat was another ‘Lu Xueqi’ wearing a single-colored robe and a bright blue sword on her back.","Host ‘Little White’ shouted again, “‘Lu Xueqi’ on the left chose Leona Heidern as her opening character! ‘Lu Xueqi’ on the right chose ‘Iori Yagami’!”","“Gongzi Xiao, I feel like these contestants are stronger than the previous ones. They dare to choose Iori Yagami as their first!” Mu Donglai stared at the big screen and said, “Which ‘Lu Xueqi’ do you think will win?”","Xiao Yulv analyzed, “Right now, the contestants are facing away from us, and we can’t see who’s playing which character. But it doesn’t matter; we can analyze their controls and plays.”","“Iori Yagami jumped up slightly and tested with a light punch. Very cautious and leaves no openings,” Xiao Yulv explained, “Heavy punch and followed with Shiki Aoi Hana and linked twice. The moves are blocked, but his rhythm is excellent!","“His opponent, Leona Heidern, has very fast reflexes. Seeing Iori Yagami retreat, she immediately followed with a light punch and Moon Slasher, using a small combo!”","“Both contestants fight cautiously with light kicks. Shiki Yami Barai! He hit her!” Xiao Yulv explained, “In the aspect of character strength, Iori Yagami obviously gets the upper hand!”","“Gongzi Xiao, do you think ‘Lu Xueqi’ on the right has better odds of winning?” Mu Donglai asked.","The moment he said it, Xiao Yulv yelled, “Iori Yagami was tricked by the counterstrike. Oh! ‘Lu Xueqi’ on the left used the desperation move?!”","“She won!” Xiao Yulv looked at Mu Donglai and yelled, “‘Lu Xueqi’ on the left won!”","– Three minutes later –","“‘Lu Xueqi’ on the left first defeated two enemy characters with one of her characters! Then, her second character Chizuru Kagura won with full HP! What?! Cautious?! ‘Lu Xueqi’ on the left has won 16 matches consecutively!”","Xiao Yulv and Mu Donglai gaped at the big screen and were at a loss for words.","On the audience stand, the disciples of ‘Green Cloud Faction’ watched one Lu Xueqi as she walked back to her seat and mutter in resentment, “I’m so angry! The damn Lu Xueqi! Scum Lu Xueqi!”","All the disciples of ‘Green Cloud Faction’ wondered, How can she cuss herself?!","“Don’t worry!” ‘Elder Senior Sister Wen Min’ walked out. “Elder Senior Sister is going to battle her!”","– Two minutes later –","“Congratulations to contestant Lu Xueqi for winning 17 matches consecutively!”","On the audience stand, ‘Water Moon Master’ looked livid. “I’ll teach this self-important girl a lesson!”","-One minute later-","“Congratulations to the contestant Lu Xueqi for winning 18 matches consecutively!”","All the disciples from the “Green Cloud Faction” yelled furiously.","“She even rebels against her master!”","[TL Note: Water Moon Master is Lu Xueqi’s master in Jade Dynasty.]","“She dares to hit her master!”","“Scum Lu Xueqi!”","“...”","As time went on, more and more contestants got into the competition while a few of them remained on the platforms fighting their way out.","“Congratulations to contestants ‘Kyo Kusanagi’, ‘Biyao’, ‘Chizuru Kagura’, and ‘Lu Xueqi’ for entering the semi-finals!” the host’s voice sounded again, “Now, ‘Kyo Kusanagi’ versus ‘Biyao’; ‘Chizuru Kagura’ versus ‘Lu Xueqi’!”","“Contestant ‘Kyo Kusanagi’ didn’t choose Kyo Kusanagi! He chose Iori Yagami as his first character!”","“Let’s see Contestant ‘Biyao’...”","Mu Donglai sipped his milk tea and asked, “Gongzi Xiao, these are the most powerful contestants. What do you think?”","Gongzi Xiao remained silent.","Mu Donglai: “...”","-Ten minutes later-","“Now, we enter the final match between Lu Xueqi and Biyao!”","Mu Donglai looked at Xiao Yulv. “Gongzi Xiao?”","Xiao Yulv stuffed some fruits into his mouth but still remained silent.","“...”","“Biyao chose Iori Yagami, Chizuru Kagura, and Chang Koehan, a traditional powerful team; her opponent chose Iori Yagami, Chizuru Kagura, and Ryuji Yamazaki?”","Obviously, both contestants were masters, and they combated with Chizuru Kagura versus Chizuru Kagura! Iori Yagami versus Iori Yagami!","“It seems that ‘Lu Xueqi’ is still inexperienced.” Mu Donglai shook his head and said, “How could she make such a big mistake? Iori Yagami controlled by ‘Biyao’ still has full HP... Ryuji Yamazaki... this character is seldomly used, right? Gongzi Xiao, do you know anything about this character?”","While biting into a piece of dried spiritual fruit, Gongzi Xiao said calmly, “I once saw my aunt use it. This ‘Lu Xueqi’ was careless to use a new character at this moment. She’s at the disadvantage now; the result is obvious.”","“Iori Yagami leaped into the air first! Shiki Aoi Hana! Three links as soon as he landed!” Xiao Yulv shook his head and said, “I told you that this character is useless.”","On the screen, Ryuji Yamazaki leaped up and followed his rival. Meanwhile ‘Lu Xueqi’ shook her joystick lightly and swiftly.","“F*ck! His kick hit the target! His rival lost half of her HP instantly?!”","“How can this character inflict such great damage?!”","“F*ck! Her opponent was stunned?!” Xiao Yulv was stupefied by the sight.","‘Lu Xueqi’ clutched the joystick and launched a dizzying big combo.","“She won?”","“Impossible!” Mu Donglai was almost choked by his milk tea.","“It seems ‘Lu Xueqi’ still has a chance?!” On the side, the Royal Princess and the others exclaimed.","“What chance?” Mu Donglai yelled at the screen, “This big hammer is so powerful, forcing ‘Lu Xueqi’ into a corner! She can’t fight back!”","“She will be finished if she gets hit with one attack of the hammer! How can Ryuji Yamazaki lose the match?! How?!”","Sitting near them, Mr. Fang’s face twitched. “!!??”","“A trick to burn the opponent’s cooldown?” On the screen, Ryuji Yamazaki moved smoothly with light punches and fake moves as if he got assistance from a god.","“F*ck! This Ryuji Yamazaki is crazy?!”","“Another combo!”","“Biyao lost all of her HP!”","“Dead Dead!”","“Ahh!”","“The champion is born! Congratulations!”"]},{"number":413,"title":"Chapter 413 - The People in this Otherworld Know How to Have Fun","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Congratulations to Contestant ‘Lu Xueqi’ for winning the champion of the King of Fighters Competition!”","“Awesome!”","“She turned the table with an unusual strategy and character!”","“She could turn the tables in such a match?!’","In the cheers, people looked at the two opponent on the platform in disbelief.","Sitting in the lounge area, Dong Qingli asked in bafflement, “What happened? Didn’t you say that she would be taken down by one hammer?”","“Yeah. What happened?!” The Royal Princess, who was wearing light armor and had a ponytail, dressing as an Amazon from Diablo 2, looked over.","“Who said those words?” The girls all looked toward Mr. Fang, Mu Donglai, and Xiao Yulv.","Mr. Fang turned to look at Xiao Yulv and Mu Donglai.","“I didn’t say it!” ‘You Ji’ covered his mouth. “I’m always cautious and never dared to predict the outcome.”","All the gazes rested on Mu Donglai.","“Ugh...” The Royal Princess’s pretty face twitched.","“I heard that people in the Star-Observing Tower can predict our country’s fate with the information derived from the Star-Observing Map left by the previous emperor,” The Second Prince, who was cosplaying a Paladin in silver armor, said, “The people from the Star-Observing Tower never left the tower and roamed around the world.”","“You mean...” The Royal Princess moved closer toward him.","“Then, a star sign came from the Star-Observing Tower, and a super genius from the tower came out and began roaming the mortal world?”","The Royal Princess whispered, “Isn’t that situation just a rumor?”","“What did the sign say?”","“Hush... Be careful. The star sign said that one country (Dajin) is going to be destroyed...” The Second Prince looked around the prosperous Dajin and fell silent.","“The man who derived this star sign was...”","“He is...” The Royal Princess glanced at Mr. Mu, who was sitting not far from them and watching the awarding ceremony on the big screen, oblivious to their talks, and she said in disdain, “Those are just rumors. After all, Mr. Mu said that Origins Internet Club is good.”","The Second Prince said, “After he said that, the Origins Internet Club was boycotted by the whole Jiuhua City.”","The Royal Princess said, “Everyone knows Mr. Mu’s contribution to our country. For example, he came to Shengjing to watch the national examination...”","“Sister... After that, the national examination was canceled...”","“Pu! Cough!”","With a puzzled expression, Mr. Mu chuckled, “What a surprise! She won just like that?! The battles are indeed unpredictable! I can’t believe that I made a mistake in this calculation. No wonder my master always tells me to get more experience whenever I return to the Star-Observing Tower.”","Cold sweat popped out on Mr. Fang’s face. “...”","At this moment, the award ceremony began.","“Next, Mr. Fang will present prizes to our winners of the top three places!”","“Firstly, we invite the winner of the third place, Contestant ‘Kyo Kusanagi’, to the platform!” In the Jiuhua City Shop, Host Little White asked ‘Kyo Kusanagi’, “What are your thoughts at this moment?”","Mr. Fang had already taken out a red square box with a length of half a meter.","‘Kyo Kusanagi’ said, “It doesn’t count! How could the main character not be the champion?!”","The bullet comments flooded the screen!","[Hahahaha! Kyo Kusanagi: I don’t believe it! I want to fight again!]","[Kyo Kusanagi: What’s this damn Boss at the end of the game?! Where’s Orochi?!]","[Report Contestant ‘Orochi’ for cheating! He got external help! <img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f92a.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F92A;\">]","[Hahahaha! The Daoist friend who wrote the prior message is too talented!]","“...”","“Next, Mr. Fang will present the prize to the winner of the second place, Contestant Biyao!”","‘Biyao’ from the Half City Shop said, “Since Host Little White can’t come here, I have to talk all by myself as a host. I want to say that Little Brother Kyo Kusanagi fought very well. Also, Contestant Lu Xueqi’s played Ryuji Yamazaki well, and it is surprising!”","The bullet comments showed on the screen.","[I was surprised too!]","[I was stunned!]","[The last play had the shop owner’s style!]","“Lastly, we invite the champion, Contestant ‘Lu Xueqi’, to come up to the platform!” Host Little White walked up. “I heard that this is the second time that she won a championship. Besides, our Contestant ‘Lu Xueqi’ is the youngest genius in Dajin. Would you like to say something to us?”","“In fact, I was surprised too.”‘Lu Xueqi’ said in her cold voice, “When I practice, I indeed can’t defeat certain people, which is why I resorted to an unexpected character to catch my opponent off guard.”","She was modest today, which was rare of her.","“Congratulations to the champion!”","“The second champion? How did she do it?!”","“Unrivalled!”","“...”","About 10,000 people from major factions and forces gathered in the two shops, and they turned their eyes to the competition. At the same time, bullet comments flooded the screen furiously, almost completely covering the live show.","Customers from both shops almost cheered simultaneously.","With her lips slightly curving up, the tall and cold girl faintly smiled; her smile looked so charming and bright as if it were a ray of warm sunshine in the spring that was melting ice and snow.","A while later, the camera turned to the two temporary hosts while they announced, “Next is our music festival!”","People cheered again before the venue could quiet down.","The big screen dimmed, and spotlights shot down on the arena. A beauty wearing a green long dress stood there like a gorgeous green lake.","Under the colorful neon lights, the cultivators standing behind her with all kinds of instruments in their hands were dressed like people from the ‘Ghost King Faction’ from Jade Dynasty as well.","“Biyao?!”","When the familiar music came from the electric guitar in her arms, the audience was astonished.","“??!!”","“Biyao is playing rock-and-roll?!’","They were stupefied.","All the cultivators and warriors were stunned by the sight.","Wearing the ancient long dress, ‘Biyao’ held the electric guitar and plucked the strings with an energetic beat.","All the people looked at each other, dumbfounded.","Then, she began to sing, “Jung sing heung hei gwai ga dik seun hou, joi ta sang meng leui, fong fat dai dim hei heui...”","[TL Note – Meaning: The clock bell chimes the signal to go home. In his life, there seems to carry a small sigh of regret.]","“Isn’t this the song that we hear in Mr. Fang’s Qzone everyday?!”","Most of them had not only heard of it but could sing it as well.","People began to calm down from the heated atmosphere while the strong beats of the song knocked on their hearts.","Without them noticing it, they began to sing along.","“Nin yuet ba yung yau bin jou sat heui, pei gyun dik seung ngan dai jeuk kei mong...”","[TL Note – Meaning: The years have changed possession into loss. The set of fatigued eyes still carries hope..]","While more and more people joined the singing, some words from the song seemed to touch the soft spots in their hearts.","The numbness to time, the hope for the future, the hunger for freedom... The thoughts that they had suppressed inside for dozens or even hundreds of years seemed to flow out at this moment and surged up into a grand wave of passion!","Soon, all the players in the shops stood up and sang.","“Yat sang ging gwo pong wong dik jang jat. Ji seun ho goi bin mei loi. Man seui yau nang jou dou...”","[TL Note – Meaning: A lifetime of loss and struggle. Believing in one’s ability to change the future. Who else can accomplish this?]","Cheers and exclamations mingled, and the atmosphere in the two shops reached a climax that they had never seen before both inside and outside the shop.","Mr. Fang, “What a surprise... They are so high at the very beginning of the festival...”","“How come I feel like these guys know how to have fun better than I do!”"]},{"number":414,"title":"Chapter 414 - Opening The Boxes Together; Moon Goddess Gun – Artemis Came Out!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","It was late in the night.","It was still snowing.","The snacks in the shop had run out, and they only had heated pots of wine to drink.","It was meant to be a sleepless night.","Even after midnight, many people didn’t show any intention of leaving.","Outside the shops, the snow fell silently. The early morning was the coldest time of the day, and people could see through the glass window that the thin layer of snow had turned into ice on the street.","However, inside the shop, they didn’t feel a trace of chill. When they drank the warm wine, they felt warmed from inside out even though the wine wasn’t that hot.","The party lasted until about 5 AM. Mr. Fang was surprised that these cultivators who excelled in battles and artifact-making were also talented musicians of instruments such as the guzheng, lute, flute, and harp. Mr. Fang felt ashamed that he could only hum some Chinese country songs.","Even Su Tianji couldn’t resist the temptation and played the A Music from Guangling.","[TL Note: A Music from Guangling is a famous song for the guzheng.]","The powerful and elegant guzheng music presented a vast and lofty presence to the audience.","Soon, the top three places of the other two big events came out.","‘Biyao’ got the most votes in the Cosplay Competition; the ‘Smirking Face Emoji’ got the second place for its high degree of difficulty; the third place went to ‘Kyo Kusanagi’ who didn’t win the champion for the King of Fighters Competition; ‘Lu Xueqi’ took fourth place with one less vote compared to Kyo Kusanagi.","Despite her laziness, Su Tianij’s A Music from Guangling that was reproduced by the System was widely acclaimed by the cultivators, winning the first place in the music festival with the most votes.","“Well, another second place.” ‘Biyao’ took the gift box with a bit of disappointment.","To Mr. Fang’s surprise, the third place went to Dong Qingli who played the Chinese harp.","In their long life of cultivation, this night was probably only a small interlude.","However, they might recall it in some moments of their long lives, and the memories would become even more precious as time passed by.","After the prizes were presented, the winners gathered together.","What were in their boxes? Many people wanted to know the answer to this question.","At Mr. Fang’s suggestion, all the winners would open their boxes on the live stream.","“Gongzi Xiao?!” Sitting on a couch, Mu Donglai asked mildly, “I heard that you got a prize too?”","“Yeah!” Proudly, he lifted a palm-sized gift box. “The 10th place of the Cosplay Competition!”","Although he gained many extra points for the difficulty, only the customers sitting in the lounge area could see him and vote for him. That was embarrassing.","The people who didn’t enter the top three, such as Xu Zixin, Nalan Hongwu, Wang Tai, and Black Demon, received one or several palm-sized small gift boxes.","Nalan Hongwu opened one. “A discount card?”","He opened another and saw a colorful air-puffed bag with the words [Potato Chips] on it.","“!!??”","He opened another and saw a piece of white stone with engravings of strange characters.","The stone seemed to contain some extremely strange power. Nalan Hongwu brightened and then laughed, “A rune?! Rune No. 13!”","“He got such a good item?!” The people stared at the big screen and were stunned.","“I got one gift box for being a lucky audience member. I’ll open it too!” An Huwei opened his gift box and exclaimed, “I got a bag of popcorn?! What’s this thing?!”","“Magic wand! I got a magic wand from Harry Potter!” This came from Mo Xian.","“Ahh!” They heard a happy exclamation from Yue Yan, “I got one! The sword for Emei disciples!”","Liu Ningyun (Chizuru Kagura) wasn’t in top three, but she got No.4 in the King of Fighters Competition. Including the good rankings that she got from other events, she had more than ten small boxes before her.","“Samurai Edge Handgun?!”","“A bottle of Sprite?!”","“Sniper rifle bullets?!”","“What are these things?!”","“...”","“I’ll open it now! Open!” Seeing that many people had opened their gift boxes, and some of them even got good items such as runes, Xiao Yulv couldn’t resist the temptation anymore.","While lifting the box, he murmured, “I must get a rare treasure!”","“Open!” He opened it and found a box of strange black strips inside.","On the box were written – [Dove Chocolate]","“!!??”","“What are these?! They look like food?”","He opened the box and ate a piece, and tears flowed down his face as he felt the silky and rich flavor. “So delicious!”","Beside him, ‘Iori Yagami’ said to ‘Kyo Kusanagi’, “Young Master Song, what did you get?”","“Forget it. Something called Dove Chocolate. Garbage...” ‘Kyo Kusanagi’ shook his head and said, “Why can’t I get a Rune No.13, just like Senior Nalan?!”","Beside them, Xiao Yulv took another bite and chewed with tears on his face.","...","Soon, the small gift boxes had all been opened, and only the big gift boxes of the top three places were left.","The first one opening the boxes was Biyao (Ning Bi) who got the most gift boxes.","She got the first place in the Cosplay Competition and the second places in both the King of Fighters Competition and the Music Festival.","“What will I get?” She gazed at the three big gift boxes that were neatly placed before her.","“Sir, can’t you give me a clue about the contents inside?” She stared at Mr. Fang intently.","“Open them. I have no idea.”","The boxes are not big, so they can’t be weapons. The best I can get is something small like Dante’s small guns! Humph! Soon, she opened the first gift box.","A silver-grey metal object appeared, and it was one size bigger than the gift box itself.","Tiny and complex patterns were engraved on the surface with a layer of faint dark-red demonic light oozing out.","“This is...!?”","At her exclamation, the people who stared at the big screen also started to breathe heavily!","“Artemis?!”","It was a system imitatation version of the Moon Goddess Gun – Artemis! (Mr. Fang’s godly weapon fragments could be turned into complete versions of the weapons)","“It’s Moon Goddess Gun – Artemis?!”","Bedlam broke out when the first gift box was opened.","Their breaths became fast and quick.","Although it wasn’t the big swords such as Rebellion or Yamato, the Moon Goddess Gun – Artemis was a very powerful weapon.","More importantly, it was a complete item created by magic technology!","After the cultivators slowly mastered the ordinary technology, these things were what they craved for!","“The things in the boxes are so amazing?!”","“Hurry! Let’s see what’s in the next box!”"]},{"number":415,"title":"Chapter 415 - A Face So Ugly That It Should be Illegal","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Instead of quickly opening the next box, Ning Bi put the Moon Goddess Gun – Artemis onto her hands and took it out of the shop.","This magic weapon looked totally different from ordinary guns. Like a strange-shaped hand cannon, energy was condensed at the muzzle, and it quickly shot out a dangerous red light!","Then, it pierced a deep hole in the ground.","While she injected more energy into the gun, the metal part on the barrel of Artemis opened, and a dark-purple spherical energy bolt that was as big as half a person spun at a high speed with the activation of the gun, shattering the feather-like snowflakes that were floating in the air!","“This gun... is different from others!”","Its power wasn’t as great as that of the Heavenly Mirror, but it was satisfactory.","All the people looked at it with envy.","This weapon was not only powerful. Most importantly, it was extremely dashing!","In a battle, one could just launch a group of energy bolts or an ‘Acid Rain’ that looked like a meteor shower.","What a magnificent sight it would be!","The envious audience members flooded the screen with bullet comments, [Two more boxes to go! Open them now!]","“Open them! Let’s see what good stuff the shop owner put in there!”","“Don’t stall! I’m impatient to see what’s inside! Quick!”","It sounded as if the boxes belong to them.","At this moment, Ning Bi slowly walked back in, and two gift boxes were still on the table.","Obviously, these gift boxes seemed to have the same effects as storage spiritual artifacts and could contain things much larger than the boxes themselves.","It meant that anything could be in there. With some anticipation, Ning Bi pulled the second box to her.","She opened it and saw an extremely chilly ice crystal.","Now that the two shops had earned many crystals and gained abundant energy, Mr. Fang didn’t have to go and find some less important materials to power the System. This ice crystal was obviously recreated and produced by the System.","“What’s this?”","“A piece of ice?”","People looked at each other in bafflement.","This piece of ice emitted chilly energy and a mysterious white light.","There was a sign beside it.","“10,000-year-old Ice Crystal?!”","“What treasure is this?”","“Who has seen such a treasure before?”","[The flying sword of Qi Hao from the Green Cloud Faction was made with 10,000-year-old Ice Crystal.] Someone posted the information on the big screen.","“It’s a material...”","“It would be great if it was 10,000-year-old Green Crystal...” Red Wing Daoist looked disappointed since 10,000-year-old Green Crystal could be made into another Dragon-Slaying Sword; the Ice Crystal was obviously an inferior material compared to it.","“This item is ordinary...”","“It’s not nearly as good as the last one.”","The messages on the big screen showed the audience’s disappointment. This treasure was not bad, but it was not as well received as the last one.","Ning Bi put it away and took up the last gift box that she had.","All the people looked at this gift box.","Since the last two boxes contained good stuff, they knew that the things in the big gift boxes were a lot more valuable than those in the small ones.","She opened the box.","An ancient-looking wooden stick lay inside.","“What’s this thing?” Curious, Ning Bi picked up this short staff and read the sign beside it, “Hollywood as the wand body, and phoenix feather as the wand core. It is 11 inches long.”","Many customers who were watching the big screen jumped up.","“Isn’t Harry Potter’s magic wand made with these materials?!”","“I think that’s right!”","Someone had just gotten an ordinary magic wand in a small gift box, and people had felt incredulous about it. But now, they saw a magic wand made with the same materials as Harry Potter’s wand!","“But... is it useable?”","Everyone who had watched the movie knew that the items in Harry Potter’s world had spirituality; only a proper and fitting magic wand could unleash its power in the hands of a wizard or witch.","The property of Hollywood was precision. And since it was an evergreen, it also had the property of persistence and grit, which were necessary qualities for anyone who wanted to realize big ambitions.","Ning Bi took it out to test. She made a snowball and pointed the magic wand at it, chanting lightly.","“Transfiguration spell?!” All the people stared at Ning Bi in astonishment.","Then, the snowball turned into a small white chubby mouse; it leaped down from her hand and chirped in the snow.","“It indeed can be used?!”","“Aren’t you surprised that she could cast the transfiguration spell?!”","“It’s amazing that she could change a lifeless item into a living animal!”","The cultivators outside the Half City Shop felt even more incredulous since they had witnessed the change in person!","Ning Bi pointed her magic wand again, and the small white mouse that was chirping and turning in the snow immediately changed back into a snow ball.","She put away the magic wand in satisfaction.","“The next...”","“It’s my turn!” Immediately, a Smirking Face Emoji floated over.","It opened the box impatiently.","Inside lay a silver-grey pistol: [Desert Eagle]","“...?”","“Where’s the treasure?! Where’s my treasure?!” It instantly pulled off its outfit as the Smirk Face Emoji and glared at Mr. Fang with its red eyes. “They all got good stuff; why do I only get this garbage?!’","“Stop blaming me,” Mr. Fang said, “All the boxes were sealed before they were taken out; even I didn’t know what was in the boxes.”","“Then... Then, tell me what happened!” While howling, it shrunk deeper into the quilt. “Damn it! It’s getting even colder!”","After shivering for a while, it yelled, “Did you do a favor to this small demon girl and give my treasure to her?! How come her least valuable prize is better than mine?!”","Mr. Fang glanced at it in disdain. “Do you need me to explain it to you? Look at your face in the mirror, and you will know why.”","“What’s wrong with my face?” He opened the quilt a bit and revealed something pitch-black inside.","Mr. Fang said, “With your ugly face, how can you compare with a beauty like her?!”","“Is it my fault that I have an ugly face?!” the demon yelled.","Mr. Fang looked very dignified. “Sorry, but your face is so ugly that it should be illegal to show it in public. Remember to bleach it before opening the box next time.”","“I’m angry! I’m so angry!” It took a deep breath of the spiritual essence and then realized something; it instantly yelled, “I quit!”","“Hahahaha!”","“Senior Sister, the demon became so dumb after it was suppressed by Mr. Fang.” Yue Yan shook with laughter.","“A face so ugly that it should be illegal... Hahaha!” Mo Xian slammed her hand on the table. “I... I quit! Hahahaha!”","[Where’s the next person? Does the next person have a beautiful face?]","Soon, someone asked in a bullet comment.","Four others received big gift boxes: Nalan Mingxue (Lu Xueqi), Song Qingfeng (Kyo Kusanagi), Dong Qingli, and Su Tianji."]},{"number":416,"title":"Chapter 416 - Mr. Fang’s super big gift box","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Song Qingfeng (Kyo Kusanagi) got the third place in both the King of Fighters Competition and the Cosplay Competition.","He received two gift boxes for being third place in two events.","On the big screen, Song Qingfeng walked up with two gift boxes in his arms; he looked a bit excited.","After all, he didn’t get into the top three in the Diablo 2 Competition and only got the prize of extra game time. However, this time, he won two gift boxes.","Cheerfully, he opened the first box.","Inside was a strange transparent small box.","Inside this box was a red flame.","“What’s this?”","Curious, he read the sign beside the flame, “Red Flame. The red flame energy inside can purify one’s own power of flames.”","“F*ck?!” Song Qingfeng froze. “Isn’t it Kyo Kusanagi’s red flame?!”","The audience was also stupefied. “Does it mean that one can transform their own flame energy into Kyo Kusanagi’s fire after refining and absorbing the energy inside this flame?”","Everyone knew that Kyo Kusanagi’s red flame had an extremely high temperature, and no ordinary flames could be compared to it.","“Hahaha! This one is awesome!” Elated, Song Qingfeng opened the other gift box.","However, he wasn’t so lucky this time. A white stone lay inside the gift box; it was a rune with a strange fire-patterned engraving on it.","“Rune No. 3?!” Song Qingfeng’s face turned dark, and he almost fainted in disappointment.","“My turn! My turn!” Su Tianji was holding the gift box for the first place in the Music Festival. Obviously, her prize was two levels higher than Song Qingfeng’s.","Impatient, she walked up and opened the box; inside was a long sword with abundant spiritual essence.","Two feet long, the sword looked to be made of jade but wasn’t jade. The strangest thing was that it felt like ice.","The sword blade was one foot shorter than ordinary swords, and it was crystal clear like autumn’s water; one could see their reflections on it clearly. ( Boxno vel. co m )","There was a straight green mark on the ridge of the sword, going from the handle to the tip.","Su Tianji exclaimed, “Black Snow?!”","Black Snow and Tianya were both known as godly swords since the ancient times in Jade Dynasty. Although Black Snow was less famous than Tianya, which was Lu Xuequ’s sword, it was very powerful!","“How come she’s so lucky?!’","“She got Black Snow!”","“What kind of luck is this?!”","People stared at the big screen in shock.","“Ahhahahaha! I got Black Snow!” Su Tianji almost danced in elation with this elegant ancient flight sword in hand. “Black Snow Godly Sword! Hahaha!”","“Calm down. You’re on the livestream!” Standing beside her, Mr. Fang looked embarrassed.","“Oh...”","“Ahem... Who’s the next one?” Su Tianji changed the subject while people were distracted by Black Snow.","Hearing the comments and seeing that others had gotten many good items, Dong Qingli couldn’t remain sitting anymore. “I’ll open my box.”","However, even though most people got good items, some items from the boxes were still disappointing, and she wondered what was inside her box for being the third place.","She unconsciously felt uneasy.","Nervous, she pulled open one corner of the gift box.","“What is it?!”","“What’s inside?!”","Almost all the cultivators and warriors watching the process had their hearts in their throats since the gift boxes had given them so many surprises.","Some people stood up from their seats while others walked closer to stand right before the big screen as if they wanted to crawl into it.","“Open! Open it!” Black Demon’s face almost touched the big screen.","“Hurry!” The few girls from the Nanhua Faction also walked up.","At this moment, Dong Qingli gritted her teeth and opened the lid!","Then, she exclaimed.","Inside the box was a celestial lingzhi mushroom with abundant spiritual essence.","The celestial lingzhi mushroom from Spiritual Mountain (From the Legend of the Sword and Fairy) was also called Fortunate Herb. It had magical effects of nurturing one’s essence and vital qi.","Although it wasn’t as good as the others, it wasn’t an ordinary item like the others. Dong Qingli was a bit disappointed, but she immediately put it away, knowing that it was rare.","At this moment, only one big gift box was left.","It was Nalan Mingxue’s gift box for getting first place in the King of Fighters Competition.","Nalan Mingxue was a bit nervous, a rare feeling for her. With slightly shaky hands, she opened the gift box.","Her eyelids twitched.","A big saber as white as snow and emitting chilly essence jumped out from the box.","Beside it was a dark blue saber sheath.","“This is...?!”","The saber was as long as three feet and seven inches. As the chilliest thing in the world, someone would bleed whenever it was unsheathed, and it could kill without shedding blood since the blood would be frozen by the chilliness of the saber before it could splash out!","The temperature in the shop lowered noticeably, and some cultivators and warriors with low cultivation strengths moved away from the saber involuntarily.","“The Snow-Drinking Saber that belongs to Nie Family in Wind and Cloud?!”","Many warriors widened their eyes.","Sitting nearby, the Royal Princess had the urge to take the saber for herself. “She really got this saber?!”","Ji Wu also stared at it with wide eyes. “Nie Feng’s Snow-Drinking Saber from Wind and Cloud?!”","[TL Note: Since snow is pronounced the same as blood in Chinese, it is also known as the Blood-Drinking Saber.]","Nalan Mingxue walked out the door with the saber in her hand.","She slashed the saber, and snowflakes fell more intensely around her!","Then, she hacked it out with vicious force!","A huge icy blue saber energy hacked down!","“The 40-meter-long saber?!”","“So cool!” Song Qingfeng and the others exclaimed while they watched.","“Ahhh... Why didn’t I get within the top three places?!” Seeing these great prizes, many people felt crazy with frustration.","“Humph!” Jiang Xiaoyue folded her arms before her chest and averted her little face; she had only three small gift boxes, all containing snacks.","The others were also filled with envy, jealousy, and hate.","At this moment, only Mr. Fang’s gift box was left unopened.","Of course, Mr. Fang wouldn’t put it on the livestream. Instead, he opened it while he was alone in his room, trying to get rich without anyone knowing.","Even the ordinary big gift box contained such good items; what was inside Mr. Fang’s super big gift box?","With shaking hands, Mr. Fang opened his super big gift box.","He saw several things jumping out from the box!","[Beep! You received one godly weapon fragment.] With a purple flash, the number of godly weapon fragments on the System Interface grew by one.","[Beep! You received Beowulf.] A set of gauntlets and greaves filled with the power of light were placed before Mr. Fang.","[Beep! You receive Kalina Ann multi-functional missile launcher (Unlimited).]","[Beep! You receive Golden Sun Wheel!]","[Beep! You receive Golden Moon Wheel!]","Hearing the prompts from the System, Mr. Fang’s face became distorted with exhilaration!","...","This establishment could be traced back to prehistoric times.","According to the legends, when the creatures all over the world still lived in ignorance, and the mortal world was like a lone boat that was floating in the bitter ocean with many creatures on it, a powerful immortal who ate wind and drank dew began preaching Dao in the blessed land of Spiritual Mountain and teaching people how to cultivate. At that time, many grandmasters emerged.","Some elites of the grand masters followed the example of that immortal and established academies to teach Dao.","Since the ancient times, many famous and virtuous masters came from the Heavenly Academy. Even people from the remote Deserted Sea Realm heard of the names of cultivators from Heavenly Academy, which showed the lofty position of the academy in the Spiritual State.","At this moment, Mr. Fang from the remotest place in the world, the Deserted Sea Realm, was about to walk out of this deserted area and step onto that strange land."]},{"number":417,"title":"Chapter 417 - Heading to Spirit State","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","In the Game Cultivation Room, Fang Qi was going through the last cultivation session before his journey.","It was said that the cultivators and warriors at Spiritual State had much higher strengths than those in the Deserted Sea Realm, so Mr. Fang had to be ready.","– On the demonic tower under the full moon –","A blue shadow flashed, and Fang Qi raised his hands to block at almost the same time.","In the next moment, blood splashed. Fang Qi’s face paled when a distinct chip appeared in his thick saber blade, and a wound appeared on his arm, so deep that it was revealing the bone inside!","However, the attack wasn’t finished yet. From the blind spot of his vision, a cold-eyed figure wearing a blue windbreaker sheathed his saber.","Immediately, Fang Qi’s vision blurred, which came with a muffled weird sound.","Meanwhile, a creepy saber energy slashed into him!","With excruciating pain, Mr. Fang opened his eyes and found himself back in the respawn spot.","From the unfathomable distance away, that aloof figure stood where he was and put his hand on his saber handle before the saber moved slightly. ( Boxno vel. co m )","Fang Qi was about to step out from the respawn spot when a saber energy appeared before him.","“F*ck!”","He died.","The moment that Mr. Fang respawned again, he fled immediately.","As soon as he moved, several saber energies appeared after him!","“...” Before he could take a breath of relief, another saber energy appeared out of the blue!","“F*ck...”","– More than half a year later –","Vergil slowly put his hand on the saber handle with a deep, abyss-like aura, and both the saber and the hand seemed to have vanished.","Meanwhile, Fang Qi moved back a bit, and the saber in his hand also vanished!","The saber energies collided with each other about a few inches before his face, instantly creating a wave of bright sparks!","“Hu...” Having reached the King Warrior Realm, the disheveled Fang Qi wiped the sweat off his forehead and saw Vergil suddenly freezing. Then, the space around them returned to darkness. “This Dimension Slash is so damn hard to master...”","[Current Cultivation: Vergil, Dimension Slash","Synchronization (Dimension Slash): 30%","Total Synchronization: 13.732%","Skill experiences gained/Character’s cultivation strength gained: 9653/3628","Comment: You can now use this technique with proficiency.","By now, Fang Qi had mastered the Dimension Slash and reached level 2 of the Royalguard Style. Together with other gun and sword techniques that he had mastered, his strength had greatly increased.","Meanwhile, his cultivation strength had finally grown to level 2 of the King Warrior Realm.","...","The sky above Half City was always gloomy. In the long time that Mr. Fang stayed in the city, it had never cleared. However, after the long period of heavy snow, it suddenly turned sunny; it was too rare.","As usual, some old customers from Half City, such as Mo Tianxing, came into the shop early in the morning and bought instant noodles; they had never missed a single day.","“Guild President, are you going out?” The old men who played online games with him still called him guild president.","By now, the Legend of Mir 2 had moved from the three old godly weapons which were Judgement, Bone Jade, and Dragon Mark, to the three new godly weapons which were Furious Hack, Dragon Tooth, and Xiaoyao Fan.","In the past year, the players had reached the Red Moon Valley and paved a path of corpses inside the valley.","They had discovered Overseas Moon Island and Bull Demon Temple. While the Dragon-Slaying Saber appeared, the path leading back to the Godly Dragon Empire was gradually taking shape.","Mr. Fang still played the game every day, and his Heaven-Defying Online Games Guild remained neutral. Despite frequent small skirmishes, the world in the game was generally peaceful.","While the cultivators and warriors from both shops joined all kinds of guilds and battled fiercely in the game, some of them had gradually developed friendships outside the game.","After they got tired of killing monsters in the Legend of Mir 2, they would drive around or race in Grand Theft Auto 5 to enjoy a totally different lifestyle.","“Yeah.” Mr. Fang stretched. “I’ve stayed in the shop for a long time, and it’s time for me to go out and explore.”","“Is it really far?” Ruan Ning frowned. She used to bicker with Mr. Fang all the time, but now she looked concerned. “With your current strength, you’ll be fine, eh?”","“Boss, when are you coming back?” Still shy, Zou Mo looked toward him and asked.","Lounging on a couch, Mr. Fang looked at the sunlight that was filtering into the shop from the window and chuckled, “I think it will be a long while.”","“Making a long trip at the beginning of the spring?” Ning Bi walked in and placed a handful of crystals on the counter before pouring herself a cup of milk tea smoothly.","“Take care,” Liu Ningyun, who usually ignored and disliked Mr. Fang, said to him.","The Black Dragon City Castellan, Huangpu Tao, Red Wing Daoist, and the others all stood up and cupped hands at him.","Mr. Fang waved his hand calmly.","...","In the Jiuhua City Shop, the group of old players acted quite calm since they had experience from the last parting.","“Going out to open another branch?” Nalan Hongwu asked while eating his instant noodles.","“When you get there, remember to put it on livestream.” Su Tianji and her two disciples were drinking milk tea. “After all, we haven’t seen Xiaoyue’s hometown, the Spirit State, yet.”","“Xiaoyue!” From the outside the shop, Lan Yan waved at Xiaoyue who stood beside Jiang Xuan. “Remember to access QQ with your communication jade, so we can still chat with each other.”","“Okay!”","With sword energies blinking, they had flown to the sky outside the city.","Jiang Xuan cupped his hands. “Brother Fang, have you considered opening a shop in the Royal City of my clan?”","He continued, “We have many masters in our clan. In the Royal City, 12 other clans come to offer contributions to our clan, giving the city a rare advantage. If you open a shop in the city, you don’t have to worry about thugs bothering you.”","“Right! Boss, open the shop near my home, and I’ll ask Dad to send some guards to the shop so that no one dares to mess around. After all, we can’t ask that senior for help every time we’re in trouble, right?”","Mr. Fang shook his head. “It’s not necessary.”","“Why is it not necessary?!” Jiang Xiaoyue was displeased. “You just don’t want to take me to have fun!”","Usually, all kinds of issues occurred in royal cities, let alone one that belonged to an ancient clan.","Besides, if the shop was opened in a border city like Jiuhua City, many people from other countries could access the shop.","If it had been opened in the Royal City of Dajin, it would have been convenient for groups of cultivators from the Yundian Realm or the three saint factions to take the whole royal city by force before Ji Wu could react. Although the possibility of such things happening was almost zero, any country must be wary of the potential risks.","Mr. Fang explained, “It would be very troublesome for you to fly back to the Royal City each day after school. I will go ahead and do some research to find a good location, so you can fly to the shop each day after school.”","“Yeah...” Jiang Xiaoyue said with sudden understanding, “Even with the sword control technique, it will take me a long time to make a round trip to the Royal City... It’s best if you don’t open it in the Royal City. Go ahead then!”","Mr. Fang nodded.","Jiang Xuan’s face twitched.","Damn it! I wanted to invite Mr. Fang to visit our Jiang Family, but now I have to think of another way .","“Brother Fang, do you know how to get through the Heavenly Forbidden Zones?”","Mr. Fang nodded. “Sort of.”","“Then, I’ll take Xiaoyue home. The girl sneaked out and hasn’t been home for a long time,” Jiang Yuan said.","Mr. Fang waved his hand, and Jiang Xuan saw a white light flash before him.","He froze.","Fang Qi was gone."]},{"number":418,"title":"Chapter 418 - Mr. Fang Put the Crash on Livestream","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","The turbulent ocean was the most dangerous place. The deep and dark sea concealed many unknown perils.","After crossing the vast ocean and traveling all the way to the south, it was heard that one could reach the distant land with much broader space and a bigger arena.","It was said that ultimate figures, who were like immortals in the mortal world, and unrivaled almighty emperors of warriors had once appeared on this vast land.","Like radiant pearls, these ultimate figures decorated the vast space in history, and their bright light overshadowed the stars.","There were abundant spiritual essence and bountiful resources, with which even a talentless mortal could learn some combat techniques to strengthen their physiques. Even ordinary wild beasts had tremendous strength, and the best of them could transform into demon beasts that had great strength and iron-like bodies.","As for the real demon beasts, mountain ghost, and spirits, they were even more powerful.","Some armored warriors standing on the cliffs along the shore were looking into the distance, watching out for unknown dangers from the ocean.","In the small town along the seashore, some men with sleeveless shirts carried back the rewards of their hunting trip – the corpse of a demon wolf that was bigger than a man. Pedestrians walking around the town carrying weapons could be seen all over the streets.","Under the blue sky, the ocean was unusually calm.","At this moment, gusts of wind swept across the endless ocean while the sky gradually dimmed. Then, thunderbolts shot across the vast sky.","In the dark sky, a bright light flashed and shot into the distance with dazzling sword energy.","“Look...”","“What’s that?!”","Some warriors pointed at the vague traveling light that appeared in the sky, but it was so fast that it disappeared in a flash. Before they could take a closer look, it had gone into the distance, and they could only see a tiny light dot in the sky.","Meanwhile, a pair of turbid eyes in the crowd stared at the speedy light in the sky with different glints in them.","“It has been many years...","“Someone came out from the Deserted Sea Realm...”","...","“Hiss...!” Flying in the sky, Fang Qi looked at the flying birds and took a deep breath. “Even the air has the fragrance of spiritual essence. Ahh!”","He felt as if he had finally come into a remote mountain after staying in a packed city with bad air quality for a long time. The fresh air and the flower fragrance refreshed his mind and spirit as if the mountain was empty and it just had rained.","Mr. Fang turned on the livestream at the same time.","“Hi! Everyone, I’ve reached the destination of this journey, Spirit State!”","Liu Ningyun, Mo Tianxing, and the others in the Half City Shop, and Su Tianji, Song Qingfeng, and some others in the Jiuhua City Shop were still eating instant noodles on the couches after saying farewell to Mr. Fang a short moment ago.","“Wu...” They almost spat out the instant noodles that they had just eaten.","What the heck?","He had just said farewell to us, and he arrived at the destination already?!","Enraged, Su Tianji sent a bullet comment to counter him, [Scummy Shop Owner, who are you trying to fool?!]","Lan Yan: [Where’s Xiaoyue?]","Mo Tianxing: [Guild President. Don’t joke; we’re not morons.]","Ning Bi widened her beautiful eyes with a cup of milk tea in her hand. [Already in the Spirit State?]","Mr. Fang said, “Of course. With the shop’s advanced technology, you still doubt my high speed?”","[I doubt it!]","[This place looks no different from ours!]","Soon, a large group of people walked up to watch the livestream, but no one believed him.","“F*ck...” Mr. Fang was frustrated. “This has to be Spirit State, okay? Am I someone who spouts nonsense?”","Ruan Ning” [Then, tell us what this place is. Aren’t you going to Heavenly Academy with Xiaoyue? Where’s the Heavenly Academy?]","Fang Qi froze. Right... Where is this place? Where am I?","The System’s teleportation was indeed convenient, but...","He had not the slightest idea as for where he was tossed to.","He had no map of this place. Even if he had one, he couldn’t find his location without an obvious landmark.","Instantly, the bullet comments began to boo him. [You only know how to tease us.]","[If you can, show us the Heavenly Academy and Xiaoyue’s home.]","Embarrassed, Mr. Fang scratched his head. [Wait. I’ll find someone and ask for directions.]","He glanced around but saw no one.","Su Tianji and the others watched the livestream on the big screen while eating breakfast.","At this moment, Mr. Fang vaguely saw a spiritual boat traveling by in the distance.","“Hey! See what I found!”","A spiritual boat was traveling alone!","All the people fell silent while their minds created a scene on their own.","[You are going to show off your sword control technique again since they had never seen it before.]","[Shame on you...] After sending the comments, they ignored Mr. Fang and resumed eating instant noodles.","“I just want to ask for directions. How can it be shameful?!” In disdain, Mr. Fang controlled the flying sword and flew over. After all, he was quite familiar with such things.","He had done it many times and would be gone immediately after asking for directions, showing off and hiding his name and identity.","A sword energy swiftly shot across the sky, flying toward the blue spiritual boat at a great speed. From the distance, people could see the beautiful cloud and bird patterns on the surface of the spiritual boat; it was luxuriously made.","The elegant streamline of the boat body made it look more like a huge blue sword, and the mystical and profound light patterns flowed in the pale blue spiritual light surrounding the boat. In one glance, they knew that it wasn’t like any spiritual boats that they had ever seen.","“Ugh? This spiritual boat looks strange...”","“The spiritual light looks weird too. It seems like the arrays are attached to the spiritual light?”","[Are there such spiritual boats in Half City?] Su Tianji asked curiously.","Ruan Ning: [We’ve never seen such spiritual boats here in Half City. Its artifact-making techniques look much more advanced than ours. Besides, this spiritual boat moves so fast!”","[Hahahaha! Look at Mr. Fang.]","Mr. Fang flew for a long while, slowly getting closer to the boat.","“That’s hilarious. I’ll have finished my instant noodles before he catches up to the boat!”","Mr. Fang was stunned as well. “How come the spiritual boats here move so fast?”","Instead of showing off himself, he got shown off instead! Besides, he was on the livestream!","He couldn’t let it go on like this!","Mr. Fang tightened his sword spell and greatly accelerated!","The speed of the sword control technique was largely determined by the user’s cultivation strength. Since Fang Qi’s cultivation strength had increased to the King Warrior Realm, he could move faster with the sword control technique.","He gained up on the boat swiftly as the distance between them quickly reduced.","Maintaining the sword spell with one hand, Mr. Fang said calmly, “It’s a piece of cake to catch up with this spiritual boat.”","The audience was at a loss for words.","“After I ask for the direction, I...”","Before he could finish, he felt an extremely dangerous sensation sweeping toward him!","He instantly retreated for dozens of meters subconsciously!","Meanwhile, the spiritual boat before him suddenly broke from the middle.","With a huge booming sound, it exploded.","Mr. Fang froze.","The audience watching the livestream stared at the screen intently. “What’s happening?!”"]},{"number":419,"title":"Chapter 419 - Whose Sword Control Technique Is Authentic?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Mr. Fang was very displeased with this situation. “My performance crashed?”","“No...” Fang Qi suddenly remembered that mysterious sense of danger; it was an intuition that he had developed after many battles in the Game Cultivation Room.","It was very likely that this wasn’t an accident.","Then, he saw several spiritual lights flying from the spiritual boat to the distance in all directions.","...","Besides abundant spiritual items, there were many precious Daoist relics left by the grandmasters who had ascended in the prehistoric time on the Spirit State. Treasures themselves were not bad, but holding onto them will cause envy, jealousy, and hate. Whenever a precious treasure appeared, it would cause a bloody war.","For some forces with relative weaker strengths, if they were lucky enough to obtain a rare treasure, it might bring them destruction if the news was leaked out.","The Li Family of Xifeng Cliff was an ordinary small cultivation family. With few talented members in the family, they would sink into a decline soon. However, not long ago, the rumors had it that the daughter of the Li Family Master suddenly achieved tremendous growth in cultivation strength.","Someone leaked the news that she had gotten a rare treasure called the Mystical Fate Jade.","It was hard to see from afar. At a closer look, the audience saw that the people flying out from the spiritual boat included a woman in a white silk long dress and some disciples in uniforms.","There was also a white-clothed elder who looked wary and alarmed.","With a grim expression, the woman in white dress looked up and said, “Who are you? Our Li Family of Xifeng Cliff never fought with anyone and have no enemies. You just destroyed our spiritual boat; do you want to wage war on Li Family?”","“Wage war?” The voice laughed arrogantly. “After today, do you think there will be a Xifeng Cliff in the world?! Ms. Li, hand over the Mystical Fate Jade. Otherwise, you’ll all end up like this spiritual boat.”","The voice resonated in the sky, and it seemed to be coming from all directions. No one knew where it came from.","The woman’s face fell immediately, and she said coldly, “What Mystical Fate Jade? I’m on my way to study in the Heavenly Academy and don’t know anything about a Mystical Fate Jade. I think you have mistaken me for someone else.”","“Don’t try to scare me with the Heavenly Academy! Study? I think you want to take this opportunity to hide the Mystical Fate Jade.” The voice sounded impatient, and that extremely dangerous presence appeared again.","Fang Qi looked intently and finally saw it; it was a light beam as slim as a black thread. In the next instant, the white-clothed elder yelled in pain, and his arm was cut off at the shoulder; sweat popped out all over his body with the excruciating pain!","Even Fang Qi felt goosebumps all over his body, let alone the audience who was watching the livestream.","“What was that?!”","“How come I feel like I just saw the sword control technique?”","“No... The cultivators in Spirit State can use sword control technique too?!”","Su Tianji said in bafflement, “Xiaoyue never mentioned it... Isn’t Xiaoyue from the Spirit State?”","“It doesn’t look like a flying sword.” In Half City Shop, strange light flashed in a pair of green eyes, and she sent a bullet comment, [It wasn’t a sword.]","Indeed, it looked like sword control technique, but all the people including the woman with the surname Li only saw something like a black iron ball hovering in the air.","“What the heck is this thing?!”","“It’s an evil and unorthodox method! We’ll fight with him to the death!” One disciple yelled before dashing toward the small iron-ball-looking object.","“Stop!” The woman tried to warn him, but with a black flash, a hole appeared on this disciple’s belly.","His body fell from the sky listlessly.","“Third Junior Brother?!” The others yelled in sorrow and caught the corpse of this white-clothed disciple. He was dead with endless fear and disbelief in his wide-opened eyes; he couldn’t be more dead.","If Fang Qi hadn’t dodged while he chased after the spiritual boat, he would probably have ended up just like this disciple.","The ball-shaped item still hovered in the mid-air; it was hard to imagine that such an ordinary-looking iron ball could unleash such horrifying power.","“This is...?!” The woman looked scared as if she had recognized it. While pointing at the ball with shaking hands, she said, “This is... sword ball?!”","“You’re not as ignorant as you look,” the voice snickered.","It was indeed not a flying sword. It was a sword ball, which could be sharp enough to cut through metal as if it were mud and soft enough to wind around fingers and turn into threads of spiritual essence. It was a kind of ultimate treasure from one of the ancient factions in the Spirit State, but the creation method had long been lost.","Anyone who could possess such a treasure and use it with proficiency must have a powerful force behind them.","The cultivators who had such treasures had much greater combat force than ordinary cultivators since this horrifying killer weapon could instantly tear open all the defense mechanisms on spiritual boats made by the cultivators of the Spirit State, let alone protective spiritual artifacts; they were weak and fragile like paper in front of it.","The woman with the surname Li laughed bitterly, “I’m surprised that Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace would become so despicable and desperate in order to get that item!”","All the people turned pale. If it were only a sword ball, they might have a chance to escape. But now, they were plunged into deep despair since they knew the huge force behind the sword ball would never allow them to escape.","A comment appeared on the big screen, [Sir, it seems that you can’t get out now...]","Fang Qi frowned slightly, finding that he was also surrounded by the many chilly auras hiding nearby.","“Treasures belong to the powerful,” the voice said with a snicker, “The only thing that you can blame is your weak strength. Now, I’ve changed my mind. I will kill you and get the Mystical Fate Jade, so you don’t have to hand it over!”","He was so sure of himself and so arrogant that he regarded the people before him as ants that he could kill whenever he wanted.","Maybe for him, these cultivators were indeed ants.","A figure with white hair and white clothes dashed down from the sky as if he were descending from Heaven, looking like a god who could dictate people’s fates.","“Nangong Jiuwen?!”","Meanwhile, the sword ball moved again.","Deep despair engulfed everyone’s mind like a layer of grey mist; they found that they couldn’t even cast spiritual spells before this sword ball.","Many of them closed their eyes subconsciously, wondering who would die after this black flash.","“There is such a thing in this world?!”","The audience who were watching the livestream was astonished.","“Which do you think is more powerful, the sword control technique or this thing?”","“It seems similar to the sword control technique...” Ruan Ning muttered, “I don’t know which is more authentic...”","Tink! At this moment, a sword light shot out from the side.","The sword ball instantly paused!","“!!?? It’s blocked?!”","Where did the sword come from?!","Mr. Fang looked displeased. “Of course, my sword control technique is authentic!”"]},{"number":420,"title":"Chapter 420 - Bold and Fearless Sword Control Technique","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Who is it?!” Hovering in the high sky and supported by invisible winds, the white-clothed cultivator stood with his hands clasped behind him. His clothes flapped in the wind, and his eyes turned chilly.","With a dark expression, Nangong Jiuwen slowly turned toward Fang Qi’s direction.","It wasn’t that he hadn’t noticed Fang Qi, but he had paid no attention to this passerby. In his eyes, this passerby, who had seen things he shouldn’t see, was going to be a dead man, and it was meaningless to pay any attention to a dead person.","Meanwhile, the cultivators of the Li Family also looked at Fang Qi.","They saw a young man wearing a blue and white robe which was in a unique style and had strange patterns.","Besides, the long robe even had two pockets. Instead of standing with hands clasped behind his back, this man stood with his hands in the pockets.","Then, they looked down and saw the young man standing on a strange-shaped broadsword which had four weird runes on the body; it seemed like he was weightless.","This person looked strange and weird.","Despite the weirdness, none of them believed that this young man had blocked Nangong Jiuwen’s sword ball.","“Who helped us?” The white-clothed elder who had lost one arm asked in a low voice; his old face twisted in pain.","With a snicker, Nangong Jiuwen said toward the sky, “Sneaky Thief, I don’t know where you are from, but do you dare to come out?”","Bullet comments already flooded the big screen.","[Is he blind? He can’t see such a big person before him?]","[Mr. Fang was ignored.] ( Boxno vel. co m )","...","Nangong Jiuwen’s face fell when he couldn’t sense another person’s presence nearby, and no one answered him.","Looking at the weirdly-dressed young man and the flying sword beneath his feet, Nangong Jiuwen asked, “Was it you? Which force are you from? Do you know what happens to the people who dare to mind my business?”","“Which force...?” Mr. Fang thought for a while. “The Heaven-Defying Online Games Guild? Yeah. I’m the guild president of the Heaven-Defying Online Games Guild.”","The audience watching the livestream in Half City shop was at a loss for words.","Song Qingfeng: [Sir, that’s your guild in the game. How can people in the real world know about it?]","[They don’t play the Legend of Mir 2. How can they know about your Heaven-Defying Online Games Guild...]","[Tell them that you’re the owner of the Origins Internet Club!] Liu Ningyun reminded him in a bullet comment.","Soon, many comments replied, [They have the same effects. I think the title of the Heaven-Defying Online Games Guild President sounds more powerful...]","The comments began to fiercely argue about which title Mr. Fang should use; he only had two.","Meanwhile, the cultivators of the Li Family exchanged looks of bafflement. “What online games guild?”","On the other side, Nangong Jiuwen laughed when he heard this title. “What online games guild?”","“I, Nangong Jiuwen, was in seclusion cultivation recently, and now even a tiny cultivator with no name dares to challenge me. You blocked my sword, eh?” He turned his wrists with interest and said with a laugh, “How about this? Take ten more sword strikes from me, and I’ll let you go if you are still alive after that. What do you think?”","He looked exactly like a cat who had just caught a mouse and wanted to play with it maliciously.","Mr. Fang looked left and right but didn’t answer.","The audience in front of the big screens were also stupefied.","“I’m sorry to get you involved in this fight,” the woman of the Li Family said with a light sigh. “Thank you for your help, but this man has great strength. If you can, you must run.”","“Run?” While glancing at Nangong Jiuwen who stood in the sky and looked down at them with his hands clasped behind his back, Mr. Fang waved his hand and replied, “How about you run instead? I’ll pretend that my hand slipped and not kill you.”","“Kill me?!” Nangong Jiuwen looked as if he had heard a joke, and chilly murderous spirit flashed in his eyes. “Do you know that you will bring death to all the people in your force with these words, even including any dogs you have!”","“F*ck?! What did you just say?!” Bullet comments exploded on the screen.","“How come the cultivators of the Spirit State are so arrogant? Even the people of the three saint factions are not so arrogant!” The cultivators in Jiuhua City were dazed, wondering if all the cultivators of the Spirit State were like this man.","– Meanwhile in the Half City Shop –","While slamming his hand on the table, Black Demon jumped up and shouted, “Sir, kill him!”","Tang Yuan, [If you dare, come to Half City, and I’ll nail you to death!]","They sounded more impatient and angrier than Mr. Fang. If they were on-site, they would have attacked by now.","“Don’t think that you’re good just because you blocked my attack,” Nangong Jiuwen said, “It was just a casual attack by me without any sword technique.”","He sneered, and the sword ball in the air was stretched by his spiritual essence, turning into a black slim sword thread.","Like a black dragon, it immediately turned into a beam a black light and vanished!","The sword technique of the sword ball was obviously weirder and more versatile compared to Fang Qi’s sword control technique. The sword ball had changed into a spiritual sword as soft as silk threads, and it moved so fast that it couldn’t be detected by the naked eye!","“Now, I’ll let you have a taste of the power of my Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace’s sword technique.”","The moment he said it, the black light, undetectable to the naked eye, hacked toward Fang Qi from one side with a nimble trajectory.","“Run!” the woman in the silk white dress yelled in alarm.","“Run? Do you want me to livestream my escape?” While he spoke, Mr. Fang held a broadsword identical to the one beneath his feet. Then, the dim sword light suddenly brightened!","“I know something about the... sword control technique as well.” Meanwhile, the sword energy grew so bright that it even overshadowed the sun high in the sky!","While the sword energy brightened, the body of the sword seemed to be shaking in excitement, and the sword cry echoed in everyone’s ears. When the sword ball hacked toward him, the whole world seemed to be engulfed by a huge bolt of sword energy. Meanwhile, Fang Qi’s whole aura changed, looking like a legendary god.","With a sharp sword whistling sound, the sword energy shot across the sky like a lightning bolt from Heaven!","Crack!","As if thunder rumbled, the sword ball and flying sword collided in the sky several times!","“You are seeking death!” The murderous spirit in Nangong Jiuwen’s eyes intensified, surprised that this weird flying sword could block the sword ball. “You want to compete with my sword ball in terms of speed?!”","A blur of pitch-black sword energy had dodged Fang Qi’s flying sword and hacked toward Fang Qi silently!","Fang Qi remained calm as if he didn’t see it coming. On the other hand, the flying sword shot out at a terrifying speed, crashing toward Nangong Jiuwen like a mountain or a surging ocean wave without any intention of defending Fang Qi from the strike!","“Are you crazy?!”","Fang Qi was expressionless.","Nangong Jiuwen’s attack would pierce Fang Qi’s chest but, Fang Qi’s sword could hack Nangong Jiuwen into two halves. Fang Qi would survive, but he wouldn’t.","With a sudden, alarming yell, Nangong Jiuwen tilted his body subconsciously.","Then, blood gushed into the sky while an arm flew up!","“This is...”","Dazed, the audience who were watching the livestream gaped at the sight.","Mr. Fang sighed lightly, “Unfortunately, I don’t have the Dragon-Slaying Sword, but this sword technique is quite effective. The secret of this sword technique lies in how fearless and bold you are; if you force yourself to use it without flinching, the bolder and more reckless you are, the more powerful the technique will be.”","Fang Qi had used the sword technique that Wan Jianyi taught to Lin Jingyu in Jade Dynasty.","Everyone fell silent."]},{"number":421,"title":"Chapter 421 - Mocking Before Fighting","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","When Nangong Jiuwen dodged, he had lost control of his sword ball, which missed its target and whistled past Fang Qi’s ear, cutting off one strand of his hair.","Mr. Fang felt some heat on his face and touched it, feeling a bloody scratch.","The cultivators around him were all stupefied.","Livid, Nangong Jiuwen covered his armless shoulder where blood gushed out.","He had great pride in the sword ball and the Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace’s exquisite sword techniques. But to his astonishment, his opponent cut off his arm a few exchanges later.","“Impetuous! Impetuous man!” Nangong Jiuwen spluttered in anger, “This kid just doesn’t know how great my sword techniques are!”","This set of sword techniques was called Sky-Startling Nine Strikes, and there were 72 variations derived from the nine strikes. However, he had only used a few variations out of the 72. Before he could unleash the profound techniques, he was injured already.","Mr. Fang shrugged and continued to explain, “Don’t waste your breath on him. I just aimed to kill with one attack. How could he fight with me? He had no choice but to dodge!”","[Got it! Got it!]","[Sir, you’re awesome!]","The bullet comments all praised and boasted. ( Boxno vel. co m )","At this moment, Nangong Jiuwen’s face turned even darker. “Aren’t you afraid that my Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace will butcher all the living beings in your force?! Do you know what existence you’re messing with?!”","“What existence?” Mr. Fang looked at the cultivators of the Li Family beside him. “Guys, can you explain it to me?”","Li Lanruo didn’t know how to answer since she just couldn’t understand the young man standing before her.","She was even more puzzled about the young man’s sword techniques. The flying sword moved as fast as the sword ball, showing no disadvantage before the Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace!","More astonishing was that this young man was so audacious that he cut off one of Nangong Jiuwen’s arms!","“Which faction are you from?” Nangong Jiuwen said with a sneer. “Do you dare to reveal your background? I want to know what force has the audacity to mess with my Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace!”","Mr. Fang answered, “I told you that I’m from the Heaven-Defying Online Games Guild.”","“It’s fine that you don’t want to tell me.” Nangong Jiuwen looked vicious. “I’ll kill you! You’re alone, but I brought more than 100 hundred elites of the Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace who have formed the Immortal-Hacking Sword Array. However powerful you are, I don’t believe that you can escape from it!”","“Immortal-Hacking Sword Array?!”","“It sounds powerful...”","“Have you heard of it before...”","The audience in the shops looked at each other in bafflement.","Su Tianji drank up the last bit of soup in the bowl. “I haven’t heard of it. I guess it’s nothing extraordinary.”","At this moment, the cultivators who were hiding around finally showed themselves.","The black figures quickly surrounded Fang Qi, flashing around him like black clouds. Many vague sword lights shot up like dancing dragons, and the whole array looked like a furious dragon from the prehistoric time!","With a vicious face, Nangong Jiuwen suppressed the excruciating pain in his shoulder and looked at Fang Qi with endless hatred in his eyes. “You dared to cut off one of my arms; you can’t repay it even if you die hundreds of times, Ant!”","His right hand waved, and the sword ball began to spin with clear dragon roar sounds!","“Do you think I, Nangong Jiuwen, have no other trump card but the sword ball?!” With a furious roar, the sword array was activated with turbulent clouds and winds. Many sword energies gathered before him and followed the movements of the sword ball, Instantly, people saw a silver dragon dancing in the clouds!","With a resonant dragon roar, the swords fell like a silver river from the Heaven, hacking toward Fang Qi!","“This sword array once killed an immortal from Heaven! I’ll see how you block it!” With his furious roar, the long dragon crashed down with a turbulent ocean of clouds, as if the sky itself was falling!","“So powerful!”","“This sword aura can’t be blocked by human means. It’s astonishing that a mere Divine Ocean Realm cultivator can unleash such great power!” At this moment, even the Xuanzhong Palace Master and Yuxu Mountain Master looked at the big screen in surprise. “Can the shop owner block it?!”","“Will he use Orochi Divine Light?”","Sitting at the counter, Xiao Yulv placed several pieces of spiritual melons before him, and he ate them while watching the livestream on the big screen. “Isn’t there a 36 Tiangang Grand Array in the Legend of the Sword and Fairy? He can use that one.”","“They have more than 100 people supporting the array!” someone said, “The power of an array built by one person is no match for an array built by more than 100 people, right?”","“What can he do then?” the two old men stared at the big screen and asked in a daze.","On the other side, the woman in a white silk dress, the elder, and the disciples of the Li Family looked desperate.","A tiny part of the power of Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace could crush them; it wasn’t a power that a family like theirs could block.","It was why many forces traveled all the way to study in the Heavenly Academy since only in the Heavenly Academy could they gain a glimpse of hope.","Finished.","They were all finished.","“No... Even if I must die, I can’t die like a coward.” The woman in white silk dress looked desperate. “If... If I use that force...”","She sensed the disk in her body and felt a terrifying force inside; it was made of a unique material that was neither gold or jade. If she activated it, it would unleash earth-shaking power!","“Ahhh–!” She yelled furiously and dashed toward the horrifying dragon of fury in despair.","Before she could do anything, a hand caught her collar. “Damn it! Get out of my way!”","She was tossed back.","“...”","Mr. Fang glanced at the System Interface.","[Complete Synchronization","Synchronization Conditions: Require possession of key items of a character, total synchronization must reach 20%. The synchronization time is determined by items’ quality, total synchronization, and your own strength","Character Can Be Completely Synchronized: Dante","Weapons in Possession: Beowulf and Kalina Ann","Total Synchronization: 20.36%","Current Strength: Level 2 King Warrior Realm","Synchronization Time: 5 seconds.","Weapons Can Be Used: Beowulf and Kalina Ann","Recovery Time: 1 second per week]","A row of strange data suddenly flashed in Fang Qi’s eyes.","Then, Fang Qi seemed to have to change into another person.","Fang Qi irises turned ice blue and his hair white, and his blue and white robe was turned dark-red.","On his hands and feet were dark silver armor-like gauntlets and long greaves.","The cultivators of the Li Family watched this scene before them in bafflement. “...!!??”","“This party is getting crazy!” Many sword energies were about to crash onto him like an ancient furious dragon, but this man hooked his fingers on both of his hands and mocked.","Li Lanruo, who had tried to die with her enemies in despair, felt like she was blinded by this sight.","The cultivators and warriors watching the livestream in the shop froze.","“Is this Dante?!”"]},{"number":422,"title":"Chapter 422 - Do You Want to Join My Guild?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Everyone saw Fang Qi’s mocking gesture while the horrifying sword power crashed down with turbulent clouds from the high sky.","Then, the surging force poured down like a river from Heaven and engulfed him.","Nangong Jiuwen sneered at the scene. He brushed Fang Qi’s strange transformation off his mind since he knew that Fang Qi was a dead man now.","In his eyes, even a true immortal wouldn’t be able to save Fang Qi from this horrifying sword light.","Finally, he looked satisfied and pleased.","On the other hand, the others looked horrified.","He’s dead?","When people were musing with this thought, the sky that was filled with crazy clouds and winds suddenly began to clear.","While the horrifying force passed them, they saw an unbelievable scene; the white-haired young man who was in the red windbreaker stood where he was with his hands in his pockets.","“What... happened?!” The cultivators of the Li Family exchanged looks of bafflement.","At this moment, the turbulent clouds attached to the tail of the dragon-like, terrifying sword power slowly dispersed. Then, the dragon created by the many sword energies from the sword array began to shatter beginning from its mouth!","Like dominos, the collapse of the heart of the array caused a bigger chain reaction. Then, all the sword energies shattered one after another, and only the sword ball which looked like a dragon ball was left.","Crack! A crack suddenly appeared on the sword ball after the noise.","A second crack appeared.","The third...","The fourth...","“What... what did you do?!” Nangong Jiuwen had never felt so scared before.","More horrifying was that his rival seemed to only be standing there and didn’t do anything, and the whole Immortal-Hacking Sword Array collapsed!","The array was pushed back by force, and the horrifying backlash enveloped all the people who were forming the array!","The 100 elites from the Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace that Nangong Jiuwen took great pride in were instantly devoured by this horrifying force and then exploded, creating a big mass of bloody mist!","Nangong Jiuwen screamed but had no hope of blocking this force that brought him desperation. In horror, he stared at the man calmly standing on the flying sword. Although the white hair and the red clothes had vanished, Fang Qi still looked like a demon to him.","He stared at the man before him intently and said, “The Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace will not let you get away with it...”","Boom!","He was turned into dust.","Everything was gone with the wind except for a faint blood smell that permeated the air.","All the cultivators and warriors watching the livestream in the Jiuhua City Shop and the Half City Shop were stunned.","“!? Do you guys know what the shop owner did?!”","“I saw nothing in the battle; I only saw him mocking that guy.”","“How did he do it?!”","“Was that the power of a dark knight?!” Shui Xianyun, who was watching the livestream with the others from the Nanhua Faction on the couch, had excitement in her eyes. “The shop owner is f*cking awesome!”","She cussed since cultured words couldn’t express her feelings right now.","“Ugh?” Sitting nearby, Yue Yan whispered, “How come the First Elder is even more excited than us?”","The Xichi Spiritual Master looked embarrassed, “Senior Sister... Please sit down first!”","Demonic Woman Ning Bi who had half demon bloodline stared at the big screen with great interest while sipping her milk tea. She sent a message, asking, [Sir, what technique did you just use? How come we don’t know about it? <img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f97a.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F97A;\">]","She added an emoji at the end of her question since no one would know that this message came from her.","“What technique?” Mr. Fang explained, “I just used Release; the Ultimate Release.”","“Was it Release?!”","“In such a short moment?!”","After all, he had only the blink of an eye after his mocking gesture; he couldn’t have done it even if he were one second slower. In the game, one could use Release by pressing one button. However, in the real world, one must proficiently spread the strength of the Royalguard Style all over the body in one moment.","His timing must be so exact that just by being one millisecond faster or slower would result in a disaster; he could only perfectly absorb all his opponent’s force using the perfect technique in that flash. If he made a tiny mistake in timing or usage of the technique, he would be killed or at least severely wounded in a battle of this scale.","It could only be achieved by Fang Qi who had activated Complete Synchronization with Dante and thus possessed extremely great power.","When he used Ultimate Release, he remained intact while the Immortal-Hacking Sword Array was instantly shattered!","Under the terrified gazes of the cultivators of the Li Family, Mr. Fang flew over to them. “This... Let me explain. I’m just a passerby who wants to ask you for directions.”","Mr. Fang looked sincere and harmless.","The cultivators of the Li Family were speechless. In fact, they were dumbfounded.","How can anyone ask for directions this way? He had just exploded Nangong Jiuwen and his Immortal-Hacking Sword Array, and then he tells me that he just wants to ask for directions?!","That elder of the Li Family’s old face twitched, and he was at a loss for words.","“I’m Li Lanruo, and I’m greatly grateful for you help, Senior,” the woman wearing the white silk dress spoke; she was elegant and beautiful despite the difficult situation she was in. Of course, if she didn’t look embarrassed, she would look even better.","Mr. Fang lightly nodded and said, “Do you know how to get to the Heavenly Academy?”","Li Lanruo was startled. “Heavenly Academy?! Are you going to the Heavenly Academy, Senior?!”","Fang Qi was pleased. It seems like the Heavenly Academy is quite famous; even this woman that I encountered knows about it.","However, Mr. Fang didn’t think that going to the Heavenly Academy was a big deal and wondered why she acted so astonished.","Fang Qi said, “Yeah. Is there anything wrong with that?”","“No...” Li Lanruo said in embarrassment, “Senior, are you planning to go to the Heavenly Academy as well?”","Then, astonishment appeared on her pretty face. “Could it be that... you plan to enroll in the Heavenly Academy as well?”","Fang Qi’s face turned dark. “Do you think I look like someone who has that plan?”","“...” Li Lanruo looked at him and found that this man was young enough to be a disciple...","However, if that is real, his strength is too terrifying to be a disciple. Could it be that he is from a super powerful yet hermit family?","With unease, she said, “Senior, you killed so many elites from the Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace and even Nangong Jiuwen who was the disciple of the head of the Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace...”","Mr. Fang said, ” Don’t always tell me how awesome the Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace is. To tell you the truth, my Heaven-Defying Online Games Guild is truly awesome. Do you guys want to join?”","Li Lanruo: “...”","Li Wuya, the elder who had lost one arm, was also at a loss for words.","So were the other members of the Li Family.","This advertisement deserved full marks."]},{"number":423,"title":"Chapter 423 - Yuanyang City","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Join...” They froze. “Join your guild?”","He had asked them if they wanted to join his guild.","Li Lanruo was at a loss for words. For her, it had been a narrow escape that she had survived the raid by people from the Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace, and she was still feeling unnerved by it.","However, the mysterious senior now invited her to join his guild?","( Boxno vel. co m ) “Certainly, I want to join it,” she said, “But... I’ve caused you enough trouble today by making you a foe of the Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace. How can I bring more trouble to you?”","The people in Half City all sent bullet comments. [No trouble! No trouble at all! He even beat Nanhua Fairy Liu’s mount with a brick and suppressed an old demon into a Smirking Face Emoji. There’s nothing that this old demon doesn’t dare to do!]","Ruan Ning: [My goodness. Even Old Demon Fang can be a senior...]","People like Ruan Ning and Xi Yue commented while they watched the livestream, “Soon, Old Demon Fang will lead the newbies off the orthodox way...”","Looking at the bullet comments, Mr. Fang said while his face twitched, “Can you guys stop trying to cause trouble?”","Then, he said to the people who he rescued, “It’s no trouble at all. They messed with our Heaven-Defying Online Games Guild, and it’s them who are in trouble.”","“This...?” The elder stroked his beard and thought for a while before saying, “Then, I thank you on behalf of Li Family.”","Heaven-Defying Online Games Guild... they thought, It sounds powerful.","Li Lanruo thought, This senior’s strength is so high, and he has a powerful force behind him. Is it possible...","Startled, she glanced at Fang Qi subconsciously and thought, I s it possible that he has reached the realm of returning to youth from old age that is described in the legends?!","Mr. Fang’s identity had now changed from Old Demon Fang to the righteous Senior Fang who had returned to youth after living for hundreds or thousands of years.","In Half City, the people thought that he could be 200 years old. Now, he was over 500 years old in these people’s eyes.","Of course, Mr. Fang was oblivious to their speculations. As a young man in his twenties, he knew nothing about the presence and aura of a grandmaster.","Perhaps the others thought that he was old since he looked dominating. Mr. Fang might be lacking in some areas, but he indeed knew how to show off. With hands in his pockets, he leisurely flew on his flying sword while the others tried to catch up with him. Even though the cultivators of Li Family were trying their best and had white foam around their mouths due to fatigue, the distance between them got greater each second.","Then, Mr. Fang turned to them. “The flying speed of people in this place isn’t very fast... Do you want me to take you on the flight?”","The cultivators of the Li Family all nodded enthusiastically.","...","The journey was enjoyable while they flew past the famous mountains and rivers on the flying swords. On the way, Fang Qi showed the cultivators and warriors from both shops the scenery beyond the Deserted Sea Realm.","As new members of the guild, Li Lanruo and the others acted as tour guides and explained to Fang Qi the customs of this place and the forces on it.","“Look! Look at the herds of demon beasts below!”","“Look up at the huge demon bird! We don’t have such creatures here!” A blue-feathered, sparrow-like demon bird that was tens of meters long flew over Fang Qi and the others, casting a shadow on them.","They flew past many spiritual mountains and beautiful rivers full of demon beasts and birds. On their way, they saw several places where cultivators gathered and passed by some cultivator and warrior forces. Many cultivators lived in the cities built high on the mountains, presenting to Fang Qi and the people in the two shops a world more prosperous than the Deserted Sea Realm.","More importantly, they rarely saw ordinary people in the big cities. There were even cultivators and warriors stationed in remote towns where ordinary people lived. They would find and recruit talented mortals to cultivate and train in their factions. Even the mortals with ordinary talent had the opportunity to learn some skills to defend the towns or hunt demon beasts for a living.","The warriors here toughened their bodies with special techniques, so they didn’t have to spend a fortune on elixirs and spiritual plants, which made it quite easy to become an Official Warrior. With the abundant spiritual essence in this world, it was a great place for cultivators and warriors to live.","“Yuanyang City is right there before us.” Li Lanruo pointed forward at a huge city on a high mountain that was flanked by high cliffs and surrounded by other mountains. “This is the nearest big city to Heavenly Academy. Before the academy begins the exam, the disciples from all the major forces would stay here.","“Each exam of the Heavenly Academy would attract elites from all over the world,” Li Lanruo said, “Even the world-famous families will send their young members to study in the Heavenly Academy; some factions will even send their direct disciples to cultivate in the Heavenly Academy.”","“This awesome?” Fang Qi clicked his tongue and looked at the elegant woman wearing the silk dress. “From the looks of it, it will be very hard for you to get into the Heavenly Academy, right? You still traveled so far to try it?”","At this topic, Li Lanruo said sadly, “I was forced into a corner and have to try it...”","With a heavy sigh, the elder who had lost one arm said, “Nangong Jiuwen’s pursuit of us means that the Li Family of Xifeng Cliff has probably been wiped off the world; I’m afraid that even the other families in Xifeng Cliff have gotten the same fate. We’re the last of the Family, and we have to try to sustain the family bloodline.”","Mr. Fang said, “How come you guys are in such a terrible state?”","The others looked embarrassed.","They looked at each other, and Li Lanruo said, “It’s not that I love the treasure so much that I don’t want to hand it over. The truth is that the Mystic Fate Jade has merged with my bloodline, and I can’t get it out...”","Mr. Fang waved his hand. “You can keep your treasure; I didn’t ask you about it. Let’s go into the city!”","The grand city built between two high cliffs was very close to them.","They looked around and saw many luxurious spiritual boats docked before the city. The people going in or out of the gate were all dressed in robes that emitted bright spiritual lights; they were either young people or grand cultivators with high cultivation strengths. People rode precious rare beasts on the wide streets which could accommodate eight horse-drawn carriages in different lanes, and they looked either celestial or valiant, obviously not ordinary people.","Fraught with extraordinary people, this city was no less prosperous than any city for mortals, let alone the fact that a grand event was happening. Members of major families who were wearing all kinds of luxurious clothes wandered the city; some looked proud while others seemed aloof.","It seemed like they had arrived at a true city of Celestial Warriors and Cultivators."]},{"number":424,"title":"Chapter 424 - Buy A Shop","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Yuanyang City looked peaceful and didn’t need guards to patrol the city all the time like in Jiuhua City.","Fang Qi saw few guards in the city, but it was very safe to walk around as its security level was high; he didn’t see anyone who dared to fight inside the city.","Taiwang Inn in the city was especially established to receive the people who were here for the Heavenly Academy and their groups and let them rest. Of course, there were different sections in Taiwang Inn. The inner section received geniuses from super forces, and the outer section was where Mr. Fang was staying right now.","( Boxno vel. co m ) However, even the ground of the outer inn was paved with jade-like white stones, and the pillars were made of mystical bronze. Beautifully engraved pavilions and corridors were everywhere. With crowds of young cultivators of excellent talents walking around, it definitely was not an ordinary inn.","Li Wuya, the elder who had lost one warm, simply bandaged his wound. Although it wasn’t difficult for cultivators in Spirit State to attach a broken arm back to the shoulder, he still needed a long while to heal the injury.","This was why they chose to stay in this inn.","“The Heavenly Academy is indeed rich...” Mr. Fang said in surprise, “You just did the registration, and we can now all stay here?”","After all, these visitors were not the academy’s official disciples until they passed the exam.","Li Lanruo said, “The Heavenly Academy’s grandeur is indeed beyond the imagination of my small family.”","“It’s said that someone saw that cultivator of the Xun Family.” In the long corridor, some passing cultivators talked among themselves as if no one were around. “He is said to have been born with a spiritual core, and his innate purple qi repels all evil. I’m surprised that he is also staying here in the Taiwang Inn.”","“Besides the Xun Family, I even heard that Nangong Zhuo of the Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace is staying in the Taiwang Inn.”","“Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace? The Nangong Family of Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace is always proud of their unique ancient Sword Dao. It’s said that when Nangong Zhuo was born, colorful auspicious clouds filled the sky, and sword spirit came down from Heaven and turned into a sword ball to guard him. With his unprecedented talent in the Sword Dao, he had mastered all the sword techniques of the Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace when he was ten. He’s the Sword Son of the younger generation of the Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace; I wonder why he wants to come to the Heavenly Academy.”","“You don’t understand,” another said, “The Heavenly Academy can teach all kinds of talented people. Even the fifth palace master of Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace once studied in Heavenly Academy. He is just following the example set by his ancestor.”","“Look over there! How come there’s such a big crowd over there?” they exclaimed when they saw people packing the corridor at the entrance of the inn; they couldn’t see who was entering the inn at all.","“It’s Wang Xie?! Another big figure!” someone yelled in astonishment.","Curious, Mr. Fang walked over and asked someone nearby, “Is this Wang Xie very famous?”","“You don’t know him?” The man looked at Fang Qi as if he were a weirdo.","“... Ugh. Is it strange that I don’t know him?” Fang Qi asked.","The cultivator said in disdain, “Brother, have you stayed inside ever since you were born? You don’t even know about Wang Xie?”","“If there’s a list of the ultimate geniuses in the younger generation of the world, Wang Xie must rank among the top ten!","“It only shows his strength ten years ago. Now that he has obtained that item from the Fortune Golden Palace, he can rank among the top three.”","Fang Qi was about to ask more questions when someone pulled at his robe.","He looked back and saw it was Li Lanruo; she had embarrassment written on her face.","“Guild President... I’ll tell you that after we get back...”","It felt as embarrassing as asking football fans about Beckham or asking basketball fans who Jordan was.","However, Mr. Fang really knew nothing about them.","When those cultivators walked away, Fang Qi asked, “What is the Fortune Golden Palace? Is it very famous?”","“...” Li Lanruo couldn’t understand him, wondering where this senior came from and why he didn’t even know Fortune Golden Palace. She gave him a short explanation, “Wang Xie used to rank around the tenth place in the younger generation between the big families; the people ranked above him were geniuses from families such as Nangong and Xun since the latter were born with great fortune and are surrounded with many grandmasters and rare treasures.”","“However, after acquiring a great treasure from the Fortune Golden Palace, Wang Xie had surpassed the geniuses born with great fortune and ranks among the first three. Do you understand now?”","She added, “The Mystic Fate Jade in my body also came from the Fortune Golden Palace. I got it by chance, but it even drew the attention of huge forces such as Nangong Family, and they are trying to hunt me down...”","“Your trash treasure came from that place...” Mr. Fang waved his hand. “Forget it.”","Li Lanruo’s pretty face turned dark and she felt like spitting blood. If the others heard of her treasure, they would come after her with greedy eyes, but this man kept saying that her treasure was trash!","If he was someone else, she would think that he was pretending to be disinterested. But after witnessing Fang Qi breaking the Immortal-Hacking Sword Array of the Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace, she knew that he was telling the truth and put her speculations away.","At this moment, Mr. Fang turned and murmured to himself, “From the looks of it, the people entering the Heavenly Academy are all powerful; will Xiaoyue be bullied?”","Forget it. I’ll think of it when the time comes... Mr. Fang said, “You guys stay here; I’ll go and buy a shop.”","...","Meanwhile, at the edge of the Heavenly Abyss Sea, there were some remains of a spiritual boat on the ground.","Several cultivators wearing white robes with patterns of golden sword clouds landed from the sky.","The leader was a gloomy-eyed old man with white hair and a white beard.","“Second Elder, this is the Li Family’s spiritual boat,” a cultivator reported, “It seems that someone hacked it open with a sword. I think it was a sword ball that broke it.”","“Where are the people of the Li Family?!” the old man asked in a cold voice, “Where’s Nangong Jiuwen?! His life token was broken... where is his body?!”","“We can’t find any bodies around this place,” another cultivator reported, “There’s some disordered spiritual essence in the air, and we think it is caused by a battle.”","“Do you think that I can’t find you just because you destroyed the corpses?!” the silver-haired old man snorted, “Wherever you go, my Nangong Family will get the Mystic Fate Jade sooner or later!”","Sharp glints flashed in his eyes, and he soon created several extremely mysterious spiritual seals with both hands one after another.","The spiritual essence moved in the sky, and the disordered spiritual essence in the air was straightened up.","A mysterious scene appeared in the sky; Nangong Jiuwen surrounded a young man who was wearing a blue and white robe with 100 cultivators of the Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace.","“Immortal-Hacking Sword Array?! Who was this man that forced them to use the Immortal-Hacking Sword Array?!”","Then, everyone saw the figure make a mocking gesture with a hooked finger just before the Immortal-Hacking Sword Array enveloped him. However, that figure who was engulfed with the terrifying power of the dragon-shaped sword light reappeared intact in the next instant, but the Immortal-Hacking Sword Array immediately collapsed!","“Puchi!” With a vicious face, the silver-haired old man spat out a mouthful of blood, and the images in the sky disappeared.","“Good! Good! Good!” Disheveled, his face was as vicious and distorted as a ghost’s while he said ‘good’ three times. “He dared to slaughter the Nangong Family Execution Hall Master and 100 elites! Whoever you are, you will be hunt down and killed by the sword slave of my Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace from now on!”"]},{"number":425,"title":"Chapter 425 - Not a Big Deal to Borrow More Money When the Debt Is Already High","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","In the Heavenly-Seeking Sword Palace, there was a forbidden zone which all the people in the world were terrified of; it was named the Sword Tomb.","However, most people only knew about the infamous name of the Sword Tomb and didn’t know why it was so scary.","Only the real major forces knew its secrets.","The winding paths inside Heavenly-Seeking Sword Palace were like a maze. The Sword Tomb was deep inside a mountain within the territory of this force, and the light turned dimmer as the path winded down.","The space at the foot of the mountain was as deep as an abyss. An unfathomable darkness and ominous presence threatened to swallow any people venturing inside.","There was no light at the bottom of the mountain, as if the people themselves were too afraid of something to light any lights.","It seemed that they were afraid to disturb something.","Only when they released some weak spiritual senses could they barely recognize the engravings on the walls; they looked like characters but were not in any language in the current world.","There were tombs that looked like small hills.","There were altogether 108 tombs in the huge underground space.","However, most of the tombs had been destroyed, and only about ten were left standing.","In the darkness, one could hear the clanking noise of metal chains.","Many people, young and old, knelt before the tombs in tattered clothes and in chains.","...","“It’s said... the Immortal-Hacking Sword Array of the Heavenly-Seeking Sword Palace once killed an immortal. Is it true?” When Fang Qi turned to leave, Li Lanruo asked curiously.","For the cultivators in the current world, true immortals existed only in distant legends, let alone the act of killing an immortal. Most people regarded these tales in the distant past as legends.","“According to the legends, it’s true...” Elder Li Wuya said, “It’s said that an ancestral master named Earth Two Eight from the Nangong Family controlled the array, and the Heavenly-Seeking Sword Palace paid a heavy price in that battle...","“It was so long ago that no one knows if it is true. Besides, it is glory of the past. Even if the descendants have inherited the array, it is probably not as powerful as it was...”","...","Faint mysterious light came from the dilapidated tombs; the brighter the lights became, the brighter were the eyes of the people chained before the tombs. Under the faint light, one could see that the tombs didn’t contain humans.","One could only recognize the characters on a few tombstones out of the dozen-or-so tombs, which were Earth Three Seven, Earth Two Eight, Sky One Six...","...","– Heavenly-Seeking Sword Palace –","In the great hall, a dignified middle-aged man with a square face was listening to the report of a cultivator of the Nangong Family, and he looked calm.","“Where are they? Have you found out who this person is?”","“Even though Second Elder used the spiritual light recall spell, we still can’t find the attacker (After all, even the audience watching the livestream didn’t see how Mr. Fang attacked). However, we saw the person who Nangong Jiuwen attacked, and we’ll find the true murderer by tracking this man down! But...”","“But what?” the middle-aged man asked coldly.","“If the attacker is from one of the major families, I’m afraid that it will be troublesome...”","“I don’t care what background the attacker has,” the middle-aged man said in a cold voice, “Even if the Heavenly Academy is involved, let alone the major families, they would have to hand over the murderer if it were their doing. The major families are indeed powerful, but my Nangong Family won’t let anyone get away from murdering more than 100 members of my family!”","He waved his hand. “Do as the Second Elder said. Go and send a message to Zhuo’er; tell him that I’ll send two sword slaves to him. It will be great if he can find the murderer. If not, he can bring back the people revealed by the spiritual light recall spell.”","“Yes!”","“By the way, take the Mystic Fate Jade before the news gets out.”","“Yes!”","He narrowed his eyes. “If this is your trump card, I’ll let you know how ridiculous it is!”","...","Oblivious to the things that were happening, Mr. Fang’s top priority as a professional shop owner was buying a shop and opening it. While he was doing that, he would consider how to prevent Xiaoyue from being bullied after entering the academy. He didn’t care about other things.","“Wow... This must be a big city, eh?” After walking out of Taiwang Inn, Mr. Fang looked around and murmured to himself.","This city was not only big but very prosperous.","There were all kinds of shops selling things including spiritual artifacts, demon beasts, and elixirs. It was obviously the busiest time of the year for the districts outside Taiwang Inn.","Clearly, there was no shop for sale around the inn.","Fang Qi had no choice but to go further out. After walking around for a long time and making a large loop, he still didn’t find any shop for sale or for lease.","When he was about to return to Taiwang Inn, Mr. Fang saw a small old man with grey hair bawling while sitting inside a shop which had been turned upside-down.","People walked over, wondering what had happened.","“What’s wrong?”","“It’s said this old guy is so ignorant that he offended someone from the Nangong Family...”","“What people from the Nangong Family? They are just Nangong Family’s dogs...”","“Shush... Be careful with your words.”","“It’s said this old guy worked his butt off most of his life and finally moved his shop to Yuanyang City. But now, he obviously can’t keep it open anymore... He will be bothered by the people who are trying to flatter the Nangong Family, let alone members of the Nangong Family.”","“There’s nothing that he can do. After all, they are a big force and can do anything they want...”","Mr. Fang thought, How come I run into these people wherever I go?","“In my opinion, he should just sell the shop and leave this place to avoid all the troubles in the future!”","“Sell the shop?” someone said with a snicker, “Do you dare to buy it? Do you dare to interfere with the business of the Nangong Family?”","The moment he said it, a figure walked over. “Hello, Senior. Is your shop for sale?”","“...” The cultivator who had been snickering froze while he stared at the young man. “Is this man a moron?”","“Where did he come from?”","The old man stared at Fang Qi in disbelief and said, “Young Man, do... you really want to buy it?!”","He pointed at the people around him. “Didn’t you hear what they said?”","Mr. Fang shrugged. “My Heaven-Defying Online Games Guild never fears anyone.”","Anyway, he had killed more than 100 of them, and it was not a big deal to kill more and create more conflict.","All the people around them fell silent.","“Thank you! Thank you very much!” The old man was full of gratitude. “Please... will you come in?”"]},{"number":426,"title":"Chapter 426 - The New Shop Owner Is Playing the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“No...”","“Is he really going to buy it?”","“Has this kid lost his mind? He dares to mess with the Nangong Family?!”","“It’s better to mess with the Heavenly Academy than the Heavenly-Seeking Sword Palace...” Someone clicked his tongue and said, “Everyone who offended Heavenly-Seeking Sword Palace met tragic ends. If they send sword slaves after you, they won’t stop until you’re dead!”","“Go! Let’s go now... We can’t be seen with him!”","The crowd that packed the entrance of the shop front was gone completely very soon.","They looked as if they were afraid to catch a plague.","Even the old man left the city during the night after selling the shop; he didn’t dare to linger in this city any longer.","“Chief President.” Li Lanruo and the others walked into the shop. They looked around at the neighboring shops which were packed with customers and then at Fang Qi’s empty shop where even a ghost couldn’t be seen; it looked as if the small area in front of his shop divided his shop from others, making it seem like it was in another world.","“How come your shop has no customers and is quite desolate?” Li Lanruo looked around the street in bafflement.","Fang Qi pointed at the shop and said, “Come and help me clean it. No matter if you can enter Heavenly Academy or not, you can come and manage the shop for me when you have time.”","Li Wuya said with a chuckle. “Then, I’ll just stay here and keep the shop for you. I’m old and won’t go and take the academy exam.”","Li Lanruo said hesitantly, “Then, I’ll...”","While clearing the shop, Mr. Fang said, “You can go to the academy with Xiaoyue; you two can keep each other company and help run the shop after school.”","Li Lanruo asked, “Who’s Xiaoyue?”","“A little girl. I think you two will get along.”","“Ugh... A little girl?” Li Lanruo froze. “And only a little over ten?!”","Since when can teenagers enter the Heavenly Academy? Besides, does this little shop need so many people to manage it?","Li Lanruo was full of questions.","With the help of the members of the Li Family, the shop was soon cleaned. The total area of this shop was even larger than that of the Half City Shop, big enough to accommodate 200 computers easily.","Since Li Lanruo lived in Taiwang Inn with her companions, one male and two female disciples, their accommodation was not an issue for the time being. Besides, the shop had three floors, and it was big enough to provide dorms for all the employees even though the System only renovated two dorm rooms.","For the time being, the shop provided food and dorms for the employees, but they had no salaries or benefits yet.","...","On the next day, Li Lanruo looked haggard as she came into the shop.","Mr. Fang asked in surprise, “What’s wrong? Where are the other two?”","Only Elder Li Wuya and a round-faced girl who was about 17 years old came with her. The latter had freckles and puffed red eyes, and she was shy and didn’t speak.","On the other hand, Li Wuya looked angry.","Now, Li Lanruo said in resentment, “They... they are no longer members of Li Family...”","Fang Qi said casually, “It doesn’t matter that they left. After all, they can do nothing here but watch and clean the shop, which are chores that they have to do just like when they were servants back in the Li Family.”","“I’m sorry...” Li Lanruo looked sad, but Fang Qi brushed it off as a tiny incident that wasn’t worthy of his attention.","He opened the shop door and saw that the interior had taken a new look.","The counter was made with a giant piece of smooth and crystal-clear black marble, and the shop door and walls were all glass. More than 200 computers were placed on two floors. The first floor was divided into three sections while the second floor was one section itself. Rows of neatly placed monitors and keyboards were lit with colorful lights, the light reflecting off of the smooth and heavy desks. The colorful lights were very eye-catching in the dim space inside.","After walking through the entrance, a huge glass screen was to the right, and these people didn’t know what it was for.","Li Lanruo almost thought that she went into the wrong place. She asked in surprise, “Guild President, what business do we do here?”","She had thought that it was a shop selling rare treasures. Now, she knew that she had been mistaken after checking it out herself.","She was clueless.","What are these things?!","She felt like the inside of the shop was totally another world.","Fang Qi chuckled. “Welcome to the Origins Internet Club. In the future, you will work here.”","He pointed at the rules written on the small blackboard and said, “Show no mercy to anyone who breaks the rules, no matter what background they have.”","The words on the small blackboard were, [The trouble makers will get their cultivation strengths destroyed before being tossed out; they won’t be welcomed again. Play if you want but get out otherwise.]","Covering their mouths, the two girls were so stunned that they were at a loss for words.","Even Elder Li Wuya said in disbelief, “Guild President, aren’t the rules a bit too harsh?”","After all, this city was full of major forces, and many of them had power beyond their imaginations!","If any member from these forces got their cultivation strength destroyed and legs broken, the shop would be in huge trouble.","“Can’t we modify the rules...?” Li Lanruo knew that the person before her was powerful, but compared with some huge forces, his background was probably not as solid as those forces.","Fang Qi said, “These are our rules: Play if you want but get out otherwise. If they don’t like the rules, they don’t have to come.”","“...” Li Lanruo was at a loss for words. While pointing at the door, she said, “Guild President, I’m afraid that no one will come.”","Indeed, no one came in as it was deserted in front of the shop. Even the passersby made detours around the shop; how could they have customers?","Mr. Fang said, “It doesn’t matter if no one comes. We can play ourselves if that is the case.”","It must be noted that the new shop only had access to the old online games; single-player games would be released after three months.","The movies and TV Series were not restricted by this rule.","Mr. Fang turned on a computer for himself.","At this moment, he heard a crisp prompt from the System.","“Beep! Task: Booming Sales is completed.”","Task Target: Number of GTA5 players reaches 3,000 (Completed)","Task Reward: Gaming Prize Wheel (Can win a game on the wheel), one luck treasure chest","Task Description: It should be a piece of cake for this game to reach the sales target of 3,000, right?]","“This task is completed?!” Fang Qi was surprised that the task was completed at this moment.","Meanwhile, he received a new task.","[New Task: New Online Game.","Task Description: The game can only be activated by unlocking more world views.","World View Unlock: Please unlock more sci-fi world views (5 sci-fic games/movies reaching average sales of 1,000); please unlock more magic world views (8 magic fantasy games/movies reaching average sales of 1,000)","Task Reward: Dungeon Fighter Online Virtual Reality Remake; one luck treasure chest (Large)]","“...”","He was surprised that such a task appeared.","However, he couldn’t do this task yet. He must find a chance to promote the genre of games and movies required for unlocking the world views.","Right now, he thought that he should turn the prize wheel and open the treasure box!","Immediately, Fang Qi opened the System Interface and turned the Prize Wheel.","[Beep! You got a new game—The Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3.]"]},{"number":427,"title":"Chapter 427 - Scared to Tears","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“The Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3?!” Mr. Fang was pleased. Although both games were about the Shu Mountain Faction, the strength showed in the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3 was much higher than the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 1.","Soon, Mr. Fang saw the logo of the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3 appear on the desktop.","“Guild President, what are you doing?” Li Xin’er, the shy girl in white of the Li Family, asked. The remaining young people of the Li Family all had good talent even though they were not as good as that of Li Lanruo who had the Mystic Fate Jade.","Li Xin’er, Li Wuya, and Li Lanruo stood behind Fang Qi and watched him operate the computer, and they were all in puzzlement.","( Boxno vel. co m ) Fang Qi put down the virtual reality headset and asked, “Would you like to try it?”","They looked at each other, and Li Lanruo said in the end after some hesitation, “I’ll try it.”","Anyway, she knew that this wouldn’t harm her.","She took the virtual reality headset and put it on following Fang Qi’s instruction.","Soon, a round mirror made with green jade appeared on the big screen, and it was resting on the ground paved with green stones. Around the mirror, there were options including [New Story] and [Old Memories].","In the mirror, clouds and mist floated around, and it seemed like immortals were living there since majestic palaces and buildings could be vaguely seen. On the mirror were the words [The Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3].","“What’s this?!” They were even more puzzled.","Following the steps that Fang Qi told her, Li Lanruo chose [New Story].","Soon, the scene before her changed, and she felt like she entered the world inside the mirror while riding on clouds.","She yelled in alarm (External communication was opened by default at the beginning), “Guild President, what... is happening?! I seem to be inside the mirror!”","“What? You entered the mirror?!” Besides her, Li Xin’er and Elder Li Wuya were also alarmed. “What happened? Can you get out?”","“Don’t be afraid. You can just take it as a virtual space,” Fang Qi explained with words that they could understand.","“!!?? A virtual space?!” Elder Li Wuya said in astonishment, “Is it a mystical realm?!”","After looking around, he saw no mystical realm and wondered if one could enter the mystical realm through this cubic spiritual artifact!","This spiritual artifact is so powerful?! This went beyond his knowledge of the world.","“Don’t panic. Lanruo, we’re behind you!” Li Wuya said immediately, “What do you see inside?”","On the screen, he saw scenes flash by before Li Lanruo in the mist, and it seemed like Li Lanruo was stepping on an auspicious cloud that was moving at a great speed. When the mist dissipated, they saw an ancient tree which was so huge that they couldn’t find words to describe it.","Standing before it, a person was as small as one of its leaves.","Under the blinding sunshine, the scenes continued to move upward to the Heaven. Mountains stood above layers of dense clouds, and celestial palaces were everywhere under the celestial light. She felt as if she had come into the world where the immortals lived.","“This... where is this place?!” Widened eyed, Li Lanruo stared at the scene before her, and the word ‘shock’ couldn’t explain what she was feeling. Right now, she wondered if this was really the immortal world!","Li Wuya and Li Xin’er who were behind her stared at the screen in disbelief. “This... Lanruo, are you in this place?!”","“I...” Li Lanruo spluttered and felt like she couldn’t put a sentence together. “I see it! This looks like the immortal world! Do you see it?”","She reached out her hand to touch, and each cloud and immortal palace was so real that she couldn’t decide if she was in a real world or a virtual space.","“We see it too!” Li Wuya’s old face was filled with thrill while he pointed at the screen, murmuring, “This... this... what happened?!”","“Sister Lanruo!” She heard an alarming yell. “Watch out! Behind you!”","Standing on a cloud was a figure wearing an indigo immortal robe and a purple golden hat with his hair and clothes flapping in the wind. In the distance, sunlight fell on the top of the nine layers of white heavenly clouds, making it seem like they were given a golden crown.","With an immortal sword in his hand, the man emitted celestial-like presence; he seemed to be a true immortal as described in the legends!","The man turned and glanced at a hill hovering in the air, and the hill exploded as if it were hit by an invisible force!","Seeing the horrifying sight, screams of alarm rose, “Lanruo! Run!”","“Calm down. He can’t see you.” Fang Qi’s face turned dark while he explained to them.","“It seems... he can’t see me!” Sure enough, the valiant-looking man who was wearing the immortal robe and purple golden hat spared no glance at Li Lanruo’s direction. Instead, he stared at a mighty man who was wearing red-gold armor and looked 70% human and 30% demon.","He looked like a proud and aloof king or an almighty demon god. Even a tiny trace of his presence or a casual glance from him gave people a terrifying suppression, containing a force that no mortals could withstand!","Li Lanruo’s jaw dropped, and her mouth turned into a big O-shape in which an egg could fit through. The two people watching from behind her also felt as if a lightning bolt flashed across their minds. “Who are these people?!”","Demon Lord Chong Lou!","Immortal General Fei Peng!","An earth-shaking battle between an immortal and a demon unfolded in the New Immortal World.","Wherever the sword energies passed by, immortal palaces were cut open like tofu. Even the mountain-high immortal statues were hacked into two halves and collapsed!","One of them possessed ultimate demonic energy, and one trace of it could turn everything around into dust. The other had sword energies that looked like rainbows, shaking Heaven and Earth. The people in the audience had never seen such a horrifying battle!","They felt as if they were being choked by an invisible force; they opened their mouths wide but couldn’t speak.","Standing inside the immortal world, Li Lanruo more acutely felt the insignificance of mortals, the grandeur of Heaven and Earth, and the unimaginable force of the immortals and demons. An innate sense of horror filled her mind while she watched the many sword energies and the destructive demonic light collide with each other with earth-shaking forces!","Like a scared rabbit, she put down the virtual reality headset and pointed at the screen, exclaiming in horror, “Guild President, what was that?! It’s terrifying!”","She was so scared that she almost cried!","Mr. Fang was at a loss for words. “No wonder you guys live such a miserable life. Can you be braver? It’s just a battle between immortals; it’s nothing to be afraid of.”","Then, he dug out a packet of tissues from his pocket and handed it to her. “Wipe your tears. I’ll show you how to play it.”"]},{"number":428,"title":"Chapter 428 - No Customers? Play Ourselves to Have Fun","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“This is a Xianxia game, but you played it into a horror game; what will happen if you play the real horror games?” In disdain, Mr. Fang put on the virtual reality headset and entered the game.","It was still the interlude animation before the game.","However, the viewers were still stupefied by just watching the battle in the New Immortal World and when Chong Lou destroyed the Demon-Suppressing Tower and took out the demonic sword. The scenes got more stunning as time went by!","“Guild President... What... is this?!”","“This is the main business of our shop.” Mr. Fang played the game while introducing the basic knowledge about games to them.","“As employees of the shop, even though you don’t play games, you must watch me play and gain some basic knowledge about them,” Mr. Fang said earnestly, “Then, you can explain them better to the customers. Understand?”","“Ugh... Guild President...” Li Wuya said, “Can... this really increase our cultivation strengths?! Can we learn the ultimate techniques of that Immortal General?!”","Mr. Fang controlled Jing Tian as he got up from the bed and said, “See? In this game, I’m the main character, which means that you can obtain whatever the main character learns. There’s another thing called ‘movies’ in which you can observe and learn everything you see. Now, I’ll show you how to play this one.”","They stood behind Mr. Fang and intently watched him play the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3.","“The Guild President got beaten by a beautiful but willful girl!”","“No. He’s not Guild President but the main character...”","While they watched, they whispered to each other.","“Guild President got scolded by the bookkeeper...”","“Shush... He’s the main character! Main character!”","“The main character was beaten by the small demon! He’s just an ordinary person...”","They followed the plot until Chong Lou walked into the pawn shop to pawn the demonic sword.","“Isn’t he that demon?!”","“How come he’s here...”","Exclamations came from behind Mr. Fang.","On the screen, Chong Lou looked at Jing Tian with surprise and disappointment before saying with a sigh, “You have come so low...?”","The voice seemed to ooze disappointment and melancholy that had accumulated for thousands of years. When the demonic sword returned to Jing Tian’s hand, the story of the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3 began.","The main plot of this game was reincarnation in which the characters had forgotten the stories in their previous lives. The audience finally understood that this insignificant character was in fact the reincarnation of the Immortal General who had battled with this Demon Lord in the New Immortal World.","Immortal General Fei Peng and Demon Lord Chong Lou were foes but appreciated each other at the same time. This was the first encounter between Jing Tian and Chong Lou in the mortal world. All fate and interactions of their previous lives between Jing Tian and Chong Lou, Xue Jian, and the demonic sword were going to be revealed in this lifetime, and the audience was brought into a wondrous Xianxia world.","If what happened before could be described as that they had been stunned by the horrifying battle between the immortal and the demon, then they now had a strong wish to learn the stories between these characters and their wondrous adventures.","“Sister Lanruo, look! The sword can actually follow Jing Tian!” Watching the scenes on the screen, the shy girl Li Xin’er found that the game was quite interesting instead of scary.","“The awe-inspiring immortal general looks just like us after reincarnation...”","Li Wuya asked, “Guild President... This... can we really learn this stuff? Will we become the reincarnation of this immortal general?”","They knew that it was just a story, but it looked incredibly real even through the screen; it was unimaginable!","– Meanwhile, outside the shop –","“There’s a new shop here?” A few stylishly-dressed young cultivators curiously looked at the shop front. They were about to enter when the clerks from the neighboring shops hurried over to stop them. “Lord, you can’t enter this shop. Would you come to our shops instead?”","“We can’t enter? Why not?”","“They offended someone they can’t afford to offend...” someone explained. “You’d better stay away from this shop.”","“...”","The shopfront was even quieter than before.","Of course, inside the shop, the employees were bursting with excitement when they learned that they could experience a true immortal’s life after reincarnation!","“Guild President, if we play it ourselves...” Li Wuya was about to ask if the employees had a discount. However, after glancing at the prices on the small blackboard which was 80 crystals for activation and 2 crystals per hour for computer time, they could well afford it. Instead, he asked, “When we have no customers, can we pay and play the game?”","“Of course!” Mr. Fang said.","He pointed at the eight words on the small black board and said, “Don’t mind others. Play if you want but get out otherwise.”","“Right! Right! Right!” Li Wuya said in excitement, “Play if you want but get out otherwise!”","He wished that no one would come.","Since there were no customers in the shop, Mr. Fang didn’t mind his employees acting as customers and playing the game during work hours.","“You can also watch Jade Dynasty and Shu Mountain; don’t get obsessed with the game,” Mr. Fang reminded them.","“Okay! Guild President!” Everyone was busy playing the game.","After returning from lunch, Mr. Fang said, “Don’t forget to eat.”","“Oayk! Guild President!” Everyone was busy playing the game.","“Remember...”","“Okay! Guild...” Before they could finish speaking, they saw the message on the screen, [Your game time has reached the limit...]","“...” They all looked at Mr. Fang morosely; anyone who saw them would cry since it was so sad. “Can’t we play a little more... Just a little...”","Mr. Fang looked at his employees. “Are you here to work or play games?”","As time went by, the players in the other two shops discovered this new game and began to play it without Mr. Fang’s recommendation.","Devil May Cry 3 was indeed great, but it focused on warriors and was not an ideal game for cultivators. In the game, most cultivators got beaten senseless, and they found that Xianxia games were more to their taste.","Several days passed, and the new shop still had no customers. Besides Li Wuya and Li Lanruo who were busy acting as both employees and customers, no one came into the shop or even asked about their business.","This morning, Li Lanruo and the others were about to leave Taiwang Inn and head to Origins Internet Club when they heard, “Look! The little princess of the Jiang Family has arrived!”","“Really? Even the little princess of the Jiang Family came to the Heavenly Academy?!”","“Wang Xie, Nangong Zhuo, Xun Yuan... Including the geniuses who are already studying in Heavenly Academy... My goodness, what a crowd...”","A message appeared on Mr. Fang’s new communication jade, [Boss, is your shop open? <img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f97a.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F97A;\">]"]},{"number":429,"title":"Chapter 429 - Pick Up in A Supercar?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Mr. Fang still had a lucky treasure chest to open. He had been busy playing the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3, but it was about time to open it.","Mr. Fang chose a good day with warm sunshine.","After washing his hands, he drank some Coke to celebrate this event.","Then, he opened the treasure chest.","[Beep! You got Pegassi Osiris (Unlimited).]","“Wu...” Mr. Fang almost spat out the Coke in his mouth. This was a damn race car?!","It was a remake of a car from Grand Theft Auto 5.","Many cars appearing in Grand Theft Auto 5 originated from the world where Fang Qi had been before he traveled through space and time. For example, the Pegassi Osiris was a supercar based on the Pagani Huayra and Enzo Ferrari Ne.","If Mr. Fang had gotten such a car before he traveled through space and time, he would have been thrilled. But now...","He glanced at the low antique buildings and the wide roads. Although the street was wide and flat, there were cultivators walking around, and demon beasts and beast-drawn carriages ran. Then, he thought of his car...","Mr. Fang scratched his head. This isn’t good...","However, he thought back to Dungeon Fighter Online. If this game was released, these people were going to witness Satellite Beam, Gaebolg Punch, etc.","Then, he looked at the spiritual boats flying in the sky. The people here had flying spiritual artifacts, and his was a spiritual artifact for driving on the ground...","Emmmm...","Suddenly, Mr. Fang didn’t think that his car would pose a problem.","– The Inner section of the Taiwang Inn –","Everything here was more luxurious than the outer section.","Each person here lived in a separate cottage which was spacious and equipped with high-level cultivation infrastructure.","In fact, the Heavenly Academy’s exam was a threshold for ordinary people to see if they could enter the school, which was the Heavenly Academy’s initial purpose of the exam.","However, it gradually started to change. Some geniuses had begun to use this opportunity to examine each other’s strength and see who was stronger.","Even though they wouldn’t show all their trump cards and fight until the death, they could use this occasion to compete with each other in front of all the talented people from all over the world to figure out a rough ranking.","Of course, this year’s Heavenly Academy exam meant more than this. Otherwise, it would be the same as the previous exams.","This year’s academy exam was especially grand for three reasons.","The first reason was the Mystic Fate Jade. Nangong Zhuo came for this treasure. Even though no one knew about its power yet, it was from Fortune Golden Palace, and it was enough for people to go crazy over it.","The second reason was...","Jiang Xiaoyue was sitting in the courtyard of her private cottage.","“Princess Your Highness, Gongzi Xun of the Xun Family had this gift delivered to you...”","“Why did he give me a gift? Do I know him that well?” Jiang Xiaoyue was busy playing with her communication jade; a penguin icon kept jumping. She said impatiently, “Return it!”","“Princess Your Highness, Young Master Nangong of the Nangong Family...”","“Aya! I told you to return it!”","“Princess Your Highness, Gongzi Xu of the Xu Family is waiting outside, hoping to see you...”","“Tell him I’m not back!” She continued to play with the communication jade.","After all, Xiaoyue was very popular.","However, the most important reason lied with the Heavenly Academy. It was said that the winner of the exam would become the final disciple of Gu Tingyun, the Old Academy Master, and be taught his world-famous Heavenly Insight Scroll.","It was said that Gu Tingyun had used this technique to predict several disasters for different clans and families. In fact, even the locations of previous openings of the Fortune Golden Palace and some of the treasures in the palace were obtained by him ahead of time.","Many geniuses who had never come out of their respective families came to the exam for this purpose.","...","– At the entrance of the internet café –","When Li Lanruo and the others came to the shop, they saw Mr. Fang playing with a strange sapphire-colored spiritual artifact in front of the shop.","The streamlined body of the spiritual artifact looked like a small spiritual boat. But instead of the usual weaving-shuttle or sword shape for spiritual boats, the front of this spiritual artifact looked like a weird snakehead.","It had the same unique metal luster as the square spiritual artifacts (computers) in the shop.","This artifact and all the artifacts inside the shop looked as if they came from a different world.","“Guild President, what’s this spiritual artifact?” Li Lanruo asked curiously, “It doesn’t look like a spiritual boat... Can it fly?”","“No.” Mr. Fang glanced at the street and said, “Flying is strictly forbidden inside the city, right? This thing runs on the ground.”","“It runs on the ground...?” Li Wuya studied the strange spiritual artifact curiously. “Why don’t you buy a mount if you want to run on the ground? It’s cheap and just needs a little time to tame. Why did you get a spiritual artifact?”","For cultivators, they could produce ground artifacts but didn’t think it was necessary with so many demon beasts around.","At this moment, some passing cultivators pointed in their direction. “Look at that guy... Is that thing a spiritual boat?”","“You’re kidding. What kind of spiritual boat has wheels?”","“Can it... fly in the sky as well?”","“I wonder who designed this weird spiritual boat. What a sucker...”","Ignoring them, Mr. Fang glanced at his communication jade.","“Hey! Guild President, how come your communication jade looks different.” Li Lanruo looked over curiously. Usually, communication jades were rectangle or round, but the one in Fang Qi’s hand was a thin jade slip with complicated patterns.","When the jade lit up, a virtual screen appeared on it, and a spiritual cursor moved on the virtual screen.","Meanwhile, Jiang Xiaoyue walked out of her private cottage holding a communication jade that looked exactly like Fang Qi’s.","“The young master of the Xun Family is holding a banquet in Essence Celestial Pavilion today and invited many people to tour Yuanyang City. Why didn’t you reply to his invitation? You must express your appreciation to the people who send you gifts even if you don’t accept them...”","The message came from her mother.","“Why should I accept his invitation? I won’t go today. Boss released a new game, and I’ll go play the game!” she quickly said to the communication jade, “Boss, when will you come and pick me up? I don’t know the way!”","Glancing at this message, Mr. Fang thought for a moment and then looked at the race car before him. [Should I drive over and pick you up?]"]},{"number":430,"title":"Chapter 430 - Still Your Boss","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Drive over?” Jiang Xiaoyue blinked. “Boss, did you buy a carriage?”","“I wonder what kind of demon beast is pulling his carriage...” She looked up into the sky and said, “It can’t be as good as mine! My mount is a prehistoric rare beast, the best of the best; I’ll scare the dumb boss a little with it!”","She smiled smugly. After all, she was no longer the girl who had no money but had a big appetite.","Meanwhile, Mr. Fang had gotten in the car. “You guys watch the shop for me. I’ll go pick up someone and be back soon.”","“Well... Guild President.” Li Lanruo looked at the doors of the spiritual artifact that were opened like a pair of metal wings, saying, “No flying spiritual artifacts can fly inside Yuanyang City. Can your small flying boat... can it work?”","Different from Half City and Jiuhua City, Yuanyang City’s array deactivated all the flight spiritual spells and thus didn’t need guards to patrol the city. Even the people with powerful backgrounds and privileges couldn’t fly in the city.","“Look! This hillbilly from somewhere wants to activate a spiritual boat inside Yuanyang City?” Many passing cultivators said in disdain while looking at Fang Qi and riding on their demonic horses.","In the next moment, with the sound of tires grinding on the ground, a blue shadow shot out, leaving a puff of dust behind it.","“!!??”","“What was that?”","“How come there is such a spiritual artifact?!”","“Today, Gongzi Xun invited all the geniuses to a banquet in Essence Celestial Pavilion and to ride around the city together afterwards...” A young man riding a black tiger laughed and said, “I’m surprised that I’m on Gongzi Xun’s list; he is inviting me to this gathering.”","“Congratulations!” His guards immediately offered their congratulations.","“I spent a fortune on this nine-patterned demonic tiger.” He pointed at his mount smugly and asked, “Do you think Gongzi Xun will like...”","Before he could finish, a weird-shaped sapphire-blue spiritual artifact flashed past them.","“What was that?!” They looked baffled.","Even the demonic tiger blinked in shock, thinking that its eyes played tricks on it.","“I think it’s a spiritual boat...?”","“How can a spiritual boat run on the ground?” That young master waved his hand. “Let’s go and have a look!”","...","“Sir! Sir! You have a pair of sharp eyes. This wind-patterned horse is absolutely a treasure in my shop! It runs so steadily that you’ll feel nothing riding on it.”","A young man led a big handsome horse out of a shop.","He patted the horse on the back and said, “Not bad. Not...”","He looked up and saw a blue tornado flashing past him.","It was so fast and steady that it looked like it floated along the road.","The young man pointed at the fast disappearing spiritual artifact and asked, “Can it be as steady as that thing?”","The shop owner’s face turned dark and didn’t reply.","The young man immediately mounted the horse. “Go! Follow it!”","He was curious. What was that thing?!","...","– In front of the beast stables of the Taiwang Inn –","“Gongzi Xun! Please!”","“Brother Nangong! Brother Xu! Gentlemen! Please!” A dignified-looking young man wearing a green robe cupped his hands to the people around him.","The guy that he called Brother Nangong was a big figure, and he had a wide face, a wide forehead, and a mild expression.","Suddenly, someone pointed at the entrance. “Isn’t she...”","A cute loli wearing a plain white dress walked out the gate while dragging a rare and majestic white deer with her.","“Well! It has been a long time since I came out with Little Bell.” The loli rubbed the big white deer’s fluffy head, looking quite pleased.","The white deer had a pair of silver bells hanging on its neck, and they tinkled while it walked.","“Isn’t she the little princess of the Jiang Family?”","“How come she’s here?”","“She declined Gongzi Xun’s invitation. I wonder where she’s going?”","With a polite smile, Xun Yuan walked over and asked, “Sister Jiang, where are you going? Should I give you a lift?”","“No! I don’t need it!” Jiang Xiaoyue shook her head and patted the big white deer’s head. “Little Bell, let’s go!”","At this moment, piercing roars that sounded like they came from tigers and dragons appeared from the depth of the beast stables. Instantly, dark clouds gathered in the sky as if an ultimate demon was about to come out!","Then, they heard a series of ear-deafening roars.","Hearing this roar, the other demon beasts inside the stables all knelt as if they were at the bottom of the food chain and had heard the roar of an existence at the top. The fear that came from the bottom of their hearts turned the whole stables into an uproar!","“Ugh?! Little Bell? What’s wrong?!” Jiang Xiaoyue’s big white deer also had panic in its eyes and couldn’t move even though she pulled.","Nangong Zhuo’s face turned dark. “That damn beast of mine is making trouble again. Wait for me for a few seconds.”","After a black flash, he vanished. Then, he came out from the beast stables while riding on a black horse with one horn. Covered in pitch-black scales, it looked as if it had been transformed from some other demon beast.","When the black horse walked out, Jiang Xiaoyue’s white deer’s legs turned to jelly and couldn’t move at all.","“Hey! Little Bell, what’s wrong?!” Jiang Xiaoyue pulled, but it didn’t budge. Angry, she rested her hands on her waist and stomped her feet.","Someone chuckled on the side and said, “I think this little deer is frightened.”","At this moment, she received a message on her communication jade. [Xiaoyue, where are you?]","[I’m in front of the beast stables of the Taiwang Inn.]","She was furious!","After sending the message in anger, she glared at her big white deer. “Why are you so cowardly?!”","“Brother Nangong!” With a light sigh, Xun Yuan shook his head and said, “Your mount is perfect in every aspect other than its bad temper. Princess Jiang, if you are in a hurry, you can ride my mount.”","“Who wants to take your mount?!” Jiang Xiaoyue was furious that such a thing would happen when she took her Little Bell for an outing.","At this moment, they heard a strange sound coming from the distance.","Then, with a blue flash, a weird-shaped ‘spiritual artifact’ raced over and steadily stopped before Xiaoyue.","The car window slid down, and Mr. Fang poked out his head. “Xiaoyue, get in the car.”","“Ahh?!” Dumbfounded, Jiang Xiao pointed at Mr. Fang’s car. “Isn’t... it...?!”","“Its the Pagassi Osiris supercar. Very awesome. Do you want to have a ride in it?” Mr. Fang arched his eyebrows.","“Yes! Yes! Yes!” Jiang Xiaoyue yelled cheerfully and then glanced at Little Bell by her side. “But... my Little Bell can’t move now!”","Mr. Fang got out of the car and pressed a button on the car key. The roof of the car retracted, and Mr. Fang threw the big white deer onto the backseat.","“Let’s go! Get in!” He put on his wind-blocking sunglasses and drove away with the excited Jiang Xiaoyue and the baffled white deer.","The others were left behind in the dust. “!!??”"]},{"number":431,"title":"Chapter 431 - Testing the Water","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Cough...”","“That thing just passed...”","“What was that?! Was it a spiritual boat or a spiritual artifact?!”","“No idea... It looks like a spiritual boat running on the ground, but not quite.”","“Who was that guy?!”","Everyone was full of questions, and the topic changed to the supercar that they had just seen.","“This guy... Who knows him?” Xun Yuan asked curiously.","“I don’t have the slightest idea...”","“He looks to be quite familiar with the little princess of the Jiang Family though?”","They talked among themselves animatedly.","While they were talking, a large group of people raced over on all kinds of mounts.","“The spiritual artifact went that way!” A white-robed young master rode over on a panting mount, and he was also feeling dizzy with the violent bumping. “It’s... too... bumpy. WTF? They told me that it would be steady!”","Before the car opened the top, it had reached a speed of more than 300 kilometers per hour. Of course, it was bumpy when they tried to chase after the car riding on demon beasts.","“Hurry! Follow it!”","“Slow... Slow down a bit! How can that thing be so fast?! Hey! It is slowing down! Go!”","“Stop! At least tell me where you bought this spiritual artifact!”","Dust rose again.","Nonplussed in the wind, Xun Yuan gestured to several servants and said, “Go and find out the identity of that man.”","Xun Yuan looked thoughtful while Nangong Zhuo looked unreadable while sitting on his scaly demonic unicorn.","How can this thing be so awesome?!","As for the speed, the extremely powerful demon beast’s speed wouldn’t be slow.","However, no demon beast could move so steadily at such a high speed. In fact, almost no demon beast-drawn carriages equipped with arrays could achieve this.","With wind whistling past her ears, Jiang Xiaoyue had been a bit uneasy at first while her hair fluttered in the wind, but she soon relaxed completely and exclaimed at the sensation.","The big white deer lay on the soft backseat, not daring to raise its head.","“Boss!” Jiang Xiaoyue turned her head and exclaimed in surprise. “There are so many people following us!”","“Sit tight!” Mr. Fang laughed. “Buckle up your big white deer!”","“How do I put the seat belt on Little Bell?” Jiang Xiaoyue looked at her little hands, and she couldn’t reach the deer.","“Move the seat belt with your qi!”","Snap! The big white deer got buckled up on the back seat.","Swoosh! Mr. Fang stepped hard on the gas pedal.","In the game, Mr. Fang dared to drive at a speed over 300 kilometers per hour as an ordinary man. With his current strength, he stepped on the gas and raced! ( B oxnovel.c om )","“My goodness! He is speeding up again?! How come it doesn’t get tired?!”","“How can a spiritual artifact be tired?”","“Can’t... can’t catch up!”","“I... I can’t do it anymore!”","“...”","Soon, the car had few followers.","Shortly, a blue shadow dashed to the door of Mr. Fang’s shop.","It almost parked before the door horizontally.","“How are my driving skills?” Smug, Mr. Fang killed the engine and opened the door.","“Superb!” Jiang Xiaoyue said excitedly, “It’s even better than in the game!”","“Aw...!” A pathetic cry came from the backseat.","“Oh! My Little Bell!” Jiang Xiaoyue immediately unbuckled it and saw the big white deer sway in the car with dizziness; it was just missing circling stars before its eyes.","Clang! It passed out.","Obviously, its first experience in the car ride was very poor.","“Come out, guys! Help me move this creature inside!” Mr. Fang yelled outside the shop.","...","There was no garage in this world, but Mr. Fang could put the car in a storage spiritual artifact, which was very convenient.","Under his employees’ help, Mr. Fang carried the dumb deer to the lounge area and took the cup of milk tea Jiang Xiaoyue poured for him.","“This is your Sister Lanruo.” Mr. Fang introduced her to the beautiful girl beside him. “She is helping out in the shop and will go to school with you.”","“Hello! Sister Lanruo!”","“This is Elder Li.” Mr. Fang pointed at the solemn old man on the side.","“This is Xin’er.” Mr. Fang pointed at the shy girl and said, “They are all new employees of this shop.”","“Oh...” While sipping the milk tea, Jiang Xiaoyue was a bit nonplussed. “Boss, how come you captured an elder as your employee...”","After Mr. Fang introduced these people to each other, the new and old employees got along well.","Of course, when Li Lanruo and the other two employees learned Xiaoyue’s background, they were speechless.","“Boss, what did you say?!” Their minds turned blank.","...","Meanwhile in the Jiuhua City, the customers created a group chat named the Legend of the Sword and Fairy Communication Group. The Legend of the Sword and Fairy 1 had been very popular, and the fanbase grew after the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3 was released.","Jiang Xiaoyue: [I’ll manage the new group! I’ll pull new players into the group! They are new employees in this shop! They are brand-new! (Husky’s cute face)]","Liu Ningyun: [New players again? Let me see!]","Su Tianji: [My Legend of the Sword and Fairy is indeed super attractive. We have new members so soon?]","[Lanruo joined the group chat.]","[Li Wuya joined the group chat.]","[Little Xin’er joined the group chat.]","Jiang Xiaoyue: [Welcome the new members! <img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f44f.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F44F;\">]","Su Tianji: [New members, do you like Sister Long Kui? Red Kui or Blue Kui? <img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f600.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F600;\">]","[TL Note: In the game, a female lead, Long Kui, has two personalities. One has red hair and is aggressive, and the other has blue hair and is gentle.]","This question drew out many girls who were staying low in the group.","Ning Bi: [Red Kui is good.]","Jiang Xiaoyue: [I like Blue Kui! Sister Blue Kui is the best!]","Dong Qingli: [Don’t you like Xue Jian? I think Xue Jian is so adorable!]","[TL Note: Xue Jian is another female lead.]","Song Qingfeng: [Are you all playing this game? I’m still playing Devil May Cry...]","“...”","They saw the messages in QQ group chat keep jumping up. “Ugh... Boss, there are so many people in the other shops?”","Li Lanruo was still not used to this. [They are so enthusiastic...]","Tentatively, she sent a message, “Hell, everyone... I like Xu Changqing...”","[TL Note: Xu Changqing is the second male lead in this game.]","Xichi Spiritual Master: [That young man is good. He’s knowledgeable and has good manners and high cultivation strength!] ( B oxnovel.c om )","Xu Zixin: [F*ck! Xu Changqing is so handsome!]","Lin Shao: [I think Xu Changqing is handsome too!]","“Ugh...” Nonplussed, Li Lanruo looked at Mr. Fang. “Shouldn’t we discuss sword techniques and spiritual spells here...?”","How come the discussion turned to another direction?!","...","– Meanwhile, in the Taiwang Inn –","“It’s almost time... The exam of the Heavenly Academy is about to begin, right?” The dim candlelight shone on Nangong Zhuo’s big figure; his mild face looked a bit grim and desolate.","“Yes,” a man answered; he was wearing a black silk robe with patterns of cloud dragons and swords.","“The person from the Li Family will attend it too?”","“Yes.”","He snickered. “Although it isn’t convenient to make a move inside Yuanyang City, the rules of this year’s academy exam have changed; I’ll see how you can slip from my grasp this time.”","At this moment, the man whispered something to him.","“You mean...” Nangong Zhuo frowned. “The man who picked up the princess of the Jiang Family is the same one who appeared by the Li Family when Nangong Jiuwen got killed?”","His face turned strange, and his expression became thoughtful.","“Jiang Family...” He looked unreadable. “Before the sword slaves make their moves, they jumped out to protect him? Or is he a member of the Jiang Family?”","“Or... it’s just a coincidence?”","“Go and find out his relationship with the Jiang Family.”","He stroked his chin while cold glints appeared in his eyes. “Shall I test this guy?”"]},{"number":432,"title":"Chapter 432 - Metal Machines and Spiritual Artifacts","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Although the story of the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3 had little to do with the previous game of the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 1, it was still popular among customers of the two shops.","The spiritual spells and ultimate techniques of the two main characters, Jing Tian and Xu Changqing, were different from those of Li Xiaoyao.","For example, Xu Changqing mainly cultivated rune spells instead of Sword Dao, and Jing Tian’s main focus was the sword techniques based on the demonic sword for battle instead of the sword control technique. In fact, Jing Tian only cultivated Shu Mountain Faction’s technique taught by Xu Changqing.","Jing Tian’s greatest strength was his astonishing understanding of Sword Dao due to his identity as the reincarnation of an immortal.","The players could feel this strength of his in the game.","When he played the game during the Tribulation at Penglai, Jing Tian’s strength was still average. Despite Mr. Fang’s own high-level swordsmanship, he felt a clumsiness while using the sword techniques. However, as the story went on, he soon obtained a lot of inspirations in swordsmanship from Jing Tian’s own understanding.","Different from the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 1, the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3 had two main characters and two storylines, which enabled the players to play the game and view the world from two perspectives. They could obtain two different kinds of feelings while playing the game.","The Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3 focused on reincarnation. The story of the reincarnations of Xu Changqing and Zi Xuan was full of tangled love from three life-times; only when the players went into this world could they understand the deep feelings which had sustained through their reincarnations.","Meanwhile, Jing Tian’s storyline was divided into two parts; one featured the Miss of the Tang Family, who was both willful and cute, and the other featured Long Kui, Jing Tian’s sister in his previous life 1,000 years ago who had been asleep in the demonic sword for 1,000 years.","People felt the weight of this kind of love which had lasted more than 1,000 years.","It was enthralling for most of the players in the two old shops and more so for the new players such as Li Lanruo.","Since there were no customers visiting the shop, they forgot that they were employees while they played the game avidly.","The Legend of the Sword and Fairy Communication Group was always boisterous with messages.","Li Lanruo gradually joined the discussion and the topics varied from their favorite girl to who was the most handsome male in the Legend of the Sword and Fairy. QQ messages kept beeping all the time.","Apart from these topics, they also talked about the story of Jade Dynasty and the sword techniques and spiritual spells in the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3.","At the lounge area near the entrance, Xiaoyue sat on a couch with a big white deer. The white deer held a cup of milk tea between its front hooves, enjoying the beverage.","“Yohahahaha... Milk... Milk tea is so good!” It yelled the words out inarticulately like a child.","“It is, isn’t it!” Jiang Xiaoyue said smugly, “I used to eat the delicacies in the shop every day!”","“Yohahahha... Yeah!” It let out a series of deer laughter.","At this moment, a handsome young master who was about 20 years old walked toward the shop followed by an aggressive-looking servant; this young man was wearing a black robe.","“Young Master...” The clerk from the Cloud-Bathing Shop, the shop next to Fang Qi’s, tried to stop them. “You can’t enter this shop! The shop owner offended Nangong...”","“Auch–!” he screamed.","“Get out!” The servant knocked him over with a kick and gestured to the young master before him, saying, “Do you know who he is? I don’t care about if its Nangong or Beigong, there’s not a shop in the city that my young master doesn’t dare to enter!”","Ignoring the upheaval behind him, the young master waved his folding fan and glanced around at the layout of the shop. “We got the right shop! The layout of the shop comes from the same person who designed that ground spiritual artifact.”","The servant bowed to him and said, “Young Master, the clerk said that the owner of this shop offended people from the Nangong Family...”","“It’s no big deal. Its not us who offended them.” The young master said indifferently, “The people of the Nangong Family are more arrogant than I am and are an eyesore for everyone! The shop owner is quite a figure. Let’s go in and have a look!”","“Yes! Yes!”","Upon entering, the servant yelled, “Sir...”","He swallowed back his words as he was startled. While pointing at the girl and the deer sitting in the lounge area, he stammered, “This... This...”","“Ugh?” The young master froze as well. “Isn’t she the little princess of the Jiang Family?”","He walked over immediately. “I’m surprised to see the little princess of the Jiang Family in this place! What an honor!”","“Xiaoyue, is he your friend?” Mr. Fang looked at the black-robed young man in bafflement.","“I’m Tang Yu!” The young master cupped his hands and said, “My Tang Family excels in making spiritual artifacts and machines. We saw someone traveling in the city in a ground spiritual boat at a speed greater than ordinary demon beasts, so we come here to... pay a visit.”","“...” Mr. Fang’s face twitched. “Do you excel in machines or spiritual artifacts?”","“...” The young master looked at Fang Qi as if he were a strange character. “Brother, don’t you know that my Tang Family always combines machine mechanisms and spiritual artifacts? You can’t separate them apart.”","“A few days ago, I saw your ground spiritual artifact run so fast without any spiritual essence fluctuation. I’m surprised that I can find someone in the same circle in the city.”","Mr. Fang was at a loss for words.","“I know I’m presumptuous, but...” The young master asked, “Can you let me have a look of your ground spiritual artifact?”","Mr. Fang thought for a moment and said, “Okay. But you can only observe it for a moment, and you can’t touch it!”","Then, he took out the supercar from his storage spiritual artifact.","Looking at the weirdly-shaped but perfect ‘ground spiritual artifact’, Tang Yuan clicked his tongue and exclaimed in appreciation, “Perfect! Indeed perfect! Everything connects with each other so well. This shape is designed to perfectly avoid the disturbance of winds when it runs... No spiritual essence! Not a trace of spiritual essence?! It’s completely made with machine mechanisms!”","He looked as if he wanted to stick his head inside the car.","Mr. Fang’s face twitched when he looked at this guy who obviously wished to drive away in his precious race car. He hadn’t imagined that the incident where he raced in his car would draw the attention of a maniac fan of race cars and mechanisms.","...","Meanwhile, the participants in the Taiwang Inn had received a message: [The Heavenly Academy’s exam will begin soon; the participants must arrive at the Heavenly Academy within three days!]"]},{"number":433,"title":"Chapter 433 - Danger","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“This sword control technique is indeed good!” Tang Yu was intently studying the race car when Li Lanruo and the other two shop clerks walked out.","“Boss, do you have a place to practice the techniques?” The three studied the spiritual spells and sword techniques in the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3 each day and were eager to try them in real life.","After glancing around, they couldn’t find a place where they could test what they had learned.","They couldn’t do it outside the shop since the city prohibited flying, and even spiritual artifacts couldn’t fly.","If some shops needed to test their spiritual artifacts, they must apply for approval to remove the array covering a certain area.","Of course, there was no guarantee that the approval would be granted.","Mr. Fang scratched his head. For the customers from the other shops, they just tested the techniques in the space in front of the shops and had never encountered such a situation.","“Ugh?! The sword can fly inside the shop!” Li Wuya formed a sword spell with his hand and controlled a flying sword to slowly rise and hover in the air.","By his side, Li Lanruo yelled in surprise, “Guild President! I know the sword control technique now!”","Then, Mr. Fang saw a figure dashing past him.","The person crashed into the glass door. The door remained intact, but the person...","Tang Yu was studying the car outside the door when he heard a loud noise and saw a figure getting stuck onto the door.","This person couldn’t get down.","Mr. Fang: “...”","Xiaoyue who was sipping milk tea and the big white deer who was holding a cup of milk tea looked nonplussed.","Tang Yu looked at the figure without a word and then turned back to the car as if nothing had happened.","“In the future, you must find another place to practice.” With a dark expression, Mr. Fang pulled down the figure. “Don’t make the shop messy and disorderly..”","However...","Curious, Fang Qi stared at Li Lanruo who was still reeling from the crash. “Did you fly with the sword control technique?”","Although she couldn’t obtain complete control of her flight, she had indeed flown up with the sword control technique, which meant that she was almost proficient with it.","She learned it so fast...?","After all, many people in Jiuhua City and Half City had spent a long time in practicing the control of the sword, let alone flying on the sword.","If he put all the credit on the potential fact that the cultivators of Spirit State were more talented... Fang Qi glanced at Elder Li Wuya and saw that the old man was still practicing how to control the sword. It would take a long time for him to fly on a sword.","Mr. Fang beckoned at her. “Get in the car.”","“Are you going out in this spiritual artifact?” Tang Yu immediately walked over. “Brother, can you take me with you?”","Mr. Fang’s face twitched. Is this guy a close friend of mine?","Seeing Mr. Fang’s displeasure, the young master added in a hurry, “I heard that you have some trouble with the Nangong Family due to this shop? Don’t worry, I’ll protect you. Okay? That’s settled then!”","Then, he got into the car.","Mr. Fang: “...”","He wanted to say that he had antagonized Nangong Family not only because of the shop; he had also killed more than 100 members of that family.","...","“Guild President, where are we going?” Sitting in the passenger seat, Li Lanruo watched the fast passing views outside the window.","“We’re going out of the city.” Since she had just begun learning the sword control technique, it was impossible for her to resist the force of the array inside the city; she could only use this technique at full force outside the city.","Outside the south gate of Yuanyang City was a huge square named Cloud Sea. There were no roads leading down the mountain; this city didn’t even consider receiving any cultivators or warriors who couldn’t fly up.","There was a parking lot for large spiritual boats near the gate, and cultivators and small spiritual boats could land on this square.","Since the square was outside the city, there was no array to restrict flying. Fang Qi stopped his car on the edge of the square, and the deep abyss was right beside it.","The river running out of the city poured down like an upside-down Milky Way. Many spiritual boats and flying cultivators landed from the sky, and it was a grand sight.","Fang Qi got out of the car and said, “How about you try flying here?”","In the next instant, she screamed while an invisible force pushed her off the edge of the square.","Li Lanruo screamed, “Ahhh!”","Soon, a woman wearing a blue dress shot up into the sky while stepping on a sword!","“My goodness! Look at that sword light!”","“What’s that?!”","“It’s so fast!”","The passing cultivators were dazed by the sight.","Tang Yu was also astonished and yelled with widened eyes, “How does she fly like this?! She is as fast as the Wind King Wings of my Tang Family!”","The vast sky was a fitting practice field for people who had just begun learning the sword control technique since they wouldn’t crash into anything even if they didn’t know how to make turns. With a scream resonating in the sky, the sword energy drew a huge arc in the sky and dashed around with an irregular route like a headless fly.","But gradually, the person on the sword began to obtain some control of the flight route. Soon, a bright blue sword energy shot through the heavenly mist and spiritual light and slowed down before landing on the square. A woman wearing a blue dress stood on the sword with her hair and clothes flapping in the wind. With bright sword light reflecting in her eyes, she looked like a female sword immortal descending from the Heavens.","The people around her were stupefied.","Mr. Fang applauded. “Great! Awesome! You are a quick learner!”","She had to learn fast! She almost died of fear!","However, she had to say, “Thank you, Guild President... I seem to have mastered the sword control technique!”","After all, the Senior had done it for my own good!","She had to thank Fang Qi while she had the urge to hit him; it was a weird feeling.","“However, you learned it really fast...” While stroking his chin, Mr. Fang looked her up and down curiously and said, “Good. I think you’ll do fine in that academy exam. You can at least flee when someone tries to hunt you down.”","“Flee?!” Tang Yu said loudly, “She can outrun most of the cultivators!”","“Can she?” Mr. Fang said in bafflement, “I feel like the sword ball of Nangong is quite fast. She still needs to work on her speed while flying on a sword.”","“...” Tang Yu said in surprise, “Didn’t you just buy a shop? Why did they use the sword ball on you?!”","He suddenly froze and said, “A couple of days ago, I heard that Nangong Family lost over 100 people when they tried to hunt down a small family... Are you their targets?”","Glints flashed in his eyes. “Do you plan to attend the Heavenly Academy’s exam?!”","Mr. Fang said, “She will attend it. Is there a problem?”","“Few forces in the world dare to challenge Nangong Family in public.” Tang Yu no longer looked flippant. He said earnestly, “You guys are indeed... amazing!”","He continued, “However, the Nangong Family has many trump cards, and they won’t let you get away from it after you killed so many people. You must be very careful. If this lady intends to attend the exam alone...”","He shook his head and said, “I don’t know what trump cards you have, but this exam will be extremely dangerous.”"]},{"number":434,"title":"Chapter 434 - Jiang Xiaoyue’s Entrance Exam","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“It’s the swords instead of the people of the Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace that you must be wary of. The swords controlled by people are not horrifying. However, if you encounter the people controlled by swords, you must be very careful!” The young master said in rare seriousness after he understood the relationship between these two people and the Nangong Family.","With narrowed eyes, Fang Qi dug out a cigarette box from his pocket. Looking at the last cigarette, he suppressed his urge to light it and put the lighter back into his pocket.","He frowned at Tang Yu’s warning.","He savored the hidden meaning in Tang Yu’s words and began to understand the great depths and accumulation of the major forces in the Spirit State.","Then, he put away the cigarette and shrugged. “Why do people always like making trouble?”","...","( B oxnovel.c om ) – The Heavenly Academy –","In the rolling spiritual mountains, there seemed to be spiritual lights flashing and purple spiritual essence rising.","The Heavenly Academy was situated in the depths of the misty spiritual essence.","In fact, this year’s academy exam went beyond its original purpose. Due to its unusual importance, all the existing disciples of the Heavenly Academy would participate in the exam as well.","People still could enter the academy through this exam, but it would be extremely difficult to get the first place and become the Old Academy Master’s last disciple, thus learning the ultimate Heavenly Insight Scroll.","Of course, for some people, this wasn’t their concern since their goal was not the first place.","Nangong Zhuo’s eyes looked cold. “It’s said that that woman of the Li Family has obtained more cultivation strength with the assistance of Mystic Fate Jade?”","“Yes! Young Master!” the man wearing a black silk robe answered, “Besides, it’s said that she has learned a wondrous sword technique, and she can fly extremely fast while standing on a sword! The cultivators saw it on the Cloud Sea Square!”","“Fast?” Nangong Zhuo snickered. “How fast can she be? Can she fly faster than my sword?”","“What about that kid with her?” Nangong Zhuo asked, “Have you found out about his relationship with the Jiang Family and his background?”","“His background is not clear,” the man said, “I only know that he is close to the little princess of the Jiang Family. He has a shop in the city, but we can’t find out about his background.”","“He’s being secretive and trying to act?” Nangong Zhuo said, “You can go now.”","“Yes.”","After that man left, two ghost-like figures appeared from thin air behind Nangong Zhuo.","The two black-cloaked figures kneeled on the ground.","“Act after he leaves the city.”","The two figures shot out like two pitch-black sword beams.","Nangong Zhuo had cold glints in his eyes. “We’ll soon find out who you are.”","Meanwhile, Xun Yuan, who had been cultivating in his room, suddenly opened his eyes and saw that the sky outside the window had turned extremely gloomy.","Crack! A bolt of lightning shot down from the sky with blinding light in the dim sky, and the thunder rumbled.","“Who has forced the Nangong Family to use sword slaves?”","Fragrant flowers in front of the window bloomed, and several yellow birds frolicked around the eaves. A white-robed young master stood in the corridor in the courtyard and looked at the gloomy sky with an ancient scroll in his hand; the characters on the scroll looked ancient and complicated as if they were written in a language from a distant past. “A tiny petal of a flower or a leaf can change one’s whole life, or it would be meaningless.”","In the sky, with many engravings of strange array patterns, a pair of huge wings made with gold and jade spread out, and a black-robed young master faintly smiled. “I’ll set off before you guys!”","A flash of light shot across the sky!","Then, many spiritual lights shot up from Yuanyang City like fireflies in the gloomy sky; they used their respective powerful techniques and shot toward the northeast direction in the form of light beams!","( B oxnovel.c om ) “Boss! We’re setting off now!” On Cloud Sea Square, Jiang Xiaoyue waved her little hand.","“Let’s go to the school, Sister Lanruo!”","Then, they drew a long trail of sword beam and joined the magnificent river of spiritual lights.","“Don’t be smug. Our senior sister will be the champion of this year’s academy exam!” A voice mumbled in the crowd.","“Stop your nonsense.” In the crowd, a woman wearing a pure-white Daoist robe with a pair of cranes embroidered on the hem lightly pushed back her bamboo hat and glanced over. Then, she flew up elegantly riding on the wind. While looking unworldly and ethereal, she followed the crowd in a distance.","It was the first time that all the masters of the younger generation gathered so close together.","...","Stepping on her flying sword, Jiang Xiaoyue flew to the foremost of the group smugly. “Sister Lanruo, don’t worry. The items in the Boss’s shop are extremely awesome.”","“How many scrolls of the Heavenly Book have you read?”","“Ugh... Only three scrolls, and I haven’t fully understood them yet.”","“Don’t worry!” Jiang Xiaoyue patted her small chest and promised, “Just watch me!”","When she stayed in the shop, she was only an employee with a super powerful senior and a mighty boss above her, and she had never had an opportunity to show her abilities, Now, she couldn’t suppress the strong urge to show her hand.","She was extremely pleased. After all, her boss couldn’t come to the exam. The most he could do was watch from outside. It was her opportunity to show her abilities!","She almost jumped with excitement!","“Ay~ Hear me out. When we’re in the exam, just stay with me; I promise that I’ll bring us to victory! I’ve read all the scrolls of the Heavenly Book and mastered the sword control technique for many years. I can also use all the ultimate techniques including Magic Shield Spell and Ice Roar Spell...”","Li Lanruo’s eyes widened. “...”","Her brain went blank.","She had just encountered the super powerful Senior Fang and wanted to show her hand. However, seeing the super powerful princess who had just appeared, she knew that she had a long way before her.","The rolling mountains outside the Heavenly Academy were full of all kinds of demonic birds and beasts. In addition, the origins of these spiritual mountains could trace back to the distant ancient times. Although it wasn’t a forbidden zone where no one could pass, these mountains were a dangerous area for ordinary people to move through.","Meanwhile, these mountains were full of all kinds of spiritual flowers and herbs and even rare treasures.","( B oxnovel.c om ) At the same time, they were covered by all kinds of restriction arrays from ancient times. For this exam, the academy had put some other restriction arrays in the mountains.","The rule for this year’s academy exam was passing this huge area of spiritual mountains and reaching the mountain gate of the Heavenly Academy!","Of course, this was the basic requirement for passing the exam. The academy only had 81 spots, which meant that not all the cultivators reaching the gate would be accepted. They must find as many natural treasures in the mountains as possible, and the people who got the most treasures would rank higher on the list.","Treasure hunting had been a necessary experience and a common training method for all the cultivators and warriors. Whenever a mystical relic came out, it would draw large groups of cultivators to explore. This academy used this method to test the participants.","Of course, the dangers didn’t only come from the spiritual mountains; they may also come from the other participants in the exam."]},{"number":435,"title":"Chapter 435 - Playing With the Communication Jade First","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","On the Heavenly Academy’s huge Sky-Patrolling Spiritual Ship stood all the young cultivators and warriors from all over the place who were here to participate in the academy exam.","Yes, there were some warriors among them.","In the long history of the continent, a few ultimate warrior masters had appeared, and their names were engraved in the history books. Once, an ultimate genius turned from a cultivator to a warrior and finally became the Lord of Emperor Warriors—he had come from Heavenly Academy.","Besides Jiang Xiaoyue, there were other demons who looked unlike normal humans; they traveled here from distant places to seek Dao.","All kinds of people could be seen here.","This was the Heavenly Academy.","A middle-aged man wearing a black robe stood on the deck in front of the crowd. His grey hair was coiled into a bun at the top of his head, pinned by a wooden pin, and he looked like a disheveled Daoist.","The other was a silver-haired middle-aged woman wearing a white robe; she looked to be about 40 years old.","“I think you all understand the rules of this academy exam!” the middle-aged man said, “If you have no objections, you can now fly off the spiritual ship and enter the spiritual mountains. You must reach the academy gate by the end of the seventh day. You will be disqualified if you can’t reach the gate by that time even if you obtained many treasures!”","“How difficult can it be?!” A voice sounded, and the person jumped off the spiritual ship.","Then, spiritual lights shot out of the spiritual ship like flower petals scattered down the sky by a fairy.","“Let’s land on Cloud-Hacking Mountain over there!”","“Here! It’s said that the Ethereal Summit has lots of good stuff!”","“Junior Master Xun, shall we go to the White Cloud Hill?”","“...”","...","In Mr. Fang’s shop, a big white deer finished its milk tea and lounged on a couch, feeling aimless after losing the job as a mount.","Suddenly, shadows appeared before the entrance.","For the first time, the shop was graced by new players.","“Where’s Xiaoyue?” Jiang Xuan strode into the shop followed by a group of people; some looked tough and wore armor while others had furry ears. Jiang Xuan looked around. “Where’s the shop owner?”","The big white deer who had been calmly lounging on a couch shivered in fear and dropped onto the ground. “Your... Highness?! Princess Her Highness has gone to take the academy exam!”","“Please get up!” Jiang Xuan waved his hand casually. “You don’t have to be so formal in the shop. It’s inconvenient!”","“Ugh... Boss...” Li Wuya walked up. “Boss is out. What do you want to play? We have the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3; it’s super fun!”","Then, he immediately corrected himself, “It’s super helpful for cultivation!”","“I understand!” Jiang Xuan thought for a moment, remembering that all the old players expressed themselves this way in the internet café.","“I’m an old driver! Get me milk tea and instant noodles!” Jiang Xuan yelled.","“!!??” Li Wuya and Li Xin’er froze.","What is an old driver?!","“Zhen Yan! Xue Ming! Go and pour a few cups of milk tea!” Seeing the puzzlement on the clerks’ faces, Jiang Xuan was a bit embarrassed, wondering if he had got the wrong words.","“Yes!”","He had only gotten to the part of Jade Dynasty where Biyao died and was eager to watch the rest!","He took a seat and put on the virtual reality headset before clicking open Jade Dynasty and beginning to watch intently.","“Sir...” Li Wujia’s face twitched while he said, “Don’t you want to try our new game, the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3?”","“I... I want to try it!” A big white deer walked over with a handful of crystals in its mouth.","“Are... Are they enough?!” It yelled like a toddler who was just learning how to speak and shook the storage bag on its back. “If not, I... I have more!”","It sounded as if it was still practicing the human language.","“...” It had drank milk tea, and now it even wanted to play the game?!","The two employees exchanged a look, wondering what kind of demons had come to visit the shop while the shop owner was out!","As members of a small family, they were shocked by the strange developments.","“Yohahahaha! This is so fun! It’s very helpful for my transformation into the human form!” Since the princess didn’t need her to be the mount today, the deer decided to take the opportunity to play the game.","The two shop clerks felt like crying, wondering what was happening.","Boss! Please come back! Can we really let this thing play?","...","However, Mr. Fang was quite busy now.","Meanwhile, the cultivators in Jiuhua City and Half City widened their eyes when they saw the message in the group chat. “F*ck! Where’s this place?!”","A photo was posted in the group, showing a dense forest with an abundance of spiritual essence. Obviously, someone had taken a selfie, and there was also a pretty girl wearing a blue long dress beside her.","“Look at the bottom on the right! They are seven-leaf flowers!”","“Look at the left! That’s a thousand-year-old Moonlight Grass!”","“Dang! Dang! Dang!” Smug, Jiang Xiaoyue pulled out QQ Interface on her new communication jade. The new communication jade newly developed by the Wuwei Daoist Alliance couldn’t contain things that were too complicated, but it contained QQ. After downloading QQ, they could transfer the QQ messages into data supported by spiritual essence on the communication jade.","In this way, the users just needed to connect QQ on the communication jade to the internet café in Yuanyang City.","Of course, it would take the cultivators many years to develop their own APPs as in the real smartphones.","She took a picture of herself with a victory hand and posted, [Now, I’m on Cloud-Hacking Mountain outside the Heavenly Academy!]","Soon, a picture of the cute Jiang Xiaoyue appeared in the Legend of the Sword and Fairy Communication Group.","“Sister Lanruo, let’s take a selfie and send it to the group chat, okay?”","Li Lanruo was dazed. You promised that you would bring me to victory! But now?! You are playing with the communication jade and taking selfies?!","If the Old Academy Master knew about it, he might become so angry that he would forbid playing with communication jade during the exam.","...","The big white deer was still playing games.","Without any knowledge about games, it just played blindly; it played an online game instead of a single-player game.","On the screen, a female wizard wearing cotton clothes stood there with a small wooden sword in her hand.","Several warriors stood in front of her.","A tough voice came from the Jiuhua Army Channel, “Guys, what are you doing in the newbie village?”","“We’re teaching a girl how to play the game! You know what? This girl is super cute! She speaks like a toddler and is cuter than my own little sister!”","“What?! There are girls in the game?!” A warrior hacked the monster before him and said in excitement.","“Yohahahaha! You guys are so awesome!” A little wizard named Lu Xiaoxian looked pleased with a wooden sword in her hand.","“...”"]},{"number":436,"title":"Chapter 436 - Sneak-Attack and Also Steal Potato Chips?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","The Heavenly Academy couldn’t sit back and watch if these participants fell into mortal danger, so it gave each of them a Heavenly Insight Token, a spiritual artifact looking neither like gold nor jade. Once it was activated, it would release a spiritual stamp with great defensive power while sending a message to the cultivators of the Heavenly Academy on the Sky-Patrolling Spiritual Ship.","Although only a part of the mountainous area was set aside as the exam area, the space was still vast, and the ship couldn’t monitor everything happening in the exam area. However, once this token was activated, the message would be sent to the spiritual ship; it meant that the participant forfeited the exam and would be rescued by cultivators of the Heavenly Academy.","Of course, this token didn’t guarantee safety. The participants might die before they could activate the tokens, or some powerful force might just break the defensive stamp of the token and kill them. Everything was possible.","In Cloud-Hacking Mountain outside Heavenly Academy, Jiang Xiaoyue began to broadcast her exam by posting texts and images on QQ with the communication jade. On the other hand, she had a bag of potato chips.","“Sister Lanruo, do you want more?” Jiang Xiaoyue crunched on the potato chips and handed a bag bigger than her head to Li Lanruo while saying with a smirk, “Now, Boss can’t stop me from eating!”","While eating potato chips, Li Lanruo said with great enjoyment, “So delicious! How come we don’t have potato chips in the shop?”","“I got it from a gift box at the new year party!” She had complained about her bad luck when she saw others getting items like the Black Snow Treasure Sword or Rune No. 13. But now facing Li Lanruo who had never opened gift boxes, she was quite smug. “It’s a new item that the shop has never sold yet!”","At this moment, some faint, irregular noises came from the hidden places near them.","“Look!” A black-robed young cultivator pulled the leaves before his eyes and saw a loli and a blue-clothed beauty who were busy eating potato chips, oblivious to the things around them.","“They are alone?!” Another black-clothed young man said as if he had discovered a new continent. “They show no signs... they haven’t discovered us for one bit!”","He beckoned at his companions. “Come over here! Come over here!”","“That girl... seems to be the little princess of the Jiang Family?!” A yellow-clothed young man froze as if he had recognized Jiang Xiaoyue. “We might greatly offend the Jiang Family if we attack her.”","“What are you afraid of?! We’ll just take her items and won’t hurt her! In the academy exam, if we don’t dare to attack anyone we meet, it’s better that we just pack and go home!”","“I checked around and found nothing good around this place. I’m sure that this little girl took them all!”","“You’re right!” There were about ten people in the group. “Let’s attack at the same time!”","Many masters from major forces had entered this year’s exam, but it didn’t mean that the others had no chance.","It was hard for cultivators with moderate strengths to survive in the spiritual mountains full of restriction arrays and look for natural treasures.","For the smart participants, they either joined a master or formed a group with other participants. When they were in danger, they could deal with it with combined forces and thus reduce damage.","This group of a dozen-or-so cultivators was clearly trying to use this strategy. Some of them came from one force and thus had a tighter bond.","More than ten people sneak-attacking two! Obviously, they had greater odds of winning!","“Brother Huang! You guys set a net array and restrict their spiritual essence!” The black-clothed cultivator said in a low voice, “Do it at my signal, and I’ll break her protective spiritual artifact with the Black Feather Snake Needle at the same time!”","“Okay! Brother Mo, you even brought Black Feather Snake Needles with you?!” The yellow-clothed man licked his lips. “I wonder what elixir they are eating; they seem to be enjoying it very much. Let’s take it and try it ourselves!”","“Right! We’ll have a taste of it too!” The black-clothed cultivator sneered. Then, he concealed his presence and moved forward stealthily.","Next, an air-piercing whistle came.","“Move!”","With a yell, a large pale blue light net surrounded Jiang Xiaoyue and Li Lanruo!","The light net spread to the depths of the mountain around them. Under this light net, Jiang Xiaoyue and Li Lanruo’s spiritual essence stopped circulating. Meanwhile, several sharp black needles shot toward them with low whistling sounds!","It seemed that Jiang Xiaoyue was too dazed to react.","“Move!” The black-clothed cultivator looked pleased. “We got them!”","At his order, about ten cultivators wearing yellow or black robes removed their concealment and stealth techniques and launched all kinds of spiritual spells and spiritual artifacts!","At this moment, they suddenly saw Jiang Xiaoyue holding two metal spiritual artifacts with strange shapes; one was black, and the other was white.","The black-clothed cultivator felt that she didn’t activate any spiritual essence.","“She is even weaker than I expected!” The black-clothed cultivator sneered.","The black holes in the spiritual artifacts suddenly shot out burning flames!","Crack! Crack...","The dozen-or-so cultivators and several spiritual artifacts dropped to the ground like dumplings going into the pot!","“We have suppressed your spiritual essence! What is th...?”","Jiang Xiaoyue changed the magazines and murmured to herself, “These guns are not good... Without my spiritual essence, their power is so weak!”","“Pu–!” The black-clothed cultivator spat out a mouthful blood, and it wasn’t clear if it was caused by the fury or getting shot.","Li Lanruo was at a loss for words while standing beside her.","Meanwhile in the distant Jiuhua City, Li Haoran was explaining something to his audience with a few bullets engraved with pale blue spiritual patterns in hands, “After many experiments, we’ve produced the eighth type of bullets—Spiritual Penetration Bullets!”","While holding one of the bullets, he said, “They are derived from the basic Magnum bullets, and the guns are based on the special guns originating from those in Devil May Cry 3 which can condense demonic energy. On the bullets, we engraved the special arrays used to break protective spiritual artifacts or spiritual spells.”","“Have you tested them?”","“We tested them only at the spiritual shooting range,” Li Haoran said, “The shop owner brought Xiaoyue here last time, and she bought some bullets; I wonder if they are effective...”","“Pu-!” The black-clothed cultivator spat out another mouthful of blood and passed out.","The cultivators who didn’t pass out immediately lowered their heads.","Xiaoyue sent a screenshot to the group chat. “<img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f600.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F600;\"> I’m awesome, eh? I knocked down more than ten cultivators in one breath!”","“Awesome! Awesome!”","“Powerful!”","“Xiaoyue is the champion!”","Then, she looted them cheerfully and took everything that they had. “Humph! Where were you when I got attacked and robbed every day in the Legend of Mir 2?!”","“Ahh! My spiritual herbs!” Seeing Jiang Xiaoyue taking all of their precious spiritual plants, they felt like crying, wondering what kind of spiritual artifacts could unleash such great power without spiritual essence?!","How could they survive that?!","They released their Heavenly Insight Tokens. GG!"]},{"number":437,"title":"Chapter 437 - Sword Slaves","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Cloud... Hacking Mountain?” Mr. Fang looked at the messages on QQ. Jiang Xiaoyue posted pictures in the group chat while she was collecting the rare plants on Cloud-Hacking Mountain and putting them into her storage bag.","Despite the large number of precious plants in the spiritual mountains, it wasn’t safe to collect all of them since some places were guarded by restriction arrays. If the participants were not careful, they would be disqualified while they tried to collect the plants.","Most of the spiritual treasures and plants in the mountains varied from level 3 to level 6, and there were a few rare level 7 spiritual plants.","The level 7 treasures were guarded by powerful demon beasts or had their own self-protective mechanisms besides potential restriction arrays. It was extremely difficult to get them.","All the level 6 spiritual items were guarded by restriction arrays, and some of them were also guarded by demon beasts. If one were lucky, they might find a level 6 item object guarded by a weak restriction array.","Jiang Xiaoyue’s eyes brightened when she saw a level 6 spiritual flower surrounded by somelevel 5 spiritual grass in the swamp before them. Obviously, she was quite lucky today.","Then, she glanced around. “Restriction arrays?”","( B oxnovel.c om ) “These restriction arrays are too obvious!” Li Lanruo clicked her tongue; these restriction arrays were concealed but not as advanced as those in other places.","Were they really this lucky?","When Jiang Xiaoyue walked closer to the swamp, several cold gazes flashed in the darkness.","“Someone’s here!”","“Good! They’re going to take the bait!”","They saw a harmless loli in a white dress and a beauty wearing a long blue dress.","“Isn’t she the woman of the Li Family?!” a voice whispered, “For some reason, the Nangong Family is trying to hunt and capture her... I’m surprised that she’s here. Young Master Nangong is around. If we catch her and hand her to the Nangong Family...”","They were excited at this prospect since it was a rare opportunity to gain favors from and establish a relationship with the Nangong Family!","“Be careful. The other seems to be a member of the Jiang Family!”","“She’s just a little girl. No one can run from the poison of my Thousand-Spider Valley! To help me with this exam, the elders have given me all the top-level poisonous creatures treasured in the valley!”","“Then, we’ll rely on you, Daoist Brother Du Zhuzi!”","“No problem! All good!”","While they spoke, Jiang Xiaoyue broke the restriction array and waved her small hand. Then, a small skeleton appeared before her.","The small skeleton walked up with an ax.","The small skeleton stopped before the spiritual flower and bent to pick it.","Suddenly, a big colorful spider sensed danger, and it jumped up and bit the skeleton.","The small skeleton continued to collect the flower as if nothing had happened...","The people hidden in the darkness exchanged a look. “Daoist Brother Du Zhuzi, what poison did you use?”","“It’s a Ghost Spider. Its poison will travel all over the body through the meridians and blood veins...”","“!!?? Do you think that thing has meridians?!”","They fell silent.","Where did this skeleton come from?!","The small skeleton collected the spiritual flower and all the spiritual plants in the area as if nothing had happened.","“Okay!” Jiang Xiaoyue waved her small hand, and the skeleton collapsed on the ground. “Here. The level 5 plants are for you.”","Then, they walked away boldly.","“No!” The people hiding in the darkness were not pleased, and their faces darkened.","“That’s our level 6 spiritual flower!”","“Stop!”","– One minute later –","They all dropped to the ground with multiple gun wounds on their bodies. With their storage bags emptied out, they screamed while lying on the ground. “Wait... That’s our spiritual flower...”","“Don’t hit us anymore!” In their pathetic howls, the useless items from their storage bags were tossed onto their faces. Feeling powerless, they released their Heavenly Insight Tokens.","( B oxnovel.c om ) – Meanwhile, on White Cloud Hill –","A bright-eyed young man wearing a purple robe and a golden belt emitted purple aura which surged up and condensed into a furious purple dragon around him. Beside the purple dragon, there was a demon snake covered in gold-iron scales that had a pair of wings.","The ugly and vicious head of the demon snake was as big as a person, but now it lay on the ground and couldn’t be deader!","In Fufang Valley, a white-robed young man with long hair stood with a scroll in his hand. Before him lay a huge golden-furred tiger; it lay on the ground and didn’t dare to move a muscle as if the harmless-looking young man was a prehistoric demon beast.","The white-robed man ambled into the depths of the valley and stopped in front of a huge tree that reached the sky. On the tree was a golden fruit, and the fruit’s presence showed that it had probably reached level 7!","– On the Ethereal Summit –","An astonishing sword energy slashed down as if it descended from the sky. On the high cliff surrounded by white clouds, sword energies with sharp and crystal-clear essence knocked down more than half of the boulders on the mountain, startling many birds into flying away. A woman wearing a pure white Daoist robe and a bamboo hat wiped blood off her cheek, and the cultivators who had tried to besiege the mountain and attack her lay on the ground.","From the looks of it, more than half of the cultivators on the Ethereal Summit were packed here.","“Senior Sister, here are the spiritual items that they collected.” A green-clothed girl spat and said, “They are as blind as bats, daring to rob us when we found good items. Now, their stuff belongs to us.”","“That’s it.” The woman nodded slightly and wiped blood from the tip of her sword with a white silk handkerchief.","...","Fierce battles were happening everywhere all the time. However, in one place, things were very quiet.","“Young Master Nangong!” A tall young man wearing a robe with clouds, dragons, and sword patterns on it stood with his hands clasped behind his back.","Behind him stood almost 100 cultivators. “We are willing to follow Young Master Nangong!”","Nangong Zhuo’s eyes turned sharp. “I saw that the woman of the Li Family had gone in the direction of Cloud-Hacking Mountain.”","“Send someone to keep an eye on her.”","“Yes!”","...","– In the group chat –","“@Mr. Fang. Where’s the despicable boss?!” Jiang Xiaoyue stomped her foot; she was showing off her loot but couldn’t find her despicable boss.","– In the sky above the Cloud Sea Square outside Yuanyang City –","Under the gloomy clouds, a figure stood on the blade of a sword.","The people on the ground pointed at him. “What’s that?!”","In the high sky, surrounded by lightning flashes, two black shadows hovered in the gloomy clouds like ghosts.","The person standing on the sword was closer to the ground, and people could roughly see that he was a young man wearing a blue-and-white robe.","In the sky, the two shadows suddenly moved closer at a horrifying high speed. Covered in black cloaks, their hands and feet were coiled by chains, and clouds of creepy pitch-black mists were emanating out from their cloaks, making them look neither like humans nor ghosts.","One of the shadows pointed its finger.","Fang Qi slightly frowned, finding this sword technique resembled the one used by Nangong Jiuwen.","He slightly moved to the side at a speed undetectable by the naked eye.","Boom! With an earth-shaking noise, a spiritual boat behind him and the cliff behind the spiritual boat were hacked open like tofu!","“The same sword technique, but the power is unbelievably greater? How come it feels like this guy cultivated the Evil-Avoiding Sword Technique?” Mr. Fang muttered.","[TL Note: The Evil-Avoiding Sword Technique is a technique in a classic wuxia novel written by Jin Yong, and the practitioners have to be male and cut off their own genitals.]","“Hurry! Retreat into the city!” The cultivators outside the city scrambled to run.","“That...” Suddenly, a cultivator yelled in shock, “Those are sword slaves of the Nangong Family!”","“Who is he?! He dares to face the Nangong Family’s sword slaves and not run?!”","“Run?!” another cultivator said in a snicker, “How can he run?!”","[Beep! You receive a new task.]","New Task: Establishing Dominance is Required to Keep a Foothold (1)","Task Description: Please defeat your enemies in the most shocking and dominating way.","Task Reward: Fortune Prize Wheel]"]},{"number":438,"title":"Chapter 438 - Mr. Fang Failed to Establish Dominance?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Mr. Fang looked up at the two half-human and half-ghost figures who flashed by in cloaks. I can defeat them, but what is the most shocking and dominating way?","While people of the Nangong Family were still cultivators, the sword slaves were human-shaped weapons designed solely for battles!","Each of their attacks emitted frightening murderous spirit and the nauseating smell of blood, reminding people of the many tombs that buried the poor souls that had died under their swords.","The Nangong Family of the Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace had gained its reputation mainly because of the sword slaves.","The Nangong Family had gotten even more overbearing in recent years, inducing disapproval from the other major families. However, the other families hadn’t shown their displeasure yet since they knew the Nangong Family had gotten a lot of benefits from the depths of the Fortune Golden Palace; another reason was that the Nangong Family had many trump cards.","This super force had raised war weapons which only had killing in mind. They couldn’t feel fatigued and had no emotions.","For a long time, no one had ever seen any of these war weapons damaged. In the history of the Spiritual State, these war weapons turned everywhere they went into a wasteland but remained intact themselves.","Engulfed by thick smoke, red and black huge sword energies hacked down, and people could hear the shrill screams inside the smoke.","( B oxnovel.c om ) The mountains on both sides shattered, turning into many giant rocks before collapsing into the abyss.","If not for the extremely powerful defense system of Yuanyang City, this city would have been destroyed by the residual energy waves of the attacks.","A spiritual light rose outside Yuanyang City. Obviously, the city had activated its defense system. When some sword energies crashed onto the spiritual light, they exploded and scattered like fireworks.","The guards standing on the city wall split and gave way to a powerful-looking, middle-aged man who had grey hair. He emitted a mountain-like presence which could shock people when they looked at him.","“Mr. Castellan!” The guards in the area quickly greeted him.","The middle-aged man gave them a slight nod and then looked up at the sky with an unreadable expression.","“The last time that Nangong Family sent out sword slaves was about 200 years ago, right?” Standing beside him was a middle-aged cultivator wearing a long robe; he looked scholarly, elegant, and otherworldly.","“Yeah. It has been a long time.”","“Castellan Zong, how many attacks do you think this young man can block?” The long-robed, middle-aged cultivator asked.","The Castellan didn’t reply, looking thoughtful.","“Five?” The long-robed, middle-aged man gave a range.","“About ten,” Castellan Zong said, “From the looks of it, he will lose soon.”","“What a pity! Why did this talented young man mess with yjr Nangong Family?”","The moment he said it, they heard loud noises under the wall.","“What’s happening?”","“Is this kid crazy?!”","“I think he’s waiting to be killed!”","In the sky, the young man stepping on the flying sword seemed to have been forced into a corner by the strikes of the sword slaves. Despite the great speed of his flying sword, the sword slaves had built a dense and horrifying net of sword energies from which no one could escape!","However, they saw the young man standing on the flying sword do something that they could never have imagined!","Looking at the horrifying sword attacks from both sides, Mr. Fang lit up a cigarette cheerfully.","The cigarette end lit up and looked bright against the gloomy sky.","Then, two pitch-black sword energies shot past him!","Crack! ( B oxnovel.c om )","Boom!","The sword energies hacked down huge pieces from the mountains on both sides.","The whole area fell silent.","Then, a thin layer of spirit light covered with strange treasure patterns and white flares surrounded Fang Qi.","“Hu...” Intact, Mr. Fang blew out some smoke from his mouth.","His left hand slightly opened, and the spirit light quickly shrunk and transformed into an exquisite palm-sized hollow metal ball covered by strange cloud patterns.","It emitted radiant light and looked as dazzling as a mini sun in his hand!","“This is...!?”","“He blocked the attacks?!”","All the cultivators watching the battle gasped and forgot to close their mouths.","“What is that spiritual treasure?!”","“He used it to block the attacks of two sword slaves and remained intact?!”","“Ultimate treasure! It must be an ultimate treasure on the same level as those from the Fortune Golden Palace!”","Golden Sun Wheel!","It was one of the ultimate spiritual treasures of the Kunlun Faction from the movie ‘Shu Mountain’!","In the movie, even the Youquan Blood Demon couldn’t break it before it absorbed the energy from the Blood Cave!","At this moment, the sword slaves launched several strikes, and these strikes were as dense as mountains and contained greater force!","Ding!","Dang!","With two huge noises, the two swords hacked onto the spiritual treasure, and the people saw that the young man in the sky didn’t move a muscle and remained intact! Not even a strand of his hair was hurt!","“Did he get it from the Fortune Golden Palace?!”","Many cultivators were green with envy, and they had the urge to rush over and grab it from Mr. Fang.","How come there is such an awesome treasure in the world?!","Meanwhile, Castellan Zong exchanged a surprised look with the cultivator wearing the long robe.","“I’m surprised that he has such a trump card; no wonder he dares to challenge the Nangong Family!","The long-robed cultivator shook his head while he watched the sword slaves hack onto the Golden Sun Wheel tirelessly. “This spiritual treasure is indeed powerful, but he can’t win by defending. When his spiritual essence runs out, he will die for sure!”","The Castellan nodded. “The sword slaves only attack and never defend. He might be able to kill one sword slave with a sudden suicidal attack, but who would trade their life with a sword slave?”","“This young man will die soon!”","While they talked, many cultivators eagerly moved closer toward the edge of the array as if they were waiting for the spiritual treasure to drop.","However, before the Castellan finished his words, a bronze crescent-shaped spiritual treasure appeared in Fang Qi’s hand.","While holding the burning Golden Sun Wheel with one hand, Fang Qi formed a sword spell with the other hand and controlled the Golden Moon Wheel to rotate around him like a new moon.","He remained still when the two sword slaves attacked again.","With two crisp noises, two figures separated while the Golden Moon Wheel drew an elegant arc like a new moon!","Dumbfounded, all the people saw that thee sword slaves had been somehow cut into two halves.","The cultivators who had been waiting to pick up the spiritual treasures backed off subconsciously!","However, the battle wasn’t over. Under everyone’s gaze, a vast amount of black smoke rushed out of the broken bodies, and the broken body parts came together, repairing themselves!","“I remember now!” one cultivator on the ground yelled in shock, “About 200 years ago, the sword slaves of the Nangong Family entered the Spirit-Destroying Array in Green Bull Valley. When they came out, all the cultivators in the valley had their heads chopped off, but the sword slaves remained intact!","“I thought the rumor was wrong, but now I know it’s true!”","With the cigarette dangling between his lips, Mr. Fang watched in surprise while the sword slaves healed themselves. “They’re still alive?”","The Castellan’s expression slightly changed. “It seems that we have underestimated the depths of this ancient family that has received this great inheritance!”"]},{"number":439,"title":"Chapter 439 - Do You Have a Garbage Can?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","The Ancient Families with Inheritance referred to the super powers with the longest history on the Spiritual State; they included six of the most ancient human families such as Nangong, Wang, and Xun, and one demon family, the Jiang Family, forming the most famous seven ancient families.","Each family was an existence with an extremely solid background and powerful inheritance from antiquity.","Meanwhile, super forces such as the Heavenly Academy was independent and parallel to these families.","These families were famous not only for their great strengths, ancient history, and vast accumulations. Their ultimate geniuses in each generation inspired awe and respect, and many people talked about them.","Some even struck fear into people.","For example, when he was 19, Nangong Zhuo of the Nangong Family entered the Heavenly Abyss Sea and killed a rare three-headed black dragon at the Divine Ocean Realm. When Xun Yuan of the Xun Family was born, a phenomenon appeared in the sky, and it was said that a demon tried to take possession of his body. However, before the possession process could complete, it was turned into ashes and disappeared!","Each of them had awe-inspiring performances in battles.","Even Tang Yu, the famous playboy, had killed a demon beast higher than his realm.","As for a loli, she had been famous for her talent, but she had disappeared for a long time since she was a little over ten years old and re-emerged recently. If re-emerging after disappearing for so long could be counted as awe-inspiring performance, she did have one.","Meanwhile, on the Sky-Patrolling Spiritual Ship outside the spiritual mountains, the black-robed Daoist stroked his beard while he stared at the mountains beneath the ship, saying with a smile, “Baoping Spiritual Master, who do you think has the potential to take the first place?”","“After his trip in the Fortune Golden Palace, Wang Xie of the Wang Family has gained tremendous growth,” the white-clothed woman said with a chuckle, “With that treasure, he has the greatest potential to become the champion.”","The black-robed Daoist said with a smirk, “Baoping Spiritual Master, you come from the Wang Family, but don’t forget about our seventh girl who had just come back from experiencing that place. After all, our Saint Warrior Branch of the Heavenly Academy has never been weak!”","“You two, don’t forget that the members of major families entering the exam are all powerful.” At this moment, a white-clothed, middle-aged man walked up from behind. “It’s still early to predict who will win.”","“Brother Fengyang, you’re right,” the black-robed Daoist laughed.","Then, the white-clothed, middle-aged man asked, “How about the girl of the Jiang Family?”","“The girl of Jiang Family... Hehe...” They exchanged a smile. “Since that Majesty had asked for a favor from us, we’ll let her experience the exam, and we’ll monitor her closely and ensure that she can enter the academy.”","“Okay,” the white-clothed middle-aged man said with a nod, “Since that Majesty has made the request... Let’s see where this little princess is... I hope she won’t encounter members of the Nangong Family or other families and get knocked out of the exam.”","“Hahaha! I was planning to find her!” They all nodded. Then, the middle-aged woman named the Baoping Spiritual Master drew a pattern in the air, and a strange layer of mist soon appeared before them. In the mist, figures moved. As the mist gradually cleared, they saw Jiang Xiaoyue and where she was.","At this moment, Jiang Xiaoyue lifted the potato chips bag which was bigger than her head and poured the last bits of chips into her mouth.","“Au! Gone so soon?!” Then, she dug out her communication jade from her pocket and looked at it while walking distractedly”","“Ugh...” The lips of the people of Heavenly Academy twitched. “...”","“Naughty!”","“It’s a shame that she is playing even in the academy exam!”","“No wonder that Majesty had to ask a favor from us. This girl probably can’t reach the gate without our help!” the black-robed Daoist said in anger; his eyes were widened, and his long beard moved as he spoke.","...","– Outside Yuanyang City –","Mr. Fang slightly frowned.","It seemed that Tang Yu was right about the Nangong Family; this family was indeed hard to deal with. None of the forces in the Deserted Sea Realm was its match.","The two sword slaves who had revived launched even faster and more powerful sword strikes!","With horrifying whistling noises, each sword hacked onto the Golden Sun Wheel with vicious force, ignoring Fang Qi’s attacks.","Each strike contained terrifying force, and the huge colliding noises were deafening!","“This kid is indeed powerful...” Standing on the city wall, the Castellan watched the battle with squinted eyes and slightly shook his head. “But still, he’s not strong enough. It seems that he has indeed obtained treasures from a relic.”","“However, these treasures are not enough for him to challenge the Nangong Family. He is too overconfident.”","“So powerful... This great power comes from only two sword slaves.” The cultivators standing on the Cloud Sea Square clicked their tongues in fear, knowing that they shouldn’t offend people of the Nangong Family unless absolutely necessary. After all, this family had more than two sword slaves!","“This kid is overestimating himself...”","“He’s finished now!”","It seemed that the sword slaves had no weaknesses. They were powerful and fearless towards any weapons or spiritual treasures. As if they could never die, every time they were cut into pieces by Fang Qi’s Golden Moon Wheel, they would quickly recover. The most horrifying thing was that they recovered even faster after being killed each time as if they were getting used to these attacks!","“Whenever the sword slaves appear, they won’t stop until the targets are dead. It’s indeed so...”","The sword slaves were terrifying! Faced with such a force, the other cultivators could do nothing but be killed!","“Look! That kid’s spiritual treasures can only inflict very little damage to the sword slaves now!”","“This kid’s spiritual essence should be running out... This Nangong Family has such an unimaginable power and method!” an old cultivator heaved a heavy sigh.","At this moment, several members of Nangong Family standing in the crowd snickered at the sight. “You dare to mess with the Nangong Family? You’re tired of living, eh? Sword slaves, kill him!”","However, at this moment, Fang Qi suddenly withdrew the Golden Sun Wheel!","“What’s happening?!”","“Is he looking to be killed?!”","While they were wondering, Fang Qi’s aura suddenly changed.","A surge of extremely terrifying sword spirit shot up into the sky! It seemed this sword spirit came from Heaven and had the power to pull the sky and the earth.","Meanwhile, a vague cold shadow appeared behind Fang Qi, looking down on the creatures in the area with aloofness.","Subconsciously, a sense of fear rose in everyone’s heart.","All the swords flew out from the cultivators’ belts or storage bags on their own and bent forward as if they were worshipping their god.","“Hu!” Fang Qi blew out a mouthful of smoke. At this moment, his potential was stimulated to the limit, and his mind was as clear as the gods’. It seemed like he finally understood one thing. “Be careful of the people who are controlled by swords...”","Heavenly Sword!","The most powerful sword control technique of the Shu Mountain Faction—Sword God!","Unlike last time where Sword God created a curtain of swords covering the sky, this time, Sword God unleashed a force that no one could resist, engulfing everything with almighty presence.","Meanwhile, the two sword slaves struggled violently. Faint and weird light flashed inside the cloaks as if a streak of horrifying, unrivaled force that no one could control was fighting for the control of their bodies.","“Ahhh!”","Suddenly, the two sword slaves let out shrill screams!","Boom! Boom!","The figures and the swords instantly exploded on their own and turned into ashes.","All the people held their breaths at this strange scene!","The sword slaves who were extremely horrifying and had almost no weakness in their eyes had just imploded?!","What was that god-like shadow which looked like a surge of horrifying sword spirit coming from Heaven?!","Many questions swirled in their mind while they stared at the young man before them in horror.","Then, Mr. Fang landed from the sky and extinguished the cigarette butt. “Do you have a garbage can? Let me throw this away.”","“...”"]},{"number":440,"title":"Chapter 440 - Are You All Like This When Playing Games?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“The sword... sword slaves died just like that?!”","Everyone backed off when Fang Qi landed as if he was a plague. The cultivators, who had swarmed up and even wanted to grab Fang Qi’s treasures after he was killed, now felt goosebumps all over their bodies!","They had witnessed how horrifying the sword slaves were!","Many people here couldn’t block one attack from their swords since the sword techniques of the sword slaves were so advanced, let alone that they had no weaknesses and had the strange ability of not dying!","For them, such humanoid war machines were nightmarish.","They couldn’t imagine what would happen if such a horrifying nightmare fell on their heads.","They had no way of dealing with it, and it was impossible to resist!","However, just a moment ago, these two terrifying sword slaves just kneeled before the young man and killed themselves at his order!","This turn of events had gone beyond everyone’s imagination; they felt like the man before them wasn’t a human being but the god of swords!","Perhaps only the god of swords could do this.","“Impossible! Absolutely impossible!” The members from the Nangong Family looked as if they had seen a ghost. The sword slaves of the Nangong Family had been unrivaled, but they just kneeled before a young man from nowhere and killed themselves today!","The fear-inducing image of the sword slaves collapsed in their hearts.","It completely collapsed and shattered into dust.","“What... what technique did you just use?!” A member of the Nangong Family asked in horror.","“It was Sword God.” Mr. Fang looked around but couldn’t find a garbage can. To prevent polluting the environment, he released a flame from his hand and burned the cigarette butt into ashes. Then, he added, “It was Sword God cast at the Heavenly Sword Realm.”","Fang Qi had just been standing before the threshold of the Heavenly Sword Realm. After his potential was stimulated by the magical cigarette, he stepped over the threshold and reached the realm.","When No Name reached the Heavenly Sword Realm, all swords submitted to him. When he reached the highest level of the realm, no one could move a sword before him. Since Fang Qi had found a way to reach this realm, his power was now unrivaled. ( .c om )","Combining this realm with the Sword God of Shu Mountain Faction, the most powerful sword control technique, it wasn’t surprising that he could control the two demonized swords.","“Heavenly Sword... Sword God?!” Today, almost all the cultivators in Yuanyang City remembered these two fear-inducing names.","Today, they witnessed a sword technique that they had never heard of before; they could force all the swords in the world into submission!","Mr. Fang patted the member of the Nangong Family on the shoulder; the latter had yelled and asked the sword slaves to kill Fang Qi.","An intense smell of urine spread out while this young man collapsed.","Mr. Fang was at a loss for words. Am I so scary?","The stout Castellan Zong and the middle-aged man who was wearing a long robe walked over, and the Castellan cupped his hands at Fang Qi, saying, “I’m surprised that your swordsmanship has reached such an unrivaled realm. Can you tell us who is your master?”","“Master?” Mr. Fang said, “The man who taught me the Heavenly Sword is No Name. As for the Sword God technique... many people can use it.”","“...” Zong Wu’s face twitched when he heard that many people had learned it!","“Then... where are these masters?” the middle-aged man immediately asked, “Can I pay a visit to them?”","Mr. Fang said, “This...”","Zong Wu looked disappointed. “Could it be that the seniors don’t want to see us?”","“In my opinion, some people here are not qualified to meet these seniors.” The middle-aged man wearing the long robe looked around, and the people who had ill intentions backed off subconsciously and moved away.","“You can see them, but it would be two crystals per hour,” Mr. Fang said.","“Ugh?!”","Like that?","Not only Castellan Zong Wu and the middle-aged man wearing the long robe, but all the people around them were stupefied.","After a moment of silence, Zong Wu said, “Please take us to them then!”","He looked as if he would sleep with these seniors in the night if there were no rules forbidding that.","Soon, dozens of people eagerly walked into the internet café with Mr. Fang.","Inside the internet café, several hairy-faced men who looked like they hadn’t fully evolved were watching something intently, each with a bowl of instant noodles in their hands.","A big white deer sat before a computer near the entrance and yelled at the screen with a bottle of Coke between its hooves.","A few words were written on the small blackboard: [2 crystals/hour]","Zong Wu pointed at the ‘Main Item’ written on the small blackboard and asked, “What is this Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3?”","Where are the seniors?!","He looked around and didn’t see any senior.","Li Xin’er looked baffled, wondering how the boss came back with so many customers with him.","She immediately walked up and asked, “Misters, what do you want to buy?”","“Our shop’s main game is the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3; it’s... em... f*cking awesome!” Li Wuya had learned this expression, feeling like it would make him look more like an old driver.","Zong Wu cupped his hands and said, “I want to meet a senior who knows the technique named Sword God.”","“Then, you must play the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3. There isn’t only Sword God but Demonic Flame Space-Flashing Strike, Nation-Destroying Silver Bullet Wave, Demon Lord Chong Lou, Immortal General Fei Peng...”","Excited that so many customers came into the shop, Li Wuya began to explain the game in detail.","The visitors exchanged a look of bafflement.","Zong Wu froze for a moment and looked at the middle-aged man wearing the long robe, saying, “Elder Yu, shall we...”","This middle-aged man was an elder of the Heavenly Academy responsible for the management of Taiwang Inn.","He nodded.","Then, under Mr. Fang’s instruction, they entered the game.","Dozens of people stood behind them to watch; some of them were the two men’s guards while others were a small group of cultivators who had watched the battle but held no ill intentions.","“What is this?!’ Elder Yu almost jumped from his seat, and his voice was full of horror.","“Is this the Immortal Realm?!” Zong Wu looked terrified. “I saw an immortal?!”","“The immortals are fighting! Run! Quick”","Scared, both of them dropped their virtual reality headsets.","“It was so scary!” They were still frightened. ( .c om )","“There are... immortals in there!”","Elder Yu had cold sweat on his face. “Fortunately, I ran fast! It was horrifying! He hacked down an immortal palace with one sword strike!”","“I’m proud that I could flee from an immortal!”","“I even saw a demon. Fortunately, he didn’t discover me!” Elder Yu said in horror.","They turned around and saw a group of dumbfounded people.","Mr. Fang was also dumbfounded. “I already told you that it’s a game! Are you all like this when you’re playing games?”","“...”"]},{"number":441,"title":"Chapter 441 - Why Are You Running?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“A game?!” Zong Wu pointed at the screen and said with widened eyes, “It’s a mystical realm! It’s an immortal relic mystical realm! How can it be a game?!”","I had indeed seen the immortal world, and real immortals have appeared before me! Of course, it is real!","“Castellan Zong is right!” Beside him, Elder Yu said with a nod, “I entered the world as well. This spiritual artifact can take our vital souls into that mystical realm. We saw not only an immortal but a demon who has dominating demonic energy!”","“We have only heard of the legends about immortals, but we had the opportunity to see a real immortal today!” Zong Wu patted his thigh and said with a heavy sigh, “The almighty immortal power is terrifying!”","Others around them looked baffled. “So powerful?”","“We might not be able to escape after we enter, right?”","Mr. Fang: “...”","( .c om ) He had no choice but to explain to them the concept of virtual reality games once again in detail.","“You mean... this is a fantasy realm?” Zong Wu shook his head. “No. No. What kind of fantasy realm is it that I can’t even spot and identify?!”","After all, back when he explored an immortal relic, he had encountered a fantasy array built in the ancient times. It was a narrow escape, but he had discerned that it was a fantasy realm very soon!","It must be noted that that place was probably an immortal relic from the prehistoric times!","How can this fantasy realm of yours be more powerful than that one?!","Elder Yu said solemnly, “When you enter that realm, you must be very cautious. Otherwise, the immortal might kill you with one casual strike! And you will die!”","The others exchanged a look and took his words to heart.","Mr. Fang was at a loss for words.","He wondered how he could instill the idea that this was indeed a game into them?!","Finally, he decided to enter the game in person and played it to prove his points to them.","After that, he looked back at Zong Wu and Elder Yu, and those two’s faces instantly reddened with embarrassment.","Hey, was it really necessary to slap our faces like this?","“Hehehe... Indeed, there are senior masters in the shop; this fantasy realm sure is advanced! Even we were fooled by it!” Elder Yu tried to smooth things over with an embarrassed expression. “It seems that the shop owner indeed has a grandmaster behind him!”","The shop fell silent.","Everyone looked at these two people with new expressions.","The two men fell silent.","They could never erase this humiliation from their history no matter how they explain it.","“...”","They felt like killing all the people here for witnessing their humiliation.","...","Meanwhile, the Legend of the Sword and Fairy Communication Group had completely gone off track.","Su Tianji: [Xiaoyue, how many spiritual items have you collected? (Husky’s dull cute face)]","Song Qingfeng: [Xiaoyue, do you have the confidence to take the first place? <img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f600.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F600;\">]","Nalan Hongwu: [Xiaoyue, post another picture. I heard that the shop owner is back!]","Ruan Ning: [How powerful are your rivals? Are they hard to deal with?]","Li Haoran: [Are the new bullets that our Wuwei Daoist Alliance created effective?]","“...”","Mr. Fang saw the sign of [999+] on the corner of the group chat icon, and he messaged the group. [<img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f630.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F630;\"> How come there are so many messages in the group chat?]","Ruan Ning: [Scummy Boss!]","Lan Yan: [You didn’t show any care for Xiaoyue! <img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f61e.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F61E;\">]","( .c om ) [Aya~ Wait for a second!] Jiang Xiaoyue blinked and took another picture. [See? No one dares to get close to me! There’s no one around!]","[Xiaoyue is awesome!]","[You’re getting more and more powerful!]","“...”","Meanwhile, on the spiritual ship of Heavenly Academy, the black-robed Daoist, Baoping Spiritual Master, and the white-clothed cultivator were all staring into the mist before them.","In the middle of the mist was Jiang Xiaoyue.","The black-robed Daoist said, “Well! This girl does nothing but play with the communication jade! She’s so badly behaved!”","Baoping Spiritual Master wondered, “How come this girl is so lucky?! She hasn’t encountered any other cultivators after walking for so long?!”","The white-clothed cultivator said, “If it were me, I would have ambushed her somewhere along the way. This girl is so careless that it will take less than two attacks to suppress her!”","They were feeling a little impatient and wanted to see someone attack her!","Anyone can jump out and rob her collection! This girl is boldly walking in the middle of the road and playing with the communication jade without a care!","She has no regard for the exam of the Heavenly Academy. Someone, jump out and teach her a lesson!","As for the girl in blue who was walking beside Jiang Xiaoyue... they completely ignored her. After all in their eyes, she was an insignificant figure from nowhere and they didn’t think she could do anything.","They continued to watch Jiang Xiaoyue.","– Two hours later –","“How come no one is coming her way?!” They had watched Jiang Xiaoyue play with her communication jade for two hours!","This spiritual spell that they were using was called [Seeing Flower in the Mist] which could pull in the distant view and even recreate the sounds. However, the resolution was moderate; they could clearly see the people inside but not the tiny words on the communication jade that looked like mosquitos.","-Six hours later-","“Hey! Some people are over there!” The white-clothed cultivator yelled, “Some people are coming their way!”","“Where are they?!” The black-robed cultivator said, “Hurry! Move the spiritual spell to them!”","Then, they saw five cultivators who were wearing yellow robes.","“These five people...” The white-clothed cultivator looked thoughtful.","“You know them?” Baoping Spiritual Master asked.","“A little bit,” the white-clothed cultivator said, “These five people call themselves the Five Immortals of Yellow Dragon Cave and are famous for their coordinated group attacks. When they attack together, even people like Wang Xie and Xun Yuan will probably feel a headache...”","The five people seemed to have noticed that there were people in front of them.","“Boss, some people are before us!”","“Just two!”","The yellow-clothed cultivator who looked to be their leader brightened. “Only two? It seems like this is our chance to become rich!”","“It seems that they haven’t seen us, boss!”","“So careless?” The cultivator in the lead said with a laugh, “So arrogant. We’ll teach them a lesson. They deserve it!”","The three people of the Heavenly Academy who were watching the scene said, “Well said. This girl deserves a lesson; she will know that our Heavenly Academy’s exam isn’t child’s play.”","While they watched intently and wondered what these five people would do, the five yellow-clothed cultivators laid an ambush with concentration.","“Boss, they are getting closer.”","“Is everything set?!” the cultivator in the lead asked.","“Everything is ready!”","“Good!” The cultivator in the lead looked pleased and raised his hand. While the girls got closer, they finally saw their faces.","“Boss, we...”","At this moment, the cultivator in the lead waved his hand. “Run!”","In the blink of an eye, they were all gone.","The three people sitting on the Sky-Patrolling Spiritual Ship looked at each other and saw the shock.","“!!??”","“Why are you running from them?! Come back!”"]},{"number":442,"title":"Chapter 442 - Where Are They?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“This... what happened?” They couldn’t believe their eyes. After rubbing their eyes, they looked again.","“How come they ran away?!” the black-robed Daoist said furiously, “Morons! They are a bunch of morons!”","Dazed, the Baoping Spiritual Master looked at Feng Yangzi, who was the white-robed, middle-aged man beside her, and said, “Are they the Five Immortals of Yellow Dragon Cave that you just mentioned?!”","Why did they run away? She is just a loli who is concentrated on playing with her communication jade! What are they afraid of?!","Feng Yangzi smiled embarrassedly and then slammed his hand on the table before yelling, “These people are foolish and don’t know what is going on!”","“She’s still playing with her communication jade; doesn’t she know how dangerous it was for her a moment ago!” the black-robed Daoist said with a snort, “If those people didn’t run, this girl would have...”","“Forget it! Forget it!”","“Don’t worry,” the Baoping Spiritual Master said, “There are many masters in this academy exam. I just don’t believe that no one can teach this girl a lesson.”","They continued to watch the scenes in the mist.","...","– Meanwhile in the Yuanyang City Shop of Origin Internet Club –","For the demon clan, the more ancient the bloodline was, the more difficult it was for the demons to perfectly transform into their human forms, except for the Jiang Family which was a perfect demon family which had merged the transformation technique into their bloodline.","Transformations were different from the illusion spell. Transformations could completely alter a creature’s physical structure while the illusion spell could only use essence to create a fake appearance. The difficulty level between the two was like the difference between Heaven and Earth.","It was why the burly general of the King Kong Ape Clan sitting beside Jiang Xuan still had a hairy face.","Even Zhen Yan and Xue Ming, Jiang Xuan’s guards, didn’t look like normal humans. One of them had a red face while the other had a green sharp face.","As for the big white deer, it might transform into a creature with a human body and a deer head before it made a total transformation.","“Look over there...”","“Are they from the demon clan?”","“It’s said that many demons have entered this year’s Heavenly Academy exam, including the little princess of the Jiang Family...”","“Is it really from the demon clan? Isn’t it just a deer...?”","The big white deer was at a loss for words.","It was enraged, and it thought, What’s so bad about being a deer? How come deers can’t be demons?!","Many cultivators who hadn’t begun playing the game yet pointed at the big white deer which was playing the game in earnest while sitting in a gaming chair and sipping Coke.","“Can this deer play the game too...?”","“It’s nothing extraordinary,” Li Xin’er said when she walked past them; she had gotten used to this scene after a few days. “It’s said that a demon plays games in another shop front. It is a big pure demon that comprehended the laws of nature...”","“...” These cultivators forcefully swallowed their saliva and said in trembling voices, “They... they are not afraid that the demon will devour the people in the shop?!”","Li Wuya stood beside them and was at a loss for words.","“Stop watching them. Let’s go and play the game!”","Meanwhile, the big demon who they talked about was sitting on a computer chair bundled in a big quilt.","From the looks of it, it had just finished playing games. While sipping the milk tea with enjoyment, it exhaled a warm breath. “Humph! You want to suppress me? You don’t allow me to take in natural spiritual essence? I can spend some crystals and increase my cultivation strength by playing games! With the method in the shop, even people with zero talent can obtain cultivation strength quickly! Excellent!”","“Hahaha! I’m so smart! After I regain my cultivation strength...” It began to imagine how it would punch Mr. Fang and kick the cunning female demon who loved scheming against it after it recovered its cultivation strength.","Meanwhile, the number of usages on the teleportation array jumped.","[13]","[14]","[15]","[16]","...","It jumped up quickly.","When the big demon finished its milk tea, it looked down at itself in astonishment. “Where’s my cultivation strength?! I got some strength after playing the games for one day with a lot of effort! Where is it?!”","“Demon Fang! You’re despicable! Return my cultivation strength! Ahhh!” A shrill howl came from the Half City shop.","“You want cultivation strength?” Nearby, Mo Xian and the other people from her faction sat together with disdainful looks on their faces.","“Yeah. You should be thankful that the shop allows you to play games,” Yue Yan said with a snort.","“If you howl again, we’ll ask Mr. Fang to toss you to Jiuhua City and keep that Gongzi Xiao company!”","“Achoo!” Xiao Yulv who was eating fruits in boredom at the counter looked around. “Who’s bad-mouthing me behind my back?!”","Meanwhile, the new players in the Yuanyang City began to play the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3.","...","– On the Heavenly Academy’s Sky-Patrolling Spiritual Ship –","“Quick! Look! Someone’s coming!” The cultivators with extremely high cultivation strengths began to feel sleepy after waiting for a long time.","At this moment, they finally saw the scene that they had been waiting for. Several figures were moving this way.","“They are people of the Xu Family.” Under the seven ancient families, there were 12 big families that also had solid backgrounds, being the top existences in the Spirit State. The Xu Family was one of them and was ranked among the top of the families.","“No... Not only the Xu Family,” Feng Yangzi said, “Here come people of the Xun Family! Although Xun Yuan is not among them, they are way stronger than those five morons!”","“Is that Lei Ge?” Looking at the imposing and tall figure who was wearing a short-sleeved robe, the Baoping Spiritual Master said, “Isn’t he the super genius of the Lei Family? He is said to have strength no less than those geniuses of the ancient families with great inheritance, right?”","“Let the Seventh Girl help her,” the black-robed Daoist said, “We can’t let this little girl get kicked out of the exam...”","“Okay! But tell her not to offer help too soon,” Feng Yangzi said, “Let this little girl have a taste of the hardship first.”","“Spiritual spell? Turn it over! Turn it!” At their urges, the Baoping Spiritual Master changed the scene, and a woman wearing a bamboo hat and a pure-white Daoist robe with patterns of cranes appeared before them; she had a three-foot water-clear sword in her hand.","On the ground before her were many corpses of demon beasts.","“This girl’s sword techniques are still powerful.” The black-robed middle-aged man stroked his beard.","“The young people are indeed powerful!” Feng Yangzi said.","The Baoping Spiritual Master nodded in satisfaction.","The woman suddenly froze and then took out her communication jade.","“Senior Sister, what’s wrong?” The green-clothed girl beside her asked in bafflement.","“Nothing,” the woman said. “The elders ordered me to run an errand. We’ll go that way.”","She pointed at the direction of Jiang Xiaoyue.","“The little girl of the Jiang Family should be able to hold on for a little while, right?” Feng Yangzi said.","“Humph! If she can’t, she doesn’t deserve the effort that we spent on her!”","“Daoist Friend Baoping, turn back to her and have a look,” the black-robed Daoist immediately said.","The scene returned to Jiang Xiaoyue.","The loli was still playing with her communication jade.","From the looks of the surroundings, she had come to a new spot and was no longer there.","There was no one around.","The people on the Sky-Patrolling Spiritual Ship were baffled.","“Where are they?!”","Then, they saw Jiang Xiaoyue holding about ten more storage spiritual artifacts in her hands.","“...”"]},{"number":443,"title":"Chapter 443 - You Want to Take My Communication Jade?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Mist rose in front.","It looked like the surface of the sea under a gloomy drizzle or a distant and fuzzy morning dream.","With a long sword in her hand, the woman wearing the white Daoist robe suddenly stopped walking, and her pretty eyes beneath the bamboo hat looked cold.","Before her, a little girl wearing a white dress and a woman in blue walked deeper into the thin mist.","“What’s wrong?!” The people on the Sky-Patrolling Spiritual Ship suddenly stood up, finding the scene created by the spiritual spell that had looked clear begin turning fuzzy as if it was being covered in a thick fog.","The fog got thicker, and finally they could see nothing but white mist. All the surroundings even turned white, let alone the people in it.","“Are there maze arrays among the restriction arrays?” the Baoping Spiritual Master asked, “Who set it?”","“No!” Feng Yangzi said, “In the whole exam area, we have set all kinds of restriction arrays except for maze arrays.” ( .c om )","Since it took people a long time to walk out of maze-style restriction arrays, if they put several of such arrays in the area, the exam would probably take more than one month to finish.","The only explanation was that some participants in the exam set up an array in the surrounding area.","From the looks of it, it wasn’t an ordinary array. Otherwise, it wouldn’t be able to block their view.","At this moment, Jiang Xiaoyue had just sent a message on QQ using her communication jade, but the small round symbol kept spinning; the message wasn’t sent out after a long time.","Then, she saw the signal bars on the top right corner of the screen jump from full to one bar, and then...","“No internet?!” Jiang Xiaoyue yelled in surprise.","She was having a good time talking to the people in the internet café on QQ, but suddenly she lost all signal!","“It seems that we have entered an array.” Beside her, Li Lanruo looked around and found the white fog extremely creepy.","Obviously, the cultivators who had built such an array here in a short time were much more powerful than the cultivators they had met before.","About 500 meters above them in the sky, Nangong Zhuo stood with his hands clasped behind him with arrogance in his eyes.","He looked down and saw the thick fog engulfing everything nearby like a huge tomb.","“Young Master Nangong,” a young man wearing the disciple uniform of the Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace said, “They have entered the array.”","Nangong Zhuo condensed spiritual essence in his eyes and looked down. Sure enough, Jiang Xiaoyue, who had a communication jade in her hand had walked into the array with Li Lanruo.","“This little girl has been playing with her communication jade all the way here,” the disciple of the Nangong Family said, “She doesn’t have the slightest regard for us.”","With gritted teeth, he said in thrill as he vented his frustration, “Now, the circulation of spiritual essence inside the array follows the circulation of the array, cutting all signals transmissions with the outside world. I’ll see how she can play with it!”","This array used a very complicated spiritual essence flow to form illusions. Meanwhile, this continuously flowing spiritual essence stopped the transmission of the spiritual essence signals.","Meanwhile, Jiang Xiaoyue shook her communication jade in anger, but there were still no signals.","“Got it!” She rolled her dark eyes as if an idea dawned on her. She took out a small, strange-looking box from her storage spiritual artifact and plugged it to her communication jade. She touched the virtual signal icon on her communication jade and chose the option of high-frequency radio signals.","Soon, the signal icon rose from zero to two bars.","Then, she continued chatting on QQ. [My internet connection was down (Husky’s dumb and cute face), and the signal still isn’t strong now.]","It seemed like something had interrupted the signal, but she could still use the communication jade.","Then, she sent a photo that she just took in which the people of the Xu Family and the Xun Family lay on the ground randomly. [Look, I knocked down a few more rivals!]","Su Tianji: [Internet connection was down? How did that happen?]","Jiang Xiaoyue replied: [I don’t know... We’re surrounded by thick fog; some damn people built an array here.]","In the sky, the disciple of the Nangong Family looked as if he had just swallowed a fly. “This little girl is still using her communication jade?!”","“Shall I...” he said in resentment, “Shall I take that communication jade from her?!”","They had cut off all communications with the outside world with this special array, yet this girl was still playing with her communication jade?!","“It’s not necessary. She won’t cause big trouble for us,” Nangong Zhuo said in a cold voice, “For the sake of the Mystic Fate Jade, my Nangong Family must take some blame, but I don’t believe that the Jiang Family and the Heavenly Academy will fall out with us for a woman of a small family!”","“Young Master, you’re right. She’s just a little girl and can only deal with those wastrels even if she is strong.” The disciple flattered him. “If you show your hand, she won’t stand a chance!”","“Don’t hurt the little girl of the Jiang Family. Right now, only we know about the real secret about the Mystic Fate Jade, and it’s not necessary to antagonize that family.”","“Yes!”","“Young Master Nangong, that person of the Heavenly Academy is coming!” another young man said; his black robe and black clothes didn’t show his background. ( .c om )","“Block her first!” Nangong Zhuo’s face turned dark. “It seems that we must make our move now, fast!”","“Little princess of the Jiang Family.” While Jiang Xiaoyue was complaining about the poor signal, a figure flew down from the sky. Nangong Zhuo stood there with his hands clasped behind his back, looking cold and indifferent. “We meet again.”","The presence that he emitted was much more powerful than ordinary cultivators, and Li Lanruo was forced to take a step back subconsciously while yelling in alarm, “Are you a member of the Nangong Family?”","“You again?” Jiang Xiaoyue said in displeasure, “What do you want?”","“Hand over your communication jade and this woman of the Li Family,” Nangong Zhuo said, “After that, you can continue with the academy exam and play with another communication jade, Princess. We won’t interfere with anything you do.”","“You even want to take my communication jade?!” Jiang Xiaoyue yelled angrily.","The disciples of the Nangong Family beside them snickered. “Princess Your Highness, I advise you to hand over your communication jade and the woman behind you right now. If you force our young master to make a move, you will ‘eat a nasty fruit’!”","“Who wants to eat a nasty fruit?!” Jiang Xiaoyue snorted, “Why are you so smug?”","“If that’s what you want.” Nangong Zhuo’s face turned livid since it was the first time that he received such a blatant refusal. “Then, I’ll teach you a lesson, reckless girl!”","While he spoke, Nangong Zhuo reached out his right hand, suddenly forming a huge hand condensed by dark clouds before Jiang Xiaoyue. The huge hand grasped toward the two girls with vicious force!"]},{"number":444,"title":"Chapter 444 - Xiaoyue Unleashing Her Power","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Excellent!” The cultivators standing beside Nangong Zhuo was full of excitement and thrill. “This is the Moyun Hand?!”","“The Moyun Hand that can handle anything in the world?! Young Master used this ultimate technique as his first attack; I’m sure that that little girl of the Jiang Family will receive a hard blow!” another cultivator said.","Before he could finish, he saw Jiang Xiaoyue holding the communication jade with one hand while her slim fingers danced on it and put in the message, [Can’t chat now. A despicable guy is trying to take my communication jade!]","Meanwhile, her left hand moved in a circle and pushed out like a thunderbolt and a fast ghost, striking with a tremendous force – Tearing Sky and Expelling Clouds, the seventh move of the Cloud Expelling Palm.","An energy hand that could tear open the sky crashed out with vicious force. With a tearing noise, Nangong Zhuo’s energy hand full of spiritual essence was instantly torn open! ( .c om )","“What?!”","“Young Master?!”","The disciples of the Nangong Family looked anxious and alarmed.","Nangong Zhuo’s face turned even more livid with humiliation, and he said with narrowed eyes, “It’s okay. I just used one-tenth of my strength in that attack. I’m surprised that a little girl like you has such a high cultivation strength. No wonder you act so arrogantly!”","Nangong Zhuo brought his hands together before his chest and formed a strange spiritual seal, saying with a cold voice, “This is the Thunder-Flame Sword Seal of the Nangong Family; you should feel honored that I am going to use this technique on you, little girl.”","Flames surged up in the area and soared into the sky like a dragon before spinning around. instantly, it transformed into a huge sword of flames above the people’s heads, hovering in the sky and not attacking while creating huge and ear-piercing noises of thunder, freezing all the people under it with a mountain-like pressure!","Li Lanruo saw a small hand reaching toward her. “Sister Lanruo, record the battle for me. Humph!”","Li Lanruo: “!!??”","She circulated Xu Changqing’s advanced mental technique of the Shu Mountain Faction and murmured, “It seems like I can move, huh...?”","Immediately, she turned the communication jade toward the battlefield.","“Burn!” At Nangong Zhuo’s yell, flames poured down from the sky like surging waves of the ocean.","They swallowed Jiang Xiaoyue almost instantly!","The disciples of the Nangong Family looked smug. “Little girl, do you still dare to challenge Young Master?”","At this moment, they felt a horrifying heat wave spreading out in all directions.","A terrifying flame pillar suddenly shot up from the spot where Jiang Xiaoyue stood.","The disciples of the Nangong Family looked surprised. “Dragon Flames?”","The flame pillar spread out swiftly like an explosion; it was the desperation move of Kyo Kusanagi – Mu Shiki!","Surrounded by burning orange flames, a tiny figure dragged out a blurry wave of shadows at a great speed. Nangong Zhuo only saw a fist shadow crash toward him with many fist shadows behind it!","The fist moved so fast that it was beyond his imagination.","Almost instantly, a layer of vague lights suddenly shot out of his luxurious robe.","Then, Jiang Xiaoyue’s fist crashed onto the clear light.","Nangong Zhuo looked surprised yet still arrogant. “Even though you broke my Thunder-Flame Sword Seal, can you break my Qianyan Daoist Robe? You are only a teenager, and the gap of cultivation strength between us is too big for you to close...”","Before he could finish, his expression changed drastically.","The many fist shadows behind Jiang Xiaoyue combined into one.","The fist shadow looked solid and no longer vague.","Bam! Bam! Bam! It hammered onto Nangong Zhuo’s luxurious Daoist robe as if it was beating on a drum.","This wasn’t the end. Jiang Xiaoyue waved her hands, and exploding flames appeared in her palms.","Then, Jiang Xiaoyue leaped up, and the flames in her hands rose like dancing dragons.","With a series of explosion noises, Nangong Zhuo’s robe bulged, and the clear light in front of his chest shattered. A big crack appeared in the layer of clear light.","Many dashes of flames surged into the crack.","Unprepared, Nangong Zhuo was sent flying backward.","Jiang Xiaoyue landed on the ground and dusted off her hands. She smugly said to the dazed Li Lanruo beside her, “Sister Lanruo, did I look dashing?”","“This technique is called Desperation Move, Mu Shiki,” Jiang Xiaoyue told her everything in detail, “If I was more experienced in using this technique, I could have pierced 1,000 of these useless robes!”","The disciples of the Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace and the cultivators of the forces under the Nangong Family fell silent with dark expressions.","“Young Master, are you okay?!” A few disciples of the Nangong Family ran over to him in alarm.","Nangong Zhuo spat out a mouthful of blood. His face turned wicked and distorted, and only endless hatred could be seen in his eyes.","“You are seeking death!” He opened his mouth, and a surge of black essence shot out.","It was a small shiny black sword that had a strange shape.","The moment the sword shot out, thunder instantly rumbled in the clear sky.","“Young Master, this is...?!” In horror, the disciples of the Nangong Family looked at the strange-shaped small sword that was as black as ink.","The small sword seemed to contain a creepy demonic energy which could absorb people’s souls.","After one glance of the small sword, the few disciples of the Nangong Family seemed to have lost their free will. Their pupils expanded, and their eyes looked dull and glassy.","They felt as if many evil devils and demons were whispering into their ears, triggering the craziest and evil thoughts in the depths of their minds.","The sky turned even gloomier and darker as if it was trying to pull all the living people into a dark abyss.","About 500 meters away, the green-clothed girl yelled in alarm, “No! Senior Sister, Nangong Zhuo is using that sword!”","Nangong Zhuo’s talent and comprehension might not be the best among the geniuses, but he had a powerful spiritual sword that was born with him. ( .c om )","When this sword was used, nothing could block it! When Nangong Zhuo was 19, he had used this sword to kill a three-headed demon dragon in the Heavenly Abyss Sea, shocking the whole world.","“Go away!” The woman wearing the white Daoist robe looked cold.","Dozens of elite cultivators with high cultivation strengths blocked her way.","“I’m sorry,” the leader of the group said arrogantly, “Young Master told us not to let anyone pass.”","On the other side, all the people around Nangong Zhuo emitted strange red lights from their glazed eyes. As if they were crazy, they lunged at Jiang Xiaoyue with speed and power that were inhumane.","If they had to be described, they looked like the sword slaves that had battled with Fang Qi.","While recording the battle with the communication jade, Li Lanruo chanted, “Remain icy clear in mind; stay calm if the sky crashes down...”","She looked like she wasn’t affected.","Nangong Zhuo’s face twitched.","However, he was satisfied with the effect and said with a sneer, “I’ll see how you handle this!”","These cultivators looked as if they had gone mad; their attacks were even more vicious than before, and their cultivation strengths grew as if they had taken some magic potion.","Suddenly, Jiang Xiaoyue took out a stack of rune notes and tossed them into the sky.","While the rune notes moved into positions, a Kirin-like beast engulfed in flames appeared before Jiang Xiaoyue.","The rare beast took in a deep breath and grew as high as a two-story building, turning into a huge monster with two horns on its forehead.","Two disciples of Nangong Family lunged at it as if they were crazy.","The monster swung out its two front paws.","Boom!","Then, these two disciples flew backward as if they had been hit by a train.","Next, more disciples of the Nangong Family lunged at it with vicious techniques as if they didn’t care about their lives.","They instantly inflicted several wounds on this monster.","Casually, Jiang Xiaoyue increased their defenses and cast a spell, and a wave of clear light surged up above the monster’s head. It was the Healing Spell!","The wounds on the monster’s body quickly healed before their eyes.","Nangong Zhuo: “!!??”","What the heck is this?!"]},{"number":445,"title":"Chapter 445 - I See Nothing; You Guys Continue","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Why are you attacking this stupid thing?!” Nangong Zhuo yelled after seeing this, “Capture that despicable girl for me!”","Finally, several crazy-eyed disciples of the Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace turned their gazes toward Jiang Xiaoyue.","With furious roars, they lunged toward her like madmen.","Jiang Xiaoyue waved her small hand.","Pale blue spiritual light rose from the ground, and the disciples of the Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace who charged at Jiang Xiaoyue looked as if they had crashed into a wall and began to turn around in the circle of spiritual light.","Demon-Trapping Spell!","With fewer people attacking it, the godly beast instantly felt less pressure. It spat out a beam of fire, and the cultivators screamed with flames all over their bodies.","Nangong Zhuo’s face turned darker.","He had thought that the little princess of the Jiang Family could do nothing but eat; he had never heard anything about her cultivation strength and thought that she was absolutely no match for him and the other geniuses.","If not for the fact that she came from the Jiang Family, he would never have spared her a glance.","But now, Nangong Zhuo’s expression turned from disdainful to grim while he slowly said, “I admit that your strength makes you qualified for being a descendant of the Jiang Family. Given more years in cultivation, you might have the power to become one of the strongest among the younger generation.”","He let out a furious roar, and the small black sword beside him also created a crisp, high-pitched sword cry.","The sword cry was so sharp and wicked that it seemed like it could enter people’s brain through all avenues. The shrill screams pierced the people’s minds like demonic music, and Li Lanruo had difficulty blocking it by chanting the Ice Heart Mental Technique from Wind and Cloud.","“I will say it again.” Nangong Zhuo looked so gloomy that it seemed like he was on the verge of exploding. “Hand over the woman of the Li Family.”","“Aya, how come you are so annoying!” Jiang Xiaoyue didn’t bother to talk to him. Instead, she copied Mr. Fang’s actions when he played Dante in Devil May Cry 3. She hooked her finger at her opponent and mocked.","Dumbfounded, Nangong Zhuo couldn’t even believe his eyes.","Even Li Lanruo beside her was stunned.","When Nangong Zhuo reacted, he exploded like a bomb, enraged that she not only refused to hand over the woman but even mocked him!","More importantly, this mocking gesture resembled Mr. Fang’s when he broke Nangong Jiuwen’s Immortal-Hacking Sword Array.","It means that this girl probably is related to the murderer who had killed more than 100 people of Nangong Family!","After all, they both used Dante’s classic mocking gesture.","“Reckless little girl,” Nangong Zhuo said fiercely, “I tried to reserve my strength to show respect to your Jiang Family, but you obviously are not grateful. Today, I’ll let you know who you can mess with and who you shouldn’t mess with!”","Crack!","Nangong Zhuo cut open his palm with the sword, leaving a shocking wound. Then, a thunderbolt exploded above his head, illuminating his deadly-pale face. His messy hair fluttered and danced in the dark gale, and nauseating blood flowed all over his pale face, making this tall young man look like a fierce ghost from Hell.","“Do you feel this force?!” Nangong Zhuo’s aura suddenly expanded, and the black energy which was turbid seemed to have condensed into a solid around him.","The great force exploded all the surrounding rocks and trees into dust, shattering them into dust inch by inch.","Right now, Nangong Zhuo’s face was distorted and wicked like a fierce ghost, and he sneered, “I’m surprised that I must use my full strength against you, a little girl! You should feel honored!”","“Now, I’ll show you why my Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace can stand on top of all the other families!” He brought his hands together before his chest, gathering the huge force. “I’m the only genius of the Nangong Family who can control the godly swords in the Sword Tomb without worrying about being reduced into a sword slave in the past 1,000 years! Today, I’ll show you how big the gap between us is!”","“Hack!”","Nangong Zhuo yelled, and a black sword energy struck down like a thunderbolt!","Boom!","With a huge, deafening sound, it left a deep trail in the ground.","...","Hundreds of meters away, the dozens of cultivators belonging to the forces under the Nangong Family had been knocked down onto the ground.","“Such strong sword energy!” The white-clothed woman was surprised. “No! Nangong Zhuo is unleashing his full strength! We must hurry over and rescue her!”","“What the heck is Nangong Zhuo doing?” The green-clothed girl frowned. “Does he want to create a war between the two families?”","...","However, when the sword struck down, it missed its target.","“You sure run fast!” Nangong Zhuo snorted and saw that Jiang Xiaoyue had moved to the side. She panted slightly, showing that it wasn’t easy for her to dodge this attack.","“I’ll see how many strikes you can dodge!” Nangong Zhuo shouted and slashed his sword again!","“Humph!” Jiang Xiaoyue snorted and said, “Since this is the case, I’ll show you a glimpse of the Immortal Wind Cloud Body, Drunken Immortal Moon-Observing Steps, and Tiangang Battle Qi!”","Gales whistled and blew up sand and rocks. Suddenly, the flying rocks around Jiang Xiaoyue paused in mid-air.","Then, the surrounding sand and rocks in the were shattered into dust by an invisible energy that seemed righteous!","She slashed out her sword, moving as unpredictably as the wind and clouds. When Nangong Zhuo’s sword missed its target for the second time, Jiang Xiaoyue had moved behind him.","In the original version of the Legend of the Sword and Fairy, Liquor Sword Immortal taught Li Xiaoyao the Immortal Wind Cloud Body and the Drunken Immortal Moon-Observing Steps before the latter went into the Demon-Suppressing Tower, and they were trump cards that were only inferior to the Liquor Immortal Spell. In the original game, the Drunken Immortal Moon-Observing Steps combined with Tiangang Battle Qi had even greater damage compared to Sword God. If one added the Immortal Wind Cloud Body to this combination, one could even kill immortals.","With these techniques and Jing Tian’s close-range sword techniques, even one-tenth of their power was...","White clouds floated around, and sword energies surged up.","– Three minutes later –","“Pu–!” Nangong Zhuo spat out a mouthful of blood, and his face was already covered in blood. He had done his best but couldn’t land a single attack on his opponent!","“Humph! Now you’ve had a taste of the Immortal Wind Cloud Body, Drunken Immortal Moon-Observing Steps, and Tiangang Battle Qi, eh?” Jiang Xiaoyue said with a snort, “I have many other techniques. Watch my Unbound Godly Sword!”","“Ahh–!” A series of shrill screams came from the forest.","“We are here! We are here!” Two women rushed over with swords in hands.","They were stupefied by the scene.","“!!??”","Pleased to see them, Nangong Zhuo, who had blood all over his face, reached his hand to them. “Help...”","“I see nothing; you guys can continue.” The two women were instantly gone.","Then, the white-clothed woman dashed back and added, “I will be outside on watch, and I will warn you if someone comes.”","With that said, she left again.","Nangong Zhuo: “!!??”"]},{"number":446,"title":"Chapter 446 - Battle With Memes When Disagreeing","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","On the Sky-Patrolling Spiritual Ship.","The black-robed Daoist, the Baoping Spiritual Master, and Feng Yangzi tinkered with the thin layer of mist before them but couldn’t get a clear view.","“Damn it! Who set up this complicated array?!” the black-robed Daoist cussed, “What the heck are they up to?”","“How about the Seventh Girl? Can you reach her?” Baoping Spiritual Master asked.","“Yes!” Feng Yangzi said while holding his communication jade, “She said... there’s a small situation over there.”","“A small situation? Can she handle it?”","“She said there is no problem.” They walked over to read the communication jade.","“No problem? That’s good.” The black-robed Daoist heaved a sigh of relief.","– Meanwhile, in the area of ‘no problem’ –","Nangong Zhuo sat inside a shaky spiritual light barrier surrounded by all kinds of broken spiritual treasures, and his small sword looked dim. With a Heavenly Insight Token in his hand, he looked disheveled and terrified.","“Little Girl, don’t be so arrogant! I can get out when the elders come!” he yelled with false courage.","Dang! Dang! Dang! Something violently hammered on the barrier set by the Heavenly Insight Token, and it was obvious that the defense wouldn’t last long.","It seemed like a mysterious and strange force stronger than the force that Nangong Zhuo could control was trying to gush out from the small sword, and its gloomy presence was fear-inducing.","However, an unrivaled sword spirit that seemed to come from the Heavens reached over.","Instantly, that strange force in the small sword abated as if nothing had happened.","Meanwhile, the elders sat around a small round table. “Since Seventh Girl said that it is fine, I’m sure it’s nothing serious. Let’s drink some wine!”","Anyway, they couldn’t see the inside of the array.","“We’ve monitored the girl of the Jiang Family for such a long time; we must take a break!”","With the Heavenly Insight Token in his hand, Nangong Zhuo was still waiting for the rescue.","Three minutes later, more screams came.","...","“Senior Sister, is it okay for us to do this?” The green-clothed girl looked back at the depths of the forest and shivered.","“Will something serious happen?”","The woman said calmly, “Don’t worry. Even people of the Nangong Family don’t dare to kill people of the Jiang Family in this place unless they are crazy. I thought Nangong Zhuo went crazy, but it turned out that he unleashed his full force since he was forced into a corner.”","After all, if they killed people in this place, they would offend not only a big family but the Heavenly Academy as well.","In fact, they might even offend all the forces that were intertwined and had obtained favors from the Heavenly Academy.","They would be in big trouble, and it couldn’t be explained with a few words.","She said with a smile, “Despite her young age, I believe that little girl knows when to stop. Besides, Nangong Zhuo is still screaming, so it means...”","“Means what?”","“It means that he can take more beatings,” the woman said mildly. “I’ve been wanting to beat him for a long time. If he needs more beatings, we can help her.”","“...” The green-clothed girl didn’t know what to say for a while. “Senior Sister, you’re experienced at this...”","A while later, they saw Jiang Xiaoyue and Li Lanruo strolling out of the forest.","“Princess Xiaoyue... is it really okay that we beat the people of the Nangong Family senseless like that...?”","“Why not?” Jiang Xiaoyue said in anger, “As Boss said, the pompous *sses always need a good beating.”","Hearing her words, the faces of the two people of the Heavenly Academy twitched. “...”","“Well, it’s a pity that I didn’t have the opportunity to use all my techniques...” Jiang Xiaoyue stretched her arms in some disappointment. While looking at the two girls, she said, “Thank you for what you did just now!”","They were super nice as they had even stayed on guard for her.","“Oh, right. What are your names? I’m Jiang Xiaoyue, and this is Sister Lanruo.”","“My name’s Mu Qing,” the green-clothed girl said cheerfully. “My senior sister’s name is Yue Bai. What a coincidence that you both have the character ‘Yue’ in your names!”","“Excellent!” Jiang Xiaoyue was in a good mood since she had vented her anger and met two friendly girls. “Can we be friends?”","She took out another bag of potato chips from her storage bag. “Boss said that I can only open a new bag of potato chips if I share the snack with my friends in school. I guess we can do it now!”","She looked smug since she had made new friends, and her boss could stop nagging her.","“Qing... Bai...” Jiang Xiaoyue looked at them. “Should I call you Little Qing and Little Bai?”","[TL Note: In this context, qing means green, and bai means white.]","“Little...?”","“Ugh...”","...","Meanwhile, Mr. Fang returned to the shop, looking fatigued.","He plunked onto a couch and said, “Little Xin’er, get me a bottle of Coke.”","“Okay!”","Then, he clicked open the System Interface.","He could finally sit down and rest. Since he still had a reward of the Fortune Prize Wheel waiting for him, he opened the System Interface while reading the messages in the group chat in QQ.","...","Meanwhile, Jiang Xiaoyue was holding a big bag of potato chips in her arms.","“What’s that?”","“Why are you so cautious with it?”","“This is the super delicious cucumber-flavored potato chips from our shop!” Jiang Xiaoyue introduced the snack proudly, “Only I have this snack, and I brought it here from a place far, far away.”","“Do you want to try some?”","A fresh fragrance floated out from the bag.","“Wow!” Mu Qing took one piece and yelled in astonishment, almost swallowing her fingers. “Fragrant and crisp with a special fresh taste. I feel like I walked through a spiritual plant garden of mature spiritual fruits. Senior Sister, you try one!”","“It looks like an ordinary snack.” Yue Bai looked curiously at the big bag that Jiang Xiaoyue pushed to her face.","She took one piece, and her eyes instantly widened.","The sweet and fresh scent of spiritual fruit filled her mouth, and she felt a surge of fresh spiritual essence circulating all over her body!","“So good!”","“Sister Lanruo, take some too!”","The four girls enjoyed the snack while walking.","“Sister Xiaoyue, where did you get this bag of super delicious potato chips?!” The two girls were amazed.","“Humph!” Jiang Xiaoyue said smugly, “I got it as a prize in a competition in the shop. It’s not for sale!”","“However, there are other good snacks in the shop such as Coke, spicy sticks, instant noodles...”","Meanwhile, bedlam broke out in the group chat on QQ.","While explaining the snacks to the girls, Jiang Xiaoyue proudly posted the video of her battle with the powerful opponent she just faced in the group chat.","[Look! Look!]","Jiang Xiaoyue sent the message with a haughty expression, begging for compliments.","[Princess Xiaoyue, you’re awesome!] Immediately, a new member in the group with the picture of deer head as her profile picture answered her.","“Yohahahaha! My princess Xiaoyue is so strong!” The big white deer laughed while it watched Jiang Xiaoyue’s performance on the computer.","Outside the Heavenly Academy, Yue Bai and Mu Qing listened to Jiang Xiaoyue’s introduction while eating potato chips. Then, they suddenly saw her communication jade, and they asked, “How come your communication jade can do so many things?”","With this communication jade, she can chat with a group of people and post pictures and even the video of the battle she just had?","Mr. Fang posted a GIF of Xiaoyue using the Desperation Move Mu Shiki, ending with the move of soaring dragon. On the bottom of the GIF was the description, [Xiaoyue’s Soaring Dragon Fist!]","It looked cool and cute.","Jiang Xiaoyue, [Hey! How come this picture of yours can move?! (Husky’s dumb cute face)]","Nalan Mingxue posted a picture of Mr. Fang smoking with the description: [Shop Owner Smoking Loneliness.]","Not to be outdone, Su Tianji posted a screenshot of Senior Nalan using Sword 23 with the description: [Who else?]","The girls standing beside Jiang Xiaoyue gaped at the group chat where the people suddenly started to battle with memes."]},{"number":447,"title":"Chapter 447 - Previous Life and Current Life","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Different from treasure boxes, the Prize Wheel showed the different prizes on it, which gave people some idea what they might get.","For example, on the Prize Wheel in front of Fang Qi, he saw items such as the movie – The Matrix, snacks such as Dove Chocolates and potato chips, and special items like Orochi Blood and Magnum Gun, etc.","Mr. Fang turned the wheel that was displayed on the System Interface.","The needle on the Prize Wheel turned around and around.","Slowly, it stopped on potato chips, and Mr. Fang froze.","“... F*ck!”","Mr. Fang almost smashed the System Interface!","Then, he saw that the needle still had a little momentum left, and it slowly moved forward to the next item.","[Beep! You received a movie – the Matrix.]","[New task begins.]","[New Task: Alternative Civilization.","Task Description: The number of activations of the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3 reaches 4,000; the number of activations of the Matrix reaches 1,000.","Task Reward: StarCraft 2, Game Cultivation Room (1 day)]","Mr. Fang: “...”","...","For those candidates who didn’t plan to fight for the first place, most of them ended the exam after obtaining enough spiritual items. However, the competition among the top geniuses in this academy exam had just begun.","Of course, the young master who had been beaten senseless didn’t have to think about that. He was already disqualified from the exam, becoming the first person among the seven ancient families who got disqualified from the Heavenly Academy exam in many years.","“Come out.” The young man who seemed to be born with scholarly presence lightly stomped his foot while his gaze rested on a well-concealed hiding spot.","“I’m not in luck!” a flippant voice sounded, “I was hoping for some small opponents but instead got a big one.”","If Fang Qi were here, he would recognize that the voice belonged to Tang Yu.","– Meanwhile, outside the main gate of the Heavenly Academy –","A young man stood tall with purple essence emitting from his body.","Xun Yuan’s eyes widened when he saw a loli, a green-clothed young girl, a blue-clothed beauty, and a girl in a white Daoist robe walk over together.","Xun Yuan, who was waiting to ambush other candidates, felt nervous, and his eyelids twitched. “...”","“Ugh? We’ve arrived at the gate!” Jiang Xiaoyue and her three companions froze in surprise.","They had been staring at the wondrous communication jade in Jiang Xiaoyue’s hand and the messages jumping in the group chat.","“Should we rob this guy before us?” Yue Bai raised her head. “Then, one of us will get first place.”","“Sister Little Bai and Sister Little Qing, do you want to get the first place?” Jiang Xiaoyue blinked her big eyes. “You can take it if you want. If I take it, I’ll have to cultivate with the Old Academy Master, which will leave me no time to play games.”","“Play games...?”","“Yeah,” Jiang Xiaoyue said morosely, “I haven’t gotten the chance to play the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3 for days. I planned to play it every day after school, but this academy exam has lasted several days already.”","“Sister Little Bai, I tell you that the Legend of the Sword and Fairy is my favorite game...”","Xun Yuan saw the four girls directly walk past him.","“Jiang Xiaoyue, pass!”","“Li Lanruo, pass!”","“Yue Bai...”","“...”","For Jiang Xiaoyue, her goal wasn’t getting the first place, and no one expected her to take the first place anyways.","For her, the Heavenly Academy exam was another battlefield in which the famous young masters gathered from all over the world to reach another summit in life with all the techniques they had learned.","Thunder rumbled in the sky, seeming like it was going to really rain this time.","Big, bean-sized raindrops fell and connected, forming a curtain of water in the world. The space between the sky and the earth all turned grey.","Outside the Heavenly Academy, one side was filled with surging purple essence while the other side was filled with colorful light. The pouring rain seemed to be held up by an invisible force. Despite the inclement weather, some battles were destined to happen.","Except for the dozens of new customers, the shop still had a slow business day as the computers had a low utilization rate. Outside the shop, the rain got heavier, and water drops smashed onto the ground outside the shop and created many dense white water flowers.","“Young Master Yu, why are you coming to this small shop in such bad weather?” In the downpour, some vague voices came closer and closer to the shop.","“Why not?” With a pot of wine in his hand, the newcomer seemed to be in a bad mood. He sounded disappointed, but perhaps he had never held any high hopes at all. It was a mood he rarely showed.","After circulating his spiritual essence, he dried his damp clothes and saw that few people were playing on the computers. In contrast, there were more people sitting in the lounge area.","“Sir, didn’t you say that Coke in your shop can lift one’s mood... Forget it, get me a cup of milk tea.” He waved his hand idly.","There had been few customers in the shop today, but strangely, some people walked in from the downpour in groups of three or two.","In the curtain of rain outside the shop, two oil-paper umbrellas appeared. The umbrellas were put away when they got under the eaves, and waterdrops slid down the tips. The first one was a young woman wearing a pure white Daoist robe.","Her slightly upward slanted eyes looked into the shop. “Xiaoyue, is this the shop that you mentioned?”","“Ugh? How come it is so quiet in the shop today?” Jiang Xiaoyue pushed open the door with her small hands.","“Big Brother! Boss! I brought two new friends with me! They are my senior sisters in the academy.” If she carried a school bag on her back, she would look like an elementary school girl who was just released from school.","“Ugh?” Jiang Xiaoyue looked at the big screen. “What is Boss livestreaming today?”","– In the Half City Shop –","Liu Ningyun, Mo Xian, and the others looked at the screen in surprise. “Is the shop owner going to put the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3 on the livestream?”","After all, Mr. Fang had been playing the game all by himself every day and had only done the livestream on the first day when he reached the Spiritual State.","Although Mr. Fang didn’t put it on the livestream, there were many players playing the game due to the popularity of the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 1. As for the players who hadn’t played the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 1 before, they had no trouble playing the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3.","After all, the story for the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3 happened hundreds of years before the story of the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 1.","“Ugh...? Is this Jing Tian?”","In the original game, there was some display of memories of the characters’ previous lives but not much, and the system version provided more details.","The story was like a complete cycle of reincarnation with stories both in the previous life and the current life.","“This... he doesn’t look like Jing Tian?” Jiang Xiaoyue said in bafflement.","Jing Tian had a rebellious personality. From some aspects, due to his low social status, he was similar to Li Xiaoyao.","However, this man in front of them was different. He was wearing armor and had deep and intense eyes. He had Jing Tian’s looks but not his personality.","“Sir, what are you playing?” the viewers asked with bullet comments.","“It looks like... the Country of Jiang in ancient times?”"]},{"number":448,"title":"Chapter 448 - Arrival of New Players","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","For most of the people in the world, their relationships with other people happened after their births.","But for some people, they had known each other in their distant previous lives.","For example, after meeting her creator, Xi Yao, on the immortal tree in the Immortal World, Xuan Jian (The female lead) realized that Xi Yao, with her longing for Immortal General Fei Peng, had created her with a fruit from the immortal tree and tossed her into the mortal world. Jing Tian was a reincarnation of the Immortal General Fei Peng.","It was fate that these two people would come together and experience another cycle of life from meeting to knowing each other.","As time went on, some people would drift further apart in the human world while others would still drift toward each other even after 1,000 years.","From Long Kui’s few words, the players learned that Jing Tian had been the Crown Prince of the Jiang Country in his past life hundreds of years ago, but no one had seen this previous life of his.","There was a spiritual spell called Reliving Dreams Like Roaming Immortals, which had also appeared in the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 1. Besides the sporadic comments from the other characters, this spell could give the players some personal experience of the stories that happened in the characters’ previous lives.","“Is this Jing Tian’s previous life? He was Prince Long Yang of the Jiang Country in his previous life?”","“Look! Is that Little Kui?”","“This pair of brother and sister are very close...”","“How come you’re all watching this...?” Tang Yu felt low, even though he had expected that he would lose to Wang Xie in the academy exam.","He bought a cup of milk tea. Now that he wasn’t in the mood to study machines, he sat on a couch and watched the livestream.","“Xiaoyue,” Mu Qing asked in bafflement. “What’s this...? Is it the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3 that you mentioned?”","Castellan Zong Wu and Elder Yu sat on a couch with solemn expressions, each holding a bottle of Coke. “I’m surprised that the shop owner has played to this part.”","“Let’s watch it!” Zong Wu stroked his beard and said, “Well, at my old age, I’m surprised that I’m still envious of this young man for being a reincarnation of an immortal and having such a good sister.”","“No! There are two sisters!” Elder Yu said with a serious expression, “Red Kuo is a bit unruly, but her spiritual spells and sword techniques are very powerful. How can you forget her!”","“But Blue Hui is considerate and smart, which is what a lady from a big family supposed to be. Red Kuo is just derived from the demonic spirit in the demon sword.”","“You know nothing! Blue Kui is too gentle and weak, which is why she’s always in danger!”","“I just like Blue Kui! What can you do about it?”","“Hey! You old man!” Elder Yu put his bottle of Coke on the desk heavily!","“...”","The people nearby looked at them with dark expressions. “...”","“Ahem! I won’t argue with you. Let’s... watch the livestream.” Instantly, they put on their serious faces in embarrassment. “What a shame!”","This part of the story was told by an animation which showed the memories in their previous lives.","The brother and sister relied on each other, but the king of the Country of Jiang was severely ill, and the neighboring country invaded them.","Long Yang, who was Jing Tian in his previous life, shouldered the burden. He helped his father manage the country during the day and practiced sword techniques during the night.","However, he couldn’t change the fate of the country alone. When the Capital of Jiang was under siege, Long Yang broke the rule set by his ancestors and opened the scripture of the demon sword. He recruited alchemists and Daoists to make the demon sword, hoping that he could break the siege with the power of the demon sword. In the end, the demon sword wasn’t finished due to the lack of a virgin girl’s blood since the king of Jiang didn’t want to sacrifice other people’s lives for it. Before the sword was made, the Capital City was broken and conquered.","Watching Long Yang fighting to the death in the battle to protect his country, his sister, Long Kui, jumped into the sword furnace, leaving her soul in the demon sword. Many people had their hearts in their throats even though some of them had never played the game before.","Then, they watched the previous lives of Xu Changqing and Zi Xuan who had planned three reincarnations in order to live happily-ever-after, but at the end of the reincarnations, they were still defeated by fate.","In fact, compared with the tragedy in the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 1, the story of the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3 was happier and not as irreparable tragic.","For the cultivators who had lived over 100 years in the real world, they put rationality over sensibilities, but it didn’t stop them from having desires and wishing for things they couldn’t get.","It didn’t matter if these things were real or not, as long as people had faith in them and believed in them, they were real in the people’s minds.","Compared with the story, the powerful techniques such as Sword God, Demonic Flame Space-Flashing Strike, Nation-Destroying Silver Bullet Wave, and Jing Tian’s horrifying close-range sword techniques became secondary.","The story felt like a top-quality tea where the taste lingered with people long after they drank it.","Tang Yu had planned to come into the shop and lift his low spirits with something new, but the result was that he got even more depressed.","Each reincarnation would end. First was the story of Zi Xuan and Xu Changqing, and then the story of Long Kui, Xuan Jian, and Jing Tian.","More people entered Yuanyang City Shop on the next day, let alone the other two shops.","“Brother Xu? How come you’re here?”","“Brother Lei?”","“Don’t call me Brother Xu. I’ve joined the Heaven-Defying Online Games Guild, and Vice President Xiaoyue ordered me to come here to greet the Guild President!”","“Ugh...” Lei Ge’s face twitched. “Me too...”","“Ugh... Aren’t they the weak cultivators defeated by Xiaoyue...?” Li Xin’er who had watched the video in the group chat in QQ looked at them curiously.","“How come they are here?”","Jiang Xiaoyue looked proud of herself.","At this moment, the audience almost cried when they saw that Long Kui jumped into the sword furnace once again before the battle with the Evil Sword Immortal.","[Scummy shop owner!]","[Do you know how to play it or not?!]","[Return my Long Kui!]","[He couldn’t even defeat the Evil Sword Immortal. The scummy shop owner is useless!]","Bullet comments flooded the screen.","Then...","With red eyes, Mu Qing said, “This shop owner sucks at the game! I’m furious! I’ll show him how to play it properly!”","She had been hesitant, but now she walked to the counter with clenched teeth. “Activate the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3 for me.”","She slammed hundreds of crystals on the table.","“Activate it for me as well!”","“Me too!”","The grand cultivators who had cultivated hundreds of years could still hold themselves in check, but the young people couldn’t bear it anymore and swarmed to the counter.","“With my excellent talent, I promise that no one has to jump into the sword furnace as a sacrifice if I play the game!”","“Activate it for me too.” With a dark expression, Yue Bai also tossed a bag of crystals on the counter.","Without a word, she went to play the game.","Meanwhile, Mr. Fang went to practice sword techniques after achieving the results he wanted.","Different from the Legend of Sword and Fairy 1, the Legend of Sword and Fairy 3 had the possibility of a perfect ending, and the condition for this perfect ending was defeating Demon Lord Chong Lou in the New Immortal World. After that, Demon Lord Chong Lou would resurrect one person.","However, it was nearly impossible to defeat Chong Lou even if the players used Jing Tian’s body in the game."]},{"number":449,"title":"Chapter 449 - Visit the Internet Cafe Tomorrow","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","The arrogant and rampant Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace had become quiet, completely different from before.","After Nangong Zhuo achieved nothing in the Heavenly Academy exam and got kicked out, becoming a laughingstock, and the two sword slaves exploded outside Yuanyang City, all the people thought that the long-term peace in the cultivation world was broken. However, up until now, the Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace hadn’t made a move.","There wasn’t even a whisper coming from them.","It seemed as if they had finally given up.","Meanwhile, Mr. Fang was quite relaxed. He took the time to practice sword techniques and also sipped milk tea while reading the official novel of Diablo 2 on a couch.","In the morning, the shop had a moderate amount of business; it wasn’t busy or slow.","( ) The shop which had been in the center of the storm settled down. No one dared to mess with this shop since even the Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace could do nothing to it. Regardless of how great their background was, everyone coming into the shop abided by its rules, and no one made trouble.","During this time, the neighboring shop had changed hands, and the clerk who used to stop people from entering Fang Qi’s shop had disappeared, never showing his face in the area again.","It took Fang Qi a long while to get used to this new development since he was used to the old environment.","The Spiritual State was indeed much larger than the Deserted Sea Realm where Dajin was situated. The seven ancient families were in different places on the continent. For most cultivators, they only heard the names of most of the families and never met anyone from these families.","The Heavenly Academy was situated in the northern region of the continent, and further north was the Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace and Heavenly Abyss Sea. North to the Heavenly Abyss Sea was the Jiang Family and 12 demon clans.","Yuanyang City belonged to the Heavenly Academy. In fact, Castellan Zong Wu had been a disciple of the Heavenly Academy.","Of course, it was long, long ago.","When the sun rose in the east, mild voices that were lecturing the disciples came from the Dao-Seeking Pavilion in the Heavenly Academy. Beside the lotus pond in the distance, a white-haired old man was focused on boiling a pot of tea. With a small and exquisite dark-red enameled teapot in his hand, he moved in an unhurried and tranquil manner.","He looked like an old man who was enjoying the last few years of his life; no one would think that he was the Old Academy Master of the Heavenly Academy, a figure respected by the masters of the ancient families.","Behind him quietly stood a scholarly young man wearing white clothes.","Beside him was the black-robed Daoist who had monitored the exam.","He looked serene, showing no complaints about standing there for a long time.","The old man nodded. “I like your presence. I’ve had many disciples in my life and taught each of them one of my ultimate techniques. However, I’ve never taught anyone the Heavenly Insight Scroll. Do you know why?”","This young man was Wang Xie. Obviously, he had defeated Xun Yuan in that day’s battle and won the first place.","With a slight frown, he thought for a moment before saying, “I heard that the secrets of Heaven are not to be leaked. Is it because this scroll contains the secrets of Heaven and can’t be known to other people?”","The old man said mildly, “Not exactly. Not all Heavenly secrets are unpredictable and unfit for people’s knowledge. Otherwise, how would people have known about my Heavenly Insight Scroll?”","“What is the reason then?” Wang Xie asked curiously.","The old man slowly said, “I don’t know when the Heavenly Insight Scroll was created; the only thing I know is that ever since it came into existence, it has never made a mistake. If many people learn it, I’m afraid that it would cause changes in Heaven and alter many people’s fates.”","“The Heavenly Insight Scroll is so powerful and accurate?”","( ) The old man nodded. “I don’t want to bring this technique with me to the netherworld. I think you have the right temperament to cultivate this technique. Today, I’ll demonstrate it to you. Watch it carefully.”","With several Yin-Yang Trigram Tokens made by unknown materials in his hand, he said, “These are the necessary trigram tokens for cultivating the Heavenly Insight Scroll. Qian represents Heaven and Yang; Kun represents Earth and Yin. When Yin and Yang intertwined and connected, Heaven and Earth merged, and all the things in the world were created.”","The old man said, “If you have any questions, you can ask me. Today, I’ll make an exception and answer a question for you once.”","“It’s a rare opportunity that Master is willing to answer something for you!” the black-robed Daoist behind Wang Xie said in excitement, “You must grasp this opportunity! Master made accurate predictions about several treasures in the Fortune Golden Palace and never got one wrong!”","Since demonstration wasn’t teaching, it was okay for the dark-robed Daoist to watch.","“Really?” Wang Xie froze.","“Lately... I’ve been wondering about something.” Since there were no treasures to hunt down for now, Wang Xie said after a moment of consideration, “A few days ago, the sword slaves of the Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace were killed, and the young master of the Nangong Family was weeded out from the exam to everyone’s surprise. Also, the most popular topic in the Heavenly Academy is the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3 and the Origins Internet Club. I don’t know what they are about, but they sound like a powerful immortal relic. Master, can you calculate and find out its background?”","“Well! I thought you would ask something interesting!” the black-robed Daoist said with a chuckle, “I’m surprised that you are interested in this minor thing; it will be a waste of Master’s efforts...”","“Pu!” Before he could finish, the old man spat out a mouthful of blood.","The trigram tokens before him suddenly shattered, and the teapot, the desk, the ground, and even the whole space began to tremble.","“Move... help me out of here!”","The black-robed Daoist’s eyes opened wide.","Wang Xie’s mouth was wide open, and his jaw dropped.","Boom!","With an earth-shaking noise, the six spiritual artifacts which looked like Yin-Yang fish exploded, turning the place they were standing on into a pile of debris.","They all fell silent.","...","“Origins Internet Club?” Gu Tingyun regained his senses after a long while.","“Ugh... Yeah...” While his face twitched, Wang Xie couldn’t remain cool anymore. Although he didn’t know what expression he had, he knew that it was very ghastly.","The black-robed Daoist was silent.","“Yes... Master...”","“And... What the heck is the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3?” The old man asked with a dark expression.","Wang Xie didn’t know what expression he had right now. “Ugh... I’m not sure. Junior Sister Xiaoyue and the others often talk about it... I heard names such as Chong Lou, Jing Tian, and Xu Changqing... They even invited me to play it.”","“Pu!” Another mouthful of blood shot out.","“Today, I’ll take some rest...” The old man said listlessly, “Tomorrow, you can take me to the Origins Internet Club.”"]},{"number":450,"title":"Chapter 450 - What is the Shop Owner Battling?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","There were many disciples in the Heavenly Academy.","They were divided into two categories. The disciples of the first category had masters, and the rest were ordinary disciples without masters.","They had different cultivation strengths and ages, but there were no ranks among them. After all, the disciples were all elites in the younger generation, and there was no need to rank them by force.","In fact, some members of the big families entered the Heavenly Academy only to get the title and cultivated their own techniques inherited from their ancestors instead of the techniques of the Heavenly Academy. Thus, these people didn’t have to stay in the Heavenly Academy every day for cultivation; Xun Yuan and Tang Yu were in this category.","Of course, most people would choose to learn from a master in the Heavenly Academy. After all, they would have a faster speed in learning the basic cultivation techniques such as essence circulation and tricks in spiritual spells if they had a master to teach them instead of trial-and-erroring on their own.","...","“Boss...” Mr. Fang was playing games intently when Jiang Xiaoyue walked into the internet café with several girls after school.","Yue Bai said, “A bowl of instant noodles and a cup of milk tea!”","Mu Qing shouted, “Sister Xin’er, I’ll have a box of spicy sticks first.”","Young Master Xu and Lei Ge said, “We’ll each have one set of these snacks. Boss Xiaoyue, what do you want?”","Instead of going to the counter, Jiang Xiaoyue ran to Mr. Fang. “Boss, today, the elders taught us the composition of qi and the Dao of Yin-Yang. He said something about ‘the heavy is earth and the light is sky’. I don’t quite understand it. Do you know anything about it?”","“As for this...” While playing the game, Mr. Fang answered casually, “Qi mainly consists of hydrogen and oxygen.”","“Oh... it consists of hydrogen and oxygen...” Xiaoyue took out a small notebook and made notes on it.","“Then, what does ‘the heavy is earth and the light is sky’ mean?” Jiang Xiaoyue asked.","Mr. Fang answered distractedly, “It means that gases with a lower density such as hydrogen rises and becomes the sky; the gases with higher density such as carbon dioxide and oxygen fall down to the ground.”","“Then, what are hydrogen and oxygen...? I don’t think the elders taught us these words.”","“Hydrogen and oxygen are...” Mr. Fang explained randomly, and Jiang Xiaoyue made notes. The others nearby gaped at this unusual teaching session.","Soon Jiang Xiaoyue filled her small notebook with knowledge of Middle School to High School Level Physics and Chemistry.","“Ugh...?” While scratching her head, Jiang Xiaoyue read from her notebook, “Qi is made up of invisible particles which are mainly H2 and O2... Above the sky is the ozonosphere which consists of O3, a substance made up with three oxygen atoms...”","“Is... that so? It sounds... I still don’t understand.”","While holding her notebook, Jiang Xiaoyue looked puzzled. “Maybe I should ask my big brother?”","“Big Brother!”","Jiang Xuan was watching Jade Dynasty.","“Oh? Xiaoyue, you’re back from school?” Jiang Xuan glanced at her and continued watching Jade Dynasty.","“Yes! The boss explained to me the composition of qi, but I still don’t understand it,” Jiang Xiaoyue said.","“The composition of qi?” Jiang Xuan waved his hand and said with confidence, “Little Sister, ask away. Mr. Fang is powerful, but his knowledge of qi is absolutely not as deep as our Jiang Family.”","After all, their family was an ancient family with a great inheritance and profound accumulation of knowledge.","“Great!” Jiang Xiaoyue said in excitement, “Boss just told me that qi mainly consists of hydrogen and oxygen...”","Dumbfounded, Jiang Xuan looked toward Mr. Fang. “!!??”","“What kind of qi is that?!”","...","The sci-fi games and movies the shop had released, such as Resident Evil, Grand Theft Auto 5, and Counter Strike, presented low-level sci-fi worlds.","The items shown in them couldn’t replace the most advanced spiritual artifacts and spiritual treasures, but they had a great impact on the low-level to middle-level spiritual artifacts and spiritual treasures.","Of course, they only impacted and couldn’t replace these spiritual artifacts which had many advantages that even modern technology couldn’t achieve. However, they did provide new options for cultivators and warriors besides their own spiritual artifacts.","To understand these new things, they must understand the basic science knowledge that they had never encountered before.","However, the players who only played games instead of studying spiritual artifacts wouldn’t pay attention to these things.","“Forget it... I’ll bring my questions to the elders...” Jiang Xiaoyue was not pleased. “How come my big brother doesn’t even know this?","“I’ll go play games!”","She took an empty seat beside them.","Meanwhile, Mr. Fang glanced at the task list and saw that the number of activations for the Legend of Sword and Fairy 3 had surpassed 2,000.","Mr. Fang didn’t livestream today. Instead, he continued to control Jing Tian to level up and practice sword techniques.","Different from the original game, even though the system version didn’t set restrictions on the use of spiritual treasures, the treasures in the game were too precious, and they were all unique. They couldn’t be obtained just by killing monsters over and over again like the original version.","Therefore, the players must rely on their own combat techniques and Jing Tian’s strength.","If the players’ strengths weren’t high enough, they must work hard to increase Jing Tian’s level, which would in turn increase their own strengths.","This was why Fang Qi was not in a hurry to pass the game.","He didn’t step into the New Immortal World until he thought he was ready.","“The shop owner turned on the livestream again?”","“Which part is he going to play?”","“Only the battle with Chong Lou is left...”","On top of many old customers, the new customers sat down in the lounge areas as well.","At this moment, a white-haired old man shakily walked toward the shop with the assistance of a black-robed Daoist and a white-clothed young man. It looked like this old man was going to fall if the wind blew on him.","“Is this the shop?” The old man glanced at the interior of the shop. “It seems... ordinary, eh?”","A shop like this exploded my trigram tokens while I tried to calculate what it was with my Heavenly Insight Scroll?!","“Help... Help me in...” the old man said shakily.","“Please be careful...” They pushed open the door and helped the old man walk in.","Upon entering the shop, they saw a large group of people sitting on the couches in the lounge area by the entrance; they all stared at the big screen.","“What are they watching?” Gu Tingyun glanced at the big screen curiously.","Then, he saw a big white deer sitting nearby, and it had a serious expression on its face.","“We’re watching the shop owner battle Chong Lou!” the big white deer explained kindly.","“Chong Lou?”","On the big screen, a young man wearing a purple-golden Daoist robe and a luxurious headpiece stood there with the demon-suppressing sword, as immortal essence flowed around him.","Standing opposite to him was a valiant-looking male demon with two horns, who was wearing a set of red-gold armor.","Jing Tian versus Chong Lou.","The last cycle of reincarnation in the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3 would end with this battle.","“Who is Chong Lou?”","The big white deer pointed its front hoof at the big screen and yelled in excitement, “The Demon Lord! Today, the shop owner is going to battle the Demon Lord on livestream. It’s the last battle in the New Immortal World and will be awesome!”","The three people who had just entered the shop asked, “What?!”","The black-robed Daoist and Wang Xie shivered so hard that they almost threw away the old man who were they holding out the door.","“What is the shop owner battling?”","How come this little deer is watching this battle so calmly?!"]},{"number":451,"title":"Chapter 451 - The Battle in the New Immortal World","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Even though Master couldn’t calculate this shop’s background... The black-robed Daoist snapped back to his senses after a long pause.","They came prepared and knew that this shop owner wouldn’t be an ordinary person since even the Heavenly Insight Scroll couldn’t find out the background of this shop, but they were still shocked when they heard that he was going up into the Immortal World to battle with a demon lord!","It is a bit far-fetched, right?","Since when is going to the Immortal World as simple as drinking water or having a meal?!","It must be noted that no one had ascended to Heaven in a long, long time!","They found seats and sat down in doubt.","The moment that they sat down, the big white deer went to the counter and came back with a dark purple round bowl dangling in its mouth.","The newcomers stared at the big screen intently. “This place looks... indeed like the Immortal World.”","On the big screen, the immortal essence and auspicious clouds floated around, and colorful lights flashed in the grand and beautiful palaces. It indeed looked celestial.","While they watched, a special fragrance suddenly floated into their noses.","They sniffed subconsciously, and Wang Xie turned his eyes toward the source of the scent.","“Keep a calm and clear mind; watch carefully!” the white-haired old man said.","“Yes... Master.” Wang Xie immediately sat straight and continued watching.","Less than ten seconds later, a yellow-clothed young master and a burly man in a shirt walked over and sat down beside the big white deer. “Little Bell, your master is not here today?”","They each had a bowl of instant noodles in their hands.","“Ugh...? What’s this scent?” The black-robed Daoist of Heavenly Academy sniffed involuntarily, finding that the sour fragrance was even stronger.","He glanced over subconsciously and saw that the two men and one deer each had a purple round bowl in their hands, and the intense fragrance...","“Gulp.” Unconsciously, he swallowed his saliva.","“Concentrate and ignore all distractions!” the old man beside him reminded him.","“Yes, Master!” With a shiver, the black-robed Daoist immediately turned his head back and concentrated his attention on the big screen.","At this moment, the two people on the big screen hadn’t attacked yet, but their presences swept over the sky and the ground like tsunamis.","Neither of them moved.","Meanwhile, several cultivators walked over from the counter, each holding a purple round bowl and a paper cup with a big straw in it.","They sat down on the other side of the three newcomers.","The rich sour fragrance and intense milk fragrance floated into their noses alternatively.","Then, a loli came over with three girls, each holding a bowl of instant noodles, and they sat down beside the big white deer.","Zong Wu walked in with some guards...","With more people coming into the lounge area, the intense fragrances filled the whole space.","Wang Xie and the black-robed Daoist glanced over again subconsciously.","“Ahem!” A slight cough came from the old man.","With a shiver, the two guys looked back and watched the big screen with straight postures.","Then, they heard the old voice say, “You two, go and ask them what they are eating. We... will take some of those.”","In disbelief, they turned their heads and saw the white-haired old man taking in a deep breath of the fragrance, looking intoxicated.","The two men were speechless.","...","“Wow! The battle is beginning!” With a bowl of instant noodles in his hands, the black-robed Daoist stared at the screen with bright eyes.","Right now, Mr. Fang controlled Jing Tian and launched an attack before his rival did, flying across the sky as a light beam!","When his sword collided with the two blades in Chong Lou’s hands, the horrifying force spread out like a tsunami. With explosive earth-shaking noises, the immortal palaces around them collapsed in the blink of an eye!","The first round of attacks between an immortal and a demon was so explosive that all the audience felt dizzy with thrills.","“Awesome!”","“When can I be as powerful as this!”","The black-robed Daoist of the Heavenly Academy froze with the bowl of instant noodles in his hands; he said shakily, “Only immortals in Heaven can unleash such power! He is a real immortal!”","“Is this what the junior sisters and brothers have been talking about everyday?!” While swallowing a mouthful of instant noodles, Wang Xie said in a daze.","After their weapons separated, chilly lights flashed in the ocean of clouds like shooting stars while they exchanged dozens of attacks in the blink of an eye. The sword energy and devil energy spread out in all directions, and they left deep cracks in the surrounding clouds and palaces.","Excited, the players flooded the screen with bullet comments. They had been thrilled when they watched the great battle between Fei Peng and Chong Lou in the opening animation of the game, and their blood boiled. Now, they realized that they could control the main character to fight the final battle with this unkillable demonic god.","Only a battle of this scale could be called a battle, and it was worth it for the viewers to feel blood-boil over it. Fighting with an ultimate master was the dream of each master. Even the ordinary cultivators without great talents also wished that they could reach the summit and have a thrilling battle.","Now, the opponent was the unkillable Lord of the Demon World, Chong Lou. He could control most people’s life, death, age, and sickness, and he had mastered spatial powers!","Since Jing Tian was technically still a human, Chong Lou wouldn’t unleash his full power in this battle. Instead, he only used a force within the range of human achievement.","“F*ck! Mr. Fang is fighting so fiercely?!” On the big screen, Fang Qi didn’t show any disadvantage after controlling Jing Tian to battle with Chong Lou for dozens of attacks. Then, his left hand turned, and a small bronze wine cup appeared in his palm.","Light flashed on the small wine cup as if a tremendous amount of spiritual energy had been injected in it, and he tossed it out.","With a huge noise, the wine cup exploded in front of Chong Lou, and a great surge of flames that could cover Heaven and Earth instantly swallowed him!","“Nation-Destroying Silver Bullet Wave?” someone exclaimed.","The attack didn’t end here.","On the screen, Jing Tian withdrew his sword and cast a spell.","After Fei Peng reincarnated as Jing Tian, he knew more than just sword techniques!","Before the aftermath of the explosion disappeared from where Chong Lou was standing, flames of extremely high temperature rose around Chong Lou, shaking the sky and the earth.","“Shaking Star and Moving Earth?! Sky-Burning Flame?!”","“Even Chong Lou can’t escape from these attacks unscathed, eh?”","“He is merciless!”","Watching a battle of such scale, all the audience felt a force surging through their veins. Then, they flooded the screen with bullet comments.","However, a chilly light appeared in the depths of the thick smoke and the ocean of flames at this moment!","Meanwhile, a streak of eight trigrams spiritual light flashed around Mr. Fang.","Mr. Fang was intact, and the chilly light turned around, instantly shooting toward Chong Lou!","“What’s that?” The audience watched the scene in horror, wondering why it seemed like Chong Lou attacked himself.","“Damn! Awesome! He used Smoky Moon Godly Mirror!”","This was a consumable-type super spiritual treasure that Fang Qi obtained in the Immortal World. The godly force attached to the mirror could bounce back the opponent’s attack even though this attack came from Chong Lou who, after all, only unleashed a force within a humans’ capabilities."]},{"number":452,"title":"Chapter 452 - Mr. Fang Is Unrivaled","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","On the big screen, Chong Lou’s two blades suddenly tilted at a weird angle as they slashed toward Fang Qi.","Fang Qi got the perfect timing with the use of Smoky Moon Godly Mirror. If he was a tiny bit earlier, Chong Lou wouldn’t have attacked since this demon lord wasn’t a fool. If he was a tiny bit later, the result would have been fatal to him.","After his training with the use of the Royalguard Style in Devil May Cry 3, Fang Qi could perfectly control the timing at these critical moments and use ultimate techniques and items.","They passed each other in a flash, and people saw a faint bloody scratch on Chong Lou’s cheek in the next moment.","“Chong Lou was wounded first?!”","“The shop owner is unrivaled!”","“Awesome! He wounded Chong Lou first in this battle!”","“What is the Smoky Moon Godly Mirror? What did the shop owner do?” The black-robed Daoist, Wang Xie, and the old man hadn’t played the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3. They just saw a flash of Tai Chi spiritual light around Jing Tian, and then an injury appeared on Chong Lou’s face after the two rivals passed each other.","“How come the shop owner is so powerful?!” The black-robed Daoist was shocked, wondering how someone could be so powerful that he could battle with a demon lord.","At this moment, someone exclaimed, “Look! What is the shop owner eating?”","When he passed Chong Lou and got a moment to breathe, Mr. Fang took the opportunity to stuff an elixir pill into his mouth.","Almost instantly, Jing Tian’s various properties such as speed and cultivation strength rocketed!","“It looks like a Godly Fortune Four Openings Pill?” In the Jiuhua City Shop, the sharp-eyed Nalan Mingxue recognized the elixir. “I saw only two such pills and obtained them in the Immortal World at great costs.”","Song Qingfeng sent several bullet comments: [The shop owner is taking drugs?]","Ruan Ning: [Boss is shameless!]","Mr. Fang ignored them. After taking the elixir pill, his strength skyrocketed, and his extremely sharp sword energies dashed toward Chong Lou.","“That demon lord is being suppressed!” Wang Xie said in astonishment, “The shop owner’s strength is so great!”","“Yeah...” The black-robed Daoist nodded repeatedly.","“You two, watch it carefully.” Old Academy Master Gu Tingyun had a different opinion. “This young man looks strong, but his strength mainly comes from the elixir pill, and he blocked his opponent’s prior attack with a spiritual treasure. In contrast, this demon lord fights without using any outside assistance, and he is very steady.”","“Master, you mean...” Wang Xie watched carefully and found that his master was right. “The shop owner’s great strength is temporary. When the effects of the elixir pill pass, he will be at a disadvantage and could even be defeated?”","Gu Tingyun said with a nod, “Something like that.”","“Really?” Hearing his words, the people around them scratched their heads and continued to watch the livestream.","The two rivals flew to the top of an immortal palace, and their sword and dual blades released many lightning bolts, almost instantly cutting the immortal palace beneath them into pieces.","Mr. Fang slashed out the Demon-Suppressing Sword with his right hand, and his left hand...","“You guys! Look at the shop owner’s left hand!”","Mr. Fang splashed out a cloud of white mist silently with his left hand.","“Pu-!” The audience almost spat out whatever they were drinking or eating. “He is even using sleep-inducing drugs?!”","On the big screen, Chong Lou froze for a second, and Jing Tian hacked down his sword mercilessly.","“Bone-Melting Pulp?!” Not an ordinary sleep-inducing drug, it was so powerful that even demons couldn’t block its effects. Since Chong Lou was in his human form instead of his demon form, he felt dizzy for a moment. The moment that he circulated his cultivation strength and disperse this poisonous energy, the Demon-Suppressing Sword was almost upon him.","“...”","He not only took drugs himself, but he drugged Chong Lou as well!","The audience was stupefied.","Then, they saw Mr. Fang tossing out a green bead with his left hand!","The bead had a creepy green color, looking like the green eye of a poisonous viper.","“Five-Poison Bead?!”","This wasn’t the end. Then, Mr. Fang dug out a bead that was emitting a pure and holy light.","“Saint Spiritual Bead?!”","His right hand drew a circle with the Demon-Suppressing Sword, and many spiritual swords appeared in the sky behind Jing Tian, forming a horrifying curtain of swords.","“Innumerable Sword Scroll?”","“Jing Tian doesn’t know this technique, right?”","“Mr. Fang knows it!” someone exclaimed.","Mr. Fang used the sword control technique and close-range sword technique with the Demon-Suppressing Sword with his right hand and threw out all kinds of spiritual treasures with his left hand. The audience was at a loss for words while they watched the battle.","Soon, Chong Lou was forced into a disadvantage. Then, he yelled in fury, and his demon energy suddenly surged!","He turned from his human form to his demon form.","Although he still used a force within the range of humans’ limit, the power that he unleashed in his demon form was way greater than his human form.","Tremendous, destructive demon energy gathered before his chest while the surrounding energy of nature swarmed toward him like waves of an ocean.","The horrifying energy was compressed in front of his chest. The dark demon energy mingled with the energy of nature, forming a terrifying ball of energy with a white core and a purple surface. Then, the energy ball shot forward like a cannonball.","The horrifying energy almost destroyed everything on its way. It was Mind Wave, an ultimate technique that Chong Lou only used after changing into his demon form.","The white burning energy ball exploded, and it instantly turned into many destructive white light beams while sweeping across the whole space.","The powerful energy waves expanded and spread out while rippling, turning everything that they met into dust!","The audience watched the scene in terror, finally having a glimpse of Demon Lord Chong Lou’s great strength at this moment.","Even Jing Tian with his current cultivation strength might not be able to block this attack, not to mention mortals!","At this moment, Mr. Fang took out a pale purple crystal from his pocket; it was emitting radiant lights.","Buzz! With a strange vibration, an invisible force appeared in the area, and it hacked open the destructive waves, keeping Jing Tian intact.","Fantasy Realm Crystal was a mysterious treasure not belonging to any of the six realms and could block any spiritual spells in a short period once it was activated.","[TL Note: Buddhist cosmology typically identifies six realms of rebirth and existence: gods(immortal), demi-gods, humans, animals, hungry ghosts, and hells.]","It could only be used once, but Fang Qi used it at the perfect time. While controlling Jing Tian to fly forward with the sword control technique, Fang Qi took out another Godly Fortune Four Openings Pill.","Then, he took out another elixir pill and swallowed both.","“Zhu Dragon Internal Core?!” the audience howled and thought, How many treasures do you have in your pockets?!","After taking the pills, Fang Qi suddenly condensed a strange barrier around his body.","Meanwhile, Jing Tian, under Mr. Fang’s control, unleashed a streak of horrifying sword spirits.","Chong Lou attacked Jing Tian with his dual blades.","Resonant, bell-like noises swept all over the space.","Mr. Fang was intact, but Fang Qi’s sword already pierced Chong Lou’s chest.","The audience fell silent.","On the big screen, Chong Lou’s expression was as dark as the bottom of a pot that had been burned by fire. “You win.”","The audience saw the wounded Chong Lou, and bullet comments flooded the screen.","“Condolence to Big Brother Chong Lou...”","“Chong Lou, you’re a good guy...”","“Mr. Fang, you win.”","“Despicable and shameless Old Demon Fang!”","“...”","Mr. Fang said in disdain, “Do you want Sister Long Kui to come back to life or not?”","“We do! We do! We do!”","“Hurry up!”","“Show us how Long Kui comes back to life!”","The bullet comments immediately changed tones.","They had instantly forgotten about Chong Lou’s little wound.","Gu Tingyun’s old face was dark. “This shop owner... don’t ever mess with him.”","If a powerful master had pride, one could still use this to their advantage and potentially win the battle. But to people like this guy...","He was invincible!"]},{"number":453,"title":"Chapter 453 - Buddhistic Players, Just Cover Your Head","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Chong Lou had captured Xuan Jian and Long Kui right after Jing Tian’s battle with the Evil Sword Immortal, which was the cause of the final battle with Chong Lou. Due to the short time between these two battles, the players didn’t have enough time to increase their levels to 99 like in the original version of the game.","Due to the limited preparation time, the players were allowed to use all kinds of methods to rescue the hostages and obtain the perfect ending.","If the players wanted to battle Chong Lou without using any tricks, they could follow another path and obtain another ending. After Xuan Jian sacrificed herself to the sword furnace and died, Jing Tian, who was heartbroken with sorrow, immersed himself in Martial Dao and finally reached the No Sword Realm. After he recovered most of his sword techniques from his previous life, he finally had the power to battle Chong Lou.","“Is there no one who is going to praise my excellent plays?” After winning the battle using all kinds of treasures and elixir pills, Mr. Fang didn’t feel a trace of shame. “Do you think it’s easy to sneak-attack a demon lord?”","If it was the original version of the game, Mr. Fang was confident that he could just barely defeat Chong Lou by using the level 1 Demon-Suppressing Sword.","But now, there weren’t that many mechanics that could be used in the virtual reality version, which meant that Fang Qi couldn’t defeat this demon lord using the fancy moves as he did in Devil May Cry 3.","After all, Dante had gained tremendous strength at the end of the Devil May Cry 3, and Mr. Fang had synchronized with Dante for a long time in the Game Cultivation Room. In contrast, Jing Tian’s current strength in the Legend of the Sword and Fairly 3 was way lower than that of Chong Lou’s.","However, people didn’t care about this. After all, they were more interested in the fact that Long Kui, who had jumped into the sword furnace, could finally be resurrected.","For Chong Lou, his small wound was no big deal. After bringing Long Kui back to life, he even separated Red Kui from Blue Kui, who had been one person with two personalities.","In this way, Long Kui became two girls.","The audience watched Jing Tian return to his life as the shop owner of Xin’an Pawn Shop. He put away and sealed his sword and lived a happy and free life.","Xue Jian became the mistress of the shop, Blue Kui was in charge of antique appraisals, and Red Kui’s job was to scare customers. They lived happily as a family.","...","Beginning from the battle in the New Immortal World and ending with the battle in the New Immortal World, all the reincarnations came to a happy ending.","While the ending of the Legend of Sword and Fairy 1 was a sharp blade cutting into the players’ hearts when they thought of it many years later, the ending of the Legend of Sword and Fairy 3 was a cup of fragrant tea where the taste would linger with them for a long time.","On the big screen, many bullet comments expressed the audience’s feelings.","Ruan Ning: [I’m touched...]","Nalan Mingxue: [Compared with the Legend of Sword and Fairy 1, I like this one better.]","Lan Yan: [I like both.]","Su Tianji: [I like both as well!]","Not only the girls such as Xu Zixin and Dong Qingli, but the guys such as Liang Shi and Song Qingfeng were so happy that they danced cheerfully. “Long live Big Brother Chong Lou! I didn’t know that Sister Long Kui could be resurrected! Excellent!”","“I knew it!” Inside the Yuanyang City Shop, Zong Wu gulped down Coke and slammed his hand on his thigh heartily, and he said while laughing. “This girl Long Kui doesn’t look like someone who would die so easily! She looks lucky!”","Since the young people from the Heavenly Academy were of similar age as the characters in the game, they were supposed to share the feelings of the characters who had experienced so many ups and downs until the happy ending was reached.","In the real world, these young people had just begun their journey, setting sail on their ships on the ocean that was called life.","However, most of them remained silent at this moment.","“So good!” One of the young people sent this short bullet comment. It contained only two words but held a deeper meaning.","Meanwhile, the newcomers, Wang Xie, the black-robed Daoist, and Old Academy Master Gu Tingyu, exchanged a look of bafflement, wondering about the story leading to the final battle. “Who... can tell us the story?”","“It’s Senior Gu!” Many people had been watching the livestream intently and didn’t see him. When Zong Wu and the others saw him and came over to greet him, the others were startled.","After all, not just anyone could have the opportunity to see him. Otherwise, the people would have swarmed to the Heavenly Academy to ask him to calculate some answers for them, and the threshold of the main gate of the Heavenly Academy would have been destroyed.","Gu Tingyun immediately stood up to return the greetings. “I’m here for a leisure outing. I’m surprised to see so many of you here.”","“We...” Zong Wu and the others smiled in embarrassment. “Senior Gu, did you just say that you want to know the story of the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3?”","“The Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3? Story?” Gu Tingyun was puzzled. “What story?”","Gu Tingyun pointed at the big screen. “I want to know how the shop owner could battle the demon lord and resurrect people...”","“Who the heck is the shop owner? He’s so powerful that he can even battle a demon lord!”","Zong Wu’s face twitched.","This was a big misunderstanding.","Immediately, he explained the game to the newcomers and took them to the computers to experience the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3 in person.","– Three minutes later –","It only took three minutes for them to fall in love with this new game. Green light lit up in their eyes while they asked, “Do you mean that we can also battle Demon Lord Chong Lou when we play to the end of the game?!”","It was awesome enough to watch someone else battle, and now they realized that they could do the same and battle this powerful master!","Although it was only a game, the experience was almost the same as in the real world. Even Gu Tingyun, an old man who was enjoying the last few years of his life, wished that he could pass the game and experience the battle with the demon lord.","“Ugh... This...” Zong Wu was embarrassed, thinking that they had a long way to go before they could reach the end, and they should take it slow.","However, Mr. Fang’s battle with Chong Lou gave them some inspiration. So long as they had the right strategies, accumulated enough experience and skills, and obtained precious treasures in the game, they also had a chance to pass the game even if their cultivation strengths were not high.","In Jiuhua City, people like Nalan Mingxue, Song Qingfeng, and Su Tianji who had played the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 1 with proficiency had no difficulty playing the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3; some of them had reached the second half of the game.","As for the cultivators in Yuanyang City, most of them were still playing the first half of the game, reaching the middle point.","As for the new players such as Gu Tingyun, Wang Xie, and the black-robed Daoist Zhou Mo, they were still being reprimanded by Ms. Tang.","“This girl is so unruly. How dare she beat me!” Zhou Mo jumped up in rage. In the game, Jing Tian who hadn’t learned any martial arts received another beating before he could attempt to fight back.","He turned his head. “Master, how did you pass this part?”","Gu Tingyu looked calm. As a Buddhistic player, since he couldn’t fight back, he just covered his head and received the beating calmly.","[TL Note: Buddhistic is a popular internet slang in China. It is used to describe people who are calm and reserved at all time.]","“...”","It seemed like they had a long way to go before they could challenge Chong Lou."]},{"number":454,"title":"Chapter 454 - The Post Bar Forum Is Unlocked","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","By now, Mr. Fang had finished his first round with the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3 and achieved the happy ending. Since he was playing the game for the second time, his progress was behind most of the other players as he started from the beginning.","The players who played the game for the second time after clearing the stage and the players returning to the beginning of the game before clearing the stage would still obtain tremendous benefits by killing monsters and leveling up again.","Of course, in the later stages of the game, they could gain more than experience and cultivation strength. They would obtain greater benefits such as powerful techniques and the main character’s comprehension and inspiration about cultivation. All these benefits were better than simple cultivation strength.","However, many people wanted to clear the stage with better performances and achieve an ending that they liked. Others enjoyed the feelings of growing from weak to strong and achieving breakthroughs in battles. Therefore, a large portion of the players played this game again.","In the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 1, the players could still do tasks after passing the game. For example, Li Xiaoyao could still finish the task that Sword Saint assigned to him and become the Master of the Shu Mountain Faction. After that, the players could continue the game by managing the affairs in the faction. However, in the system version of the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3, it was different. After the perfect ending, Jing Tian put away and sealed his sword. Although the players could still experience the happy life in Xin’an Pawn Shop, some players who sought after thrills would find it more fun to play the game again from the very beginning.","Despite the high degree of freedom in the system version of the game, it couldn’t let the players continue playing the game after the end of the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3 until the Side Chapter of the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3, which was another game, was unlocked. Likewise, the players couldn’t play for another 80 to 100 years until they enter the game of the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 1 and the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 2.","Such a thing wouldn’t happen.","Unlike Devil May Cry, which was perfect for warriors to play, the characters in the series of the Legend of the Sword and Fairy could cultivate either sword techniques or spiritual spells. In the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 1, players could focus on the sword control technique, or they could resort to plain attacks using Tiangang Battle Qi, or they could learn all the spiritual spells. In the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3, the players could control Jing Tian to cultivate spiritual spells while warriors could control him to practice sword techniques. They could even move Li Xiaoyao’s sword control technique from the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 1 to here to continue practicing.","Of course, the sword control technique was Xu Changqing’s strong suit while Jing Tian didn’t show any great talent in this technique.","Jiang Xiaoyue sat together with four others while playing the game in the internet café.","Right now, people could see that Yue Bai held a demon sword and killed her way into Thunderclap Hall with the main characters without using any spiritual spells.","Beside them, the big white deer was chased by disciples of Thunderclap Hall while casting the Ice Spell. It yelled in tears, “This game is so difficult to play! Why doesn’t Jing Tian have four legs?! They will catch me soon!”","While it yelled, its screen turned grey.","“Little Bell, you are so dumb!” Jiang Xiaoyue glanced at the deer and said, “Watch me!”","Although Jiang Xiaoyue had lost several days of playtime due to the academy exam, her progress in the game was quite fast. By now, she had reached the part where she had to rescue Xuan Jian from the Ghost Realm.","Right now, she was walking on Yellow Spring Road which led to Hell, but she showed no fear in this gloomy place.","Two small ghosts floated toward her.","On the screen, Jiang Xiaoyue’s plays were so fast that the people watching could only see a blur.","“This is called kiting!” On the screen, Jiang Xiaoyue controlled Jing Tian to toss out a long-range spiritual spell. “Attack while running.”","“This is called side-stepping!” When the two small ghosts rushed up, Jing Tian calmly dodged their attacks.","Then, he tossed a spiritual spell and hit a ghost that missed the target. “This is called prediction!”","After a series of plays, the few small ghosts vanished with screams before they could touch his clothes.","The other players glanced over and yelled, “Amazing!”","“How did you do that?!”","The big white deer said, “Princess Xiaoyue, you’re awesome! Can you teach me?”","Jiang Xiaoyue snickered, “Hehehe!”","While the players were in different stages in the game, with some close to the end while others were at the beginning, it didn’t stop them from discussing the game.","“I tried the lightning-style and fire-style spiritual spells today. Just what happened after I increased its level to level 3?!” A voice came from outside the shop before the people in the shop could see this person through the windows. The voice came from Tang Yu, and he was waving a folding fan made of black jade.","Beside him was Wang Xie, a white-clothed handsome young man who looked scholarly and elegant. He said with a chuckle, “Brother Tang, you found something new?”","“More than that!” Tang Yu said, “I’ve made that spell called Shooting Star level 3, and my Lightning-Style spell, Sky-Piercing Heavenly Lightning also reached level 3. Once, I used both spiritual spells at the same time by accident, and they formed a mixed spiritual spell called Lightning-Igniting Burning Flames.”","“Indeed?” Wang Xie was also a cultivator who chose to focus on spiritual spells, but he chose a different direction compared to Tang Yu; he cultivated the wind-style and water-style spells.","“Can these spiritual spells really mix with each other? How powerful is the new spell?”","“The power more than doubled!” Tang Yu said proudly, “I’ll show you in the game.”","“Excellent! Excellent!” Wang Xie said, “If this method proves useful, I’ll buy you a bowl of instant noodles.”","“Ugh? Look! Junior Sister Xiaoyue is here.”","“That is... Senior Sister Yue Bai? They are all playing the Legend of Sword and Fairy 3?”","Jiang Xiaoyue was reading messages in the group chat in QQ.","In the Legend of Sword and Fairy Communicate Group, Jiang Xiaoyue asked, [Who knows how to get through Yellow Spring Road? I’m lost!]","Lan Yan: [Ask your Sister Mingxue. She has all the detailed maps before the Immortal World.]","Jiang Xiaoyue was surprised. [How come you guys have such things?!]","Nalan Mingxue: [😏 I paid people to scout out the areas and drew the maps. Do you want them? I’ll give them to you if you call me ‘Good Big Sister’.]","Jiang Xiaoyue: [😳]","Su Tianji: [😅]","Lan Yan: [We also have the mixing conditions for several mixed spiritual spells 😏.]","Song Qingfeng didn’t hesitate, [Good Big Sister, please give me one copy of that.]","“...”","Watching from behind, Tang Yu and Wang Xie were dazed. “Who are they? They even have all the maps leading to the Immortal World?”","After all, they had just begun playing the game!","“They have detailed maps?”","Instantly, several people turned their heads to this direction. It must be noted that there were many places like Thunderclap Hall in the Legend of Sword and Fairy 3. To defend against invaders, these places were huge and maze-like, and the players got lost easily if they didn’t pay close attention.","Wu Zong asked, “Where is it?”","Wang Xie replied, “It’s in their group chat on QQ.”","Black-robed Daoist Zhou Mo asked, “Can we join this group chat?”","Meanwhile, Mr. Fang saw that the messages in the group chat on QQ jumping like crazy, and the number on the top right corner of this group chat icon soon reached [999+].","Mr. Fang suddenly got a prompt from the System:","[The messages in the various group chats in QQ reached the limit several times. Post Bar Forum is now unlocked.]","[TL Note: Post Bar Forum is an internet product created by the Chinese company, Baidu. Just think of it as Reddit.]"]},{"number":455,"title":"Chapter 455 - It’s Always Right to Follow the Steps of the Shop Owner","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Post Bar Forum?” Fang Qi glanced at the screen and saw the icon. “...”","Soon, a blue square icon for the Post Bar Forum appeared on the desktop of all the computers.","This was the third free basic software after QQ and the Virtual Item Trading Net.","Since it was unlocked by the System, it appeared on the desktop directly. In contrast, the Matrix was a prize drawn by Fang Qi, and he could choose when to release it.","For the customers in the old shops, they would understand the movie. But for the customers in the new shop, they didn’t have the slightest idea about internet, and the only reason that they came to the shop was to play the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3.","Since these people had no idea, if he released the Matrix now, they wouldn’t be as excited and inclined to purchase it.","Therefore, Mr. Fang decided to wait for a while before releasing the Matrix. At least the new customers would have to have a basic idea about virtual reality, computers, and machines, etc.","Many new players played the game by themselves and talked about it in their small circles; they knew nothing about QQ or Qzone. They also didn’t know that in the distant place beyond the Heavenly Abyss Sea, another group of cultivators was also playing this game. When they encountered problems while playing the game, they only discussed about it in their small circles.","However, things changed after the appearance of Post Bar Forum. At this moment, Mr. Fang created a post bar named ‘The Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3’.","At this moment, Mr. Fang saw a profile photo jump in QQ.","Su Tianji: [(Husky’s dumb cute face) How come I found another new item?]","[Are you watching out for new items each day?] Mr. Fang was exasperated. [You saw it the moment it appeared?]","[<img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f620.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F620;\"> What’s this for? I saw nothing when I clicked it open...]","Mr. Fang. “...”","However, as the owner of the shop, he was the only one who knew how to use this thing.","Soon, Mr. Fang replied after a series of operations, [Now, enter it again.]","Su Tianji entered the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3 Post Bar. Sure enough, she saw two posts inside.","[Discussion: The Plausibility of Merging Five-Elemental Spiritual Spells]","[Guide: How to Obtain the Fantasy Realm Crystal]","“Fantasy Realm Crystal?!” In the Jiuhua City Shop, Su Tianji’s eyes widened as she held a cup of milk tea in her hands. She exclaimed after a moment of stupefaction, “The shop owner released the method of getting the Fantasy Realm Crystal!”","Different from the original version, in the system version, there were very few treasures that could block spells from Chong Lou.","Different from the group chats, the Post Bar Forum had no restriction ‘circles’ for participants, and anyone could discuss all topics regarding a game or a movie. Soon, a large group of people replied to the posts. New players asked questions in the post bar while new guides and discussion posts appeared.","[The Legend of the Sword and Fairy Communication Group is recruiting new members! The QQ Group Number is...] Several days later, this post appeared in the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3 Post Bar.","At this moment, Mr. Fang glanced at the activation number of the Legend of Sword and Fairy 3 and found that it had surpassed 3,000.","[I’m going to battle Chong Lou now!] Nalan Mingxue posted a screenshot in the group, showing that she was on the way to the New Immortal World.","[How come you guys are so fast?] Wang Xie froze when he entered the group chat.","[How come you’re so fast?] Huangpu Tao with the ID [Black Dragon Castellan] posted a message, [I play eight hours a day but only reached the Evil Sword Immortal. By the way, the Evil Sword Immortal is so powerful...]","[I’ll post a guide after passing <img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f600.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F600;\">]","Mr. Fang, [It sounds like a farewell.]","Song Qingfeng, [<img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f605.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F605;\"> He is not replying; I guess the battle has begun.]","– One hour later –","Nalan Mingxue: [(Husky’s pitiable face) I was beaten senseless...]","Jiang Xiaoyue: [I haven’t got there yet.]","Song Qingfeng: [Brother Chong Lou is so powerful... I guess I’ll lose to him tomorrow too.]","Black-robed Daoist Zhou Mo’s profile photo was a picture of Chong Lou. “After all, he is the Demon Lord.”","...","While the people in the Half City Shop and Jiuhua City Shop had gotten to know each other through battles, the relationship between the new shop and the old shops was much friendlier as they were all playing the Legend of Sword and Fairy 3.","There was less competition. Instead, the cultivators discussed with each other in the group chats and forums as if they were studying Dao together in a peaceful atmosphere.","...","One day, Mr. Fang finally added a new movie on the small blackboard: [The Matrix]","The Spiritual State’s climate was even milder when compared to Jiuhua City in the Deserted Sea Realm. It was well into the spring. Even though Yuanyang City was built on the top of a spiritual mountain, it wasn’t cold. Meanwhile, a big demon still stayed in Half City, the coldest of the three shops.","“Achoo! When will that damn Old Demon Fang take me to the new shop?!”","Mr. Fang had no such intention at all.","The disciples of the Heavenly Academy came to the shop whenever the elders didn’t hold lectures.","The elders of the Heavenly Academy didn’t have lectures each day. For the geniuses, self-cultivation was more important since the masters only acted as guides. It was why the disciples of the Heavenly Academy had lots of free time.","Some even went out for a long time to experience the world or seek adventures.","“Sister Lanruo, I can do it.”","Li Lanruo prepared instant noodles and milk tea for her good friends in school while she was preparing her own snacks.","The Li Family had few members left in the world, and she was the most talented one in the family, which was why Elder Li Wuya and Little Xin’er hoped that she could put all her energy on cultivation. However, she would help them out in the shop since she came to the shop every day.","“Boss, how come the main item isn’t the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3?” While walking past the counter, Li Lanruo saw that the first item on the small blackboard changed to a movie with the weird name ‘The Matrix’.","She knew what movies were since she had watched Shu Mountain at Jiang Xiaoyue’s recommendation.","Zong Wu came to the shop whenever he had time, so it was up to how much affairs he had everyday. Today, he wasn’t in the shop yet, which meant that he was busy.","However, people who were not busy walked into the shop.","“Master, be careful.”","Wang Xie helped Old Academy Master Gu Tingyu into the shop.","Gu Tingyun had retired from the position of Academy Master long ago. Right now, during the last years of his life, his only job was teaching disciples.","Wang Xie’s only job right now was studying the Heavenly Insight Scroll.","But since his master even came here to play games, he didn’t need to study at all.","The master and disciple were the earliest customers in the shop almost every day.","“What are they doing standing around the counter?” Gu Tingyun narrowed his old eyes.","Then, he heard Jiang Xiaoyue asking in her crisp voice, “Boss, are you going to watch The Matrix?”","“Of course. Why not?”","“Then, I’ll watch it too!” Anyway, it was always right to follow the shop owner.","“The Matrix?” Wang Xie and Gu Tingyun exchanged a look. “What’s this?”"]},{"number":456,"title":"Chapter 456 - Tour Group Sets Off to The Matrix","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","[TL Note: the plain translation of the Matrix into Chinese is Hackers’ Empire. Therefore, it would cause some confusion in this section.]","“Hackers?”","“Hackers?!” In the Jiuhua City Shop, people were bustling in the early morning. Although the shop only opened just now, it was already busy.","Upon entering the shop, Li Haoran froze when he saw the new movie that was offered.","Others might not understand this word, but as the genius artifact master in Dajin, he clearly knew how they easily won the information war against the alliance of major forces.","They had borrowed the idea and strategy from the Hacker Lester in Grand Theft Auto 5.","Perhaps the strategy was a bit crude and in its infancy, but it was effective against the major forces who had never imagined such a strategy before.","“Is this a movie featuring hackers?!” Li Haoran was a bit curious. Although they had achieved success by using this strategy, what was the use of watching hackers? How could that be applied in the real world?","Could they use the skills learned in the movie to hack into the computers in the internet café?","It was a bit far-fetched and non-realistic.","Then, he glanced at the price and found that it was quite expensive: [38 crystals]","He could afford this price, but he wondered why this movie was as expensive as Shu Mountain.","For the cultivators, the science technology of the ordinary people was child’s play compared with the top-level spiritual treasures in Shu Mountain and the Legend of the Sword and Fairy.","In the Half City Shop.","“How come they are all standing here?”","Unbound King was a young man with shoulder-length white hair; he looked to be about 18 years old.","Behind him was a purple-clothed old man, the Reincarnation King of Half City.","The Reincarnation King had originally been scheming against the internet café, but the old man was smart enough to stop his plans after the big demon was suppressed. Now, he came into the internet café every day to play games.","Upon entering the shop, they saw elders and disciples of the Nanhua Faction standing around the counter.","Mo Xian said, “The shop released a new movie today, and we’re deciding if we should watch it together.”","Yue Yan wondered, “The Matrix? After watching it, can we dump Lester and hack into the security system ourselves to do all kinds of tasks?”","Liu Ningyun asked, “Ms. Ruan, do you guys plan to watch it?”","“I will if the Guild President watches it,” Ruan Ning said, “this old demon never misses a good thing.”","Mo Xian said in disdain. “It’s a good thing for him if we watch it since he can make money from us.”","The Xichi Spiritual Master said, “Is it about hackers? Let’s get online first and ask the cultivators in Jiuhua City in the group chat.”","Mo Xian replied, “I have a feeling that it’s no good...”","After staying in the world of Grand Theft Auto 5 for a while, they found that this world had nothing good except for some excellent spiritual artifacts.","Even though those machines and tools were good, the top-level cultivators could still deal with these heavy machines as long as they understood their mechanisms and the principles behind them.","Unbound King and Reincarnation King exchanged a look. “What’s this thing? Should we watch it...”","Usually Mr. Fang’s Group Tour in QQ was quiet, but whenever a new movie was released, many people would jump out and flood the chat with messages.","Su Tianji: [Sir, are you going to organize a group tour today?]","Nalan Hongwu: [This doesn’t look like a movie for warriors, eh? Should I watch it?]","Mr. Fang: [It’s your decision; it only lasts a bit over 2 hours. Get on board if you want to watch it!]","Su Tianji: [Me!]","Dong Qingli: [Me! Me! Me!]","An Huwei: [Count me in!]","“...” Messages flooded the group chat in QQ.","– In the Half City Shop –","Mo Xian urged, “Let’s go now! Hurry up and get onboard!”","Liu Ningyun was nonplussed, “Senior Sister, didn’t you say that it wouldn’t be good?”","Mo Xian replied, “Don’t you see that they’ve all gone? If we don’t hurry, there won’t be seats available!”","Yue Yan shouted, “Hurry! Hurry!”","“...”","– In the Yuanyang Shop –","“What are they doing?”","“So many people?”","“Shall we go and watch it too?”","Tang Yu said, “What’s happening? Let’s go and have a look...”","Instantly, a large group of people showed up in Mr. Fang’s Qzone.","“Didn’t you say that you wouldn’t watch it?”","“How come you’re all here?”","Fang Qi glanced around and saw the old man Gu Tingyun and Elder Yu, wondering how they got into this group.","While his face twitched, Mr. Fang said, “The tour bus is full; please wait for the next bus!”","The customers who hadn’t gotten onto the tour bus were silent for a while.","Then, Black Demon asked, “Anyone wants to get onboard my tour bus of the Matrix?”","“Me!”","“Count me in!”","Nearby, the Reincarnation King and Unbound King had just gotten online. “How come they all went to watch the movie?”","“Shall we watch it too?”","With a clank, the access to Mr. Fang’s Qzone was closed, and Mr. Fang’s tour bus set off.","It was pitch-black. When the light came, they saw dense rows of data flowing on the pitch-black screen in a complicated manner. Fortunately, the System had the translation function, which enabled the audience to see that it was online communication between two hackers.","“It looks powerful...” Wang Xie whispered.","“I wonder if it’s better than the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3,” Tang Yu whispered since he knew only one game.","The environment around them looked modern, and the buildings were in the style of the end of the 20th Century. In a dim and crude room, a female hacker sat inside while policer officers swarmed up to the door.","“Senior Sister, these guys are so weirdly dressed...” Mu Qing whispered. Both of them had come to watch the movie with Jiang Xiaoyue.","The cultivators of the Yuanyang City Shop didn’t know what they were watching except that it was similar to the opening animation of the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3, so they watched for fun.","Having played Grand Theft Auto 5, Mo Xian and the others were familiar with this concept. She said with some disdain, “What good is this? Catching a hacker? It would be more fun to drive a car and lead them on a wild chase.”","The others were also a bit disappointed. For them, modern society was full of people with low-level strengths. After all, the Wuwei Daoist Alliance had mastered the creation of items such as guns, and it seemed meaningless to watch a movie with a similar theme.","It wasn’t exactly meaningless; it was just that its theme overlapped with that of Grand Theft Auto 5.","The cultivators of Yuanyang City also felt that the spiritual artifacts and martial art techniques shown in this move were child’s play.","“This is not nearly as good as the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3...” Zong Wu said, “Senior Gu, what do you think?”","Gu Tingyun nodded. “Indeed, it doesn’t seem as good.”","Elder Yu said, “I can deal with 100 or 1,000 people who are on this strength level. They are indeed lame.”","“Is it a mistake that we came to watch it?”"]},{"number":457,"title":"Chapter 457 - The Weird World in the Movie","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","The beginning of the movie was indeed a bit boring if one came to watch the movie expecting to learn something. The fighting scenes were lame in the eyes of warriors and cultivators even though the heroine showed strength much greater than ordinary people.","If one watched it as an ordinary movie, the chase part was in fact quite thrilling. After all, not every movie or game would begin with a great battle between an immortal and a demon as in the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3.","At this moment, the camera turned to a telephone booth by the road. Meanwhile, the agents were crashing toward it while driving a big truck.","“This thing looks to be in the same category as the shop owner’s racecar...” Curious, Tang Yu walked up and stared at the truck.","Boom!","As a loud noise sounded, it seemed like the telephone booth was shattered with the heroine in it.","The headlights of the truck shone on the shattered telephone booth.","“She’s not in there?!”","At this moment, the dozens of viewers stood on the opposite side of the street with Mr. Fang, staring at the destroyed telephone booth.","There wasn’t a trace of the woman; it looked as if the truck had crashed into a ghost.","“Boss... Are you sure this isn’t Silent Hill?” Loli Jiang Xiaoyue moved closer to Mr. Fang subconsciously.","A big white deer raced to her. “Princess Your Highness, there... is a monster!”","Then, a Smirking Face Emoji floated over. “Strange. How come a little demon dares to venture out?”","“...”","Three agents got out from the truck. Agent Smith seemed to have anticipated this situation. “She got off.”","“!!??” All the people froze. “How did she do it?”","Even hackers have to follow the basic laws of nature when escaping, right?","Did she flee through the internet cable?!","“Master.”","Gu Tingyun looked grim. “I can’t tell how she left.”","Puzzled, the audience continued watching.","“There are such people in this world?” Wang Xie watched the scenes dubiously.","“Brother Wang, where do you think this place is?” While wearing crude clothes, Tang Yu had a black folding fan painted with golden bamboo leaves. He had bought it after growing vegetables for several days, and the fan looked quite fancy with its top-grade material.","As for clothes, he had run out of money.","The story of the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3 was set in the Immortal World and Mortal World, and the viewers were familiar about it. However, the clothes and weapons in this movie were quite novel for them.","When the customers of the Yuanyang City Shop glanced at the customers from other shops, they found that one wore Kyo Kusanagi’s costume, one wore a sorcerer’s cloak, and one wore a Daoist robe from an unknown faction. In fact, there was even a Smirking Face Emoji floating in the air. There were all kinds of people wearing all kinds of clothes.","“...”","For the customers of the Yuanyang City Shop, most of them had never seen the style of living shown in the movie; it seemed to be a totally different civilization from theirs.","As the camera turned, they arrived at Neo’s home; Neo was the main character.","The following scene was even odder. When Neo woke up, the computer blacked out and then showed the words:","[Wake up Neo.","The Matrix has you...","Follow the white rabbit.]","Three strange, choppy, and puzzling messages appeared.","As the story went on, things got even weirder. At first, the Hacker Morpheus directed Neo through the phone to escape from the chasing agents in the big office; Morpheus even knew the exact moment when the agents had their backs to Neo. Easily, he helped Neo dodge the agents and get out of the office.","He was just beside the agents, but the latter couldn’t see him because he was in their blind spots, so they didn’t discover everything.","All of this was because someone directed his moves from a distance.","Some people in the audience had played Grand Theft Auto 5, and they did the Fleeca Bank Job. They felt like this scene was like when Lester used his own little software to avoid the bank’s defense software and hacked into its security system.","The audience watched while Neo failed in his escape and was apprehended by the agents.","Having watched some modern movies and games, the audience from the Jiuhua City and the Half City expected that Neo would be interrogated by the agents. Neo even gave the agents the finger and said that he would call a lawyer.","Without a word, the agent glued Neo’s lips, making him into a mouthless man. Meanwhile, a strange electronic device turned into an electronic worm and entered Neo’s belly.","“!!??”","The audience felt weirder, and their expressions became strange.","Even the people who knew the meaning of the word ‘hacker’ began to realize this wasn’t a movie about ordinary hackers.","“This world looks like that in Grand Theft Auto 5, but they are not the same, right?” Li Haoran said in surprise.","The technology shown in Resident Evil and Grand Theft Auto 5 was not complicated, and it was not difficult for them to understand and master.","While watching the movie, Song Qingfeng said in a low voice, “If the police in GTA 5 are as powerful as the agents in this movie, we wouldn’t be able to do any jobs.”","Wang Xie said, “They seem to know things that we don’t.”","Tang Yu said in a low voice, “The cars driven in the movie have the same mechanisms as the shop owner’s race car. He might have gotten the technology from these people in the movie.”","The people from Yuanyang City whispered among themselves.","“Look! They found Morpheus.” Morpheus was a tall bald guy wearing a black leather coat and sunglasses. He was the leader of the hackers and the person who had helped Neo. The audience felt that he might explain all the mysteries that they had witnessed.","“What the heck is going on?” Su Tianji watched in bafflement as the two people talked. “It looks like the world in Grand Theft Auto 5, but it’s much weirder.”","“I have the same feeling...” Dong Qingli said, “Each time when something happens, he would wake up in his bed, but the things he dreams about are real; even the electronic worm is...”","Nalan Hongwu said, “In my opinion, there’s a mastermind behind all this!”","An Huwei said with a nod, “It must be the so-called Matrix.”","They stood there and continued watching.","While they talked, Neo swallowed the red pill. Morpheus and others helped him attach all kinds of devices to his body, it seemed like the truth would come out in the next moment."]},{"number":458,"title":"Chapter 458 - The Real World","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","In the movie, Morpheus, who was clothed in black and wearing a pair of sunglasses, said, “The pill you took is part of a trace program. It’s designed to disrupt your input and output carrier signals, so we can pinpoint your location.”","Thunderbolts flashed in the storm outside. While a rumbling thunder rolling outside the window, Neo began to transform!","“What’s happening?” Mo Xian stared at Neo intently.","Wang Xie watched the scene curiously.","Other disciples from the Heavenly Academy also stared at Neo intently while his body was engulfed by liquid metallic material.","“What will happen?” Yue Bai, Li Lanruo, and the other girls all stared at the scene.","“Is this a fantasy realm?” Demonic Woman Ning Bi guessed uneasily.","“Impossible... Everything is real here...”","Everyone stared at Neo without blinking, not wanting to miss any detail.","The movie continued.","“It’s going into replication.”","“Tank, we’re going to need a signal soon.”","“Located.”","“Targeting, almost there...”","“...”","A series of electronic beeping sounds came...","“He’s going into arrest.”","“Lock! I got him!”","Among horrified exclamations, a high-tech tank filled with red liquid appeared.","In it was a man who had tubes attached to his spine, the back of his head, and other places on his body.","Looking out from the water tank, the man saw rows and rows of neatly placed high-tech tanks.","He turned to look forward and saw two huge pillars reaching up into the sky. On the pillars were densely placed high-tech tanks like that looked like warm eggs.","Looking down, he saw a bottomless abyss with many jumping electrical currents.","Looking up, he saw a seemingly limitless number of pillars with high-tech tanks on them, and his high-tech tank was one of the many.","“What... What are these?!” Seeing this scene, even the grand cultivators such as Zong Wu in Yuanyang City were shocked.","More importantly, they should be in the room with Morpheus anthe d other hackers, right?!","Could it be that it really was just a dream?! What are these cocoon-like high-tech tanks ?","The big white deer’s legs turned to jelly, and it dropped to the ground with tears. “So scary!”","Some cultivators from Yuanyang City stepped back subconsciously.","“Sir, what the heck are these things?!” Su Tianji also looked alarmed. Isn’t it supposed to be a world like that in Grand Theft Auto 5? How come it suddenly changed into this world?!","Her two disciples hugged each other and shrieked in fear.","Even the fearless Demon Woman was surprised, and her expression changed. Is this the truth?","Even Nalan Hongwu looked astonished.","“Master, what... is this?!” Wang Xie backed off subconsciously while glancing at Gu Tingyun beside him.","Humans’ fear came from the unknown. However, sometimes the truth was even more horrifying than the unknown!","Only the non-human creatures in here could be compared to Gu Tingyun’s age and experience, and his cultivation strength was almost unrivaled. However, at this moment, his old face had changed color as well.","“What are these damn things?! I don’t like this feeling.” The big demon floated back to the middle of the crowd from the foremost position.","Then, all the tubes were removed from Neo’s body, and he slid down from the high-tech tank before being picked up.","“Welcome... to the real world.” In the aircraft, Morpheus and the others wore crude sweaters, looking like refugees from a disaster. He looked totally different from his previous image, where he wore a pair of sunglasses and a black coat.","Inside the aircraft were antique-looking machines.","The audience glanced around the real world and watched the people in the aircraft help Neo recover his bodily functions. The audience looked alarmed and shocked when they saw the plug holes all over Neo’s body.","They felt fearful about the unknown and dreaded the truth at the same time.","They had vague yet strong anticipation, waiting for the people in the movie to explain the scenes they had seen.","What is truth?","What is real?","They watched the recovered Neo enter the previous world again. With a tube connecting the plug in the back of his head, he relaxed and then found that he was suddenly inside a pure white world.","A virtual reality world!","“Right now we’re inside a computer program??!”","“Is it really so hard to believe?” In the movie, Morpheus explained, “What is real? How do you define real? If you’re talking about what you can feel, what you can smell, what you can taste and see, then real is simply electrical signals interpreted by your brain.”","“This is the world that you know.”","All the cultivators watched their conversation dumbfoundedly.","Is this the so-called real?!","Is it just signals interpreted by the body?","It was ridiculously simple, but no one could laugh at this moment.","I’m surprised that it’s so easy to turn fantasy into reality!","The virtual reality world in the movie was horrifying to them. The so-called signals could completely keep people’s awareness in the virtual reality world.","Perhaps in their eyes, a human body was no different from an advanced and complicated spiritual artifact.","The conversation between the two continued.","“This is the world as it was at the end of the twentieth century.” Morpheus turned on the TV which showed the scenes of their former world.","“It exists now only as part of a neural-interactive simulation that we call the Matrix.”","“We have only bits and pieces of information but what we know for certain is that at some point in the early twenty-first century, all of mankind was united in celebration. We marveled at our own magnificence as we gave birth to AI.”","“A singular consciousness that spawned an entire race of machines.”","“AI?” Many cultivators from Yuanyang City looked puzzled.","“AI?! Artificial intelligence?” Some people saw such a thing in Resident Evil. “Red Queen?”","“Red Queen? What’s that?” Zong Wu asked curiously, “What is artificial intelligence?”","Obviously, the customers in the new shop couldn’t understand this term.","However, the customers from the old shops were different since they had encountered this world in the movie ‘Resident Evil’ and the game ‘Grand Theft Auto 5’.","“People who don’t understand AI can go and watch the movie ‘Resident Evil’,” Lan Mo said, “It is an intelligence created by humans; it is something like artifact spirits.”","The calculation ability beyond humans’ imagination and the intelligence controlling everything like a shadow were still nightmarish for many players of Resident Evil."]},{"number":459,"title":"Chapter 459 - Almost Swayed My Faith in Dao","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“We don’t know who struck first, us or them.” In the movie, Morpheus continued to explain, “But we know that it was us that scorched the sky. At the time they were dependent on solar power and it was believed that they would be unable to survive without an energy source as abundant as the sun. Throughout human history, we have been dependent on machines to survive. Fate, it seems, is not without a sense of irony.”","“The human body generates more bio-electricity than a 120-volt battery and over 25,000 BTUs of body heat. Combined with a form of fusion, the machines have found all the energy they would ever need. There are fields, endless fields, where human beings are no longer born. We are grown.”","From the TV in the scene, everyone saw a large field that seemed to be used for farming, and there were huge octopus-like machines that were growing babies in red containers as if they were growing in wombs.","This was the horrifying and accurate production process of humans by the machines.","This was the truth that the audience had been looking for.","This was the bioenergy that the machines invented.","The movie presented to the audience endless machine fields and mountain-like human growing machines that had intelligence.","These scenes swept over the mind of the audience like surging waves in a tsunami.","The truth was so horrifying!","Some people had remained calm before this scene, but now even the grandmasters with extremely high cultivation strengths looked scared and twisted.","Soon, a group of girls shrieked in fear.","Perhaps nothing in the world was more shocking than these scenes for them.","Fortunately, they watched it on the TV, and they were separated from the scenes by the TV screen.","Despite this, the big white deer still dropped to the ground, covering its eyes with hooves.","Occasionally, it peeked from between its hooves, looking curious and scared at the same time.","“Does it mean...” Tang Yu said in shock, “They put intelligence into the machines that they made, and then they were enslaved by these machines?!”","“The machines created a virtual reality world to enslave humans?” It was like the cultivators giving their spiritual artifacts intelligence, and the latter enslaved the cultivators.","However, these ‘spiritual artifacts’ were much more advanced than their spiritual treasures born with spirituality.","The intelligence that they possessed was so horrifying that they could create a whole virtual reality world.","In other words, the humans used the knowledge named ‘technology’ to create a ‘god’. Even if it wasn’t a god, it was a demi-god.","At this moment, this movie had brought them a totally different sensation.","Some people such as Mo Xian were even worried if they were living in a virtual reality world but were sleeping in high-tech tanks in reality as the people shown in the movie.","Of course, this wasn’t possible.","“What will happen then?!”","The people who had followed the trend to watch the movie and weren’t that interested were now completely enthralled by it!","It wasn’t just novel! It was beyond that!","It ventured into the conversation of humanity and worldviews!","It was just a story? Even if it were just a story, it showed them a perspective that they had never heard or imagined before!","Even if they couldn’t obtain any benefits from this costly movie, they would all continue watching it at this point.","It is superb! Many people exclaimed silently.","It is amazing!","At this moment, most people hadn’t recovered from the shock that the previous scenes gave them.","When the characters came to the real world, the plot began to settle down a bit.","Gradually, some weird ideas started to grow in their minds.","The people in the movie live in a virtual reality world and thought that it is the real world. What about us?!","What about our world?!","These thoughts washed over their minds.","They felt as if their whole worldviews were about to collapse.","“Will we one day find ourselves lying in such things?!” Mo Xian asked fearfully.","Bedlam broke out after she said that.","The people around her began to talk animatedly among themselves.","We have lived many years and take the reincarnations and immortal ascendance as laws of nature that have existed as long as time itself. If one day, all these prove to be lies...","What if our physical bodies are stored at some unknown places while our minds lived in a virtual reality world, just as Neo did.","Only thinking about it sent chills down their spines and scared them.","After all, they didn’t know anything. They were living in the mortal world; no one could say that it was impossible.","At these thoughts, some cultivators felt weak in their legs.","What if they found that they had been living in a dream after cultivating for hundreds of years?","“Master, pinch me so that I will know if I’m dreaming.” Fenghua and Yuexin looked fearful.","“Pooh! If it’s really a dream, it’s no use pinching you!” Su Tianji said morosely.","“How come you turned into humans in the dream while I am a deer! It’s not fair!” A big white deer yelled its complaint. Obviously, its concern seemed to be different from the others.","“Um... This...”","“...”","Mo Xian: “...”","Mr. Fang put his hand on his forehead.","“Stay strong and don’t get swayed by external things!” Gu Tingyun inhaled deeply, even though he had been doubtful for one second as well.","However, as a grandmaster, his mind and fortitude were much stronger than these small and weak cultivators’.","“Let’s continue with the movie!” Nalan Hongwu said, “Obviously, their world is different from ours. Don’t dwell on the impossible, Little Girls.”","“It’s just a movie, right?” Song Qingfeng snapped back to his senses. “I wish that I could one day wake up as Li Xiaoyao.”","After all, the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 1 began with a dream.","Despite his casual words, he was still a bit doubtful and spooked out.","“Right!” Su Tianji rolled her eyes at Mr. Fang. “It almost swayed my faith in Dao.”","Mr. Fang didn’t know what to say for a second. “It’s not my fault that you know so little about the world.”","“...”","People instinctively avoided harm and pursued benefits. Although some people might get a horrifying idea at some point, they would discard it as a story if they didn’t want it to be true. Besides, this was only a story, a movie, wasn’t it?”","However, this movie still shocked the viewers so much that they began to doubt the truth of their lives.","As for the young people, they didn’t dare to dwell on this thought.","It was natural to think about the origin of the world and life, but the story depicted in the movie was scary.","Perhaps many people were comforting themselves that it was just a movie.","Although this movie spawned doubt in their minds about life itself, they were still avidly curious to see what would happen next in the story."]},{"number":460,"title":"Chapter 460 - Dumb or Not?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","As time went on, the audience began to understand the storyline of the movie. When the Matrix was born, there was a person, a hacker, who could change the Matrix at his will.","In Zion, the last human city, there were a few people who had been born in the Matrix, and they were all released by this hacker.","After his death, the oracle prophesied that he would return and lead humans out of the Matrix to regain freedom.","The following plot was simple. Neo recovered his strength and got familiar with the programs in the Matrix while strengthening himself with it being the foundation.","Obviously, the rules in the Matrix were different from those in the real world. The agents could borrow any human body in the Matrix and take full use of the rules in the Matrix. In the Matrix, they were god-like existences.","Unkillable, able to change into anybody, could bend rules and control time; they could do anything unimaginable to humans.","Humans entering the Matrix would die if they encountered the agents. Obviously, it was difficult to free humankind.","However, they must enter the Matrix to save their minds first since only rescuing the physical bodies was a meaningless job as the bodies were like corpses without consciousness.","By now, the audience began to have a general idea of the worldview expressed in the movie. For the cultivators and warriors, the humans in this movie had gone off track with their technological advancements. These humans put all their strength and energy into developing spiritual artifacts instead of improving their own bodies. In the world shown in the movie, the humans created many spiritual artifacts with extremely high intelligence, which eventually sent humans themselves into Hell.","Now, this was the hackers’ path to redemption.","This wasn’t an ordinary movie discussing hackers. It was about the humans’ revolution at the end of the world.","The technology level in the movie was too high for the cultivators to reach with their current research level, but it didn’t stop them from understanding this system.","For most of them, they just watched it as an ordinary movie since not all of them studied spiritual artifacts.","However, this movie shocked them more than anything else, and they watched from different lenses.","The world shown in the movie was eye-opening! Although the viewers knew that anything could happen in the world, this story still went beyond everyone’s imagination!","Most of them watched the movie with wide-open eyes and mouths from the beginning to the end.","By now, the people in the movie believed that they had found ‘The One’...","They believed that it was time to fight back.","Obviously, this attack was a total failure. Perhaps it would have been fine if no accidents happened. To their surprise, they had a traitor among them.","The traitor was a person who was tired of struggling in fear each day in the end of the world; this person wanted to return to the Matrix as an ignorant ordinary person.","After all, ignorance was a blessing.","Meanwhile, it seemed that Neo wasn’t ‘The One’, at least not yet.","Maybe he had the potential to become ‘The One’, but he was far from that right now. The Matrix changed the program and trapped everyone inside.","Death in the Matrix meant death in the real world, and many people died in this battle. Except for Neo and the heroine, no one escaped from the Matrix. Even their leader, Morpheus, was trapped inside while he tried to slow down the agents.","This system version of the movie was different from the original version.","In the original version, people would instantly die if they were unplugged when their awareness was still inside the Matrix.","However, in the system version, the people’s awareness would slowly disappear in the Matrix while their physical bodies would suffer brain death.","Seeing the traitor unplug several people and causing them brain death, Mo Xian and other faint-hearted girls were scared.","Immediately, they put down their virtual reality headset and found that they could still go back. Then, they reconnected again.","Then, they disconnected and connected again and again several times. As a result, some girls beside Mr. Fang kept disappearing and appearing.","Everyone gaped at what they were doing, and they were speechless.","Mr. Fang was exasperated. “Damn it. Are you dumb or not!”","“...”","“Does it mean that my feeling of realness in this world is the result of a similar virtual reality technology?!” While watching the movie, Li Haoran appraised his senses.","“Impossible!” The Xichi Spiritual Master said, “My vital soul can leave my body already, and the false feelings of the physical body can’t fool me!”","Even if she were trapped inside a fantasy array, she still couldn’t tell the subtle difference between the real and the fake.","Just like when Wu Zong was trapped in the fantasy array in a celestial relic, he also knew that he was inside a fantasy array.","“Even Neo, who is ‘The One’, can’t distinguish the difference, right? I’m afraid that it isn’t only a reaction of the physical body.”","However, after awakening, Neo never doubted that the world inside the Matrix was fake, and he still had a subtle feeling of dreaming even though he was clearly awake.","When they watched the great battle between Fei Peng and Chong Lou, everyone including Gu Tingyun who had much more life experience and higher cultivation strength had thought it was real.","They didn’t see that it was fake and virtual reality.","What was more was that the higher-level cultivators could leave a trace of their awareness in the real world to keep watching the surroundings while playing the game; it felt the same as when they released a streak of their vital soul into a mystic realm to explore while their physical bodies remained outside.","“Virtual reality is supposed to be like this,” Lan Mo speculated, “But the things in the shop must be different. If it is the same thing as in the movie...”","“We would have died many times.”","In the virtual reality world in the Matrix, the death of awareness meant the death of the physical body. If the games in the shop had the same mechanism as the movie, the people here would have died dozens or hundreds of times by now. After all, each of them had died many times in the games.","“...” The people instantly fell silent.","“Watch the movie... continue watching the movie!” They immediately changed the topic.","At this moment, all of them had witnessed the horrifying abilities of the agents who could change from any people in this world and possessed unimaginable strength.","No attacks were effective on them. Even Morpheus, the hacker who had elevated his abilities beyond the limit of ordinary people in this digital world, could do nothing to the agent in front of them named Smith.","“How can he be so strong?!” Song Qingfeng exclaimed in astonishment, “He feels nothing just standing there while taking the beating?!”","There wasn’t even a scratch on his skin.","After accepting everything when they reached and comprehended the horrifying truth, they felt a thrill and enjoyment as they watched the movie.","The combat style of the hackers in the movie went beyond the imagination of the audience."]},{"number":461,"title":"Chapter 461 - Another Battle Between Immortals?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Su Tianji stared at the two people intently. “This is... a battle between immortals. They are using the laws of nature that governs the whole world, eh?”","“Wow! They are so powerful!” While biting into a spiritual fruit grown in Qzone, Jiang Xiaoyue muffled.","“Awesome!”","Now, it was time for Neo to decide if he should give up on Morpheus and escape or return to the virtual reality world to rescue him.","Of course, the main character Neo chose the latter.","The most thrilling moment came.","When the two walked in wearing black coats and high boots with a box of weapons in hands, one must admit that humans sometimes shared the concepts of beauty.","Besides, many viewers had played some modern games and thus were used to this style of dressing.","“Dashing!”","“Awesome!”","In fact, this style of dress was closer to the viewers’ with long coats, long pants, and high boots; the only difference was the materials of the attire which made them look strange to the viewers.","Song Qingfeng looked down at his Kyo Kusanagi costume, wondering if he should change his cosplay tomorrow.","The battle of the two hackers in the virtual reality world was obviously different from those in the real world. They could speed up, dodge bullets, and use all kinds of close-range combat techniques. The audience exclaimed in awe when they watched the hackers’ accurate aiming and the wipeout of the well-equipped police officers working under the agents; all those operations were not human-like!","Lin Shao exclaimed, “It’s f*cking awesome!”","Mo Xian was dumbfounded as well. “Sir, can we learn this?”","“If we can be as awesome as this while doing jobs in Grand Theft Auto 5...”","While his face twitched, Mr. Fang remembered that the online mode of the game had been full of such ‘immortals’ before he traveled through space and time.","Anyway, the scenes in the movie were indeed thrilling. Neo ran through the gunfire while dodging and firing with all kinds of fancy moves; the enemies’ bullets couldn’t even touch his clothes.","When the gunshots ceased, all were dead except Neo and the heroine.","Neo had been growing and could use an ordinary pistol to break steel.","When they got up to the roof to take the helicopter, an agent came after them.","“The way he dodged the bullet is insane!” At this moment, the audience stood on the roof and watched Neo fire several strengthened bullets in the blink of an eye.","The agent before him was so fast that his movements left a series of afterimages. Without moving his feet, he had dodged all the bullets!","Obviously, Neo was learning this method as well. Everyone looked from Neo’s perspective and saw that everything around him slowed down.","Even the strengthened bullets shot by the agents looked extremely slow, and they could even see the trajectories of the bullets with their eyes.","However, in the eyes of the ordinary people, these bullets were too fast to detect and see with their eyes.","This was the famous Bullet Time.","“Awesome!”","“Invincible!”","The scene was indeed cool when Neo in the black windbreaker battled with the expressionless agent in the black suit and sunglasses while the extremely fast bullets shot past them as if it were in slow motion.","The young people in the audience exclaimed in astonishment.","After all, even warriors with high cultivation strength didn’t dare to dodge bullets by swaying their bodies without moving their feet. Besides, the agent’s bullets were so fast and powerful that they went beyond the limit set by the laws of nature.","With combined forces, the two hackers finally killed one agent. However, they had just killed the police officer whose body had been taken by the agent, and the agent had just returned to where he had come from.","This kind of existence obviously couldn’t be killed.","“How can they fire without aiming?!”","The two hackers came into the room where Morpheus was imprisoned. Among the exclamations of the audience, Smith fired with an ordinary pistol, but each bullet shot through the wall without losing any momentum. While Morpheus fled with great speed, the agent shot at him through a thick wall and wounded him in the leg.","“It is indeed a battle between immortals...”","“Oh my goodness, if I had this power when I played Counter Strike, I would have gotten first place,” Su Tianji said.","Mr. Fang’s face turned dark again.","“Both parties are using the power of laws...” Gu Tingyun narrowed his eyes.","“Guns can be used this way?” Ning Bi’s eyelids twitched.","It looked to be a battle of modern weapons, but in fact, it went beyond the realm of weapons.","In the eyes of the cultivators, it was a battle of ‘laws’!","“Two shots from the pistol took down the helicopter?!” Many people who had played with guns knew the power of ordinary handguns. Then, they saw Smith shoot down Neo’s helicopter with two shots.","Under this situation, they could only run. They would be safe if they could find the exit point and return to the real world.","But unfortunately, when Morpheus and the heroine Trinity fled to the telephone booth, the beggar beside it suddenly turned into an agent who then destroyed the telephone booth. The two parties could only engage in the final battle.","This was the climax of this movie.","Although both people used the most ordinary combat techniques, the horrifying force and speed of each strike were dizzying to look.","At last they came into the subway station, and they unleashed all their power. In the eyes of the cultivators and warriors with low-level cultivation strength, it was a fist-to-fist combat of techniques.","However, from the perspective of the grandmasters who had begun to understand the laws of nature, they could tell that this was a high-level battle of the comprehension of laws.","The fighters used their understanding of the laws of this world in their attacks and defenses; they used a series of unimaginable moves.","For these cultivators, this was a soul-stirring high-level battle.","“How come this guy can’t be killed?!” Li Lanruo, Mu Qing, and other girls from the Heavenly Academy yelled in astonishment.","Regardless of how they fought, they remained intact.","The audience watched the battle standing in the subway station. The fighters’ fists and feet moved so fast that they were just blurry shadows to ordinary people; others couldn’t see them clearly.","When the subway train ran over Agent Smith, everyone thought that he was finally dead. However, when the train stopped, one of the passengers in the train changed into Smith and walked out intact.","“So powerful!”","It was more terrifying than being unkillable. Even demons and gods needed time to gather their body parts after being shattered.","The hackers had no other options but to run.","This part was extremely thrilling since the agents seemed to be everywhere. Wherever the hackers went, the humans around them would turn into agents.","“My goodness?!” Many girls shrieked, hugging their heads together.","“How can they deal with these agents?!”"]},{"number":462,"title":"Chapter 462 - The World based On Digits","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“This virtual reality world was created by the Matrix,” Gu Tingyun analyzed, “These agents are executors of the Matrix and are equipped with all kinds of abilities by using the laws. They are almost invincible.”","“Then, how can they be dealt with?”","“No one can deal with this kind of power,” Song Qingfeng said with his eyes glued to the scene before him.","At this moment, Smith caught up with Neo and fired two shots at his vital spot!","Then, several more shots hit him.","In the real world, Neo’s electrocardiography became a flat line.","It meant that he was dead since his awareness in the virtual reality world was scattering.","If his awareness was eliminated, the so-called ‘The One’ would vanish completely.","Obviously, ‘The One’ wasn’t invincible. Otherwise, the first ‘The One’ who had begun the revolution and led them wouldn’t have died.","However, miracles did sometimes happen in this world.","After all, he was a person who had abilities no ordinary people had.","“Ahh!” Some people in the audience suddenly shrieked.","“He’s not dead!” Yue Yan pointed forward and exclaimed.","“F*ck?!” Song Qingfeng widened his eyes.","“Coming back to life?!” Nalan Hongwu stared at the scene before him as well.","“Obviously, this kid has gained a total understanding of the laws in the world.” A big demon floated in mid-air and said, “It’s nothing for him to come back to life.”","Tang Yu said, “The set of laws are virtual; there is nothing strange, right?”","“The laws are virtual?” Gu Tingyun stroked his beard, looking thoughtful. He pointed at the scene before them and said, “This is a complete and real world!”","Even though it was virtual reality.","At this moment, the three agents found Neo coming back to life. They turned around and fired several shots.","However, instead of dodging the bullets, Neo made all the bullets hover before him. It wasn’t a pause of time since the bullets behind the hovering bullets were still moving forward.","It seemed as if the dynamic scene suddenly turned into a static scene.","Then, the camera changed to Neo’s perspective.","The audience saw everything before them, including the ceiling, walls, ground, and even the three agents, had turned into rows of flowing data.","Ruan Ning gasped, “Is this the basic form of this virtual reality world?!”","Su Tianji exclaimed, “Is this virtual reality world made up of these numbers and digits?”","The cultivators from Half City were a little scared by this scene. “It is unimaginable!”","Everyone knew that the real world was made up of Yin Essence and Yang Essence.","But they had never imagined that digits could also form a world!","Also, the world looked so real!","Then, they saw Neo block his rivals’ attacks as if they were child’s play. He first blocked with his hands casually, and then he blocked the attacks with one hand without sparing a glance at his opponents. They were obviously no longer at the same level of strength.","At this moment, the agents could no longer be called ‘invincible’.","Lan Mo laughed and said, “I understand it! They use the lightning energy to show and form digits, and they in turn use digits to form patterns and words, which eventually form a complete world.”","As a member of Wuwei Daoist Alliance, he obviously was quite familiar with these ‘electrical’ spiritual artifacts.","It wasn’t like they never studied these things.","“This world is completely made up of digits and can only be accessed by consciousness and awareness.”","“This story depicts an idea beyond one’s imagination,” Gu Tingyu said with a sigh of appreciation, “It’s unthinkable!”","Tang Yu shook his head and said, “Unfortunately, the virtual reality world can never be real.”","Li Haoran said in reminiscence, “It seems that the intelligence of Red Queen is also made up of numbers and digits.”","“I wonder... if the intelligence of these machines is also made up of digits.”","All the people stared at him in astonishment.","After all, except the horrifying supreme treasures which had existed for many years, most of the spiritual artifacts with spirits only had child-level intelligence.","“You could use such digits to create high-level intelligence?!”","At this point, the movie was coming to an end with ‘The One’ recovering his power and abilities. As for the agents, they were naturally not his matches.","After Neo rewrote the programs, the unkillable abilities of the agents became a joke; Smith exploded into digital debris.","The other two agents instantly fled.","“Hahahaha! Awesome!”","“This main character is unrivaled!”","“So dashing!”","“Neo absolutely has the power to save the world. He’s so powerful!”","Song Qingfeng said, “I must learn his skill of dodging bullets. I’ll dodge bullets this way next time.”","Lin Shao added, “Then, you will become a sieve, Young Master Song.”","...","Long after the movie came to an end, the audience was still lingering in this wondrous world.","It was hard to believe that there were such humans living in such a world depicted in the movie.","They were amazed by this story and the development of the plot.","The most impressive parts were when Neo woke up from the virtual reality world and the last grand battle.","For the young cultivators and warriors, the last scene, in which Neo paused all the bullets and fought the agent with one hand, was super dashing; they were amazed by the unthinkable power and speed that Neo showed.","The grandmasters among the cultivators and warriors were deep in thought after watching the movie.","They had seen worlds that were artificially created. In fact, the mystical realms in the relics were a kind of small world.","However, the world depicted in the movie was complete with everything from the real world.","Also, the basic structure of this world was made up of rows of digits.","This was indeed hard to imagine.","The moment that the movie ended, the three shops instantly got loud with discussions.","With their current level of knowledge, even the Wuwei Daoist Alliance could do nothing but borrow some basic ideas from this advanced technology.","The AI and the Matrix shown in the movie were too advanced for them to study; it wasn’t even realistic.","They might have a small chance if they understood the Red Queen in Resident Evil.","Anyway, they had obtained a deep understanding of the horrifying power of AI.","For grand cultivators and warriors, they got a better understanding of laws, and that was the key benefit of the movie. After all, the movie had demonstrated the law with a virtual reality world and showed the structure of this world to all the viewers.","It was quite beneficial to those people who either had reached this realm or would reach this realm in the future.","They were not supposed to access the knowledge of building and creating small worlds like the mystical realm in the relics. But now, they began to understand some secrets about them."]},{"number":463,"title":"Chapter 463 - Test the Theory","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“This movie is superb!” In the Half City Shop, a big quilt yelled in mid-air. “If I construct something with the laws that I know this way, I can change that world however I want, eh? Hahahaha! Anyone who enters the area built with my laws will die for sure!”","The laughter suddenly stopped when it remembered that it didn’t even have spiritual essence; how could it create a world?!","It was deflated.","“Gegege... Thank you!” A demonic woman with brown hair and green eyes covered her smirk with her hand. “Old demon, your idea is worth a try!”","“You can’t try it! It’s my idea!”","“This idea... sounds good!” Unbound King who had great hearing overheard them.","In the past, few people had the opportunity to deal with such things. But now, after reading the Heavenly Book and watching all kinds of battles between immortals and demons, many grand cultivators and warriors were gradually getting contact with this new realm.","Of course, for most of them, they only got a glimpse of it.","“This idea is indeed good!” Shui Xianyun got close and joined the conversation.","“Ahhh! None of you can try it! It’s my invention!”","“Shut up! If you yell again, I’ll deal with you as a trouble maker!” Ruan Ning gave it a hard look.","“...” It instantly shut up.","– Meanwhile, in the Yuanyang City Shop –","The cultivators and warriors put down their virtual reality headsets one after another.","No matter if they were grand cultivators or ordinary disciples, none of them could remain calm.","“Senior sister.”","Yue Bai felt someone tugging at her clothes. She turned and saw Mu Qing with an uneasy expression on her face.","“I suspect that it’s our consciousness that’s sitting here while our physical bodies...” she spoke haltingly, “After all, at the beginning of the movie, Neo didn’t know that he was living in the virtual reality world.”","“I have the same suspicion!” Jiang Xiaoyue brought her small arms together before her chest and mumbled, “We might be living in a virtual reality world. I’m so awesome, so I must be ‘The One’! We’ll save humankind together!”","It was perfect.","“Nonsense! I’m ‘The One’!” Mu Qing complained.","“I want to be The One too.” The big white deer said with its head lowered.","Jiang Xiaoyue said, “Whoever has the greatest power will be ‘The One’!”","Sitting beside Jiang Xiaoyue, Mr. Fang pinched her cheek with a dark expression. “I think you just want to be ‘The One’.”","The loli copied Neo in the movie and gave him a middle finger in disdain.","“Big Brother, what do you think?!”","Jiang Xuan didn’t hear her since he had started watching the movie for the second time.","“...”","Yue Bai said, “Anyway, their weapons are impressive. I wonder where we can get them...”","The other disciples from the Heavenly Academy were also talking about the weapons.","“Brother Tang,” Wang Xie said, “The Tang Family is famous for making machines and spiritual artifacts. I wonder if you can make copies of the weapons in the movie.”","“Right! Young Master Tang!” Xu Chengfeng, a direct descendant of the Xu Family with excellent talent, was quite close to the geniuses from these ancient families. When he put down his virtual reality headset, the first thought that he had was the Tang Family.","A burly man also came over; he was Lei Ge of the Lei Family. “Young Master Tang... Your Tang Family...”","Before he could finish, he heard shrieks beside him.","“Are these... pistols?!”","Mu Qing stared at the two pistols in Jiang Xiaoyue’s hands.","The antique-looking guns had patterns engraved on the surface; they were copies of Dante’s handguns.","“Humph!”","“Wow! Junior Sister Xiaoyue!” Mu Qing exclaimed, “Can you fire these guns?”","“Yes.” Li Lanruo had watch Jiang Xiaoyue deal with a group of cultivators with these guns.","These guns might not be able to deal with strong cultivators such as Lei Ge and Xu Chengfeng, but they were more than enough to deal with cultivators such as Du Zhuzi who were weaker. They consumed little spiritual essence and had great power.","“Of course.” After replying, Jiang Xiaoyue walked out of the shop and fired two shots.","Glancing at the two bullet holes with smoke in the ground, Wang Xie looked toward Tang Yu standing beside him.","“We didn’t make those!” Tang Yu said, “It seems that the shop owner doesn’t only have cars but guns as well?”","The production of guns was a partnership between Mr. Fang, the Wuwei Daoist Alliance, and the people who won prizes in the Counter Strike Competition. After many breakthroughs that they made in technology, they had long passed the difficult stage in which they couldn’t even mimic an ordinary pistol.","Jiang Xiaoyue injected some spiritual essence into the guns, and blue light instantly engulfed them.","“Xiaoyue, you’re awesome!” Mu Qing had stars in her eyes.","“Where did you get the guns?!” People like Xu Chengfeng and Lei Ge stared at the guns with widened eyes.","After firing, Jiang Xiaoyue met Mr. Fang’s gaze and gave him a victory hand with some smugness.","Mr. Fang’s face turned dark. “Don’t ruin the ground before my shop!”","“Ugh...”","These weapons looked ordinary, but when Smith and Neo used them, they looked unrivaled!","The bullets were fast, convenient, powerful; they could pierce through walls and be used from a long distance.","Of course, in the real world, it was almost impossible to upgrade the bullets at will casually.","Perhaps the big demon in Half City had the ability to mimic some parts of such power, but it didn’t even have any spiritual essence in its body right now.","While almost none of the cultivators in the Deserted Sea Realm could reach the realm of laws, the cultivators in the Spiritual State were different.","Their abilities and accumulations in this aspect were greater than those people in the Deserted Sea Realm.","The laws were the rules that all the things in the world had to follow and operate by. In this world, the laws and the rules were the same thing.","They just had different names in different places.","Almost each of the families in the Spiritual State obtained and mastered more than one law, which they had gotten either through inheritance or chance since they had been around for a long time.","Some of the laws were stored in artifacts; some were supreme spiritual items born with the power of laws; some were artifact spirits that had been inherited from the beginning of time for ages. The laws were the inheritances that enabled the ancient families to prosper for many, many years.","Other than these ancient families, a few extremely powerful forces and cultivators had also reached the realm of laws and had saved and passed down their understanding to their descendants.","Therefore, they could mimic some of the power shown in the movie. For example, Gu Tingyun’s understanding of wind had reached the realm of laws. If he attached it to a bullet, most of the defenses in the world could be treated as not there before the bullet.","Gu Tingyun walked out the door with a benign smile. “Little girl of the Jiang Family, can I borrow your gun for a while?”","“Master?” Wang Xie looked at Gu Tingyun in bafflement.","“After watching the Matrix, I have obtained some inspiration,” Gu Tingyun said, “Now, I need a gun to test my theory.”","“Okay.” Jiang Xiaoyue had no choice but hand a pistol to him since he was the Old Academy Master.","While gripping the gun, Gu Tingyun closed his eyes and took some time to prepare.","All the people gazed at him.","They held their breaths, not wanting to miss any details.","Gu Tingyun slowly raised the gun.","In the next moment, a voice floated out from the shop. “You’ll be dealt with as a trouble maker if you break the ground before the shop.”","The old man looked as if he had just swallowed a dead fly. If possible, he would have beaten Mr. Fang to death."]},{"number":464,"title":"Chapter 464 - The Spiritual State and the Deserted Sea Realm","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","The Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3 and the Matrix, the newly-released game and movie, became the hottest topics among the customers.","To understand what AI, artificial intelligence, was, the cultivators and warriors of Yuanyang City returned to their seats. After watching the Matrix, most of them felt unsatisfied.","Subconsciously, they began to look for something with a similar theme.","Lei Ge asked, “Does anyone know if the shop has similar movies?”","With half of her time working as an employee of the shop, Li Lanruo was quite familiar with the shop’s movies and games. “From what I know, Resident Evil has a similar theme.”","“Brother Wang, should we watch the Resident Evil?” Tang Yu asked.","While some people planned to watch the Matrix again, others tried to find similar movies to watch.","After talking with some customers from the Jiuhua City Shop and Half City Shop, they began to have a general idea about the categories of the strange movies and games in the shop. The category of sci-fi included the games and movies such as ‘The Matrix’ in which people used mechanic spiritual artifacts while their own strengths were not great. The category of Xianxia included the games and movies such as the Legend of the Sword and Fairy, and Jade Dynasty. As for the category of magic fantasy, they could only experience it through the movie Harry Potter since they couldn’t meet the demons and evils in Devil May Cry 3 and Lords of Hell in Diablo 2 at the moment.","“Do you guys want to watch Resident Evil together?” Tang Yu copied the shop owner’s tone and asked, “Come on! The tour bus of Resident Evil 1 is about to embark!”","“Young Master Tang, I’ll go!”","“Count me in!”","“Me too!”","Wang Xie asked in bafflement, “Junior Brother Tang, don’t you want to play the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3?”","“It’s not that I don’t want to play,” Tang Yu said, “I’m still waiting for the guide. Someone named New Snow in the Legend of the Sword and Fairy Forum posted a guide of the game, and I gained great progress in the game following her tips! Unfortunately, the guide stops at the Immortal Realm, and I’m waiting for her to update the guide!”","“Is she a cultivator from the Deserted Sea Realm?” Xu Chengfeng asked.","“Right,” Tang Yu said, “It’s said that the main shop is over there.”","“Young Master Tang.” Xu Chengfeng glanced around before lowering his voice. “Have you heard about the tales about the Deserted Sea Realm?”","“What tales?” Tang Yu shook his head and said, “I hadn’t heard of the Deserted Sea Realm until I came into this shop. It’s said that that place is very remote and has scarce spiritual essence, separated from us by a...um... heavenly barriers. Anyway, it’s super inconvenient to get there.”","“Deserted Sea Realm?” Lei Ge asked curiously on the side, “Isn’t it the name for the place with little spiritual essence beyond the Heavenly Abyss Sea?”","Tang Yu said, “Young Master Xu’s family is famous for having large volumes of ancient scrolls and documents. Do you have more information about this place?”","Xu Chengfeng said, “I read about it in a fragment of a scroll in my family. I don’t know if the record is true or not. Don’t you see any records about it your Tang Family?”","“Who knows?” After all, no one would have cared about the desolate deserted area before they came into the shop.","But now, Tang Yu and others’ interest was piqued since they had talked with people from the Deserted Sea Realm about the Legend of Sword and Fairy in the group chat and the guide of fighting bosses in the forum.","Xu Chengfeng said, “The record said that that place is like a huge prison, stating that it’s a place for prisoners and is thus ominous’.”","“A place for prisoners and is thus ominous?” Hearing their conversation about the Deserted Sea Realm, Wang Xie who was listening on the side looked puzzled.","“The ancient scrolls said that thousands of years ago when the strength of the heavenly barrier weakened, the Zixiao Spiritual Master had traveled there and brought back a group of cultivators from the Deserted Sea Realm...”","“Really?” Tang Yu asked, “Then, why haven’t we heard of it before?”","“I have no idea. After the Zixiao Spiritual Master passed away, no one heard of them anymore.”","Meanwhile, at the shore of Heavenly Abyss Sea, which was north to the Heavenly Academy.","It was late in the night; ocean breezes brushed over the beach, and faint sounds of rolling waves could be vaguely heard in the distance.","The people in the small town were sound asleep.","Across the ocean to the north of Heavenly Abyss Ocean was the Deserted Sea Realm.","The Deserted Sea Realm was called a sea realm since most of the place was covered by seas and oceans.","Looking into the distance from the beach, one could see nothing but dark ocean. Even moonlight and starlight were swallowed by this darkness.","In the depths of the ocean, there seemed to be an ugly fierce ghost guarding the place.","On the watch tower, the soldiers woke up from their doze and stared into the distance.","No one knew what they were watching for; they had done it since the ancient times.","...","“Yawn...!” It was late in the night. Fang Qi yawned heavily while the customers left the shop in twos and threes.","“Junior Brother Tang?” Curious, Wang Xie looked at Tang Yu who had just walked out of the shop. “How come you’re so late today?”","“Brother Wang, you’re late too.” Tang Yu chuckled.","With a scroll in his hand, Wang Xie rubbed his eyes. “I read the official novel of Diablo 2 in the shop for a whole day. I borrowed this scroll from Junior Sister Xiaoyue to read back at my place... The demonic gods in this story are unthinkable! I recommend you read it, Junior Brother Tang.”","“Well... I’m afraid that I don’t have time for it lately.” Tang Yu stretched and said, “Today, I bought the blueprint of a basic gun structure; I won’t be able to sleep well until I can figure it out.”","“Hahahaha!” Wang Xie said while laughing, “I know the Tang Family excels in machines and mechanisms. Are you... interested in guns?”","“I’m fascinated by guns after watching the Matrix,” Tang Yu said with a chuckle, “Now after watching Resident Evil, I found that these weapons are quite exquisite.”","“What do they call these weapons...” Tang Yu said, “Art! Yes! They’re called art!”","...","“Castellan Zong, you’re in a bad mood today?” Elder Yu in a grey-white robe said with a chuckle.","The tall Castellan of Yuanyang City said, “I thought there were only a few places with high-level Martial Dao in the world. However, I saw a post in the forum talking about Martial Dao which inspired me greatly!”","Elder Yu asked curiously, “Isn’t it a good thing?”","“Unfortunately, I had just joined that person’s group chat in QQ and chatted for a little while when my computer time was up...”","He stomped his foot and said, “How come I can’t chat with people freely?! There are so many restrictions!”","“It’s said the Little Princess Jiang has a communication jade which can connect with QQ...” Elder Yu said while stroking his beard.","“Tomorrow, I’ll borrow it and try logging into my QQ account,” Zong Wu complained, “How come our communication jades are so lame that they are even worse than those in the Deserted Sea Realm!”","...","“Little Xin’er, close the shop!”","“Okay! Boss!”","Fang Qi suddenly had the feeling that a pair of eyes were staring at the shop from the depths of the darkness outside. He wasn’t sure if it was an illusion.","He raised his head and looked out, but he saw nothing."]},{"number":465,"title":"Chapter 465 - An Idea Inspired by The Matrix","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Gu Tingyun, an old man who had planned to pass his last years with leisure, got up each morning to drink morning dew and consume the morning sunshine before cultivating his technique for one cycle. Then, he would stare at the clouds coming up from the valley.","Behind the green pine tree on the edge of the cliff was an elegant cottage; on the stone table before the cottage was a pot of tea. It was the life of a hermit.","But now...","Standing in the mist while holding an ancient sword in his hand, he formed a sword spell with one hand and chanted, “Sword control technique! Up!”","It was silent.","“Sword control technique! Up!”","The sword tip lightly shivered.","“Is it because I didn’t put enough spiritual essence in it?”","He gathered more spiritual essence. “Up!”","A sharp sword energy shot into the sky.","Wang Xie who had just come to the door was startled.","It was done!","Stroking his silver beard, Gu Tingyun laughed and said, “What do you think of my sword control technique?”","“Unrivaled! Absolutely...”","Boom!","The cottage collapsed, the old pine tree fell, and even the pot of newly-made tea was gone...","“...”","After a long pause, a shout came from the mountain peak, “My purple mist mystic sand teapot!”","...","Four pretty girls presented a dazzling scene in Heavenly Academy.","“Junior Sister Xiaoyue, where are your sidekicks today?”","“Humph! Who knows? I heard that they went to the Tang Family to order guns. After all, the Deserted Sea Realm is too far from here...” Jiang Xiaoyue said, “I’ll tell you what, the shop owner has a big gun which can launch unlimited rocket missiles; it’s super powerful. But the despicable shop owner is stingy and doesn’t let me play with it.”","“It’s said that the shop owner even has the Golden Sun Wheel and Golden Moon Wheel?” Mu Qing gossiped and asked with bright eyes, “He even can use Sword God?!”","“I haven’t seen Sword God,” Li Lanruo said on the side, “But I saw him use Release, and its power was terrifying!”","“What technique is Release?!” The others leaned over.","...","In another corner at the Heavenly Academy, a black-robed elegant young man had a feather fan in one hand while holding a strange blue flame in the other hand.","Beside him was a roll of an exquisite drawing which obviously had been drawn last night.","With a wave of the folding fan in his left hand, a piece of metal entered the flame in his right palm.","Then, the metal was extended and shaped in the flame.","Beside him were parts including a barrel, a magazine, springs, etc. They were all components that went into a gun.","“It’s done!” With smooth and swift movements, he put these components together and placed the only bullet in it.","“Senior Brother Tang...”","“Come in!”","A tall young man wearing green clothes walked in from the outside. “Senior Brother Tang, is this... a gun?”","“Of course! It’s a piece of cake for me to make these little components!” He waved the gun and put his finger on the trigger while saying, “I improved the formula of the powder yesterday, and its power is even greater than before!”","Lei Ge was elated. “Really?!”","“Boom!”","A mass of black smoke rose in the room.","“...”","...","In a beautiful pavilion inside the Heavenly Academy, a purple-clothed, elegant young man stood there with his hands clasped behind his back.","“Have you found it out?”","“Young Master, I found it out. The Matrix is a movie, and the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3 that they are talking about is a game in the Origins Internet Club.” A cute purple-clothed maid stood behind him.","“Wang Xie! Wang Xie! How can you get obsessed with games and toys after defeating me?!” The young man’s face turned grim.","He looked at his communication jade. “He even sent me a message, asking me to play games with him? Do I look like a wastrel!?”","“This Wang Xie is so lazy and lacks ambition. You’ll soon surpass him, Young Master!”","“No!” Xun Yuan said in a deep voice, “Nangong Zhuo is less powerful than he looks. In the Heavenly Academy, only Wang Xie is my match, which is rare for me. Since he can’t get out of his current mood himself, I must warn him and get him out of the bad habits!”","“You’re right, Young Master!”","“Where is he?” Xun Yuan asked.","“I think he has gone to that shop again.”","“Take me there!”","...","“Yawn...” Mr. Fang stretched and walked out of his room.","Right now, Li Wuya had gone downstairs to open the shop.","“Good morning, Boss!”","“Morning!” Mr. Fang greeted the shy girl and went to wash up. “Please make a bowl of instant noodles for me! With a sausage!","The shop had only released the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3 and ‘The Matrix’, and new online games were still not available, but the shop was still thronged with customers.","There weren’t many sci-fic items in the shop, but after watching ‘The Matrix’, many customers in Half City and Yuanyang City went back to watch Resident Evil.","As for artificial intelligence, the Wuwei Daoist Alliance had begun studying it long ago. Due to their low-level technology, they had never produced any artificial spirits in spiritual treasures and artifacts yet.","If they succeeded in the research, they would have no problem producing artificial artifact and treasure spirits.","Of course, they had little knowledge in this area, and their foundation was weak. They had learned little in Grand Theft Auto 5 and had only made the new communication jade with their system of spiritual spells. Without any knowledge of programming, it was impossible to create artificial intelligence. They were on the brink of giving up.","In contrast, they had a lot more experience in making spiritual artifacts.","After watching ‘The Matrix’, there was a hot trend of making spiritual artifacts. After all, it would be awesome if they could create a virtual reality world as shown in the movie. Then, in this virtual reality world, they would be the god! How amazing would that be?","Of course, it was an impossible task for them right now.","It would take them a long time to move from beginners to novices.","Although it was impossible for them to create a virtual reality world right now, they had gained some inspirations from the virtual reality world shown in ‘The Matrix’ and acquired a deeper understanding of the laws in the real world.","Building arrays was one example.","They built the structure of arrays by simulating the movements of stars. If the people building the arrays could find out the layout and moving patterns of the stars from the study of five elements and the theory of Yin and Yang and simulate the patterns with corresponding objects, the arrays could resonate with the sun, the moon, and stars and borrow strength from them.","However, this was a complete simulation.","But now, they had a new idea, which was how to build a complete and comparatively perfect fantasy array from the basic structure."]},{"number":466,"title":"Chapter 466 - Great New Snow","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Except for the parts that hackers could change and overwrite, the virtual reality world in ‘The Matrix’ had everything that a real world could have. Even if some people knew that it was all fake, their bodies still would think that it was real subconsciously.","It was a complete world built on the algorithms created by an AI’s super intelligence.","In contrast, most of the current fantasy realms and fantasy arrays were low-level simulations of the real world. The goods ones could only give people the illusions, let alone simulating the basic structure of the world.","Of course, this was a concern for the super masters instead of the weak cultivators and young people; they didn’t have to spend time on that.","Even for the super masters, they had a long way to go in this area.","Anyway, it was something that they would consider in the future. Right now, the only thing that they could do was to watch as many movies and play as many games as possible in this internet café.","“Master.” The moment Wang Xie and Gu Tingyun entered the door, a figure went toward them.","“Senior Master Zhou Mo?”","Zhou Mo came into the shop with the Baoping Spiritual Master and Feng Yangzi who had monitored the Heavenly Academy exam on the spiritual ship with him.","Wang Xie was about to go up and greet them when a figure with a cold face intercepted him.","“Brother Wang!”","“Brother Xun?!”","Xun Yuan looked cold. “I can’t believe that you are throwing your cultivation away! Are you so arrogant that you think you can rest and play after defeating me? Are you so full of yourself? Or you just hold me in such little regard?”","In the Jiuhua City Shop, Nalan Mingxue opened the Post Bar as usual and uploaded a post that she organized while eating instant noodles.","– In Yuanyang City Shop –","“F*ck! New Snow posted another guide!”","“What? New Snow posted another guide?” Wang Xie’s eyes brightened. “Master!”","“Good!” Gu Tingyun stroked his long beard and said, “I’m stuck in the Ghost Realm. I wonder if today’s guide is about the Ghost Realm.”","“I think so!” Wang Xie said immediately, “Brother Xun, I’ll talk to you later!”","Gu Tingyun looked pleased. “Let’s go online and take a look!”","Then, he immediately took a seat and opened the Post Bar.","He saw a highlighted post that was pinned at the top of the bar: [Guide—Chasing After Souls in the Ghost Realm] [Author: New Snow]","“Hahaha! It’s indeed about the Ghost Realm!” Gu Tingyun immediately clicked open the post.","[The general map of the outer range of ghost realm: (map)]","[The discovered side missions (Gongzi Xiao provided a part of the information)...]","“Brother Wang?”","“Junior Brother Tang! Hurry up! New Snow updated the guide for the Legend of Sword and Fairy 3!”","“Really?!”","A player with the ID ‘Lu Xiaoxian’ and the profile photo of white deer replied under the post, [Thank you, Great New Snow! This guide is awesome! <img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f600.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F600;\"> Can you tell me who’s this cute Gongzi Xiao? Why does he always provide information?]","Gu Tingyun glanced at the reply before copying and pasting it.","[Thank you, Great New Snow! This guide is awesome! <img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f600.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F600;\"> Can you tell me who’s this cute Gongzi Xiao? Why does he always provide information?]","Then, he hurriedly entered the game after replying.","Clicking open the post, Wang Xie saw this reply. “...”","Xun Yuan was still standing at the entrance, and he was at a loss for words.","“Young Master... Is that... Senior Gu?”","Xun Yuan’s face turned dark. “Not only him... I saw Castellan Zong... and Elder Yu, Zhou Mo, the Baoping Spiritual Master...”","“What should we do now?”","“Let’s see what they are doing.” He quickly walked over to watch from behind.","On Gu Tingyun’s screen was a young man.","Wang Xie glanced at his screen and said, “Master, you’re fighting the Fire Ghost King already?”","“Fighting? The Fire Ghost King?” Xun Yuan looked at Wang Xie in bafflement.","“Yeah. I didn’t have time to explain it to you before, Brother Xun. You might not know...” Then, Wang Xie briefly told him about the game.","On the screen was a world completely engulfed in flames.","Standing before the main character was an ugly, burly, and fat monster with three horns on the forehead.","The monster had been a human who was burned to death by heavenly fire in the ancient time. After his death, he had turned into a fire ghost and didn’t want to enter another cycle of life of reincarnation due to his craving for the freedom in the Ghost Realm. His spiritual power was great, and the fire that he could use was hellfire and could burn souls into ashes.","On the screen, hellfire flew around while lava flowed in from all directions. One could even feel the extremely high temperature through the screen.","Xun Yuan murmured with a gloomy expression. “I’ll see how good and fun this game is!”","Since the opponent was the Fire Ghost King, the best array to deal with him was the water array. On the screen, Jing Tian and Long Kui changed positions and used water-elemental spiritual spells to deal with the surrounding heat wave so that their combat strengths wouldn’t decrease.","On the screen, Jing Tian formed and cast a spiritual spell, and an iceberg dashed out from the ground!","Fire and wind collided on the screen, and lava splashed out while flames suddenly spread all over the place.","“Young Master, this looks powerful!” a purple-clothed maid yelled in astonishment.","“...” Xun Yuan turned to look at another screen.","The scene on this screen looked even more awe-inspiring. The four people stood in positions of a pre-arranged array and gathered their spiritual essence in one spot.","“All-Directional Demon-Sealing Strike!” Tang Yu yelled.","“Ahh!” Dumbfounded, Xun Yuan watched the shattered ground and mountain on the screen. “Did Young Master Tang launch this technique?”","How come it is earth-shaking?!","With gritted teeth, he put crystals on the counter. “Sir, I want to play the Legend of the Sword and Fairy too!”","“Um...”","“Activate the game for my Zi’er as well!”","Eight hours had passed since he started playing.","He leaped up from his seat as if there were a spring under his butt. “Impossible! Isn’t it a game?! How come it’s so powerful?!”","“Brother Wang! This game is so great! The reincarnation of an immortal! I’m the reincarnation of an immortal!” Elated, he turned to speak to Wang Xie who had just gotten offline.","“Yeah!” Wang Xie looked calm. “It’s indeed powerful.”","Xun Yuan turned to look at Tang Yu. “Young Master Tang, I just experienced the sword techniques of an immortal! It is unbelievable!”","Tang Yu looked nonchalant as well. “Yeah.”","Then, he turned to Lei Ge who had just gotten offline. “Junior Brother Lei!”","Lie Ge looked cool. “It is indeed powerful.”","While his face twitched, Xun Yuan thought to himself, Can you guys have a different expression when saying the word ‘powerful’?","Walking past them, Yue Bai glanced at him and said, “How come you only learned about it? We’re close to passing the game.”","“Ugh...”","Mu Qing said in disdain, “He looks so startled. Such a newbie.”","Xun Yuan exchanged a look with his maid.","“Young Master, it seems that only the two of us are new players...”","Xun Yuan’s face turned dark.","Ignoring him, Mu Qing asked, “Oh, Senior Sister, I heard that New Snow is going to try to get the perfect ending; is it true?”","“No, she got the imperfect ending (Fighting with Chong Lou for some time before being defeated); I guess she will have to wait for the next time to achieve the perfect ending.”","“The perfect ending is so hard to get...” Mu Qing said with a frown, “It’s said that the players in the Jiuhua City Shop all got imperfect endings.”","“It can’t be helped.” Tang Yu said on the side, “Brother Lou has already restricted his power, and that’s the best we can get.”","“So powerful,” Wang Xie said while clicking his tongue. “After playing the game for the first round, we can’t keep many of the treasures. It’s said that New Snow has been focusing purely on sword techniques.”","“We have to admit that the players in their shop are very good...”","“It doesn’t matter,” Xun Yuan said with heroic passion, “When we get used to the game, we’ll leave them in the dust!”","“Hahahaha! It’s good to have confidence.” As geniuses of the Heavenly Academy, they could admire others but would never admit defeat."]},{"number":467,"title":"Chapter 467 - StarCraft","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","For most people, the genres of the games in the shop were abundant and complete.","However, some people were still unsatisfied as they felt like it lacked something,","In this world, some people focused on spiritual spells, and some focused on combat techniques. The Matrix inspired the artifact masters in arrays and fantasy spells, and the people who wanted to expand their forces would go and play the Legend of Mir 2.","However, for people who wanted to sharpen their commanding skills in war, the Legend of Mir 2 had its limits.","After all, the players couldn’t die, which made the strategies used in the game quite different from those in real wars.","The real strategies decided the outcome of wars from thousands of kilometers away.","Jiang Xuan lounged on his computer chair. He had played many games and had just finished the Hua Ying Ending in the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3 (In this ending, Jing Tian would battle with Chong Lou ten years later after the end of the game).","“It would be great if there’s a game that simulates wars so that we could practice strategies and make decisions to command troops.”","The endings in the Legend of Sword and Fairy 3 had all come out. After fighting hard for days, Nalan Mingxue finally achieved the perfect ending in the second round.","Many players who were fast with the progress had gotten to the end.","The Zi Xuan Ending had the shortest process. In this ending, Chong Lou used his own demonic energy to repair the Demon-Suppressing Tower for Zi Xuan, and the story ended after the battle with the Evil Sword Immortal.","Of course, some people got the ending in which both Xuan Jian and Long Kui died, which doesn’t deserve to be discussed here.","By now, the number of activations of the Legend of the Sword and Fairy 3 had surpassed 4,000.","The Matrix had attracted many viewers from the day it was released. Even though this movie didn’t help viewers improve their strength in clear ways and was limited in this aspect, it still had a high number of activations with its novel plot and imagination. The popularity of this movie even increased the activations of the Resident Evil movie and game.","Of course, some players enjoyed the games and movies without expecting to obtain benefits. In fact, Gu Tingyun and Zong Wu liked the Resident Evil game and movie even though they didn’t obtain any benefits from them. They liked them because these games and movies brought something new to their long lives of cultivation.","Even the grandmasters found this kind of novelty breathtaking.","Yes, it was breathtaking.","In the tedious life of cultivation which was thousands of years long, everything seemed the same. Therefore, they sometimes felt bored.","It was especially the case with people such as Gu Tingyun, who had achieved a realm as high as he could but only had limited years remaining in his life. Cultivation didn’t matter much to them, and the only job for them now was teaching disciples and enjoying the last years in life.","Even some young people such as Wang Xie and Xun Yuan sometimes felt bored. They were born in this huge system and had to abide by every rule of the world, making no mistakes.","In comparison, these new things brought them some ripples in their sedate lives in which they do nothing but gain cultivation strength and fight for treasures. The new things weren’t better; they were just new and novel.","Now, they added some new terms to their lives which was filled with cultivators, warriors, ascendance, and immortals.","“Brother Wang, I’m going to fight Chong Lou today!” Xun Yuan was smug since that he could finally meet the most powerful demonic god in the legends.","He was excited about this prospect.","“You suck,” Tang Yu said in disdain, “I’m half-way through the second round.”","“I suck? You know nothing! I’m invincible!” Xun Yuan rolled his eyes at him and said, “Jing Tian’s speed in mastering spiritual spells is many times faster than ours. Now, I’ve mastered all three styles of spiritual spells!”","“I’ll absolutely defeat Chong Lou! I’ll show you!”","“I bet that you can’t do it even if you spend all day on it!” Tang Yuan said in amusement.","“Defeating Chong Lou is more difficult than passing a tribulation.” Wang Xie shook his head in resignation. “I think it makes more sense for us to bet on if he can pass the tribulation and ascend today.”","Xun Yuan’s face turned dark. “...”","Three seconds after he entered the New Immortal Realm, his screen turned grey while Chong Lou stood with two blades in his hands that were covered in blood.","He died.","“I was killed by a tribulation lightning bolt.”","...","No one knew how to ascend to Heaven and what it looked like above the mortal world.","Even Mr. Fang’s sword control technique couldn’t help them fly out of this world. Each day, people looked up at the starry sky. The sun, the moon, and stars moved, but people didn’t know what the stars really were.","They didn’t know if the sky had an end or what the structure of the sky looked like and how it was different from this world. The only thing was for sure; Mr. Fang couldn’t fly out of this world.","No one could fly out of it.","It was natural that the people in this world had no idea what the galaxy really looked like.","Perhaps they still fantasize about a realm of gods with celestial palaces in Heaven.","It was a realm where every cultivator and warrior wished to go to. In this dreamy realm, there was no aging, illnesses, or death.","“Sir, what is this StarCraft?” Many people were playing the Legend of Sword and Fairy 3 for the second time since there hadn’t been new games for a long time. Some players even went to play Resident Evil and cleared the stage.","The Matrix had spawned new bizarre ideas in them about the origin of the world. Then, StarCraft might introduce them to an even broader world.","“Boss...” Loli Jiang Xiaoyue looked at Mr. Fang imploringly. “Can we watch you play the game?”","“I want to watch it! I want to watch it!” The big white deer put its front hooves on the counter and looked avid.","Jiang Xiaoyue stroked its furry head. “Hehe. I’ll watch it with Little Bell!”","“Okay. I’ll turn on the livestream.”","“Good!” Tang Yu’s gaze followed Mr. Fang until the latter sat down. “You are going to livestream today?”","He remembered that the last time when he watched the livestream, it was a thrilling battle between an immortal and a demon lord – Jing Tian vs Chong Lou.","The memory was still fresh in his mind.","“Let’s go! The shop owner has turned on the livestream!”","“What is he livestreaming?” Xun Yuan said solemnly, “I’m passing the tribulation!”","“F*ck your tribulation,” Tang Yu said, “Let’s go and watch the livestream.”","...","It was still early in the morning, but people bustled in all three shops as the popularity of Origins Internet Club increased.","They turned to look at the big screen. “The shop owner has turned on the livestream?”","The people of the Nanhua Faction who were walking toward the computers immediately sat on the couches with unprecedented speed.","The people around them looked dazed. Before they could react, half of the seats on the couches had been taken.","Soon, a row of blue alphabet-like icons appeared on the screen.","“Blizzard?” Nalan Hongwu glanced at the big screen. “Is the shop owner going to broadcast Diablo?”","He was baffled. “The kid only got to Nightmare Difficulty, right?”","The screen showed a vast space in the universe, and the dark blue planet in the bottom-left corner occupied one-fourth of the screen.","There were several icons on the screen: [Satellite (Multiple players)], [Battleship and Remains (Single Player)], and [Black Hole (Exit)].","The big letters on the right side showed: StarCraft."]},{"number":468,"title":"Chapter 468 - War Commander","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“StarCraft?!” This name was even harder to understand than the Matrix!","“Is there a Diablo in this game?” Jiang Xiaoyue asked curiously since she saw the logo of Blizzard, which was also shown in Diablo 2 and the official novel of Diablo.","Even people like Wang Xie and Yue Bai had read the official novel of Diablo and found it very imaginative.","Seeing Blizzard’s logo, Jiang Xiaoyue immediately wondered, “Is this game a sequel or a prequel of Diablo 2?”","“It doesn’t look like one...” Sitting on a couch, Yue Bai turned to the beginning of the official novel of Diablo. “Diablo tells the story about the survival of humans who are stuck in the battle between angels and devils...”","“Look!” The audience looked at the big screen and saw a metallic aircraft hovering in the dark space with stars twinkling in the background. “This seems to be... the galaxy?”","This was a different place from the one described in Diablo.","They all looked baffled. “Is this space above the sky during the night?”","Yes, it must be night. Otherwise, how can it be so dark during the daytime?","The opening computer graphics (CG) of StarCraft was different from other games; it was the start of a grand world and described the first encounter of humans (Terrans) and Protoss, another intelligent species in the universe.","The Protoss was purifying the infested human planet, and a group of unlucky humans was watching it right there.","The huge shadow cast by the spacecraft blocked out the light above their heads. When they looked up, they saw the giant thing. If it were a battleship, the bow of the battleship blocked out all the light and filled the people’s vision.","They felt as if they were a school of tiny fish which suddenly looked up and saw the legendary Roc.","“What’s that?”","“This spiritual ship is so huge!”","“It seems bigger than the academy’s Sky-Patrolling Spiritual Ship!”","Suddenly, blue light shot out under the ship!","The big screen was filled with a wave of destructive blue light!","The black-robed Daoist Zhou Mo yelled, “Where did these cultivators come from? How come they can build such a powerful spiritual ship?!”","In the Jiuhua City Shop.","A group of people sat on the couches in the lounge area.","A white-robed old man was eating spicy sticks with leisure.","“Brother Gongshu, how is this ship compared with the warships of your Gongshu Family?” someone asked casually.","“...” Damn it! He put the spicy sticks on the table with force as his face turned dark.","There were three races in StarCraft.","The human civilization was based on science and technology with the assistance of psionic power; Terran ghosts were one example.","The Protoss was also called the race of gods. This race shared some similarities with cultivators or a magic civilization with templars being the center of the society. They had had powerful psionic abilities which seemed to be in the same category of magic power and spiritual essence. Meanwhile, the Protoss could cast magic spells and close-range combat techniques with extremely powerful individual combat forces.","[TL Note: Protoss was directly translated into gods in the Chinese version of the game.]","The zerg followed the combat style of insects and beasts; their greatest advantage was their large population and the lack of fear of death. The Queen of Blades had once been a human and thus could battle using psionic abilities.","Entering the option interface, Fang Qi saw two options to operate the system version of StarCraft.","The first option was the commander mode which was the most popular mode. The players would act as the commander to battle and fight with other players.","The other option was the single-player RPG mode. In some battles, the players were not allowed to develop Commander Center or SCVs (worker units) and were equipped with only one or several squads without back-up. They could enter the battle as an individual character such as Jim Raynor (The main character of the humans), Sarah Kerrigan (Queen of Blades), Zeratul (A Dark Templar of the Protoss), the marines, drivers, other templars, or Hunter Killer Hydralisks, etc.","Among the characters, only female players could control the Queen of Blades, and Zeratul and some other Protoss characters could only be controlled by male players. Otherwise, the players could only finish the battle from the perspective as the commander.","The most classic operation was naturally the commander mode.","Mr. Fang chose a human battle and started the game.","This was the background of the battle. Since a colony was destroyed as introduced in the opening CG, Mr. Fang was asked to protect another colony named Mar Sara as the commander.","In the original game, there was only a crude map with one commander center and a few SCVs. It was a barren land with a few mines.","However, it was different in the system version. When Fang Qi entered the game, he saw a prosperous human colony base. The main base was a lot more complicated compared to the original version, and there was a vast interior space.","There were all kinds of buildings, streets, and plants outside the commander center. It was complex and unique, looking like a small town.","On the modern streets, some marines who wore heavy armor were patrolling with huge guns.","The pale-grey modern rooms were the office of the judicial officer in the colony, and the young female deputy officer was reporting the situation of the colony on the side.","Fang Qi looked at the screen and found that he could issue electronic or verbal instructions. The electronic commands were similar to the original version but had more complete functions. Combined with verbal instructions, he could simulate the commanding process of a battle.","Of course, it was the operation method of humans, and Fang Qi still didn’t know if it was different from the commanding method of the other two races. In the tutorial session, the players must destroy the small zerg forces nearby. There was a squad of 12 marines, and Fang Qi casually organized a wing-shaped formation.","He found that after he told the marines to keep this formation, they would do it when they advanced or turned to another direction. However, in the original version, the formation would be disrupted whenever they encountered an obstacle and they would block themselves with awful pathing.","After the squad walked out of the center, they saw a squad of zerglings loitering outside of the colony.","Obviously, the zerglings saw the marines and swarmed up swiftly.","“The center, retreat! The flanks, surround them!” At Mr. Fang’s dizzying operations, the marines in the center retreated while firing, and the marines from the two sides surrounded the enemies. The number of zerglings decreased quickly.","When the last zergling rushed to the marine, the marine in the center moved to one side at Mr. Fang’s order.","Meanwhile, the other marines fired almost simultaneously. The zergling missed its target and fell to the ground.","Gunsmoke filled the battlefield. With smooth retreat and attacks, the marines killed all the enemies without any casualties.","“We can command soldiers to battle in this game?!” The audience gazed at the big screen, realizing that they could not only play the main characters but the commanders as well!"]},{"number":469,"title":"Chapter 469 - Battle Seven Zerg!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","At this moment, the audience didn’t have the concept of stars and planets yet. After all, the opening CG was short, and the introduction wasn’t very clear about this idea.","From the CG at the beginning of the game, they understood that a huge spiritual ship above the continent casually destroyed a small spiritual ship.","The colony is probably only a name for some new land discovered by humans. Who knows?","Although this explanation sounded strange, it was easier for them to understand since it was more in line with their concept of the world.","“This game feels... interesting?” Mu Qing said after some consideration.","Lately, the shop had piqued their interest in ‘spiritual artifacts’, which included the unique combat style of using these strange-looking spiritual artifacts.","“But...” Tang Yu said curiously, “Who does that super-powerful spiritual ship at the beginning of the game belong to?”","No one could blame him for dwelling on this thought since the huge light-blocking spiritual ship at the very beginning of the game was too impressive to ignore.","“That’s a battleship of the Protoss.” Mr. Fang returned to the interface where he could select the races and paused his cursor on the golden armor on the right; this race had a completely different appearance from humans. “You can also call this the race of gods.”","“Race of gods?” Tang Yu and other young people were startled. Remembering the destructive force that the ‘spiritual ship’ had shown, they were awe-struck by this race.","Zong Wu and other senior cultivators exchanged a look of surprise and wondered, So powerful?","“It’s like... the race of angels in Diablo,” Mr. Fang explained, “They are different from the gods of your understanding.”","“Oh really...?” Many people nodded and realized what was happening; they were clear now after hearing that explanation.","“It still sounds powerful...” Mu Qing clicked her tongue and pointed at the big screen. “Can we command them too?”","Fang Qi pointed at the words [The Third Episode] on the screen and said, “You can do it after finishing the first and the second episode.”","“We can do that?!”","“Boss! I want to play it too!” Jiang Xiaoyue was the first to enter the game.","“Ugh? Xiaoyue! Wait for me!” Other girls also activated the game.","“I want to play it too!” The big white deer also activated the game.","“This...” Tang Yu and others exchanged a look. “Let’s go and try the game too!”","...","[Sir, how come this gun looks so weird?] Su Tianji sent him a message.","Obviously, she had begun playing the game in the Jiuhua City Shop and had passed the Boot Camp and Officer Training. In the second episode, Wasteland, Main Character Jim Raynor appeared, and the players could choose to play as a single unit.","[Besides, how come the armor is holding the gun instead of me?] She controlled Raynor who wore thick armor, and the armor held a huge gun.","The marines in the original game looked as tiny as a thumbnail, but when converted to the real world, it was clear that the armor was one size bigger than a burly man; it was even bigger than the armor of Paladins in Diablo.","“So strange.” Tang Yu had already put on the combat armor. “The humans are so weak that they need such things to give them power?”","He fired casually and saw flames shooting out from the muzzle. The air before him vibrated slightly, and then the ground shook with a huge and terrifying bullet hole in it! It was a horrifying sight.","In the commander mode, they couldn’t feel the power of these weapons through the screen. But now they had a clear view of it.","The piercing power was horrifying.","“This gun is so powerful!” Tang Yu gasped, knowing that these guns were not in the same category as those in the Matrix and Resident Evil.","Upon closer observation, he even saw electric currents flowing inside.","“What gun is this?!”","Soon, someone @-ed Mr. Fang in the group chat, Mr. Fang’s Tour Group. [Sir, why are the guns in this game different from those we saw before?]","Li Haoran had led the marine squad and ran into a few zerglings, and he fired with the gun in his hand, piercing the shells of the zerglings with each shot. If not for the swiftness of these insects, he could have killed one with two or even one shot.","“Oh that. You can change to the commander mode and read the introduction,” Mr. Fang said calmly.","“C-14 Impaler Gauss Rifle?” Su Tianji turned the gun in her hands and studied it with interest. “What’s this thing? Is it very powerful?”","“I feel like it’s even more powerful than my new handguns with spiritual energy?” Li Haoran said curiously, “Only the fully array-engraved sniper rifle with new armor-piercing bullets could be compared to its power.”","The problem was that there were no engravings of array patterns on this gun.","Gauss was the electromagnetic unit. Fang Qi remembered that this thing had been in its experimental phase on Earth before he traveled through space and time, and its energy was derived from electromagnetic coils.","When strong electric currents passed through the coil, the magnetic force would shoot out the iron magnetic bullets which were so powerful that they could turn a tank into a pile of waste metal.","The most common gauss weapons used magnetic needles which could be shot out noiselessly. In fact, they were more like sneak-attack weapons in use instead of firearms.","The marines in StarCraft used even cheaper items, which was the traditional ammunitions accelerated by gauss force. The supersonic bullets had such power that they could pierce tanks or the armor on the space battleships.","Of course, it was fine to fire at tanks. It was better not to mess with space battleships with these guns if one treasured their life.","The ordinary people needed combat suits to use these guns. The suits could also restock ammunition and help them aim. It was impossible to use the gauss rifles without the combat suits.","These things had reached the limit that the cultivators and artifact masters in this world could understand and potentially study. After all, this world was at a stage even more backward than the world that Mr. Fang had traveled from; there was no way that they could develop even better technology.","It would be better for them to focus on the gameplay.","“Sir.” Whenever a new game was released, many people would bring questions to the shop owner. Su Tianji and Gu Tingyun were among them.","“What’s this Multiplayer Mode? I found that I can directly choose Protoss?” Gu Tingyun was obviously very eager to play Protoss after seeing the super battleship. “What does it mean by adding a computer bot?”","Mr. Fang answered casually, “When no one plays with you, you can play with the computer.”","“Then, I...” He looked around. “I’ll choose Protoss then?”","Then, he looked again. “Battle... with three zerg?”","He added three zerg bots.","“No. With the great power of Protoss, I can battle several zerg!” Having witnessed the great power of Protoss, he thought that he could handle quite a few zerg.","Then, he found that the maximum was seven.","“How come there’s an upper limit?” Reluctant, he clicked on the button, [1 VS 7]."]},{"number":470,"title":"Chapter 470 - The Ocean of Zerg","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Senior Gu, how come your base is golden?!” Zong Wu sneaked a glance and thought, “I’m still trying to figure out how to use the gun, but Senior Gu’s base is already looking so grand and majestic.”","On the center of Gu Tingyun’s screen was a huge pyramid-like building standing proudly in the wasteland. Pale blue light flowed on the metal plates on the surface of the building while the energy crystal on the top flashed blue spiritual light. The whole building looked beautiful in an exotic way.","Standing before it, humans looked tiny. The huge building was awe-inspiring when one looked at it either from the ground up or from the sky down.","In the distance, one could see a vast wasteland and the dark blue sky with hues of red. The violent gusts swept up the dust on the ground like ocean waves, and few plants grew on the ground. Obviously, the climate and environment in this place weren’t pleasant.","This old man knew nothing about the situation. Luckily, a Protoss assistant explained to him the functions of things like the base and the probes.","Hearing Zong Wu’s question, Gu Tingyun stroked his beard and said with a smile, “I’m playing the Protoss! They are the existences that controls that spiritual ship you had just seen!”","“You can actually command Protoss now?!”","Hearing Zong Wu’s exclamation, many people looked toward them. Some people not sitting nearby even walked over to watch from behind.","Soon, a large group of people gathered behind Gu Tingyun.","“Can we choose Protoss directly?!” Tang Yu looked at his character who was still patrolling with a rifle, wondering why someone could now command the Protoss!","“Senior, how did you do it?!” Yue Bai stared at the screen intently.","“I want to command the Protoss too!” The big white deer jumped, but it was even shorter than Jiang Xiaoyue when it stood on all fours. “I want to watch it too!”","Surrounded by the crowd, Gu Tingyu smiled and said, “This is the multiplayer mode, and you can choose Protoss at the beginning in this mode!”","“Can we choose Protoss like this?” The Baoping Spiritual Master said in surprise, “Commanding such a powerful race, you will be unrivaled, right?”","Gu Tingyun said, “Of course! In the battle, I chose seven zerg as my enemies; I’m sure I can handle them.”","Zong Wu laughed and said, “Senior, you never make mistakes in calculations. I’m sure you will be invincible when commanding this race!”","Mr. Fang was also looking at the multiplayer mode. Instead of playing, he was reading the rules of this mode.","Since it was a real-time strategy game, this mode was different from the campaign mode.","The campaign mode was true to the original storyline and simulated the battles in the plot to a high-degree. They could choose one battle and ignore the lengthy and tedious parts leading to it.","However, in the multiplayer mode, one must build their base, mine, and develop their forces. The lengthy process would bore the players, so the multiplayer mode made some adjustments to make the game more enjoyable. For example, it adjusted the length of time to build infrastructure, the number of base units like SCVs required, and the length of time spent on extracting minerals.","After all, if it took a long time to establish a prosperous base like real life, there would be no time to command the battle at all since the computer time would have run out for the day by then.","Under the advice from the assistant, Gu Tingyun studied the buildings that he could put into construction.","He built a gateway.","Then, he trained some zealots.","In the multiplayer mode, the commanding methods of different races were almost the same.","Besides the verbal instructions, there were some small differences.","For example, the Protoss’ psionic link could help the commander control a few soldiers in the battle, and the controlled soldiers had different combat power depending on the players’ performances.","The human commander could direct the battle from the distance and even control some machines in emergencies with commands without the drivers’ participation.","The zerg units could respond the fastest to the commands of the Zerg Overmind among the races and could make subtle and swift adjustments in individual zerg units.","Looking at the sharp psi-blades on their wrists and swift movements of the zealots and the psionic spheres around them, the audience became envious.","Zong Wu offered a plan after a moment of consideration, “With such powerful soldiers, I think you should move swiftly and give the enemies a heavy blow!”","“You’re right!” Gu Tingyun sent out all three zealots while continuing training probes and zealots; he sent the zealots to explore the map.","It was a desert, but the terrain looked good. There was only one exit situated in the southeast end of this vast valley. The three zealots walked out while Gu Tingyun talked about the development plan with the others around him.","“I think you can block this entrance!” Tang Yu said, “Then, no one can enter your valley, right?”","“Yes! Good idea.” Gu Tingyun said with a nod, “We must move steadily. Even though I’m in the advantage, I can’t be careless...”","“Where are my zealots?!” Staring at the commander screen in the base, he froze for a moment. “Where are the three zealots I just sent out?”","Standing nearby, Mu Qing watched while sipping milk tea. She said casually, “Maybe they surrendered to the enemies?”","“How could they?” The audience had been watching Gu Tingyun build a photon cannon, how could three soldiers surrender to the enemies?","“Unlucky!” Gu Tingyun shook his head. “This gateway is so unreliable.”","He glanced at the four zealots that had just come out of training. “This time, I’ll train them myself!”","Then, he sent out the four zealots.","Controlling one of the zealots himself, he waved the psi-blades heroically and led the others out of the valley. “Come with me to hunt down the traitors!","They followed the path that the previous three zealots had taken.","“Look! What’s that?!” After walking a long distance in the wilderness, they saw that the ground before them was covered by a blanket of purple slime. Before they could react, groups of zerglings swarmed up.","With a scream, one of the zealots was pierced by a thick spike from the ground before it could react.","Meanwhile, several zerglings swarmed up like ocean waves!","The zealots that Gu Tingyun controlled twitched twice and died.","The screen turned pitch-black again.","The audience exchanged a look and remained silent.","“Hurry up! Assistant! Build some more photon cannons for me!”","About ten minutes later, the audience saw a giant herd of zerg units like an ocean wave had come to the outside of the valley where the base of the Protoss was situated.","The Hydralisks shot out their needles, filling the sky like black raindrops. Instantly, the foremost photon cannons exploded.","“Look over there! What’s that?!” Groups of ugly monsters with wings and dragon heads quickly flew over the base like gusts of wind.","Among the zerg units, there was even a huge mammoth-like beast with long tusks that was several stories high. It lifted one foot and stomped a dragoon into pieces!","The audience looked at each other and then at the sight in a daze. “...”"]},{"number":471,"title":"Chapter 471 - A Competition?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Why are there so many zerg?!”","Looking at his base that had been swallowed by the sea of zerg, Gu Tingyu’s expression was hard to describe.","More importantly, a large group of people had been watching his defeat after he became the commander of the powerful Protoss for less than 20 minutes!","He had just gotten out of the base, but he was already buried by the ocean-like zerg!","How come I only got zealots and dragoons, but they already developed to this stage?","His mind lingered at the moment when the base exploded.","“...” His old face turned dark.","“The zerg looks powerful...” A few men from the Demon Clan scratched their hairy heads and said.","“Humph! The zerg are ugly and disgusting!” Mu Qing said with a snort. “Who would choose to play them!”","...","“Junior Sister Mu, you’re right,” Xun Yuan said, “Senior Gu was only careless. After all, the zerg are no match for the Protoss.”","This time, Gu Tingyun chose only three zerg as his enemies and then got busy with building the gateway.","About a dozen minutes later, a sea of zerg swarmed up.","“So many of them again?!”","The audience felt sick as their faces almost turned green.","Gu Tingyun decreased the number of enemies to one! One versus one battle!","“I don’t believe it...”","Three minutes later, waves of zerglings swarmed into the Protoss base.","Meanwhile, the few zealots in Gu Tingyun’s base watched the waves of zerglings in a daze. “...”","The audience fell silent.","“The zerg are so powerful?!”","Gu Tingyun quickly changed his race to play zerg.","Many people returned to their seats and chose to play zerg as well.","Then, their six zerglings were killed by three zealots, and a team of zerglings was killed by six zealots.","After being killed many times, they finally discovered the truth: none of the races was stronger than the other; it was possibly because they couldn’t defeat the computer.","After being tortured by the computer for a while, someone finally complained to the shop owner. Pointing at his computer, Xun Yuan Yelled, “Sir! How come the computer is so powerful?!”","“Is it powerful?” Mr. Fang looked nonplussed. Although the players couldn’t set the degree of difficulty for the computer bots, it should only be a little more intelligent than the bots that he had played against before he traveled through space and time; it wasn’t as dumb as before in some areas.","For example, in the original version, when a player sent two base units like SCVs to lure the base units from the bots, the latter would all follow out like morons, which made the 1 vs 7 match a piece of cake.","“How can you say it’s not difficult!” Mu Qing seconded Xun Yuan while eating spicy sticks.","She glanced at Mr. Fang’s screen and saw that he was still playing the campaign mode. “Why don’t you try it?”","Mr. Fang said in disdain. “Why should I?”","He continued with the campaign mode.","“Ugh? Is it possible that the boss doesn’t know how to play this mode?” Jiang Xiaoyue leaned over curiously. After all, the shop owner would have shown off his skills whenever he was given the opportunity.","This wasn’t his style.","“Impossible. I just don’t want to lower myself to be on the same level as these people who couldn’t even defeat bots,” Mr. Fang said while staring at the screen. He discovered that when he played the campaign mode from the RPG angle, it felt like playing Resident Evil. Occasionally, the players were allowed to drive Vultures or other battle vehicles and could even operate the Wraiths and Starcruisers from the first-person perspective. It was much more interesting compared to the campaign mode in the original version.","More importantly, he would soon meet the Queen of Blades!","Although the Queen of Blades was now still a human, Mr. Fang was still pleased that he could see her.","“What do you mean by ‘lower yourself’?!” The people who had complained about the difficulty of the game were not happy.","“Right. How could he say that?!”","“I’m sure he can’t beat the computer either! He doesn’t dare to try it!”","Mr. Fang: “...”","Meanwhile, an old laughter came. “I finally defeated them!”","“Ugh?!”","“Look! Senior Gu has defeated the computer!”","“So soon?!” Wang Xie looked over in surprise. Sure enough, a victory icon appeared on the screen.","“Of course!” Gu Tingyun said with confidence, “This game is good. You have to control all your resources carefully and have a clear understanding of your resources and troops. The most important thing is that you must multitask.”","Gu Tingyun shared his experience. “In this battle, I directed the ground troop to guard the entrance to the valley with the defense arrays. On the other hand, I sent out small teams of soldiers to harass the enemies in transportation spiritual boats under my personal control, taking advantage of their lack of air control methods. Meanwhile, I developed my force at top speed. By working three lines at the same time, I took their base without a sweat!”","“Excellent!” Zong Wu praised gustily, “Senior, that is an amazing strategy that you thought of yourself!”","“The senior taught arrays in Heavenly Academy! He excels in making strategies!”","“I heard that Senior Gu is one of the best chess players in the world; this strategy was easy for him!”","“The shop owner is indeed good, but old people are more experienced in this field of making strategies!”","The people talked among themselves while nodding.","At this moment, the players of the other two shops were mostly playing the campaign mode.","Meanwhile, Mr. Fang was still calmly playing the campaign mode.","“I’m sure that the scummy shop owner doesn’t know how to play multiplayer mode!” After staying in the group chat for a long while, some people began to call him scummy shop owner as well.","“Otherwise, he wouldn’t keep playing campaign mode all the time.” After all, in the campaign mode, the players could use their own cultivation strength to their advantage.","“Look! Senior Gu destroyed the Protoss with zerg.”","“He’s indeed a shrewd man!”","“Sir!” In fact, Mu Qing had been reluctant to accept Mr. Fang’s title as the President of Heaven-Defying Online Games Guild.","Even the little princess of Jiang Family calls him ‘Boss’, which means that us, Jiang Xiaoyue’s good friends, are one level lower than him too.","At this moment, she said gloatingly, “Didn’t you say that you didn’t want to lower yourself to play with people who couldn’t defeat the computer? Now that Senior Gu has won against several computers, maybe it’s time for you to show your hand?”","“Little Qing!” Yue Bai tugged at her clothes, feeling a headache since she knew that this girl was trying to make trouble again.","“Yeah. Sir, it’s time for you to try it, right?” Others seconded her and shouted, obviously not believing that Mr. Fang, a young man, could be more experienced in leading troops and making strategies than the experienced old men.","After all, this wasn’t a game that one could win with small tricks; it was a battle of strategies.","Helpless, Mr. Fang could only look at Gu Tingyun.","At this moment, battling with the computers obviously couldn’t satisfy Gu Tingyun. He stroked his beard and suggested, “Shall we... have a match?”"]},{"number":472,"title":"Chapter 472 - There Is Such A Strategy?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“A match?” Mr. Fang glanced at his own screen. “Are you sure it’s a good idea?”","“Why not?” Xun Yuan said immediately, “We want to watch your sophisticated strategies. Don’t you agree, guys?”","Hearing these words, Mr. Fang knew that it was impossible to decline. So, he nodded and said, “Okay. I’ll have a match.”","Not daring to be careless, Gu Tingyun chose the Protoss that he was the most familiar with.","“Let’s see what race Mr. Fang will choose.” After seeing Gu Tingyun choose the Protoss, the audience walked over and watched Mr. Fang.","Mr. Fang’s cursor hovered on the races in hesitation and then clicked on [Random].","“Huh???”","“How come the shop owner chose random?”","“He is too arrogant and underestimated his opponent!” Zhou Mo said with a snort, “Does he think that he will defeat Master’s Protoss army with a random race?”","After all, it was a match of commanding skills and strategies, not the Legend of Sword and Fairy 3. In the Legend of Sword and Fairy 3, one could defeat Chong Lou with all kinds of items, but this game focused on strategies.","This wasn’t a strong area for young people! The shop owner didn’t look old, and it wasn’t easy for old cultivators to act young; one still could see their true age through their manners and ways of doing things.","In his opinion, the ability to make good decisions and create proper strategies needed time to polish.","“Maybe the shop owner thinks that it doesn’t matter which race he chooses since he is bad at this game anyway.”","“Hahahaha!” Mu Qing convulsed with laughter. “He can’t be so weak and lame.”","Jiang Xiaoyue leaned toward Mr. Fang. “Boss, can you do it? I found the old academy principal has excellent commanding skills.”","“Of course!” Mr. Fang answered casually, “Don’t worry. I can easily defeat seven computers at the same time.”","“Humph! You’re bluffing!” Now, even Jiang Xiaoyue didn’t believe him.","Even if the senior gave you private lessons, you can’t boast like this.","Meanwhile, the game started.","It was a rocky wildness in a medium-sized map. The moment that he entered the game, Gu Tingyun got busy developing his force.","– On Mr. Fang’s side –","Standing behind Mr. Fang, some young guys exclaimed, “Protoss as well?” They were surprised that Random also give Mr. Fang Protoss.","“It’s not good for the opponent to know about your race, right?” Li Wuya said from the side, “The random choice can confuse the opponent, but you guys just told everyone the result, eh?”","“...” Gu Tingyun looked back in displeasure and said, “Keep quiet just like you are watching a chess match.”","However, Mr. Fang didn’t show any intention to restart the game; he continued to make probes.","Then, he sent out a probe to scout, which wasn’t an unusual move.","At this moment, most of the audience turned their attention to Gu Tingyun’s operations; he built a gateway first.","“It seems that Senior Gu wants to test the water with an attack?”","“It looks like it...”","Gu Tingyun had just trained one zealot when Mr. Fang’s probe trotted in.","It strolled past the zealot as if it were in its own base.","Then, it ambled to one of Gu Tingyun’s probes which was working and shot the latter with its particle beam.","The tiny particle beam shot on the probe’s energy shield, creating a streak of pale blue light; it didn’t inflict much damage except consuming some energy of the shield, but its behavior was...","“So arrogant!”","“Is it here to be killed?!”","“Doesn’t he know that his rival has trained a zealot?!”","“Provocation! This is blatant provocation!”","Gu Tingyun didn’t say anything, but the young people behind him rolled up their sleeves indignantly, wishing that they could go up and kill the provocative probe.","It was outrageous!","Gu Tingyun was calm since he had trained two zealots by now; it was a piece of cake to kill a probe.","However, when the two zealots started moving toward it, the probe turned and ran at top speed with a sway of its butt!","“Its good that it knows who’s more powerful!” Zhou Mo nodded and said, “It seems that this probe knows the great power of zealots.”","The moment he said it, Mr. Fang’s probe turned back around and continued to fire at Gu Tingyun’s probe.","Damn it!","The two zealots followed up again.","This time, they didn’t plan to let this unit of Mr. Fang go; they surrounded the probe from both sides.","Mr. Fang’s probe moved to the left for a while before turning a big circle and running out.","It dashed out from the gap between the two zealots.","“It is about to get away again?”","By now, the gateway had trained another zealot.","This zealot exerted force and dashed toward Fang Qi’s probe at a faster speed.","With the new operations, the players had more accurate control of the psionic power in the Protoss units if they could operate them in person.","Mr. Fang’s probe moved in a fancy and dashing fashion, swaying its butt.","Ding!","Two psi-blades struck on the tail wing of the probe; the light shield disappeared, which showed that the damage was high.","Then, the audience watched as Mr. Fang dragged the injured probe away.","“Humph! What was the use of harassing with this probe?” Xun Yuan said in disdain, “It scrambled away after zealots showed their hands.”","“If it is a distraction designed to pull the enemy away from their base, it isn’t a good one!” Wang Xie commented.","“Right!” Zong Wu nodded and said, “Now, Senior Gu can send zealots to harass his opponent’ base.”","After all, the zealots were not like probes which had little damage.","At this moment, someone glanced at Mr. Fang’s base and saw no offensive buildings and not even a defense tower. “Look at the shop owner’s base. He hasn’t even built the gateway yet!”","“He was busy directing the probe to harass and forgot to build his base!”","“Hahaha! Now that the zealots are going over, his base will be destroyed!”","“Academy Master Gu’s four zealots are going there!”","“The shop owner is placing photon cannons!”","“It’s too late, no?” Xun Yuan said contemptuously, “He doesn’t have any soldiers; what’s the use of building cannons now? How can he fight?”","“Ugh?! Senior Gu’s zealots are turning back?!” Gu Tingyun’s zealots had covered half of the distance between the two bases when they suddenly turned back.","“Mr. Fang canceled the building of the photon cannon?!”","“How come Senior Gu’s base is on fire?!” Mu Qing exclaimed while pointing at the screen.","They glanced up and almost spat blood on the screen. On the right-top corner behind an inconspicuous hill, Mr. Fang’s photon cannon appeared out of the blue and began firing at Gu Tingyun’s probes and base!","Some probes that came out of nowhere were still busying building more photon cannons!","“!!??” No one had noticed this place!","The two newly-trained zealots hurried up to help. Before they could get close, they felt a sense of dizziness when they saw another two photon cannons hiding behind the concealed location of the first one!","Boom! Boom!","One zealot was dead.","Not only Gu Tingyun, but the players watching from behind felt as if they would spit out blood as well!","Damn it! What kind of strategy is this?!"]},{"number":473,"title":"Chapter 473 - An Honorable Match?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","In the final phase and the hardest part of a chess game, there were some special moves for special situations, and one couldn’t lose if they followed the steps in the chess book.","In StarCraft, there were some strategies and certain moves similar to the ones recorded in the chess book. For example, Mr. Fang used this move of photon cannons, which was a killing move against new players.","However, it didn’t mean that the old players wouldn’t be fooled. To trick the old players, one had to have a great understanding of psychology and some luck.","In fact, everyone fooled by this move would instantly doubt their own intelligence since this strategy looked so dumb.","However, except for the super masters, there were so many people, new and old players, who fell for this trap that they could form a line around Earth.","In terms of the game, players didn’t find it easier to play when it was more real.","In the original version, one could find out from the red marks on the map if there were enemies. But now they could only see the surrounding area from the mental images transferred among different individual Protoss units besides the bird-view map of the area around the base and the camera surveillance on the buildings. On one hand, there wasn’t the fog of war anymore, but on the other hand, vision didn’t become more convenient.","Mr. Fang’s probe entered his rival’s base not only to provoke but to distract the audience and the enemy’s Protoss force. Meanwhile, he built photon cannons in the blind spot.","When Gu Tingyun withdrew the force from the outside, Fang Qi had almost finished building the fourth photon cannon!","The four photon cannons were planted near Gu Tingyun’s base like a malignant tumor. If they were not destroyed, Gu Tingyun couldn’t even send his probes to extract minerals.","However, even if he sent out his force, they were lowest-level Protoss units as their attack damage and defenses weren’t upgraded. Regardless of how good Gu Tingyun’s operations were, they were no match for the defense towers!","Fang Qi killed all the zealots and lost only one photon cannon!","While his photon cannons fired at Gu Tingyun’s probes, Mr. Fang built another photon cannon right beside Gu Tingyun’s base.","“...”","The audience watching from behind all turned red with pent-up rage; they felt like dying and taking Mr. Fang along.","Gu Tingyun took off his virtual reality headset and quitted the game! GG!","If he were another person, he would have jumped up and hit Mr. Fang with a chair.","Mr. Fang put down his virtual reality headset and turned his head, and he saw a group of people glaring at him with green eyes!","They were indignant!","How can he be so cunning!","“It wasn’t a fair match! Not fair at all!” Zhou Mo yelled in disapproval, “It was a win by playing tricks; one must move steadily in a real war. How could you use such a trick at the beginning of the game?!”","“Right. If it were a real war, it would be suicidal to build nothing in your own base. If anything went wrong, you would have been defeated easily!” Xun Yun said.","The audience had noticed that Mr. Fang had no defense towers or and no soldiers. With only probes, his base could be destroyed by a handful of enemies.","How can anyone command a war like this?! If the ancient families had done things this way, they would have been destroyed long ago.","“I think you should have another match!” Mu Qing said while eating spicy sticks.","“I think so too. One more match!” Many people seconded her opinion.","Gu Tingyu said, “Shall we have another match?”","At everyone’s urging, they started another match since it was in high demand.","This time, Gu Tingyun kept an eye on Mr. Fang’s tricks. He chose the map in which he had played the first 1 vs 7 game as Protoss. His base was in a valley with one opening, and he blocked the entrance with a photon cannon, so no one could enter under the monitoring of the defense tower.","Mr. Fang’s SCVs ventured to his opponent’s gate and returned when he found that his opponent was building a photon cannon. After all, one must have the opportunity to use the Rush Strategy. If there were no opportunity, they must give it up as it would be meaningless since it wouldn’t succeed.","In this match, Mr. Fang used the standard moves and commands and exchanged several rounds of attacks with his opponent. Despite Mr. Fang’s good skills, he didn’t want to compete with a grandmaster on micromanagement.","After all, grandmasters were fast learners, and these operations were not difficult for them.","A Protoss commander could control a portion of the soldiers with the psionic link personally like controlling several doppelgangers.","Mr. Fang’s opponent wasn’t an ordinary player but a super grand cultivator with extremely high cultivation strength.","With great micromanagement, he could even control three zealots simultaneously to hack bullets with blades; these scenes were thrilling to look both in terms of visual effect and skills.","The operations were almost impeccable.","This time, the random option gave Mr. Fang the race of Terrans which was a race that Gu Tingyun had not fought with before. Despite all that, Mr. Fang kept a steady pace with his moves.","– 20 minutes later –","“I told you that the shop owner is not good at this!”","“Look at Senior Gu’s base!”","“Such a huge battleship!”","“So many strange spiritual boats...”","Then, they looked at Mr. Fang’s home base.","“There are so few spiritual ships in the shop owner’s base...”","“Academy Master Gu is on the offense.”","Gu Tingyun’s screen was filled with all kinds of battleships, which showed a strong economy.","In contrast, Mr. Fang still had a mixture of air and ground forces.","If not mentioning the mix of forces, he had even launched a sneak attack when his opponent was out on the attack. In the end, he caused little damage to his opponent but lost all his soldiers.","What was stranger? They were puzzled that Mr. Fang had even brought a dropship for transportation in his sneak attack. This ship exploded before it could drop any soldiers.","“I’m sure that the shop owner is going to lose!”","Seeing Gu Tingyun leading the huge army of battleships to attack his enemy, the audience chattered in excitement.","Escorted by all kinds of ‘flying spiritual artifacts’, the golden battleships lined up like a wave of golden clouds, blocking out the sun.","When a huge golden ‘spiritual ship’ flew up slowly, and then the light surrounding it distorted. As if they were concealed by an intangible sky curtain, all the Protoss battleships turned invisible.","The yellow sand swept across the desolate wasteland, and the golden arbiter flew across the sky like a swallow-shaped shadow when one looked up. Only on Gu Tingyun’s screen could the audience see the massive number of battleships.","The huge group of battleships attacked from one side of Fang Qi’s base. The interceptors flying out from the huge battleships swarmed up like locusts. In the blink of an eye, most of the buildings in Fang Qi’s second base were destroyed including the reinforcements!","They swept toward the heart of the base with tremendous force."]},{"number":474,"title":"Chapter 474 - Is This Why You Call the Shop Owner Scum?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“The shop owner is going to lose for sure!”","“Hahahaha! Excellent! Excellent!” Zhou Mo said while laughing, “This group of spiritual ships is super powerful!”","Nodding, Zong Wu said, “In the last match, the shop owner caught us by surprise, but tricks can’t help him go far.”","More importantly, they had been feeling so indignant watching the last match that they felt exhilarated to see that Mr. Fang was finally at a disadvantage!","However, they saw a strange arrow-shaped ‘spiritual artifact’ slowly raising from the second base.","It shot up into the sky with a long tail of flames like a shooting star.","In the next moment, Gu Tingyun, who was sitting in the command station, suddenly turned his head and looked out of the window.","He saw an object landed with a long tail of flames!","It landed right in the center of the buildings around the base.","Next, the audience felt as if their eyes were going to pop out when they saw a huge mushroom-shaped cloud rising into the air with earth-shaking noises!","Then, everything in sight, including the spiritual ships and buildings, was shattered into pieces by a horrifying force!","A destructive blast instantly radiated out, and the shields outside the base were torn into pieces like paper! Then, the metal armor of the base melted and shattered into dust.","The audience reached out their heads and watched the scene in terror!","“What’s this?!”","When they recovered their eyesights, which had been blinded by the dazzling light, they found that the heart of the base had become a ruin.","Only a few buildings in the outer range remained standing.","The audience felt like their minds turned blank at this scene.","“The thing came from the shop owner’s base?!” They had clearly seen something fly out of his base.","“Destroy this base!” The audience yelled, looking more impatient than Gu Tingyun.","At this moment, in Mr. Fang’s commander center, a strange ball slowly floated after some battlecruisers.","Meanwhile, Mr. Fang’s hands moved so swiftly that it looked like he was having a stroke.","A violent shaking spread out from the Protoss battleships. Almost instantly, the EMP Shockwave from the Science Vessel paralyzed most of the psionic shields of the Protoss army!","A strange ripple swept across the Protoss battleships— scanner sweep.","All the invisible units were revealed!","“My Goodness! Look at Mr. Fang’s screen!” People saw Mr. Fang directing the battlecruisers and the wraiths to cover others while he himself controlled two wraiths to fly into the core of the Protoss battleship fleet in an elegant arc while bullets shot around them.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","In the smoke, the Protoss observer which could detect invisible units was found out and destroyed.","When the damaged wraiths aircrafts returned from battle, another two wraiths flew out and destroyed another observer together with the other aircraft. On the screen, Mr. Fang swiftly switched screens, drove the aircrafts, and issued orders all at the same time.","Now the wraiths turned invisible, and the Protoss couldn’t detect their whereabouts!","Like ghosts, the wraiths attacked the carrier that no longer had the protection of energy shields. When the battlecruisers fired, the carriers tried to flee, but they suddenly were frozen in mid-air.","They were locked by ghosts; Mr. Fang had moved them up without alerting his enemies.","“Pull over more troops! Steady!”","The Protoss base, which had been razed to the ground, was in reconstruction. It was lucky that the nuclear missle didn’t have radiation. Otherwise, the whole base would have become a wasteland.","At this moment, several banshee aircraft flew into Gu Tingyun’s base and directly fired at the nexus even though it was still warping in.","“...” Gu Tingyun was livid with fury, and his face almost turned green.","Can’t you wait until I rebuild the base?","In the second base, a row of dropships flew in, and then tanks formed a line while many marines gathered. The marines instantly started firing, the ends of their guns looking like a long dragon of flames.","Meanwhile, tanks were moving in from the front!","The Protoss’s main force was forced to retreat, and the newly-formed military force was instantly scattered by the Terran forces that were coming from all side. The Protoss force couldn’t put up a defense.","“Oh my goodness...” The audience watching in the back gasped.","It was obvious that the Protoss’s military force was more powerful, but at Mr. Fang’s command, the human units worked together seamlessly. The aircraft that he personally controlled pierced into the heart of the enemy like a sharp blade!","The machines followed Mr. Fang’s swift orders completely, moving at a dizzying fast speed without losing formation. They attacked the three Protoss bases from six directions, and the survivors of the Protoss main force fled back with more than half of its soldiers lost!","“Ahh!” Mu Qing yelled while pointing at the screen. “How can the shop owner command so well?!’","“Doesn’t everyone call him the scummy shop owner?” The few girls looked incredulous.","Zhou Mo gazed at the screen in a daze. “It shouldn’t have ended like this...”","Zong Wu craned his neck as if he wished to dig into the screen.","With ashen faces, Xun Yuan and the others stared at Gu Tingyun’s screen which was filled with flying ‘spiritual artifacts’ and Terran troops that were razing everywhere.","The Protoss had been in the advantage, but the tables were turned when the horrible mushroom-shaped cloud rose into the sky.","“What the heck was that?!”","“What was the thing that had instantly got rid of all the shields on the Protoss battleships?!”","The war scenes were so magnificent and real in the virtual reality that the audience was awe-struck even though they watched the scenes merely through the screen.","Displeased, Mu Qing asked in the group chat in QQ. [Didn’t you guys always say the shop owner is scum and trash? How come he’s so powerful?!]","The people in the group chat always called him sum and trash! She just couldn’t believe what she had just seen!","He had defeated Chong Lou with dirty tricks; then how come he became so powerful all of a sudden?","[???] Nalan Mingxue sent three question marks. [The shop owner has always been powerful. <img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f605.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F605;\">]","[Then, why do you call him scum and trash?!]","Liu Ningyun replied, [We say it to vent our frustration since we can’t defeat him...]","Nalan Hongwu chimed in, [Wait, don’t tell me that you guys went to mess with him.]","The cultivators in Yuanyang City read the messages in the group.","Xun Yuan replied, [...]","Wang Xie send, [...<img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f613.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F613;\">]","Zong Wu added, [<img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f44d.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F44D;\">]","Gu Tingyun exited the game and glared at the messages in the group chat. [This is why you call him scummy shop owner and trash every day?! <img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f605.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F605;\">]","Tang Yu followed up, [...]","Damn it! Why are you only telling the truth after he tortured us like this?!"]},{"number":475,"title":"Chapter 475 - We Live on a Star as Well?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Mr. Fang suddenly found that people were staring at him with weird looks on their faces.","“Why are you staring at me?” Mr. Fang touched his face. “Do I have flowers on my face?”","The others were speechless.","“Pooh! Scummy shop owner!” Mu Qing mumbled and turned back to her game.","The others who had wanted to watch the shop owner’s defeat looked embarrassed.","They were not on the same level as Mr. Fang. Obviously, Mr. Fang had reached quite a high level in the understanding of different strategies and making the different units work in harmony while they were still at the stage of simply moving armies.","“He’s really good!” Zong Wu was amazed to find that the young shop owner had such a good understanding of strategies.","“Boss, how come you’re also good at this game?” Jiang Xiaoyue stared at his screen curiously with wide-open eyes. “Boss, what were those things that you just used? They are indeed powerful!”","She had seen that there were many ‘spiritual ships’ parked in Gu Tingyun’s base after the carriers were sent out to attack. However, these ships were all destroyed by Mr. Fang’s bomb which also left a terrifying crater in the ground.","“That weapon was indeed powerful!” Li Lanruo still looked fearful when she recalled the shocking sight of the mushroom cloud and the power which shattered everything in one instant. “The humans look tiny and fragile, but their spiritual weapons are so powerful. I wonder how they make these spiritual artifacts!”","It was more than powerful! Its power went beyond their imagination!","“How could humans are so powerful?!”","Hearing this question, everyone turned to look at him.","“Um...” Mr. Fang didn’t know how to answer this question of how to make a nuclear missile. I’m just the owner of an internet café; how can I explain this to you?","“Let’s enter the game to find the answer!” Tang Yu said.","...","In the other two shops, the customers were mostly playing the campaign mode. Right now, there were no group chats in QQ for StarCraft yet, but someone had created the StarCraft Post Bar. The new players of this game could open and browse the post bar when they took a break from fighting battles in the campaign mode.","Not everyone would play the new games when they just came out. Most of the customers were still playing old games; only the customers who loved new things or followed the footprints of the shop owner tried StarCraft.","However, with the increase of the players in the shops, there were many people playing StarCraft already.","They included old players such as Su Tianji, Li Haoran, Duan Yue who was the head artifact master who led the project of the Heavenly Mirror in the Half City Shop, and the disciples of the Nanhua Faction.","Even Nalan Hongwu, a loyal player of Diablo and the Legend of the Sword and Fairy, had begun playing StarCraft since it was a product of Blizzard.","At this moment, Nalan Hongwu had just finished a battle while controlling Raynor in campaign mode. He took a break and opened the post bar.","Then, he was startled; there were thousands of replies to posts in the newly-established StarCraft Post Bar.","[Where Is StarCraft happening?] Soon, he saw a post that was really popular in the post bar.","He opened the post and saw that it was from a girl with ID ‘Sprite’. There were many screenshots in the post, including a picture showing the limitless universe with a huge black metal spaceship filling the screen. Above the ship was a dark red planet.","The spaceship traveled silently in the void like an island, followed by many small strange-looking bats.","Ning Bi was reading the many replies to her discussion post.","[Is this a screenshot of the game?]","[It looks like the starry sky at the beginning of the game!]","[Did you see that there’s no land below the ship?! The land is the red sphere above the spiritual ship.]","“This land is a sphere?” The cultivators in the Jiuhua City Shop and the Half City Shop had never ventured out of the Deserted Sea Realm, and it was natural that they didn’t know the shape of their land.","“...”","Nalan Hongwu browsed the screenshots and saw that this battleship was flying toward the nearby red sphere. When it got closer, the land looked larger until it became a vast and broad continent.","Then, he saw another reply, [They (the people in the game) always talk about stars; could it be that they live on stars?]","Nalan Hongwu was deep in thought.","[Sir, do the people in StarCraft... really live on stars? <img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f61c.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F61C;\">] With a cup of milk tea in her hand, Ning Bi sent a message to Mr. Fang on QQ as if she had discovered a new continent, [Stars twinkle, right? How come the stars they live on don’t twinkle?]","“Um...?” Mr. Fang read this message and felt as if he was looking at an elementary schoolgirl in the world where he had lived before his journey to this world. [How come you are so naïve...]","The moment that he replied to the message, another person’s icon jumped.","Nalan Hongwu asked, [Sir, the people in StarCraft actually live on stars?]","Nalan Mingxue questioned, [(A screenshot of the universe) I feel like these people live on stars. But... do the stars really look like this?]","Mr. Fang was at a loss for words.","He suddenly found that Ning Bi wasn’t the only naïve person; it seemed like all the people here were naïve.","They were as curious as children.","Jiang Xiaoyue suddenly asked, “Ugh? How come you’re all talking about stars? And the people living on stars?”","Mu Qing replied, “It’s very magical. Living on stars; won’t they fall down?”","Mr. Fang’s face turned dark. This is magical?","Mr. Fang said, “Did it ever occur to you...”","He rephrased his words and said, “Maybe, I mean maybe, the land we are standing on is also a star. Have you never thought about it?”","“How can it be?!” Sitting next to Mr. Fang, Jiang Xiaoyue mumbled to herself, “Boss is trying to fool us again.”","Mr. Fang’s words landed like a bomb and created giant waves, but soon many people expressed their disagreement.","Yue Bai said, “If we lived on a star, I would be a fairy, right? <img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f600.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F600;\">”","Ning Bi added, “I wonder if they are really in the sky, but I do envy them.”","Su Tianji sent a message in the group chat in QQ while eating instant noodles, [(A screenshot of the starry sky) So beautiful!]","Mu Donglai: [Indeed beautiful! More beautiful than the view that I had seen when standing on the Star-Observing Tower.]","“...”","They had never seen the view of the whole world or the sight beyond the sky, which was probably why they couldn’t imagine the view of their planet from space."]},{"number":476,"title":"Chapter 476 - Issue Derived from StarCraft","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","As a person who had traveled through space and time, Mr. Fang took it for granted that the Earth was a sphere in his understanding.","However, the people who were born and raised in this world all thought Mr. Fang was wrong, and they completely rejected his suggestion.","However, Mr. Fang thought it was meaningless to argue with them. After all, he had even traveled through space and time, and thus he shouldn’t be surprised by this as even stranger things might happen.","Of course, Mr. Fang still thought that he was right since the sun, the moon, and the stars above their heads were not fake.","Despite their puzzlement about this problem, the players were enjoying the game greatly. Although the battles in campaign mode usually happened on different planets, they could still appreciate the endless universe during the animations being scenes.","[These zerg units looks powerful...] Ning Bi posted a picture showing a group of zerg units catching up with battlecruisers in space. [How do they fly?]","[With wings <img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f60f.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F60F;\">]","[Nonsense. This zerg unit looks like a big crab! How can it have no wings but still fly?]","Mr. Fang replied, [<img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f605.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F605;\"> They fly with psionic power...]","They talked about these novel things in the group chat from morning to night. For example, they wondered why the universe was always dark and why the people didn’t fly during the day.","Meanwhile, a group of artifact masters had begun their new research.","[Look! Isn’t it powerful?!] In the group chat for artifact masters, Tang Yu posted a picture of a mushroom cloud. [I finally launched it after being killed by the computer many times...<img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f600.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F600;\">]","[How come this power is so great?! <img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f628.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F628;\">]","[What’s this? A new spiritual artifact?] Some artifact masters who hadn’t seen this scene before asked in surprise.","Li Haoran said, [Can anyone explain the theory of this? What kind of gunpowder can achieve this effect?]","Duan Yue added, [It appears to be more destructive than the explosion of my damn furnace when I tried to make the Heavenly Mirror...]","It was well known that the first batch of gunpowder was a by-product of ancient Daoists trying to make elixir pills, and there were similar things in this world. In most cases, they were treated as failures in the elixir making process.","Lan Mo chimed in, [I’ve thought for a long time and still can’t figure out a way to study the mushroom cloud, Daoist friends. I just couldn’t understand it.]","Jun Yangzi voiced his opinion, [I think the gauss rifle is more interesting. It uses lightning which is part of our spiritual spells, right? Spiritual spells are our strong suit, no?]","Duan Buyi typed, [<img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f624.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F624;\"> It needs a highly steady source of lightning energy, not like the spells that we use to shock people for a quick second.]","Jun Yanzi posted the rough blueprint and the design drawing of a huge crossbow. He said furiously, [Can’t we think of a solution to this problem? Even ordinary people could do it. This...]","[I intend to make it into an advanced weapon like the Immortal-Slaying Crossbow. This crossbow is quite simple in structure, but we can put other features on it.]","In fact, Baoping Spiritual Master was an experienced artifact master. The moment this cultivator joined the group, she heard people talking about this topic. [Our Heavenly Academy has a spiritual spell which can transform lightning fire into threads. Maybe we can try it?]","[Good idea!] Tang Yu clapped his hands with bright eyes, ignoring the mushroom cloud that he had no clue about how to research. [I think we can further simplify the crossbow and attach spiritual spells, or even better, arrays... maybe we can get a rough draft first?]","[Good! Good!]","[This spiritual artifact would be awesome!]","[I think we can make it more powerful than those in the game.]","[We can make a big one with runes engraved on it and put it on a spiritual ship.]","Li Haoran, [Good idea! It will be unrivaled!]","[Um...] Someone with the ID of ‘Spiritual Ship Expert Gongshu Kuo’ posted a screenshot of a carrier. [Daoist friends, do you think we can make a spiritual ship like this one?]","[This...<img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f633.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F633;\"> you can study it at your leisure, Brother.]","[Best wishes to you.]","[I hope I can see it before I die.]","[If you succeed, you’ll be famous for thousands of years as your name will be recorded into history books.]","[No, for 10,000 years.]","“...”","For the artifact masters, playing games wasn’t the only fun thing to do; they also enjoyed studying all kinds of strange spiritual artifacts and discussing their ideas in the group chat.","Of course, some people could only play games. For example...","Jiang Xiaoyue was now driving a vulture vehicle, screaming all the way as she did it. With a dark face, Mr. Fang turned off her external communication.","Controlling Kerrigan (Queen of Blades) who was still a ghost agent, Su Tianji was doing well with her excellent shooting skills.","She posted a screenshot in the group; the picture showed her leaning on a wall in a deserted human base. While wiping sweat off her forehead, she said, [This battle was hard, but I still got through. Hahaha! (Husky’s laughing face)]","[Which battle is this?]","Su Tianji replied, [The battle in which I was ordered to stall the Protoss army. I did it all by myself (Jiang Xiaoyue’s smug face with the victory hand).]","It was an epic victory in which she blocked so many Protoss elite units all by herself; it was a battle that could be recorded in the history.","Jiang Xiaoyue typed, [Sister Su, how can you steal my personal emoji! <img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f620.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F620;\">]","[Awesome! I haven’t reached that part yet!]","[Magnificent!]","Su Tianji replied, [It finally ended. I’ll take a good break afterwards!]","In the war among the Terrans, Protoss, and Zerg in StarCraft, each battle was legendary and much more magnificent than those in other games. They were more so in the system version of the game.","The humans who were as tiny as ants stood in the huge ruins and looked up at the huge carriers that were blocking the sky, and the groups of zerg units flew all over the sky in the smoke and devoted themselves in these battles. Even from the perspective of a cultivator, it felt exhilarated to experience such a magnificent battle.","As if they were being summoned by something, many zerg units swarmed up like ocean waves.","[Ugh? Sir, how come my communication is cut off? I was told that I can retreat after the battle, right?] Suddenly, Su Tianji sent a message in the group chat.","[The battle that Sister Kerrigan is in?]","[You’re finished. You might have been betrayed.]","Su Tianji asked, [What?!]","Putting on the combat goggles, Su Tianji looked forward and saw many zerg units surging up toward her like ocean waves.","There was no exit or reinforcement; she was surrounded by many zerg units; they were everywhere.","It was probably the first time that humans faced a horrifying force like this one. The sea of zerg was even more terrifying than heavenly power.","The gun slipped down from Su Tianji’s fingers when despair swallowed her like cold sea water.","At this moment, one could best understand why a human elite would embark on the road of revenge as the Queen of Blades.","“F*ck! I quit!” she cussed."]},{"number":477,"title":"Chapter 477 - Hand Slipped","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","[These humans are truly trash.] Ning Bi also suddenly posted a screenshot of her being surrounded by zerg units.","Su Tianji asked, [You came to this part as well?]","Nalan Mingxue chimed in, [I just finished the battle. I can’t carry these humans.]","Xun Yuan typed, [Have you noticed that most of the people in this game look like the western barbarians?]","While people talked about the plot of StarCraft in the group chats, some people had come to the battle which signaled the end of the plot about the Terrans and the beginning of the story about the emergence of the Queen of Blades of the Zerg.","In the Yuanyang City Shop, players began the multiplayer mode.","On the screen, a 2 vs 2 battle had begun; the two parties were Gu Tingyun and Wang Xie vs Zong Wu and Tang Yu.","A group of people watched the match from behind.","“This game doesn’t only test your strategies and tactics. Watch carefully!” Gu Tingyun looked more experienced after being defeated and ‘tortured’ by the shop owner several times. On the screen, two archons (white balls) and four high templars were attacking Zong Wu’s Protoss base under the protection of several zealots and dragoons.","There was a river that had a width of several dozens of meters before the base, and several photon cannons stood on the bridge.","“The strong suit of Protoss is splitting the mind and multitasking.” The two archons that he controlled shot apart the light shield of one photon cannon with two sharp psionic shockwaves.","Then, the four high templars formed an array as if they knew each other’s mind; a psionic storm instantly engulfed a large area before them.","Meanwhile, something concealed in the darkness moved swiftly in the base, creating violent gales.","“The Protoss units connect with each other with the psionic link, which makes each unit our eyes.” The archon appeared as if it had eyes on the back of its head; it suddenly turned around and shot a huge psionic shockwave toward a prior blind spot.","A dark shadow flashed – dark templar!","The saber energies hacking toward the high templars slipped and shattered the energy shields but missed the high templars behind; this wasn’t lethal.","“Oh My Goodness!” The audience exclaimed from behind.","Meanwhile, several zealots surrounded them.","These newly-trained Protoss soldiers only had the lowest level of strength, but when they were controlled by Zong Wu, a warrior whose strength was close to the Emperor Warrior Realm, their strength almost reached the hero level!","Moving with weird steps, they dodged the surrounding of the enemy units and broke the enemies’ energy shields with sharp blades. Immediately, several enemy zealots died under the psi-blades.","In the next moment, groups of zealots dashed toward Gu Tingyun’s army.","At least six of the zealots were much more powerful than the others. One of them even dodged the psionic shockwave from an archon and got close to it.","Zong Wu said, “This game can hone your sense of strategy, but it is also effective and powerful training for your mental energy.”","The six zealots under Zong Wu’s control obviously received less damage compared to others while slashing their blades from all kinds of impossible angles; it was a thrilling sight.","While controlling the archons, Gu Tingyun quickly issued many commands, directing the reinforcements to move the high templars to another spot by the shuttle aircraft. It was a fast, lightning-like raid. The operations were smoothly done in one breath.","Obviously, these grand cultivators were fast learners and had become very strong at least in operations and micromanagement.","Even Mr. Fang was surprised while he watched from behind. This old guy can operate so fast after playing only for a short time! How did he do that... Damn! Aren’t his hands going to slip?","“Auch! My high templars fell into the river!” The swift, stroke-like operations stopped, and he slammed his hand on his thighs while yelling in regret.","“...”","The audience watched as the high templars that fell into the river struggled, and their lips twitched.","Gu Tingyun’s old face turned dark. “Anyway, this game is very helpful to strengthen your mental energy.”","...","“Haa—!” In his room on the second floor, Mr. Fang stretched while the scene before his eyes changed.","Before him stood a young man; he wore a purple-gold crown and had a dark purple sword in his hand.","He’s the Jing Tian who has defeated the Evil Sword Immortal in the second act of the Legend of Sword and Fairy 3; maybe I can try fighting him. Mr. Fang tightened his grip on his sword while staring at his opponent intently.","He could feel his opponent’s sharp sword spirit. The sword techniques that Jing Tian used were a little bit rough around the edges, but he moved like a grandmaster.","Fang Qi’s sword techniques had become even more sophisticated. His style was a mixture of techniques from both the east and the west. The eastern techniques came from the Shu Mountain Faction and Wu Ming’s heavenly sword, which were elegant and deep; the western techniques included Dante’s double-handed sword moves which were broad yet nimble.","The sword energies collided, and they exchanged dozens of attacks in an instant. The mountains on both sides were hacked open, and boulders rolled down with debris.","“He’s getting stronger and stronger...” With a grim expression, Fang Qi continued to block the sword energies that were as swift as lightning flashes.","...","The clouds in the sky dimmed; huge turbid waves surged up.","The sky above the shore of the Heavenly Abyss Sea turned from sunny to darkness in the blink of an eye; it seemed like it was another world.","Someone seemed to be whispering in the shadows in the sky.","“That person... that came from the other side of the Heavenly Abyss Sea was found?”","“It is another cycle...”","“Zixiao is dead. Does the Jiang Family want to touch the forbidden area now?”","“He killed the Nangong Family’s sword slaves and broke the Immortal-Hacking Sword Array.”","“The ability to understand the basic laws. The thing that that bunch of prisoners have been craving for might have appeared.”","“Indeed. Only with this ability could one instantly kill sword slaves.”","“That person seems to have re-established the connections between the places separated by the Heavenly Forbidden Zones; he did what Zixiao had done before.”","“Kill him! We must cut off any connections with the place inside the Heavenly Forbidden Zones.”","“Regardless of how powerful he is, he can’t get away from us.”","“No... We don’t need to show our hands.”","The small town on the shore of the Heavenly Abyss Sea was silent. Despite the huge sounds of the surging ocean waves, the people of the town seemed to be in a deep slumber. Right now, two figures standing on the cliff seemed to be whispering to each other about something.","“Nangong Lin of the Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace is getting more arrogant.”","“After all, those few broken swords in the Nangong Family are going to wake up...”","“This is their best opportunity to conquer and unite all seven ancient families; they won’t let it pass.”","“Maybe, we can nudge them toward it a bit faster.”","“Good idea.”","“...”","The voices turned faint and distant, and the two figures vanished in the light wind and thin clouds in the sky as if nothing had happened."]},{"number":478,"title":"Chapter 478 - Can Be Said as Very Pleased","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Under the leadership of some elders, the Heavenly Academy formed a research group to develop a series of gauss weapons.","For cultivators, it was not a big deal to change the shapes of lightning bolts, flames, and other things. In fact, some powerful spiritual spells took the form of dragons, phoenixes, or kirins not only for good looks; some auspicious symbols coming from the ancient bloodlines represented a force or a type of control of some energy.","One of the inherited spiritual spells in the Heavenly Academy could transform lightning fire into thin threads; it was a method to increase one’s control of spiritual spells.","The Baoping Spiritual Master had studied this area with her research group formed by disciples for a while now. The moment she logged into QQ, she found that people were talking about this topic in the group chat.","Li Haoran said, [We have understood a small part of the structure of the gun.]","In the game, he had disassembled a small part of his gun.","On the ground by his feet was loot that he got from the enemy marines.","Baoping Spiritual Master replied, [The structure looks simple... It’s a metal coil with lightning energy?]","Li Haoran said, [There are some complicated shooting mechanisms, but I think this is the main part.]","Tang Yu chimed in, [It sounds simple, but when I was trying to mimic it, the bullet got stuck in the coil and wouldn’t shoot out. Please tell me where it went wrong <img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f62d.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F62D;\"> It looks so simple...]","You’re reading on .com Thanks!","Baoping Spiritual Master replied, [Really? I thought one coil was enough...]","Very naïve.","When electricity was conducted into the metal coil, the electromagnetic force at both ends would reach the maximum, but the thrust forces were aiming at the opposite direction, which meant that the bullet would be pushed and stuck in the middle. To solve the problem, they had to release the electricity in pulses. These people just put electricity into the coil without thinking, and it was natural that the bullet wouldn’t come out.","These cultivators obviously knew nothing about theories and thus encountered awkward problems when they mimicked the structures.","Li Haoran said, [I thought this thing would be super simple. How come the bullets can’t shoot out?]","Tang Yu seconded that, [Yeah. Could it be that these guns are fake?]","Duan Yue refuted, [<img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f605.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F605;\"> We even simulated about 30 percent the power of Heavenly Mirror, and its force was unrivaled. Don’t say things that you don’t understand.]","Since most cultivators knew a little about artifact making, sometimes the group chat for artifact masters was visited by people not of this profession.","Su Tianji read the discussions in the group chat and downloaded a copy of the theory behind the use of the spell that could transform lightning fire into threads, which wasn’t a confidential document.","Su Tianji said, [Daoist friends, with our abilities, don’t you think that we can use the theory of the gauss guns to make a new spiritual spell? For example, we can discard the spiritual artifact and transform the lightning energy into a coil with our lightning spell. Then, we just put in the bullets; it will be more convenient.]","Mr. Fang added, [Good idea. Are you going to research it? <img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f60f.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F60F;\">]","[!!?? How come the shop owner slipped into our group?] Baoping Spiritual Master was surprised.","[Even she, a person who has never made artifacts before, could slip in, why can’t I? Don’t forget who taught you the gun-making knowledge.] Mr. Fang wiped sweat off his forehead. [Just came out of training, and I’m surprised to find that you are talking about such an interesting topic.]","Duan Yue replied, [<img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f605.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F605;\"> Mr. Fang’s everywhere.]","Baoping Spiritual Master asked, [Do you guys want to research and develop new spiritual spells?]","Indeed, if they were like the ordinary people in the game, studying guns would be more than enough on their plates. However, they were cultivators with extremely high cultivation strengths, and some of them excelled in the lightning spell.","Some of them could directly use things and command power that others couldn’t even do with the help of spiritual artifacts.","Perhaps one day, they didn’t have to borrow heavenly power or ancient auspicious symbols in their spiritual spells; they would invent some new and special spiritual spells.","Mr. Fang said, [You guys can indeed look into it. I even have a name for this spell...]","Su Tianji quickly chimed in, [I got a name for it too! I think it can be called Tianji Godly-Lightning! <img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f60e.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F60E;\">]","Ning Bi said, [Green (Bi) Water Godly Lightning sounds better <img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f600.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F600;\">]","Li Haoran suggested, [Call it Qian-Kun Limitless Shocking-Thunder Cannon!]","Mr. Fang was at a loss for words. [...<img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f605.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F605;\"> I can’t find names dumber than these. Can you have a more serious case of eighth-grader syndrome?]","...","While people were in heated discussions in the group chats in QQ, several elders gathered in the Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace.","The chilly murderous spirit filled the solemn great hall.","In recent years, the ambitious Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace had restrained their behaviors and kept themselves within the acceptable zone.","After all, the other big ancient families were too powerful to be ignored.","“What the heck is the background of the shop in Yuanyang City? Have you found it out?” The middle-aged man sitting in the center of the great hall asked; his eyes were deep, and profound light flashed in there.","“This kid seems to come from the Deserted Sea Realm,” a silver-robed old man said, “In normal circumstances, a cultivator from the Deserted Sea Realm can’t be so powerful.”","“Indeed, the cultivators from Deserted Sea Realm can’t catch up with us even after 10,000 years.”","“Do you mean...” The dignified-looking man sitting in the center of the great hall said, “This kid got a treasure?”","“Something like that, even if it isn’t exact,” the old man said, “is good news for our Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace.”","“But...” the middle-aged man said coldly, “I heard that even that old Gu Tingyun is involved with this shop.”","“Hmph! How much longer can that old guy live?” the old man said with a snort, “When those people of our Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace come out, no one is our match, not the other ancient families or the Heavenly Academy!”","“We have waited for so long!”","A gloomy growl came from the Sword Tomb of Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace; it wasn’t a human’s voice. The sound was deep and metallic, and it felt as if it were resonating in everyone’s heart.","The disciples of the Nangong Family who were guarding the entrance of the Sword Tomb looked terrified as if they had seen the most horrifying thing in their lives.","“I think...” the elder said coldly, “Before we conquer the ancient families, we must remove that obstacle and the Heavenly Academy. We can stun the ancient families and show them the great force of our Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace!”","“By then, they will understand the situation and submit to us. Otherwise, we will show them no mercy, and they can’t complain about it!”","Hearing that gloomy sound, the people in the great hall looked pleased instead of terrified. “What a surprise... What made them wake up so early?”","One elder suggested, “I think we can invite the masters of the big ancient families to watch how we remove these people who overestimate themselves in person.”","“Right!” another elder said fiercely, “In the past 1,000 years, no one dared to mess with people of our family; even the big ancient families must be respectful toward us. Who is this kid? How dare he try to act tough before us?! I’ll see how he looks when we raze his shop to the ground!”","“Wen’er had the best talent in the younger generations of our family; I’ll let these wastrels die with him to keep him company! This is the only way that I can vent my anger!”","“Hahaha!” Hearty laughter came from the great hall.","They were very happy at this prospect."]},{"number":479,"title":"Chapter 479 - Prelude","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Chilly rain engulfed Yuanyang City, turning the warm weather gloomy all of a sudden.","Such bad weather was rarely seen in this ancient city.","Raindrops flowed down from the eaves and gathered in the ditches on both sides of the streets before flowing into the man-made canals in the city.","A ghost-like figure appeared from nowhere. It stood on the stone bridge while holding a black paper umbrella, watching the rapid currents under the bridge run to the distance while carrying fallen leaves with them.","“How is the situation in the Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace?”","“Don’t worry. When those swords come out, even if we don’t interfere, they won’t stay put. Those guys have always been ambitious.” The voice seemed to come from the rapid currents under the bridge or from the gloomy rain that was engulfing the city.","“The turbid mortal world is like a boat, and the people in it are like tiny weeds that were trying to cross the bitter ocean of life. Only...” The cold eyes stared at the fallen leaves and broken branches that were floating in the river as if it were watching everything that was happening in the mortal world with cold eyes. The voice under the umbrella seemed to merge into the rain and gradually faded away.","...","“How come it is raining all of a sudden?” Jiang Xiaoyue complained when she entered the shop with a small floral umbrella in her hand.","“It’s just rain. Achoo!” A few other girls came in with her after being released from school. Mu Qing looked dry even though she didn’t hold an umbrella.","She suddenly sneezed. “How come the rain feels so gloomy today?’","“Get me a cup of milk tea!”","A new day began from a cup of delicious milk tea.","“Boss!”","Instead of playing games, Mr. Fang was sitting on a couch in the lounge area, which was quite unusual.","He was probably staring at the sky at a 45-degree angle.","“Bo...ss...!” Jiang Xiaoyue waved her little white palm before Mr. Fang’s face for a while.","“Ugh?” He snapped back.","“Boss, what were you thinking, staring into the air?”","“Are you worrying about the situation with the Nangong Family?” Li Lanruo asked in concern.","“What thing with the Nangong Family?” Mr. Fang looked nonplussed.","After all, the Nangong Family had never been disgraced like this; this wasn’t a small grudge. It had threatened its reputation as an ancient family.","Li Lanruo had been feeling uneasy lately. “I’m worried about the quietness; I’m afraid they are making some schemes in the dark.”","“You’re right.” Mu Qing who had been sipping milk tea heard Li Lanruo’s words and said, “After all, the Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace has always been arrogant and aggressive in the past 1,000 years; they kill others but never allow others to kill their people.”","Next, Mr. Fang would probably receive a heavy blow from the Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace with their powerful trump cards that they had concealed for a long time. As a huge ancient family that had a vast accumulation of resources, it only needed to use a few of these trump cards to destroy a major faction.","“Um...?” Nonplussed, Mr. Fang looked at them and said, “I don’t know how to phrase some words, and I wonder what you will think of them.”","Beside him, Li Lanruo lowered her head to slowly sip milk tea without a word. Obviously, she didn’t know what to say.","She kept her face lowered; she almost buried it under the couch. It seemed like she was afraid that she had misspoken and caused trouble.","“Sir! You don’t have to hide your fear from us!” Mu Qing seemed eager to see Mr. Fang act soft. After all, she could only obtain some satisfaction with words since she couldn’t defeat him in the game.","“Why would I be afraid?” Mr. Fang said, “I just want to know what you think of the option of livestream. If you guys can also livestream...”","On Mr. Fang’s System Interface, a new task appeared.","[New Task: Establishing Dominance is Required to Keep a Foothold (2)","Task Description: Please establish dominance again so that the players in the shop can get online without worrying (No restrictions on methods that can be used)","Task Completion: Upon completing this task, it will show that the host has become a qualified internet café owner and can unlock more privileges.","Task Reward: Fortune Prize Wheel, increase of privileges, unlocking of QQ E-Sports and QQ Livestream (Customers can watch the livestream by downloading QQ on their communication jades; the members of the shop can download it without charge)]","“We can livestream too?” Jiang Xiaoyue almost jumped up with surprise and joy. She had been in the shop for a long time and could only watch Mr. Fang livestream while feeling envious.","I can livestream as well?","She didn’t know how Mr. Fang did the outdoor livestream, but it would be awesome to show her excellent strategies and gameplay to others even from inside the shop.","After all, Mr. Fang had been showing off his skills every day and Jiang Xiaoyue could do nothing but watch.","“Ugh...?” The others exchanged a look and said in pleasant surprise, “Can we do it too?”","...","– Meanwhile, in the Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace –","Deep beneath the gloomy Sword Tomb, there was no light; it was as black as Hell.","With a gloomy low growl, a dark red light suddenly flashed from the depths of the underground.","Among the sounds of metal chains dragging on the ground and inhuman deep growls, groups of people in chains, young and old, kneeled on the ground as if they were worshiping their god.","The broken ancient tombs looked like the residences of dominating gods or fierce, man-eating devils. While the gloomy and dark lights jumped, the lights in these people’s eyes also moved. The ominous and gloomy growls struck fear into people’s minds and sent chills down their spines.","It was an ancient and powerful sword spirit which had existed for endless years but had never been eroded by time. The sword spirit inside the broken sword seemed more terrifying than the darkness in the deep abyss.","The ancient engravings and sword-slash marks on the tombstones were almost ground away by time, and all of this seemed to be telling a glorious story in the distant past.","The dark lights lit up, and in the tombs laid ancient-looking long swords. Some of the swords were so rusted that it was hard to imagine their original looks, and some were covered by all kinds of ugly and vicious cuts from other weapons in battles, looking as if they would shatter in the next moment.","However, no one dared to ignore the horrid, crazy, and demon-like sword spirits contained in the swords. Only one thread of this maniac sword spirit could induce the deepest fear in people’s minds.","“Do you feel that?!” Wild laughter came from the great hall of the Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace; it sounded so arrogant as if everything in the world were under its feet and beneath it.","Perhaps soon, everything in the world would indeed be beneath its feet and could no longer be in its eyes, because...","Crack!","A pitch-black thunderbolt crashed down, and a black sword energy shot up from beneath the Sword Tomb!","“I wonder which ancestral master is coming out...”","“Greetings, Ancestral Master! We all welcome your arrival!” All the disciples of the Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace including Nangong Lin fell on their knees."]},{"number":480,"title":"Chapter 480 - A Netizen Meetup?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Are the Daoist tokens issued?” In the black winds, Nangong Lin’s slightly withered face oozed cold murderous spirit.","When the godly swords in the Sword Tomb that were guarded by the Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace for generations came out, it was natural for the palace to invite the ancient families to attend and watch the ceremony.","It was an opportunity for the Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace to show off their dominant strength to the world.","By that time, Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace would remove all the obstacles before them and make all the forces in the Spiritual State submit to this almighty sword power.","Before Nangong Lin were about 100 prisoners in ragged clothes bound by black chains.","Some of them were enemies of the Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace, some of them were traitors, and some of them were zealous followers.","After being immersed in the horrid sword spirit in the Sword Tomb for many years, they had been transformed into half-human half-ghost sword slaves who could do nothing but follow orders.","The other ancient families had thought that this was the biggest trump card of the Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace since the ancient times. If they had seen the godly sword that was engulfed in so much murderous spirit which ordinary people wouldn’t even have the will to resist, they would have gathered all their forces and destroyed such a threat.","However, it was too late now.","“Now that the Saint Ancestral Master has awakened, it is our Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace’s turn to rule the world!” In the sky, heavenly thunder rumbled, and the scarlet lightning bolts danced wildly, illuminating Nangong Lin’s face which looked half-ghost and half-god.","In this world, people hadn’t heard about immortals for a long, long time. The strengths of the ancient families had gradually weakened as time went by, even though they were still stronger than the major families. These families once had many talented cultivators like water surging from a spring, but the cultivators of great talents were few and scarce in the past 1,000 years.","It seemed to be a curse that no one could break. Perhaps after many years, these ancient families would disappear in the long river of time themselves.","But now...","“Only my Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace has the right to control this boat of the turbid mortal world!”","“This dream will be realized in my hand!”","“Roar!”","With an earth-shaking roar, the overwhelming murderous spirit which had turned into the sun-blocking dark clouds poured down like ocean waves.","In the center of the murderous spirit was a sword in its infancy.","“Now that the Saint Ancestral Master is out, these sword slaves are useless. Take them down as sacrifices,” Nangong Lin said in a booming voice, “Pass my order and hold a seven-day sword sacrificial ceremony. When the sacrificial ceremony ends and the ancient families gather here, our Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace will become the ruler of the world!”","After all, there was no one close to the realm of ascendance among the ancient families, let alone realm immortals. In Nangong Lin’s eyes, it was a piece of cake to deter and conquer them.","What the Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace needed to do was strike fear into them by killing someone.","...","“Guys... why do you think many humans in the games look like western barbarians?” Puzzled, Zong Qu even created a group to discuss this topic.","The western barbarians were the savages living in the region to the far northwest; most of them were descendants of the native barbarians, and a few were refugees from the Spiritual State.","These people had fled there for many reasons. They might have fled from wars between big families since these wars often caused slaughters of whole families; they might have fled from other catastrophes caused by humans or nature.","A vast wasteland lay to the west of the Spiritual State. Its harsh environment made it impossible for life except for the fierce beasts which had survived since the prehistoric times. Even the immature fierce beasts were as strong as Grand Ancestral Warriors or even King Warriors.","It must be noted that the general strength of the warriors of the Spiritual State was much greater than those in the Deserted Sea Realm even if they were on the same realm.","It was a result of the living environment for warriors. The warriors who had survived in this environment were not as weak as those in the Deserted Sea Realm, even though they were still weaker compared to cultivators later on.","The residents in the wasteland in the northwest were mainly warriors who had toughened their physical bodies in their fights with fierce beasts; they had their own fighting styles which was different from the warriors living in the Spiritual State.","Elder Yu asked, [Maybe... According to the legends among the barbarians, they had experienced a period of prosperity in the past. I wonder if this stuff is something that the barbarians left from the prehistoric times?]","The black-robed Daoist Zhou Mo chimed in, [That’s impossible. These guns and cannons are totally different from their weapons. I don’t believe that they could have left such things; I would be shocked if their inheritance got twisted like this.]","Feng Yangzi said, [I brought this question to the Daoist friends from other shops, and they said the cultivators and warriors who share our style have similar features as ours. However, the ordinary people who fight with such spiritual artifacts all look like the western barbarians.]","[The people in StarCraft all live on stars, right?] Zong Wu wondered, [Is it possible...]","He looked up at the ceiling as if he could see the sky through it. [Maybe these people fell from the sky in the prehistoric times? Don’t they say that there is something called...um... gravity in the stars? Maybe one day this gravity disappeared, and they just fell from the stars?]","Fortunately, Mr. Fang wasn’t in this group. Otherwise, he would bow to these people’s great imagination and logical reasoning.","[I heard that the warriors from the northwest would come to the Heavenly Academy to have practice matches and discussions of Martial Dao with us, right?]","Zhou Mo replied, [<img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f624.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F624;\"> They only dare to fight with our warriors. If they dare to fight cultivators, many people can crush them.]","Baoping Spiritual Master refuted, [It’s an exchange of Martial Dao; it would be a shame if we sent cultivators to fight them.]","Zong Wu said, [Although our Heavenly Academy had Emperor Warriors before, I’m afraid that we might not able to rival the barbarians in the northwest... Alas! When I talked about the Martial Dao with that old Nalan Hongwu in the group chat, I found that their understanding of Martial Dao is very deep. The... um... Heavenly Sword and Sword 23 are indeed powerful.]","Zhou Mo added, [We must watch the Wind and Cloud more often. Didn’t they say that the second season has been released, eh? There’s someone named Di Shitian who is claimed to be even more powerful than the figures in the previous season?]","[He looks powerful but hasn’t revealed his true strength yet. I wonder how he is compared with Sword Saint and No Name.] Zong Wu said, [I would be exhilarated if I could understand it by watching. I wonder how lucky the old Nalan Hongwu was that he was able to comprehend all of this; I’m totally clueless right now.]","Zhou Mo said, [Worst come to worst, we can invite them here and do a United Martial Dao Discussion Conference. I don’t believe that those barbarians can defeat all of us!]","Baoping Spiritual Master replied, [Shame on you <img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f624.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F624;\">! It would be a disgrace for us if we couldn’t defeat them, and you want to further disgrace us by enlisting help from the Deserted Sea Realm?]","[But, inviting them to a United Martial Dao Discussion Conference is not bad; the young people can have practice matches with each other.]","[People from the Deserted Sea Realm...? I’m not sure if it’s a good idea.] Zong Wu seemed to have remembered a taboo that existed only in the legends."]},{"number":481,"title":"Chapter 481 - Watching Crowd","paragraphs":["Chapter 481: Watching Crowd","Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","– In the Legend of the Sword and Fairy Communication Group –","Tang Yu asked, [I say... do you guys want to come to the Spiritual State for fun?]","The idea mentioned by the few grand cultivators in their chat group somehow had spread to the disciples of the Heavenly Academy.","They didn’t know if the news were true or not, but this idea inspired these young people and made them think.","Fifth Prince Ji Yang chimed in, [<img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f624.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F624;\"> Why don’t you come and tour our Dajin country?]","Xu Zixin chimed in, [Yeah, the Spiritual State is too far away.]","Black Demon said, [Come to our Half City.]","Song Qingfeng refuted, [<img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f624.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F624;\"> People get beaten while walking on the streets in Half City. Who would want to go there?]","Sitting before a computer in Half City Shop, Black Demon’s lips twitched while he stomped his foot. [You bunch of little b*stards, do you dare to come? I’ll give you a good beating!]","“...”","Xiaoyue said, [Sister Su said that she will come to the Spiritual State and visit me! <img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f60f.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F60F;\">]","“WTF?!”","“I’m going too!”","“Count me in!”","In the Jiuhua City Shop, Xue Daolv, the Master of the Liuyun Daoist Palace, put down the virtual reality headset and yelled at Su Tianji, who was sipping milk tea and watching her vegetable garden while talking on QQ, “Junior Sister, do you plan to visit the Spiritual State?”","“Yeah. I’m bored of sitting in the shop or in the faction every day. I plan to take a trip,” Su Tianji said, “Isn’t it a good idea to visit Xiaoyue in the Spiritual State?”","Gongshu Kuo who was playing StarCraft heard this astonishing news. “It’s so far away; it will take a long time even if you travel with the sword control technique. Considering the dangers on the way and in the deep ocean, I, an experienced old man, don’t think you can cross that sea realm.”","Stroking his long beard, Gongshu Kuo continued, “That sea realm is extremely dangerous. An ancestral master from Yundian Upper Realm had the wild idea to go there but never came back.”","“It’s said that that sea realm calms down a bit every 3,000 years. Even powerful people from the outside world must take this opportunity to travel across the ocean. I’m afraid that we can never go out.”","“Really?” Su Tianji looked reluctant and [@Mr. Fang] in the Legend of the Sword and Fairy Communication Group","Now, the people in the shop were all talking about this topic and even pulled Mr. Fang into it.","The people from different shops only knew each other through the internet and had never seen each other before. Some of them wouldn’t have known that there were places such as Half City and that there were divisions such as the Deserted Sea Realm and the Spiritual State if they hadn’t talked to these people from those places.","In the past, they had thought that the land before them was the whole world.","But now, they discovered that there was another vast continent beyond the ocean, which was more real than the imaginary worlds in the games.","They had indeed discovered a new continent!","...","While some players planned to go out of the internet café and tour the Spiritual State, the Heavenly Academy faced the greatest crisis in its history.","“The murderous spirit is so thick!”","“Look! What’s that?!”","At this moment, the elders of the Heavenly Academy had just finished lecturing, and disciples were walking out in twos and threes. When they looked up, they saw black clouds filling the sky above the Heavenly Academy and huge shadows slowly piercing the mountain-like clouds. A black dragon-shaped bow appeared from the surging clouds.","Then, a huge ship appeared; it was pitch-black, and the golden lights that it reflected made it look like a huge monster coming from the clouds.","The clouds had distorted shapes of monsters and devils, and a flash of sharp blade energy occasionally revealed itself.","Heaven-piercing bestial roars came from the spiritual ship as if a demonic god had come down to the world!","On the spiritual ship, a banquet was being held with dances, songs, wine, and pretty girls. Several people sat in the cabin on the top of the ship, and their clothes looked extremely luxurious; the best one could get in this world.","However, they looked gloomy and cold at this moment.","“What? The Jiang Family of Snow Nation declined to come, claiming that they don’t attend events of humans?” Nangong Lin walked over, asking, “And two ancient families only sent elders here?”","“Hmph! These old guys will regret their decisions after today!” Then, he sat down.","“Master of Nangong, what do you mean by this?!” one of the guests asked in a cold voice.","Driving a spiritual ship into the sky above another force was declaring war!","“Nothing,” Nangong Lin laughed and said. “I only invited you guys here to watch a good show!”","Behind him was a tall man wearing strange-shaped black armor and a cloak. Nangong Lin turned around and acted very respectfully toward this guy.","“Nangong Zhuo?!”","They saw that guy was Nangong Zhuo.","However, his face seemed longer as if it got extended, and his eyes looked pointer. Overall, he was like a stranger-looking Nangong Zhuo.","“Qing... Ming.” His voice was deeper than Nangong Zhuo’s, and he sounded rusty as if he hadn’t spoken for tens of thousands of years.","It seemed like he had changed into another person.","Nangong Lin laughed and said, “This kid is lucky that the Saint Ancestral Master is willing to borrow his body!”","“Of course, you might be unfamiliar with this name, but this saint ancestral master is the host of the Immortal-Hacking Sword Array thousands of years ago.”","“What’s happening?!”","“What?!”","“Didn’t that ancestral master of your family die in that battle?!”","The guests exchanged a horrified look since this man’s presence sent chills down their spines.","It wasn’t a human’s presence!","Nangong Lin laughed and said, “Saint Ancestral Master, please remove the obstacles for our Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace!”","“Hurry! Activate the protective grand array!” In the Heavenly Academy, the elders felt tinges on their skin while watching this horrible scene.","“Isn’t this the Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace’s spiritual ship?! What do they want?!”","“Where’s the Old... Old Academy Master?!”","“He’s in the internet café!”","“Where’s ... the Vice Academy Master?!”","“The Old Academy Master took him to learn how to play StarCraft...”","“...” Elder Yu immediately took out his communication jade and sent messages frantically.","“Why aren’t they returning the messages?!”","In the Yuanyang City Shop, a white-haired old man was pointing his fingers on the crystal screen inside the commander center.","“How long can it last?” Elder Yu felt a bit calmer when he looked at the dense pale blue spiritual patterns in the sky.","“It will take the Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace more than a month to break the array!”","Elder Yu nodded, “I’ve sent messages to the elders and the academy master, asking them to return as soon as possible.”","The moment that he said it, he heard an alarming shout, “Look up at the sky!”","An ugly, distorted black sword mark appeared in the sky, and the spiritual ship of the Nangong Family was sailing through this crack.","On the spiritual ship, maids brought out platters of spiritual objects looking like fruits; these fruits had a green jade surface and were fiery red inside.","One of the elders of Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace said, “These are Red Puti, a spiritual fruit that takes 1,000 years to bloom and another 1,000 years to mature. Please enjoy them.”","Then, they saw the sight outside the spiritual ship.","The masters of the ancient families began to watch."]},{"number":482,"title":"Chapter 482 - Can Do Nothing but Yelling Awesome","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Daoist Friend Tang, what do you think?” In the cabin on the top of the spiritual ship, the luxuriously clothed men were all staring at the Heavenly Academy with grim expressions. “The Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace has revealed its ambition.”","“How can I know?!” The dull-looking old man wearing a black robe said with the communication jade in his hand, “I’ve sent a message back home, and it’s not my decision now!”","“The Heavenly Academy’s protective grand array was broken by one sword strike. I’m afraid that he is that person!” A man wearing a purple robe with gold patterns and had a short mustache said to the others around him.","“How can it be?! Isn’t that person dead?!”","An elder of Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace who was standing beside them snickered as if he was mocking this person’s ignorance.","“What the heck does your Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace want?!”","That elder’s face turned dark. “Can’t you see what we want by now?!”","“After today, there will be only two kinds of people in this world.” His voice oozed endless chilliness. “You either submit to us or die!”","Meanwhile, a huge spiritual ship that was as long as several kilometers rose from the depths of a valley inside the Heavenly Academy.","On the spiritual ship of the Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace, the dragon head at the bow suddenly opened its mouth and revealed a rectangular jade tablet with the engravings of seven stars. Under the contrast of the black ship body, it seemed like many stars were lighting up one by one in the dark night.","Everyone could feel that a horrifying force was gathering in the sky above the Heavenly Academy.","The murderous spirit covering the sky suddenly showed many cracks. Then, they crashed down under the pull of that spiritual ship!","“Run! Quickly run!” Elder Yu looked terrified while he watched this destructive light hang in the dark sky as if many cracks appeared in it. “Run! As fast as you can!”","In the next moment, many light beams fell from the sky!","The ground was instantly pierced, and the huge energy entering deeper down caused the ground to tumble like waves on the surface of the ocean. With the light beam being the center, the ground surged up under the high pressure and then shattered, causing a destructive storm of dust and debris!","Almost the entire Heavenly Academy was engulfed by this destructive light. At this moment, the whole place seemed to be plunged into doomsday!","The spiritual ships which had just risen into the sky were instantly pierced by the white light beam, and then they shattered and collapsed.","“Nangong Lin! Are you mad?!” That elder of Tang Family yelled furiously, “We still have disciples down there!”","“You dare to attack the Heavenly Academy! I think you are completely crazy!” The guy with the mustache and purple robe said in a rage.","He slammed the melon on the table and began to walk out. “Do you think that you can make me stand here and watch?! What a joke!”","“You want to do it in the hard way then!” The elder of Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace said with a sneer, “Do you think that you can get onboard and offboard the spiritual ship of our Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace at will?”","The purple-robed cultivator said with a sneer, “Nangong Xiao, you’re alone. What can you do to me?”","The elder behind him glanced at the spiritual melons involuntarily as if he were wondering whether or not they were poisoned.","Before the purple-robed cultivator could walk out, the elder of the Nangong Family’s eyes suddenly emitted murderous spirit with a wicked expression on his face.","An extremely gloomy and chilly presence spread all over the cabin and seemed to seep into the people’s bones and meridians.","With a sneer, the elder said, “Open your damn eyes and watch! Nangong Xiao, the elder of the 49th generation, invites Earth 37 of the Sword Tomb – Qing Shuang (Green Frost)!”","With a flash of purple light, the person who was walking out to help the Heavenly Academy found that his arm was cut off from the shoulder!","Blood gushed out, splashing all over the place!","That elder panted like a fish out of water, and his pale face became distorted. “Anyone else wants to give it a try? I’m sure that I’ll kill you all before I become a sword slave!”","...","At this moment, reactions finally came from the Heavenly Academy. A golden layer of light shot out from the depths of the Heavenly Academy, and the pale golden mist turned into a huge golden cloud, covering the sky above the Heavenly Academy at an extremely fast speed.","Most of the buildings and land in the Heavenly Academy had been destroyed, and many disciples were injured or killed. However, the survivors were now protected by this golden layer of light.","“Hurry! Get the Old Academy Master! We can’t last long!” On Golden Afterglow Summit of the Heavenly Academy, three white-haired old men stood on a weird-looking golden disk, and tremendous spiritual energy flowed around the disk which was connected to the underground. Obviously, they were borrowing the spiritual essence from the earth vein to barely block the attack.","“Where’s the Old Academy Master?!”","“He said that he’s in the internet café! He’ll be here soon!” Elder Yu howled.","At this moment, Old Academy Master was still hurrying toward the Heavenly Academy.","– On the Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace’s spiritual ship –","“The strength of the Heavenly Academy is indeed great.”","On the spiritual ship, the people of the ancient families were either indignant or calm. A green-robed old man picked up a platter of Red Puti and said, “Daoist Friend Xun, eat one. It will be good for your injury.”","“B*stards! These b*stards!”","“Guys! Quickly look over there!”","The few masters of the ancient families on the spiritual ship saw a person, who looked like Nangong Zhuo, land on the layer of golden light as if he was as light as air.","He ignored the white light beam that was crashing down from the sky.","He opened his mouth and sucked.","“Pu!” The three old men on Golden Afterglow Summit spat out blood while the disk underneath their feet shattered; the layer of golden light in the sky above Heavenly Academy was being sucked into the black figure’s stomach!","“Pu!” When the three men saw this scene, they spat out blood again and exchanged a look of horror. “How can it be?!”","The people of the Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace cheered, “The Saint Ancestral Master is unrivaled!”","“Saint Ancestral Master is unrivaled! Saint Ancestral Master will lead us to conquer the world and make the Nangong Family prosperous forever!”","“...” Standing with her girl friends, Jiang Xiaoyue stomped her foot in a fury. “These wastrels can do nothing but yell awesome to their so-called Saint Ancestral Master!”","...","“Buzz!” Holding his double-handed sword with both hands, Mr. Fang blocked a green longsword that was crashing toward him.","His lips curved up. “I blocked it!”","However, in the next moment, he felt an extremely horrifying sword energy.","Boom!","The mountain behind him was hacked into two parts.","Meanwhile, a neat bloody line appeared on his chest.","“Hu!” Fang Qi opened his eyes abruptly and found that he was lying on his bed on the second floor with a layer of cold sweat on his forehead.","He picked up a towel and walked downstairs while wiping his forehead.","“Ugh?” He found that the downstairs was in turmoil.","“What’s wrong with you guys?”","“Boss! Something happened!” Li Xin’er said anxiously.","“Big trouble!” Li Wuya lamented.","“Boss, Xiaoyue is still in the Heavenly Academy!”","“Sister Lanruo is still in the Heavenly Academy as well!”","“Of course, they are in the Heavenly Academy,” Mr. Fang said mildly, “They are in school, right?”","“Can you guys explain more clearly?”"]},{"number":483,"title":"Chapter 483 - Come out for Me!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Standing on his spiritual ship, Nangong Lin let out a wild laugh. “I thought that the Heavenly Academy is powerful. But now, I know that it’s only a group of wastrels!”","“Hahahaha...! I thought that only one Saint Ancestral Master had woken up, but in fact, three Saint Ancestral Masters have woken up. It seems that our Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace is destined to rise and conquer the world!” The Second Elder beside Nangong Lin also laughed and said, “Master, some powerful cultivators are missing from the Heavenly Academy, and it’s said that they are in the small shop that has messed with us. I’ll take three other elders and one Saint Ancestral Master to that shop and capture them. On the way, we’ll destroy everyone who has dealings with this shop!”","“Go!” Nangong Lin’s face turned a bit dark. “Some of the people missing from the Heavenly Academy are stronger than you. Return to the Sword Palace and invite the Saint Ancestral Master who had just woken up to go with you. Then, you’ll have nothing to worry about!”","...","The masters of several ancient families in the cabin of the spiritual ship were forced to sit and watch the battle. The elder who guarded the cabin laughed and said, “You guys are in luck; you’ll be able to see the Saint Ancestral Master, who has ‘Sky’ in his title, when the Second Elder invites him out of the tomb!”","...","Mr. Fang patted his forehead, feeling a bit dizzy after being tortured for more than half a year in the Game Cultivation Room.","“Ugh? The shop owner has unsteady steps and a pale face. What the heck was he doing upstairs?!”","“Huh, I feel empty inside. I shouldn’t have done that thing for so long.” Mr. Fang shook his head and then saw the group of people staring at him while gaping.","“What did you just say?” Mr. Fang frowned. “Xiaoyue got bullied in school?”","With sudden understanding, he slammed his hand on the table and shouted, “Don’t they know that Xiaoyue is under my protection?!”","“What?! Someone dares to bully my little sister?!” Jiang Xuan who had been playing the game instantly stood up.","The two guards, Zhen Yan and Xue Ming, slammed their hands on the tables and stood up. “Someone dares to bully our little princess Her Highness?!”","“Go! Let’s go get them!”","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","Several sword energies shot into the sky outside Yuanyang City like lightning flashes.","...","– Inside the Heavenly Academy –","At this moment, most of the disciples gathered around the elders. Although the overall strength of the Heavenly Academy had been greater than the Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace’s, many of them felt terrified at this moment. After all, the protective grand array of the academy had easily been torn open by one sword strike, and the golden cloud was sucked in by that figure.","Standing on the huge spiritual ship in the sky, Nangong Lin stared at the frantic crowds beneath him with cold eyes.","If not for the golden cloud which blocked that attack at the last moment, protecting most of the elites of the Heavenly Academy, the whole Heavenly Academy would have been razed to the ground.","As an ancient family, the Nangong Family had many trump cards, and this was only one of them. Otherwise, they couldn’t be one of the top seven ancient families that ruled over the Spiritual State with abundant resources and many talented cultivators.","From the sides of the spiritual ship that Nangong Lin was standing on, black clouds made of thick murderous spirit continued to spread into the area. The two giant clouds extending out on the two sides of the spiritual ship looked like a huge pair of black wings. Inside the wings, it seemed like strange things were flowing inside. They looked like black balls that were half-vague and half-real, and they were pulled into the shape of swords.","At the order, many pitch-black sword energies shot down like shooting stars!","With booming noises, the ground shook violently. A black sword energy struck a near lecture palace, and it shattered and then collapsed. It instantly turned into a pile of debris and blew waves of thick dust into the air.","A huge array pattern spread out as a few elders tried their best to support it, and it covered the sky. But obviously, this array pattern would be broken sooner or later.","Besides, the nightmarish black figure in the sky had broken two trump cards of the Heavenly Academy. If he wanted to and made a move, this array pattern wouldn’t last one second.","“In the last 100 years, the Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace has gotten even more aggressive and arrogant,” Elder Yu yelled in a cold voice, “You began the scheme thousands of years ago, right? Now, you can’t wait anymore?!”","“Wait?!” Nangong Lin stood on the bow of his spiritual ship and looked down on the world beneath him. He raised his hand high and waved before saying, “We don’t have to wait anymore! Today, I’ll destroy the Heavenly Academy! Anyone not submitting to us will die...”","“This person is such a boaster!” Jiang Xiaoyue stared at the sky. “Hmph! When Boss comes, he’ll beat you to death!”","The moment that he said it, Nangong Lin suddenly felt chill all over his body when a green light hacked directly down from the sky as if it were coming from Heaven!","Then, a black sword energy flashed by.","He looked back subconsciously and saw that a thin line somehow appeared on the floor of the bow. Then, the front half of the spiritual ship slipped down along this line.","Like a huge meteorite, the front part of the spiritual ship fell from the high sky and caught fire due to the friction in the air. It dropped to the ground in a huge fire ball!","The ground shook violently, and the cloud-like murderous spirit in the sky scattered as if it were dreading and avoiding something. In the distant sky, auspicious clouds gathered, and a young man stood in the clouds. He was wearing a purple-gold crown while holding the green Demon-Suppressing Sword in his hand.","“Ahh!”","“Jing Tian!”","Beside Jiang Xiaoyue, everyone, no matter if they were girls or guys, disciples or elders, shrieked at the top of their lungs.","“Isn’t he a fictional figure?!”","It must be noted that the figures in the games lived in fictional worlds like the Matrix in the movie. In the virtual reality worlds such as the Matrix, Neo could do anything in it including learning Judo and boxing.","But in the real world, Neo couldn’t do anything; he couldn’t even beat a machine octopus.","But now, what were they looking at?!","The Demon-Suppressing Sword?! Jing Tian?!","“What’s that?!” The masters of the various ancient families who were watching the ‘livestream’ on the Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace’s spiritual ship widened their eyes, almost spitting out melon seeds from their mouths.","“Who dares to mess with Xiaoyue and the other girls? Stand out for me!” That immortal-like figure in the sky suddenly spoke.","“...” Hearing this voice, everyone’s face twitched a little.","I s that the damn shop owner?!"]},{"number":484,"title":"Chapter 484 - GG for All","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“What’s the shop owner doing?”","At this moment, there was one less godly weapon fragment in the System Interface.","[Character Can Be Completely Synchronized: Jing Tian","Synchronization Time: Determined by the strength of the synchronization character (The higher the character’s strength, the shorter the synchronization time is)","Number of Usages: One]","With the Demon-Suppressing Sword in his hand, Mr. Fang stood on the edge of the clouds and looked down.","A hole appeared in the cloud-like, pitch-black murderous spirit, and the people on the ground looked up and felt like there was a vaster world behind the layers of murderous spirit and mountain-like white clouds.","The figure holding the Demon-Suppressing Sword looked like an immortal general who was descending from the Heavenly Realm. With his clothes flapping in the wind, he looked down at the mortal world.","At this moment, they seemed to see a true immortal descending into the mortal world.","In the spiritual ship of Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace, the family masters and elders who were forced to watch the ‘livestream’ looked dazed. “Who’s this person?!”","“Look at the green godly sword in his hand!”","The elder of the Tang Family picked up a Red Puti and intently stared at the scene before him while eating the fruit.","Outside the spiritual ship, Nangong Lin stared at the sky in horror. “Who are you?!”","He didn’t believe that there were immortals in this world. Even if immortals existed, they wouldn’t stay in the mortal world, let alone descend into the mortal world.","This wasn’t that era which was thousands of years ago.","Mr. Fang’s displeased gaze turned to him. “Is it you? You dare to mess with the people under my protection?”","“You’re playing a trick!” Hovering in the air, Nangong Lin humbly bowed to the black figure in mid-air. “Please, Saint Lord Qing Ming...”","Before he could finish, the black figure in the air raised his head and let out a sky-piercing roar as if he had met his nemesis. Then, he transformed into a streak of black light.","Fang Qi cast his sword techniques calmly. In the high sky, the black murderous spirit and the white clouds surged with the sword strikes, and each move was perfectly and seamlessly used.","The surrounding murderous spirit surged up like ocean waves, but the green sword energy scattered them with ease.","Flying on the sword, Mr. Fang dug out a few wine cups, bronze cauldrons, cigarette lighters, and a cigarette box from his storage spiritual artifact and tossed them out.","Horrifying spiritual energy exploded in the sky.","“Is this the Nation-Destroying Silver Bullet Wave?!” The several elders of the Heavenly Academy craned their necks to watch the battle.","“This person is so powerful!” The family masters and elders were enthralled by the ‘livestream’.","The elder of the Nangong Family looked gloomy. “Don’t think that’s all the strength of Saint Lord Qing Ming. When he uses the Immortal-Hacking Sword Array, this person will die and disappear within three attacks!”","The others froze. This legend about the sword array had existed for thousands of years even though they had never seen this array before. However, even only from the legend, they could feel the great power of the sword array. Besides, the person who created this array in history was back here to host it again.","If this figure was really that person, only the talented ancestral masters of their families could block him with their ultimate treasures which had helped them pass tribulations and ascend.","Otherwise, no one could block this sword array even if it were built by only one person.","At this moment, Nangong Zhuo, whose body was taken by the Qing Ming Sword, looked grave with murderous spirit circling him like dragons. Then, many black sword energies flew out from his back, forming an array to engulf the surrounding area, clouds, and Fang Qi. The 108 chilly black sword energies turned into a big array with a powerful and shocking presence!","“No!” The master of the Xun Family yelled in alarm from the cabin, “The Immortal-Hacking Sword Array?!”","He wouldn’t be shaken if anyone else from the Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace formed this array. However, this person was different.","The people on the spiritual ship all grew up listening to the legends about this person.","“Hahahaha!” Nangong Lin laughed wildly, “Ignorant Kid! I’ll see how you block it!”","Suddenly, exclamations came from the crowd of disciples and elders of the Heavenly Academy.","The Demon-Suppressing Sword in Mr. Fang’s hand split into two, four, and eventually into 36.","While he injected spiritual energy into them, the green swords began to emit blinding golden light.","The golden flying swords seemed to move randomly, but they formed faint Eight Trigram green patterns which connected to each other seamlessly.","Then, all the flight swords transformed into a mysterious and complete Tai Chi pattern in the sky.","All the people of Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace including Nangong Lin and the elder inside the cabin widened their eyes. “What’s this?!”","“What’s this?!” Tang Yu who had been watching in the crowd yelled, “How come I didn’t see this when I played Jing Tian?!”","“This is Li Xiaoyao’s 36 Tiangang Sword Array of Shu Mountain Faction!” Out of all people, only Jiang Xiaoyue knew this array, and she showed off her knowledge smugly. “It has superb power!”","Although Jing Tian couldn’t learn sword techniques such as Innumerable Sword Scroll from the plot of the game, Mr. Fang knew them himself. Since the character Jing Tian that Mr. Fang had in the game excelled in the sword control technique, he could well manage the 36 Tiangang Sword Array.","The black sword energies in the area constantly transformed and so did the 36 golden sword beams. These two sword arrays with large quantity of sword energies repeatedly passed each other in the high sky. The surrounding murderous spirit danced like dragons, and the golden sword array of Tai Chi pattern emitted layers of pale green spiritual light.","Nangong Zhuo who was controlled by the Qing Ming Sword yelled, and earth-shaking dragon roars resonated in the sky.","Many black sword energies swept up the ocean-like murderous spirit, and they gathered in one place. The sword energies and the murderous spirit combined and condensed into a huge black dragon.","The fierce dragon opened its mouth and roared, and hurricanes swept all over the space.","Meanwhile, Fang Qi unleashed a wave of horrifying sword energy which almost distorted the air. Then, his whole body shot out like an arrow, as fast as lightning.","The 36 golden sword energies followed him and merged into him, turning into a golden rainbow!","The golden rainbow and the black dragon collided with each other in the high sky!","Energy surged up, tearing everything around them into pieces.","It seemed like the whole world became silent.","The people of Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace couldn’t think anymore as their minds had turned blank.","They couldn’t understand how anyone in the world could battle with the real Immortal-Hacking Sword Array.","However, in the next moment, they saw an even more horrifying sight.","When the dust settled, they saw the green sword and the black sword pressing onto each other.","“Even...? They broke even?” Nangong Lin was out of breath and almost suffocated. He thought @How come such a terrifying figure exist in the world?!”","Nangong Zhuo’s lips curved up a little, and his words stumbled over his tongue. “You...are good. But I... still blocked it!”","However, in the next moment, the surging black clouds of murderous spirit behind Nangong Zhuo was suddenly hacked into two by a sword energy!","Mr. Fang withdrew the Demon-Suppressing Sword and saw a tiny blood line appearing on Nangong Zhuo’s chest.","“Blocked it?” Mr. Fang said, “I had the same thought when I was tortured.”","“...” Nangong Lin’s mind instantly turned blank.","In the cabin of the spiritual ship of Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace, the elder of Nangong Family stared at the scene in a daze.","The other few family masters were also stupefied. “How come there is such a talented person in the world!”","“Hurry!” Nangong Lin suddenly snapped back to his senses. “Go and bring that Sky-Titled Saint Ancestral Master here!”","The elder in the spiritual ship also recovered his senses, and he said with a wicked expression, “Do you think that’s the end of it?! I hope you won’t be scared by what you will see next!”","Then, he turned the screen to the Second Elder who had gone to invite the Sky-Titled Saint Ancestral Master.","They saw the grey-haired old man standing before a transparent glass door. With a strange-shaped ancient sword lifting high in his hand, he shouted, “Charge in and kill them all!”","Boom!","Lightning bolts suddenly flashed inside the glass door.","Then, a round-faced shy girl and an old man walked out while lifting people up with both hands. The girl asked with a confused expression, “Elder Wuya, what happened to these people?”","“I have no idea...” Li Wuya also looked puzzled.","All the people in the spiritual ship were at a loss for words.","@","GG!"]},{"number":485,"title":"Chapter 485 - Got A Few More Antiques","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“What... what’s with this shop!?” Not only the elder of the Nangong Family, but the masters of various ancient families were also dazed by this scene.","These people had just entered the shop arrogantly but were then carried out on their last breaths. What happened?","“Where’s the Saint... Saint Ancestral Master?!” The elder of the Nangong Family looked at the scene with wide-open eyes while the round-faced girl picked up a strange-shaped longsword which looked dim and rusted.","Clank!","She tossed it out of the door. “How come there is garbage like this in here?”","The people watching on the spiritual ship of the Nangong Family fell silent.","The family masters craned their necks and watched the scene outside the shop as if they wanted to poke their heads through the screen.","“Elder Wuya, what do you think we should do with these people?” Li Xin’er exclaimed in alarm when she recognized them. “They are people of the Nangong Family?!”","She took several steps back, and her pretty face paled.","The Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace and the Nangong Family were nightmares for the Li Family. Li Xin’er was surprised to find that these people were from the Nangong Family. Judging from their clothes, they were high-level members.","“What? You’re afraid?!” The elder on the spiritual ship laughed arrogantly at this scene. “With the reputation of our Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace, who would dare to mess with us even if you catch our members?!”","The moment he said that, Li Wuya glanced at his communication jade and said, “Boss told us to destroy their cultivation strength and toss them onto the streets.”","“Hahahaha!” the Master of the Xun Family, whose arm had been cut off earlier, laughed when he saw this, and he said, “Good! Well Done! Tomorrow, other ancient families will join hands and raze the Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace to the ground!”","“...” The elder turned ashen-faced.","...","“Hahahaha!” Outside the spiritual ship, Nangong Lin suddenly raised his head and laughed since he found that Fang Qi’s strength had weakened.","The Demon-Suppressing Sword vanished from Fang Qi’s hand, and his aura dropped rapidly.","Clearly, after consuming a large amount of energy, the synchronization time was over.","The consumption of this battle was much higher than the previous battle with the Three Saint Factions.","Everything would be okay if Fang Qi actually possessed this level of strength. However, he didn’t possess this great power and had relied on Complete Synchronization. He had reached his limit after fighting in such an intense battle for so long.","“You’ll die when that saint ancestral master comes from our Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace!”","“Family Master,” one elder reported, “That saint ancestral master was destroyed.”","“...!!??”","“What?! Impossible!” Being forced into a corner, Nangong Lin looked crazy, losing all his arrogance.","“There are no immortals in this world, right!” Nangong Lin raised his head and yelled in fury, “Who the heck is he?!”","“Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace, you deserve what you get!” Li Lanruo, whose family had been slaughtered by Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace, said with gritted teeth.","“You deserve to die with all the crimes that you committed!” An old voice came from the sky, and the deactivated protective grand array of the Heavenly Academy emitted radiant light again.","“Impossible! Even if I only have the Qing Ming Saint Ancestral Master, who can block him?!” Nangong Lin yelled. As if answering his yell, a sword shot up into the sky from the broken spiritual ship of the Nangong Family!","Nangong Lin glared at Fang Qi with hatred. The young man disrupted his plans, thus incurring his hatred!","“I’ll kill you first!”","With a dark green ancient sword in hand, Nangong Lin shot toward Fang Qi like a long rainbow.","“Sir! Be careful!”","The audience on the ground yelled in alarm.","However, in the next moment, they saw that Nangong Lin’s sword missed its target; Fang Qi vanished!","Then, they saw the whole space being filled with dense horrifying crescent-shaped sword energies.","“Vergil’s Dimension Slash?!” Jiang Xiaoyue covered her little mouth in disbelief. “How come Boss know this technique as well?!”","It must be noted that the Beowulf gauntlets and greaves had belonged to Vergil before Dante got them.","On Mr. Fang’s System Interface, Vergil was one of the options for synchronization.","[Beep. Synchronization time is up.]","In the sky, a silver-haired young man who was wearing a blue windbreaker slowly withdrew his sword.","Before him, a head was exploded into four parts.","Mr. Fang returned to his own form and shouted, “Anyone who dares to mess with my employees and Xiaoyue, come out for me!”","Everyone looked at Mr. Fang who was in the sky, and they were all speechless.","How come this shop owner is so f*cking powerful?!","“Yaa! How come Boss cosplays every day?! And he is so good at it!” Jiang Xiaoyue was green with envy.","“I want to learn these techniques too...” Li Lanruo was also envious.","“Can we learn those techniques?” Tang Yu and the others were also excited. They imagined the scenarios in which they dressed like awesome game characters, with Jing Tian for example, and used the Nation-Destroying Silver Bullet Wave.","Or, they could dress as Neo and shoot bullets with the power of laws in them.","It would be superb!","Mr. Fang didn’t know that a large group of young people in this world would soon walk around in strange costumes and use all kinds of weird techniques.","[The task is completed.]","Ugh? It’s completed like this? Mr. Fang still felt a bit dizzy after being tortured by Jing Tian in the Game Cultivation Room for a long time.","Meanwhile, the remaining force of the Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace wouldn’t last long even without Mr. Fang’s contribution.","After all, the Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace had revealed its ambition. If it succeeded, it would become the ruler of the world. If not, the other forces wouldn’t allow such an ancient family to remain in this world.","– Later –","Soon, the alliance of other ancient families and the Heavenly Academy attacked the Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace, and this leaderless force was destroyed.","The remaining swords in the Sword Tomb of Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace and the ones that had awakened were later delivered to the Origins Internet Club.","Mr. Fang had never seen such antiques even before he traveled through space and time, let alone now.","You’re reading on .com Thanks!","Therefore, he put up a bamboo stick and dangled the swords on it with strings.","“My shop looks grand with such antiques as decorations, eh?” Mr. Fang brushed the dust off his hands.","“Sir, are you drying brined fish?” Entering the shop, Jiang Xiaoyue glanced at the things dangling on the stick and suddenly felt like her vision blurred a little.","“...”","“Little Girl, what did you say?!”","“I’m an ancient godly sword!”","“Little Girl, do you have any experience in spotting treasures?”","“Do you believe...”","“If you continue, I’ll give you all the lightning therapy!” Mr. Fang’s face turned dark.","“...” They all shut up."]},{"number":486,"title":"Chapter 486 - The Researchers in the Shop","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","The number of customers in the shop had been increasing gradually, but it wasn’t crammed with players yet. After all, few people would go around and promote it on a mass scale.","Right now, the games in the shop could teach much more than simple combat skills like the very beginning.","Of course, compared with players in the Deserted Sea Realm, the customers in the Spiritual State had much greater strength and broader views; some of them understood the laws of nature, and some could make powerful spiritual treasures. Besides, they had found many treasures in the prehistoric relics, and these treasures’ power would be destructive if the cultivators could master them.","This was why the ancient families had been observing the situation after they heard about the shop.","After all, they were proud of the stuff in their own families when their descendants told them about the amazing things in this shop. Some of the stuff that they had were left by immortals from ancient times.","They hadn’t totally understood their own treasures yet, thus they couldn’t spend time on things in a shop.","But now, the situation had changed, and they decided to take a look at the shop together.","Besides, the owner of the shop had revealed his great strength, and it was wise to pay him a visit and establish friendship.","Mr. Fang glanced at the godly weapon fragment on the System Interface and saw the last one. Also, the synchronization time for the weapon ‘Beowulf’ was used up.","Meanwhile, a lot of system energy was used as well.","“It’s not a bad deal.” Seeing the number of customers in the shop increasing by many folds, Mr. Fang forced the argument of a good deal to comfort himself.","Today, people of the Tang Family, the Xun Family, and the Wang Family came to visit.","The door opened, and three grey-bearded old men who looked to be about 60 years old walked in; a group of people, male and female, young and old, followed each of them.","The people of the Tang Family all wore black clothes, the people of the Wang Family all wore green and white robes, and the people of the Xun Family all wore purple robes with golden trims.","They looked grand, neat, and orderly with the deportment of big families.","“Great to meet you!”","“It is an honor to meet you!”","Tang Yu and the others brought them a few bowls of instant noodles.","“Hu...”","“Slurp...”","“...”","...","“Xun Family Master, this is indeed a good place.” A black-robed elder sat on a couch and watched the bustling customers with a bowl of instant noodles in his hands. “This...um... instant noodle is indeed as effective as they say!”","“In fact, our Little Yu mentioned the shop to me, but I thought it was one of this naughty boy’s pranks.” One old man lowered his head to eat the instant noodles. “Wow! Let’s try all of the things here!”","Xun Tai, the Xun Family Master, was a middle-aged man wearing a luxurious purple robe. With a bowl of instant noodles in his hand, he looked up in the direction of the cabinet. “Aren’t those the godly swords from the Sword Tomb?”","He remembered that the ancient families had delivered those swords to the shop after destroying the Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace a few days ago.","“What are you looking at? Granddaddy is an ancient godly sword!” one of the swords made noises.","The people exchanged a look with instant noodles in their hands. “Ugh...”","...","Having finished their instant noodles, these people walked along the corridors with their hands clasped behind their backs and toured the shop, followed by their disciples and elders.","On some screens, they saw little people with weapons; one of them had a big ax in hand, battling with a white hog that was about 30 centimeters taller than the average height of humans.","On some screens, some figures were fighting monsters with dark-purple swords.","They even saw a big white deer.","Many of them blinked, wondering if their eyes were playing tricks on them.","Finally, they stopped behind a white-haired old man.","“Old Academy Master?” On his screen was a simple box, and the icon of a penguin was jumping in the bottom-right corner of the screen.","“What’s he doing?” Some family masters asked in surprise.","Battles are easier to understand, but what is this thing? It only has one box, showing some words.","“He’s chatting on QQ!”","On Gu Tingyun’s screen, several people’s messages appeared beside several names.","Gu Tingyun typed, [Um... This Holiness, you just said that people can use the laws of nature that they understand to build a special zone around them. Can it really be realized?]","Ms. Spirit replied, [<img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f612.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F612;\">What Holiness? He’s just a Smirk Face Emoji. This thing is difficult to realize but not impossible.]","The one with the ID of ‘Unrivalled Almighty’ and the profile photo of a smirk face emoji yelled, [Who? Who are you talking about? Who are you calling a smirk face emoji?!]","Then, it continued, [It’s difficult for you, a dumb little girl. But for me, it’s a piece of cake!]","[Look! Someone’s boasting so hard that cows can even fly!]","“...”","While they chatted animatedly in the group chat, the family masters who were watching from behind exchanged a look of bafflement.","Building a zone with the laws of nature around themselves? What’s this for?","Confused, they continued the tour and wandered to somewhere else.","They saw that a few elders of the Heavenly Academy sitting near Gu Tingyun were also chatting with this thing.","They were talking in the Artifact Master Advanced Communication Group.","Li Haoran said, [Good news! Great news! Our Daoist Alliance made a breakthrough in the Gauss-Related Research Project!]","The Baoping Spiritual Master asked, [What breakthrough? We’ve been stuck here for a long time.]","Tang Yu chimed in, [Yeah. I pulled apart the guns in the game and tried to mimic them, but I couldn’t do it. I don’t know what the problem is, and the shop owner acts mysterious and wouldn’t tell me anything when I ask him questions.]","Li Haoran said, [<img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f600.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F600;\"> Do you remember the scientist that we rescued in Grand Theft Auto 5? The weapon expert with a lot of titles?]","Baoping Spiritual Master typed, [We don’t have this game! What happened? Did he give you the blueprint?]","Li Haoran replied, [<img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f600.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F600;\"> No, he didn’t do that. He wouldn’t tell us the key parts and only mentioned that the Gauss cannons had been replaced by railguns long ago. Anyway, I got some information and made a small toy.]","Then, Li Haoran uploaded a short video in which he injected lightning energy into a Gauss gun with four coils and then pressed a button through a device.","Snap!","A teacup in front of him was shattered.","“What is good about this thing?” The family masters asked in disdain.","“Master, if we don’t hurry, there won’t be seats left,” someone reminded them.","“...”","“Have you decided? Which game are you going to play?” They immediately went online.","...","“Boss, what do you think of a big netizen meetup?” Jiang Xiaoyue suggested with some excitement; obviously, she had been planning this in the group for a long time.","“A big netizen meetup?” Mr. Fang stroked his chin. “It sounds good. But, do you want the cultivators and warriors of the Deserted Sea Realm to come over here? It might be a problem.”","“Didn’t you say that you used some innate ability to go to the Deserted Sea Realm? And you couldn’t take others?”","“What? You want to pass the Heavenly Forbidden Zones?” At this moment, the godly swords hanging on the bamboo stick opened their mouths; they seemed to know something about it."]},{"number":487,"title":"Chapter 487 - People from Exotic Realm","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Ugh?” Jiang Xiaoyue curiously glanced at these self-proclaimed ancient godly swords.","Tink! She flicked her little finger on the ridge of a sword and tilted her head curiously, “Could it be that this sword knows how to pass it?”","“Of course, I do.” The sword named Qing Ming swayed on the bamboo stick, and threads of black murderous spirit rose and condensed into two arms. It brought its arms to its ‘chest’ and ‘glanced’ at Jiang Xiaoyue with cold arrogance before saying in a deep voice, “Little Girl, don’t you know that you must show your respect when you ask a senior a question...?”","“Ugh...” Suddenly, the little girl was replaced by Mr. Fang.","Embarrassed, it immediately said, “Um... since you are a master who overpowered me with your sword techniques, I will go against my rules and give you some clues.”","Mr. Fang was at a loss for words.","“It was long, long ago.” This ancient longsword spread its hands, looking reminiscent.","Behind Mr. Fang, many people including Zong Wu and Jiang Xuan stopped their games and leaned over with eagerness, wanting to know more.","Mr. Fang glanced at the group of people behind him in exasperation. “What are you doing?”","“...”","“It was the era when my master, who created me, and I fought together. At that time, there were way more powerful cultivators besides people like you...” Its voice was deep and ancient, as if it were telling an epic story of the distant past.","Mr. Fang wiped sweat off his forehead and said, “Stop boasting about yourself... get to the point.”","Zong Wu and the others craned their necks to listen.","“It... it...” This black ancient sword with stains of rust seemed to be organizing its words.","Choking for a while, it almost had sweat popping out on its body. Finally, it blurted out, “It’s a place even I, a godly sword, can’t explain clearly!”","“!!??”","“Damn it! I waited so long, and you are telling me this?!” Mr. Fang’s face turned dark, feeling like he was going to beat someone.","The black sword squeezed out a few more words as if someone was trying to get the last bit of toothpaste out of a tube. “I had the honor to pass a sea realm in the Heavenly Forbidden Zones. When I traveled across it, I wasn’t able to see the sun, the moon, or other stars for months. Even the cultivators who excelled in future prediction and calculation couldn’t tell the directions.”","Zong Wu, the Castellan of Yuanyang City, exclaimed, “Someone indeed ventured into that place?”","Mr. Fang asked, “Ugh? Is it so rare?”","“...”","Then, they heard the sword adding a few more details, “The storms in the ocean were much more powerful than the powerful sharp wind above the high sky. We saw water walls that were thousands of meters high and huge holes to the bottom of the sea; we even encountered monsters we never saw before. You can never imagine how hard we had fought.”","“Ugh?” Mr. Fang glanced around at the people who craned their necks to listen.","“So...” Zong Wu lamented, “So dangerous!”","“Senior, you had ventured into such a dangerous place.” As an elder of the Heavenly Academy, Elder Yu had obviously heard about some stories about it. “I didn’t realize that it would be so unimaginably dangerous.”","“Do you think this guy is BSing?” Mr. Fang asked.","“Not likely. According to the legends, the place to the north of the Heavenly Abyss Sea has always been ominous. The only method of passing that zone recorded in the books is the spatial shifting teleportation with the teleportation array from the prehistoric times,” Elder Yu said, “No one has ever imagined of traveling through the Heavenly Forbidden Zones.”","The other elders of the Heavenly Academy nodded and showed their agreement. “In other words, we must connect these two areas with a teleportation array if we want to hold this netizen meetup.”","“Can’t we... go in and open a path?” Mr. Fang suggested tentatively, “It’s the most convenient method, right?”","“...” All the other people’s faces turned green at this idea. “It’s best... to build a teleportation array.”","Mr. Fang stroked his chin. “Then, who knows how to build this type of teleportation array?”","“This...” Elder Yu said, “Senior Zixiao had an ancient teleportation array. Unfortunately, after Senior Zixiao disappeared, that ancient array was destroyed by a natural disaster. It will take a lot of manpower and resources to repair it.”","Subconsciously, Mr. Fang reached for his wallet. “Will it cost a lot?”","“Um...” Zong Wu and the others exchanged a look. “If all the ancient families contribute, the cost will be little to them.”","“Good...” They began to plan this grand netizen meetup.","...","– Meanwhile, in the sky above Yuanyang City –","Roars of rare beasts suddenly sounded from the distant sky as if some powerful killers were poking their heads from the clouds.","In the spacious Cloud Ocean Square outside Yuanyang City, many cultivators were pointing at the distant sky and chattering. Soon, a huge beast poked its head from the clouds.","A roar resonated in the sky.","Then, all kinds of strange beasts flew toward Cloud Ocean Square like gales.","“Over there! What’s that?!”","A huge lizard-like beast covered in black scales was in the lead; it had two horns on its forehead, and its black wings spread out and fluttered, creating powerful winds around it.","“It seems to be a horned dragon of the western barbarians!” one cultivator yelled.","The huge body of the beast in the lead landed on Cloud Ocean Square, and its sturdy and sharp claws left deep cuts in the ground when it landed as if it were scratching tofu.","“Are they western barbarians?!”","“Western barbarians?!”","All the cultivators backed off, observing with wide-open eyes. They had heard about the barbarians in the northwest, but they hadn’t seen one before.","The man in the lead was about 40 years old with a chiseled, handsome face; he looked like a marble statue. His golden hair glittered in the sun, and he looked imposing and powerful.","With a whistle, a young man who was about 20 years old and had red and brown hair landed from the sky on a horned dragon next. He looked exotic, flippant, and somewhat wicked. “Look! Are these the ancient and elegant oriental people that you mentioned, Big Brother? How come they are all backing away from us like mice seeing cats?”","“Sister Sia, are you disappointed in our rash journey?”","A horned dragon with red scales, three horns, and golden pupils slowly landed beside him. On it was a woman wearing silver armor, a red dress, and a bull-horn-shaped helmet. She was also carrying a giant, strange-shaped sword on her waist.","She took off her helmet, revealing a chiseled and exotically beautiful face.","In the next moment, they saw a scene that they couldn’t imagine on their own!","“Look!”","Silver sword energies shot out from the city, and they formed a curtain of light, creating a dazzling show of colorful lights. With speed undetectable by the naked eye, the sword energies created streaks of silver afterimages and elegant arcs before landing on the platform. They were cultivators of Yuanyang City who were wearing silver warrior armor and Daoist robes.","They looked extremely elegant standing on flying swords that emitted spiritual lights.","“Big brother,” the red-haired man froze for a moment and said, “Are these guards warriors or cultivators?”","Beside him, the blond-haired man was also dazed.","He felt like...","Subconsciously, this man looked down at the horned dragon beneath him.","The horned dragon pulled back its paws. Then, it looked down at its huge paws and seemed to be wondering if it could also fly this way."]},{"number":488,"title":"Chapter 488 - Go and Scout Out That Shop","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Duan Mude, the Honorable Captain of the Yuanyang City Guards and the Executive Elder of the Heavenly Academy.”","The cultivator in the lead was wearing a silver robe; he was one of the cultivators who had witnessed Fang Qi destroying the sword slaves with Castellan Zong Wu at Cloud Ocean Square.","“Seth Mogus Blackdragon from the Black Dragon Family in Ultimate West Realm.” The man who was older than the others and looked about 40 years old spoke. He had blond curly hair, he looked bright, and he was fluent in the native language of the Spiritual State.","Although the cultivators in the Spiritual State called them western barbarians, they wouldn’t call themselves ‘barbarians’. They usually referred to themselves as people of the Ultimate West Realm or Ultimate West Land.","These people had borrowed the term ‘families’ from the cultivators in the Spiritual State. They had four big families, and this man came from the Black Dragon Family, which was one of the four.","In fact, the languages of the people from the Spiritual State and the Deserted Sea Realm; they were similar with only a few differences. The people of the Ultimate West Realm had their own language, and some of them had learned and mastered the language of the Spiritual State.","Some of them had even given themselves names using the language of the Spiritual State. For example, Seth said, “You can also call me Luo Piaoling.”","Luo Piaoling had excellent manners. Some of them put extra emphasis on good manners probably because they knew that they were called barbarians.","Of course, others just acted as what people of the Spiritual State expected them to be. The red-haired young man beside Luo Piaoling tried to speak using the language of the Spiritual State, but it sounded strange and awkward, “The swords are so slim that they can’t even be used as toothpicks. Aren’t you afraid that you will fall from them?”","“Not at all.” Duan Mude landed slowly. With one hand casting a sword spell, his flying sword grew bigger than the double-handed broad sword that these visitors were using. “With this wondrous sword control technique, even a person with a big body can stand on it.”","Then, he moved his fingers, and the sword immediately split into two and then to four. “You can even fly with others if you want; it all depends on your skill.”","The visitors were dazed.","“This is the second son of the Frost Dragon Family Master.”","“You can call me with my Spiritual State name.” The red-haired handsome young man leaped down from the horned dragon and proudly interrupted the introduction. “Before I came here, I gave myself a name to use in the Spiritual State.”","In case you don’t understand my grand and majestic real name, he thought.","Duan Mude was secretly relieved that he didn’t have to memorize the weird names of the western barbarians; they were all strange to him. He immediately asked about it.","The handsome red-head said with cold arrogance, “Lei Dazhuang!” [TL Note: Dazhuang means big and strong, but it is a bad-sounding name is Chinese.]","Duan Mude’s face twitched. “... Good name!”","“Of course!” Lei Dazhuang said proudly, “I know that in your language, ‘zhuang’ means powerful and masters. Of course, Dazhuang means the master among masters.”","“...” Duan Mude gave him a thumbs-up and said, “Young Master, you have an excellent name.”","Luo Piaoling was standing on the side, and his face twitched as well.","Then, he introduced the valiant-looking woman who was wearing a red dress and silver armor, “This is Ms. Sia of the Red Dragon Family.”","Duan Mude nodded at her slightly. This woman was a genius even among the barbarians who focused on the path of the warrior. She had reached the King Warrior Realm at such a young age.","“This is Elder Andrew of our Black Dragon Family.” He gestured toward an old man who was wearing black armor and had a brown mustache.","“This is Elder Lu Mingwei of the Red Dragon Family.” He pointed at a middle-aged man with long hair reaching his shoulder and said, “His ancestors came from the Spiritual State.”","...","“Please come in!” After the introductions and greetings, Duan Mude asked in a low voice, “Where’s Castellan Zong?”","“He went to the internet café to take a seat... he told us to send him a message to his communication jade when the visitors come...”","“...” Duan Mude’s face turned dark. “I’ll take you guys to the Taiwang Inn to rest; we’ll go to the Heavenly Academy tomorrow.”","...","– Meanwhile, in the Origins Internet Club –","Li Haoran asked, [Do you plan to rebuild the teleportation array?]","In fact, there were teleportation arrays in the Legend of the Sword and Fairy and Diablo 2.","Even the Legend of Mir 2 had random teleportation and instant teleportation spells.","The most convenient method was the teleportation magic spell in Harry Potter. With enough energy, it was faster to move from one zone to another than the sword control technique.","Of course, if one failed, one could lose a limb or a body part, which made it not suitable for battles.","At the current stage, the best option was the teleportation technology in Diablo.","It could be a spatial portal or an array disk; it was a very mature system.","However, the teleportation arrays in Diablo had drawbacks. For example, the people who wanted to use them must pass them and light up the array on the other side before they could be teleported to the exact location.","Only the type of teleportation gates in the mysterious Sanctuary in Act II of Diablo could teleport people without meeting those criteria.","If this kind of teleportation arrays was developed, people could be even teleported to another world, but it was quite difficult for these cultivators to research and make.","The only good news was that Heavenly Academy had the expertise to build one type of teleportation arrays.","...","“I’m surprised that this shop even defeated the Nangong Family and those few godly swords.” On the shore of the Heavenly Abyss Sea, black winds howled. The black figure standing on the cliff by the sea said after a pause, “Only three godly swords came out from the Nangong Family, but two of them are on the immortal-slayer-level.”","“Does it mean that the opponent’s strength is above the immortal-slayer-level?” The black figure sounded greedy. “The pair of Daoist eyes gave him so much power? No... it should belong to us!”","The chilly rainfall and blowing breeze made it sound like someone was whispering. A ghost-like figure said, “My spies brought me news. They are going to repair the teleportation array.”","“We can’t let them repair the array.” His voice was as faint as a breeze while his words whispered in the sky, “We can’t let them find out the truth about that person’s downfall... at least, not now.”","“If this person with strength on the immortal-slayer-level combines his power with those of the ancient families...” The ghost-like figure said, “We might not be able to defeat them for sure.”","“Damn it...” The black shadow said with hatred, “Our clan has arrived at the last moment after scheming for many years; we must get them! Otherwise, we will... turn into ashes in tribulations...”","A murderous spirit appeared around them, and it seemed like no one could stop him as he was determined to do whatever he must even at the price of his life.","“Then...” Their voices got even fainter until vanishing in the darkness. The last words seemed to be, “Let’s go into that shop and test the waters...”"]},{"number":489,"title":"Chapter 489 - Plan","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Fang Qi glanced at the task list on the System Interface. He had completed the second task of establishing dominance and obtained the rewards.","Mr. Fang dreaded turning the Fortune Prize Wheel since he still remembered that he almost got a bag of potato chips when he turned it the last time.","However, Fang Qi glanced at the items listed on the wheel and saw the high-level items included Final Fantasy VII: Advent Children, Orochi’s Blood, Random Bloodline Elixir, and a Godly Weapon Fragment. These items would stay on the wheel. Mr. Fang had turned the wheel several times and saw these items many times as well.","As for the low-end items such as potato chips, they would usually only stay on the wheel once. They would be replaced randomly by other things even if they were not drawn.","This time, the spot for the potato chip was replaced by Cappuccino, and the Dove chocolate was also switched off.","Mr. Fang had no choice but to lower his head and turn the Fortune Prize Wheel.","The needle on the wheel swiftly turned and then gradually slowed down until it came to the zone of the high-end items.","Godly weapon fragment...","Passed.","Orochi’s Blood...","Mr. Fang’s face turned dark when the needle passed it too.","The needle moved even slower, and the next item was Cappuccino.","“F*ck!”","Snap! The needle moved a bit further in the end and stopped at a strange machine.","[Beep! Host, congratulations on getting a ‘Norton’s Disassembler’. This machine offers services with fees.]","[TL Note: The Chinese version of Dungeon Fighter Online seems to be a little different compared to the North American version. Therefore, we translated the terminologies to the best of our abilities.]","“Ahh!?” Mr. Fang froze for a few seconds as he glanced at the strange machine that looked like a cupboard. “Norton’s Disassembler?”","He felt puzzled, and his vision almost darkened. Wait, I don’t even have the game yet! The disassembler’ is in place already?","In Dungeon Fighter Online, it was well known that alchemy reached an ultimate high level. In this game, players could even disassemble equipment and crystals; that went to show how advanced this technology was.","Through alchemy, most of the items in the game could be disassembled and made into various colored crystals with different elements or colorless small crystals. Using these crystals of different categories, players could create new equipment.","The colorless small crystals could be understood as mediums or sorcerers’ magic crystals.","These crystals had steady and dense structures, which made them extremely important products of alchemy. While ignoring other features, they could act as medium or buffers which were a necessity for using many skills in the game.","Fang Qin didn’t know if the skills recreated by the System were like those in the original game. In the original game, once the players that focused on close-range combat went over level 30, they all required colorless small crystals as a medium to use the more powerful skills.","However, in terms of mages, the mage players must cast spells through the mediums, which was the common feature of most systems of mages and sorcerers.","“...” Mr. Fang at a loss for words, wondered why he was given this item before the game was released; it only made sense if this item came after.","He had to accept it anyway since it was his prize...","The only good news was that Fang Qi would get the majority of the income earned from this machine including activation fees and service fees. After all, it was his prize.","In other words, this item would bring him more income later on, but he had to put it away for now.","Another task had stayed on Mr. Fang’s System Interface for a long time.","It was the task to unlock the new online game, Dungeon Fighter Online. The number of the sci-fic games and movies including Resident Evil the movie, Resident Evil the game, Grand Thief Auto 5, The Matrix, and StarCraft had reached 5; the earlier ones had far surpassed 1,000 activations.","With more players entering the two old shops, GTA 5, the game with the highest degree of freedom in the sci-fi genre, had more than 6,000 activations.","Despite this game not being that helpful towards improving strength, it was casual, relaxing, and open. The players could get familiar with the functions of modern objects, and the artifact masters, cultivators, and warriors could also learn basic knowledge about the machines in this game.","It was why many cultivators tried this game even though its style was not to their tastes.","For example, Tang Yu had dismantled the marines’ guns while he played StarCraft and spent some time on trying to mimic them but couldn’t find a way. However, Li Haoran could make a breakthrough in this research with his advantage in the basic knowledge that he learned from Grand Thief Auto 5.","The newly-released StarCraft had a sharp increase in sales lately. As for ‘The Matrix’, its activation number had reached the target set by the task before the release of StarCraft.","The goal of promoting sci-fi world views was temporarily completed.","As for the goal of unlocking the magic world views, Diablo 2 had been popular for a while now. The movie series including Harry Potter and the Hobbit were not as popular, but the fourth movie of Harry Potter had been released and the first movie of the Hobbit was released; each of them still had many fans.","The basic knowledge of runes and spells in the movies and games were helpful to the viewers. For example, the knowledge in Diablo 2 helped cultivators with the research of magic instillation and teleportation arrays. On top of that, spells such as teleportation and transfiguration had their own advantages.","In a magnificent palace in the inner section of Half City, a demonic woman with brown hair and green eyes stretched lazily and waved her magic wand. In the next moment, she already appeared before the shop.","“It’s been a long while since I saw the young Mr. Fang...” She reached out her slim hand to push open the door and entered the shop.","This was the advantage of the teleportation spell shown in Harry Potter. It had limitations in some areas and was even dangerous sometimes, but it was obviously very useful.","Mr. Fang sneezed, and he wondered who was thinking of him. Anyway, including Diablo 2, Devil May Cry, Harry Potter, and the Hobbit, he was only one step away from reaching the goal of the magic world views.","[TL Note: In Chapter 426, the author mentioned that 8 movies and games were required for magic world views, but it is now down to 5 here. We think that the author made a typo in Chapter 426 and will issue the correction.]","...","After completing the last task, he had also obtained an elevation of privileges. Fang Qi saw a tree-shaped graph on the System Interface after his privileges were upgraded.","With this graph, he didn’t need the System to send him tasks. Instead, he could see on the System Interface what he would do to develop the internet café and what benefits he would get.","For example, the three shops had all reached the limit for expansion. Fang Qi could calculate through the tree-shaped graph what degree of expansion he should make before he could get new rewards.","This way, he could make his own plans instead of solely relying on getting tasks from the System."]},{"number":490,"title":"Chapter 490 - Lecture on QQ","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Expand the Jiuhua City Shop to 8,000 seats...? Expand the Half City Shop to 6,500 seats and the Yuanyang City Shop to...1,000. With all that and making sure the seat occupancy rates are no lower than 70% at peak times, I will obtain the achieve ‘First Stage Prosperity’, get the right to sell iced red tea, and choose a movie or a game?” Fang Qi guessed that he would get benefits if he expanded the shops, and he sure found one achievement.","“Can I choose a movie or a game on my own will?” Fang Qi scratched his head and saw the instruction specifying that the movie or game he chose must have a lower power level compared to those of the existent games and movies. It meant that his decision wasn’t unbounded.","Compared with the tasks such as establishing dominance, the things that Fang Qi now needed to do were a little trivial.","Of course, ‘trivial’ didn’t mean ‘unnecessary’.","– In the Jiuhua City Shop –","With the increase in customers, two employees for each shop were not enough to deal with the daily business as there were too many players.","The situation was now completely different from when the Legend of Mir 2 was just released.","When the Legend of Mir 2 was just released, there were indeed large numbers of players, but they were mostly disciplined like the soldiers of the Jiuhua Army and Royal Guards which managed their people with strict rules, thus giving little extra burden to the shop.","But now, many elite disciples from different factions and families entered the shop. At the peak times, nearly 10,000 players passed each shop’s gate.","The shops were only organized thus far since the shop employees were cultivators; they were nimbler in both movements and minds and could multitask. If they were ordinary people, they would have been overwhelmed by now.","The System seemed to have no intention of handling this problem. Instead, it tossed the problem to Mr. Fang who had obtained an elevation of privileges and could operate on his own, as the System described.","“...” Mr. Fang was feeling pain as he muttered in puzzlement, “Didn’t you say that I’m responsible for outside business and you will manage the business inside the shops? I haven’t finished conquering the world yet, and you put this burden on me. Do you think it’s fair?”","“Then, what’s your job now? Staying idle? As a system, you can’t continue in this idle lifestyle.”","System didn’t respond.","If the System had a face, it must be dark right now.","“Come on, give me a suggestion.” Finally, Mr. Fang revealed his intention.","Silence.","After a long pause, the System seemed to give in and spat out some words reluctantly, [With your current privileges, you can recruit employees by yourself.]","Mr. Fang was at a loss for words.","The System didn’t offer anything useful and ‘bicker’ back. Mr. Fang viewed the System’s action in disdain.","Do I need you to tell me the obvious?","Mr. Fang had no choice but to consider the issue of employee recruitment. Right now, the Yuanyang City Shop had more than enough employees.","But in the other two shops...","He must solve the problem of employees before expanding the shops.","He must put out notices of recruitment first.","...","Mr. Fang handled the trivial matters in the shop and didn’t have time to mind other things.","Meanwhile, the players in the three shops were busy preparing for the Netizen Meetup.","Right now, Su Tianji was talking to her disciples in Liuyun Daoist Palace, “Fenghua! Yuexin! Which robe do you think is the best for me to wear on my journey to the Spiritual State?”","In her room behind Tianji Palace, Su Tianji was putting a white Daoist skirt and a blue Daoist robe against her body to compare.","Her two disciples looked embarrassed.","Obviously, idle people like them were not qualified to join the construction team for the teleportation array, and so they had lots of free time.","Class A of the Huang House in Lingyun Academy, where Nalan Mingxue and Song Qingfeng were at, had become the elite class of Lingyun Academy. Mu Hongzhu, the combat technique instructor, had become one of the elite instructors as well.","These young people came out from the practice field in high spirits.","“Young Master Song, should we go to the Spiritual State this time?” Lin Shao was dressed in black clothes and wore black boots; he had been dressing like this after watching ‘The Matrix’.","“Of course!” These young people had reached the Grandmaster Warrior Realm. Song Qingfeng practiced two fist techniques and said, “I feel like I’m unrivaled!”","Lin Shao murmured, “Senior Sister Zixin beat you senseless yesterday, eh?”","Xu Luo stopped him. “Hush! Don’t expose him.”","Song Qingfeng was feeling a little smug.","...","The elite young warriors from the three academies in Dajin were also the most experienced players; they were the main guests invited by the Heavenly Academy. Shengjing Academy and Xiyi Academy were invited along with Lingyun Academy.","Compared with their peers of Lingyun Academy, the disciples of Xiyi Academy and Shengjing Academy were more nervous.","They had played games in the internet café for a long time but had only competed with their own peers; they never had battled with outside people.","In the last competition, the disciples from these two academies had been defeated by their peers from the Lingyun Academy. This time, they were determined not to repeat their shameful experience!","“Senior Brother, are you sure that you can win?” some disciples were whispering among themselves outside of the shop.","“Don’t worry! I’ve cultivated for so long in the shop. Besides, our Dajin Royal Family has improved the Gold Raven Scroll!” Fifth Prince Ji Yang was among them, and he laughed with arrogance while saying, “It’s said that the western barbarians are visiting the Spiritual State; we finally get the chance to show our abilities!”","“Fifth Prince, you are a great genius!” someone praised, “You are not 30 yet, but you have reached such a high level in the Martial Dao!”","“Of course.”","Behind them, Nalan Hongwu walked out of the shop, patting Liang Heihu, an instructor at Shengjing Academy, on the shoulder. This Old Duke said, “Heihu, you are the best among the instructors of Shengjing Academy. It’s said that in the Spiritual State, cultivators under 150 years old and warriors under 100 years old are counted as the young generation. At your age, you can join this competition.”","“His Majesty has told me this. The younger disciples under 30 can go there and just watch.”","The Fifth Prince who was walking before them looked back at them with wide-open eyes. “...”","...","In the Artifact Masters Group Chat, people were working harder and way more professionally.","The artifact masters from different forces were the main strength in making the Cross-Regional Netizen Meetup possible. The forces included Xuanzhong Manor and Yuxu Mountain, which had inherited the original array disk of the ancient teleportation array and had begun talking about the building plan of the new teleportation array.","Gu Tingyun created a group chat in QQ, and many artifact masters from the Half City Shop and the Jiuhua City Shop joined the group. He sat before the computer and said solemnly, [I’ll explain the structure of the teleportation array in detail.]","The Baoping Spiritual Master said, [Guys, we’ve successfully made the new communication jade based on your blueprint of the jade-slip-style communication jade.]","In her hand was a communication jade bigger than the ordinary ones. It could not only send messages but also upload the information stored in the jade slips to QQ.","Gu Tingyun added, [I have brought you a lot of documents about building the array.]","The lecture began on QQ."]},{"number":491,"title":"Chapter 491 - Not Seats? Watch Anime First","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","The issue with the Heaven-Seeking Sword Palace shook the high-level cultivators like a big bomb, but it had no effects on Dajin and Half City.","The artifact masters from these two shops came early today to hear the lecture about teleportation array structure given by a master in Spiritual State.","The teleportation array lecture on QQ attracted many elite artifact masters.","In the lecture, Gu Tingyu explained the traditional teleportation array structure. Then, Jun Yangzi from Wuwei Daoist Alliance shared his research on the materials and structure of the small teleportation array in Diablo 2.","Each type of teleportation arrays had its own advantages.","After the lecture, there were private tutor sessions on QQ so that they could quickly build the teleportation arrays together.","After all, it wasn’t a project that could be completed in one or two days, and the people in these shops got busy since this morning.","...","The convenient life and daily items such as smart phones and cars shown in Grand Theft Auto 5 greatly inspired the cultivators in this world.","It didn’t mean that the cultivators in this world couldn’t make these things, but few people thought about making items in this direction.","After all, their main concern was increasing their cultivation strength to defend themselves against their enemies. If they were killed one day, what could these non-combative items do for them?","As for the cultivators with high cultivation strength, they could do whatever they wanted with spiritual spells without using these items.","However, the situation had changed. After the Wuwei Daoist Alliance defeated the Yundian Upper Realm and the alliance of major forces with ease, the whole country was finally at peace.","Grand Theft Auto 5 was like the front-end, and The Matrix was like a ‘heavenly book’ in programming and helped the cultivators understand modern technologies better. Gradually, the cultivators began to use their new communication jades in their daily life.","The new type of communication jades was still a novelty for most cultivators, but the people such as the Royal Princess, Nalan Mingxue, and Su Tianji who were in no shortage of crystals had begun using the new communication jades.","The structure of the new communication jades was mostly made with traditional artifact making techniques. They were new and special spiritual artifacts with functions such as showing pictures, replaying videos, and transmitting sounds from a distance.","Of course, the players would be proud to be in possession of such an artifact.","Dong Qingli, the owner of the Wind and Moon Pavilion, bought one recently.","“Miss, the seats are all taken...” Zhang Wanyu came back from the counter, wondering why so many customers came to the shop so early in the morning.","Usually, they would find a few seats empty at this time of the day even though people had to wait in line at peak times.","“It’s said that the artifact masters are having a lecture...” Unperturbed, Dong Qingli said mildly, “They are trying to repair the teleportation array leading to the Spiritual State, which is an important task. We can wait here...”","After the last upgrading of the shop a while ago, the customers didn’t have to stand behind the computer to wait for their turn. Instead, they could get on the waiting list using their membership cards, and they would be assigned seats in order.","However, this system had just been put into use not long ago.","Many people were sitting on the couches of the lounge area with milk tea or instant noodles, waiting for their turn.","“We’re just a little bit late today...” Zhang Wanyu was sullen. “Miss, should we return to the Wind and Moon Pavilion first?”","At this moment, Dong Qingli dug out an exquisite communication-jade-looking jade tablet.","“It’s okay,” Dong Qingli said, “We’ll watch this while we wait.”","“Chatting on QQ?” Zhang Wanyu was a little surprised.","“No. Let’s watch an anime.” Dong Qingli turned on the virtual media and injected her spiritual essence into it after she clicked around. Then, the virtual screen before them grew bigger until it was as big as a 20-inch computer screen.","“Animation?” Zhang Wanyu thought for a moment and remembered that it referred to the stories they watched on the computers in Qzone.","Who would watch such stories with their precious computer time? Besides, they must pay gold coins that they earned in Qzone to buy these stories. It was a waste of time and money!","If the players were not required to buy the anime to unlock certain items they wanted, Zhang Wanyu thought no one would have wanted to buy them at all.","“Yes!” Dong Qingli said in excitement, “I bought several of them in Qzone, and we can watch them on the communication jade!”","“Ugh...?” Zhang Wanyu asked in surprise, “We can watch on the communication jade?!”","She saw many options on the communication jade. With the traditional communication jade, cultivators received and picked up messages with spiritual senses, which meant that no one else could see them.","However, although the new communication jade was also operated through spiritual senses and spiritual essence, others could also see the virtual images and videos shown on it. Right now, she saw the list of anime on the jade tablet such as Pokémon, Tom and Jerry, and Re:Zero − Starting Life in Another World.","Dong Qingli chose Pokémon. Then, the two girls sat together and watched it while eating instant noodles.","This Pokemon anime told the story about amazing creatures on the planet. In the story, Ash, who dreamed to become a Pokemon Master, and Pikachu, embarked on an adventure.","With the characters in the anime, the two girls also embarked on an amazing adventure.","Obviously, the System remade the anime, so each frame was as exquisite as a wall paper.","Eating instant noodles, Zhang Wanyu felt young again while watching the yellow electric mouse which could only yell ‘Pikachu’. “Wow! This Pikachu is adorable!”","“I bought it already!” Dong Qingli had bought a stuffed Pikachu with the first bit of money that she earned by growing vegetables in Qzone.","“Hahahaha! Look at them! They got stunned by the electricity shock!”","“This pokémon is super fun...”","“Cute and fun...”","The two quickly attracted the attention of the people around them.","As the son of the Castellan of Jiuhua, An Cheng lived an idle life, and now he was bored.","As for An Huwei, he had some free time this morning, so he came to the shop. However, all the seats had been taken. Sitting on a couch, he looked sullen while drinking a cup of milk tea.","“Ms. Nalan, we’re late today.” Lan Yan made a circle in the shop. “All the seats are taken.”","Then, they sat down in the lounge area.","“Ugh? What are you guys watching?”","“Pokemon,” Zhang Wanyu answered, “You have to buy this to unlock the special spiritual demon beasts nurturing method.”","“Oh, I see...” With a bowl of instant noodles in her hands, Nalan Mingxue sat beside them and watched it too.","Then, the bored young masters in Jiuhua, including An Cheng, leaned over. “What are you watching?”","“What? What are you watching?” Even An Huwei, who had been flipping through his files, looked toward them.","At this moment, the screen was filled with yellow flashes while Pikachu knocked down everyone present with an electric shock.","“What is this demon beast?” Putting down the cup of milk tea, An Huwei watched the anime curiously."]},{"number":492,"title":"Chapter 492 - From the Shadows","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","The Half City Shop and the Jiuhua City Shop had begun recruiting new clerks.","Since each shop had two senior and experienced employees, the new clerks didn’t have to be very familiar with the games and business in the shop.","The process went on smoothly.","Boom!","The sky above Jiuhua City turned pitch-black.","It was 9 AM of a day in spring. The weather had been getting warmer, but it suddenly turned colder than winter.","The booming thunders seemed to be pouring their fury into the ground, and black waves surged in the wide canal in Jiuhua City and pushed the boats and ships docking at the harbor by the bank up and down.","The strong gales howled in the sky and across the river. The black water in the river got darker, and the gales pushed up huge waves, almost sweeping a few strong boatmen off their boats. Fortunately, these boatmen had some basic training in martial arts and tightly held onto the ropes on the boats.","Chilly water surged up onto the banks, turning the canal in Jiuhua City into turmoil. Cold winds howled in a remote alley by the bank that no one paid attention to. The invisible wind and the raindrops seemed to condense at this place and form a ghost-like figure.","Jiuhua City had always been prosperous. Ever since cultivators from major forces swarmed into this city from all places, it got even more crammed with people. The pedestrians including cultivators, warriors, and even ordinary people thronged on the streets. In the inclement weather, they hid under eaves or dashed back home while covering their heads with wide sleeves.","A dark figure watched the pedestrians in the rain like an observer of this mortal world, and this figure murmured to himself, “Like short-lived cicada who do not know the seasons, these lowly ants don’t have to worry about the future. How lucky they are.”","“The time is here; doom is coming.” The figure seemed to merge with the pedestrians who were finding shelter from the rain and then vanished.","...","More and more players entered the shop. Although they had to wait for seats, many of them seemed to find a way to kill time. After watching several episodes of Pokémon, Dong Qingli turned her head and froze. “How come there are so many people around us?”","In the crowd, a black shadow moved a little to the side subconsciously. Was I... discovered?","Since all the computers were taken, it had stood behind and watched the anime for a long while.","Dong Qingli turned back around and continued watching the anime.","The crowd behind the two girls watched several episodes of Pokémon and a few episodes of Tom and Jerry with them until it was their turn to get on computers.","After Dong Qingli and Zhang Wanyu went onto the computers, the crowd behind her could do nothing but wait patiently for their turns. Since they came in later, the wait was obviously longer.","“Well! The show is over! Nothing more to watch!”","Without Dong Qingli who was playing the anime, the crowd soon dispersed, and the black figure lurking behind was about to leave as well.","At this moment, a strange sour aroma floated over.","With a purple bowl of instant noodles in his hands, a young man wearing a purple warrior outfit walked toward the lounge area with his friends.","They were Song Qingfeng and his buddies.","With a new communication jade in his hand, Song Qingfeng heard the chatter of the people nearby.","As old players of Qzone, they had opened large pieces of vegetable fields in their spaces and thus earned lots of money.","“Young Master Song, how come they seem to be talking about anime too?” Lin Shao asked curiously.","“I thought only we watched anime,” Xu Luo said.","“Anyway, I downloaded several episodes of the anime named Detective Conan!”","“What do you think of it? Is it good?”","“Let’s watch it!”","They sat down on a couch and began to watch.","“Ugh...? They are watching this, too?!”","“More anime to watch?”","Lin Shao who had been absorbed in watching the anime suddenly looked back, scratching his head. “Junior Master Song, how come I feel chilly?”","He had a feeling that someone was staring at them.","He saw black-gloved hands moving back silently while holding a bowl of instant noodles.","Song Qingfeng said curiously, “Now, it feels better.”","...","The weather at the shore of the Heavenly Abyss Sea had been gloomy lately.","The guards at the checkpoints on the shore took a little nap while a drizzle began to fall from the sky.","It was silent except for the sounds of raindrops; it looked as if even the sky and the earth were sound asleep.","At this moment, no one was awake in the small town.","A few guards fell asleep, feeling as if their eyelids were as heavy as lead.","Strong gales blew rocks off the cliff, revealing a tall figure who was hidden in a black cloak. This figure appeared without a sound as if it had come from the pitch-black night and was going to merge into this pitch-black night soon.","Dark clouds surged up in the sky, and black winds swept up raindrops.","“When I arrived at the Morning Star Sea Realm, I waited for more than 8 hours to get a seat. How are things going with you?”","“I went from Yuanyang City all the way to the Deserted Sea Realm and finally got a chance to test the waters,” the chilly voice sounded in the sky.","“What do you think...?”","The chilly voice said, “We need to change our strategy... In the Heavenly Abyss Sea...”","He sounded fearful of the depths of the ocean.","His voice got lower and lower, and one could only hear the faint words such as playing games in the shop and anime.","“You want us to change the plan now and play the Legend of the Sword and Fairy in the shop? Do you think it wise? Besides...” The tall figure wearing the cloak said, “If others know that we go to the little shop in the mortal world everyday, they will laugh at us.”","In the howling wind and pouring rain, the chilly and faint voice in the sky said with conviction, “Don’t worry. If we keep silent about it, no one will know that we’ve been to that shop or that I watched Tom and Jerry and Detective Conan for hours.”","Its voice was full of confidence.","A while later, the voices vanished; it seemed like the two figures had left.","...","Everything seemed to have quieted down, no matter if it was the Heavenly Abyss Sea or the shops.","It was midnight, and the lights were still on in the shops.","A group of cultivators and warriors gathered in the lounge area; they were watching anime while sipping milk tea or eating instant noodles. It looked tranquil.","It gave people the illusion that the whole world was peaceful and tranquil like this.","No one would imagine that huge changes were taking place in the center of the Heavenly Abyss Sea which was famous for its mystery and all kinds of legends; it was also the border between the Deserted Sea Realm and the Spiritual State."]},{"number":493,"title":"Chapter 493 - Upgrading the Shops Again","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","For cultivators from either the Deserted Sea Realm or the Spiritual State, the sea realm around the border in the center of Heavenly Abyss Sea was a taboo that no one wanted to bring up.","Few people had ever traveled across this sea realm in history, and the phenomenon that took place in there were rare and only existed in legends.","Besides, the cultivators of the Spiritual State had been in a decline from its prime time. No people had gotten close to that sea realm after the downfall of the Zixiao Spiritual Master.","Only sporadic descriptions of it were left in the scrolls kept by the ancient families.","The morning sun rose above the ocean and lit up the ocean waves. The sunbeams shining through the morning mist were beautiful as it showed multiple colors through refraction.","There were no people in the center of the Heavenly Abyss Sea, and there were also few fish and birds.","The morning mist and clouds got thicker, merging in the distant horizon. Further away, it was hard to tell the clouds apart from the mist, but they all looked like snow mountains standing on the sea surface, moving with winds. Suddenly, a huge thing could be vaguely seen in the cloud mountains like the tip of an iceberg.","...","Lately, the sky above Jiuhua City was always gloomy. Even without rain, it felt chilly, making people suspect if they were in Half City.","The phenomenon in the distant Heavenly Abyss Sea naturally had no effects on this place; the shop was tranquil as usual.","A ghost-like figure walked into the shop with the thronging crowd. While he walked, he seemed to be murmuring something to himself or sending voice messages to someone.","“These lowly mortals are indeed insignificant, ridiculous, and ignorant.”","“Well, they are watching anime in the shop.” He glanced around and saw Song Qingfeng and Dong Qingli sitting before computers, but a luxuriously dressed young master was watching anime on his communication jade.","As time went on, the players had gotten more and more income through growing vegetables in Qzone. With more gold coins in hand, they bought more anime. They originally bought anime to unlock certain functions, but they were now buying anime because they liked them.","There were quite a few young masters and playboys, such as Young Castellan An Cheng. He had watched anime behind the others and thus downloaded some episodes himself to kill time while waiting for his turn to get online.","“Young Master An, what’s this?” Some other young masters in the Jiuhua City looked at the virtual media before An Cheng curiously. “I’ve never seen this before. Naruto? What is it?”","“It seems like we are required to buy this to unlock the five-elemental ninjutsu. This is an action genre anime, and it’s worth a try.” After all, the anime they watched recently such as Tom and Jerry and Detective Conan were interesting and entertaining, but they lacked action and weren’t as thrilling.","In the world of cultivators and warriors, watching anime without action was like eating a meal without meat.","Although there were fights in Tom and Jerry, it wasn’t worth mentioning.","“Action genre?”","A black figure leaned over. “Okay, I’ve got to go now. There are no seats available right now, so I’ll watch some anime first.”","“...”","“Don’t worry. I won’t forget about our plan.”","...","Fang Qi glanced around and was satisfied that the recruitment of employees had finished. Different from the previous recruitment, this time, he only needed hard-working clerks with a strong sense of responsibility since they would only deal with trivial duties such as being the cashiers.","The new employees of the Jiuhua City Shop were mostly the young talented cultivators rescued from the Taixi Faction incident. In the Half City shop, the new employees were mostly native residents of the city.","He recruited ten new clerks, five males and five females, for each shop. Including the old employees, there were 12 people in each shop. With enough help, Mr. Fang could now expand the space in the shops.","After the elevation of his privileges, Mr. Fang found that he could make his own choices in the layout and decorations of the shops.","For example, in the traditional style shop, he could grow some spiritual herbs and flowers. He had placed a small wooden bridge near the entrance. In the gurgling creek under the bridge, he put in some fish and shrimp.","In the fantasy style shop, he placed a round flowerbed made of white stone in the center of the shop. The ground was paved with white stones, and the computer desks were made of green stones. The entire shop looked quite high-end and had an emotional appeal.","The spatial arrays which could contain living things weren’t extraordinary to cultivators in the Spiritual State. After all, all the ancient families could do that, and many of their palaces were built with this type of arrays.","However, what Mr. Fang chose next was something that they had never seen before.","[Beep! The selections are complete. The shop will finish the upgrade before opening for business tomorrow.]","Slam!","When Mr. Fang walked down from the second floor after finishing selecting options for tonight’s upgrades, he saw a strange cultivator wearing a black cloak slamming his hand on the desk and standing up.","The hood of the big cloak was pulled low, concealing most of the person’s face, and his skin revealed from the hood had a weird greenish-grey hue.","Many people glanced at his direction.","Since the people of the ancient families came into the shop, the Yuanyang City Shop, which didn’t have many seats, was crammed.","The black-robed man’s face looked dark with displeasure. It was true that people could watch anime to kill time, but...","Not far from him sat a cute loli who was about ten, and she had a big white deer with her.","She had a new communication jade in her hands.","There were several other girls sitting around her.","A strange song floated from the communication jade: “Happy Lamb, Pretty Lamb, and Lazy Lamb... Although I’m only a lamb...”","[This is the opening song for the Chinese Anime, Pleasant Goat and Big Big Wolf, which is meant for young kids who are in kindergarten and elementary school.]","He found that it was hard to bear this song for long!","“Can’t the shop get some more of these... machines?!”","“...” The person under the cloak glanced at the anime Jiang Xiaoyue was watching. Didn’t they claim that this stuff is interesting for killing time...? How could anyone say that this thing is interesting?! I had watched it for almost a day and didn’t find anything interesting about it!","“Hahahaha! These lambs are so cute!” The big white deer laughed while sitting on a couch.","“...” The person under the cloak was frustrated, and his face darkened while it twitched.","For a moment, he suspected that his brain malfunctioned.","“Don’t worry!” Mr. Fang waved his hand and gave him some good news. “Tomorrow, we’ll have enough seats for all of you.”","Li Wuya yelled, “Please be patient, Sir. It will be your turn very soon.”","“Okay!” The black-cloaked cultivator sat down reluctantly. “Then, I’ll wait a little longer.”","“Yohahahaha! This wolf is so dumb!”","“Yes, isn’t it?” Jiang Xiaoyue giggled while covering her mouth with her hand. “How can this wolf eat other small animals?”","Hearing their words, the person in the cloak looked over subconsciously and continued watching the anime.","..."]},{"number":494,"title":"Chapter 494 - Are You Going to Play or Not?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","In the ancient relics of the Cultivation Realm controlled by the Three Saint Factions, which was to the west of Dajin, everything had turned into bleak and desolate ruins. Due to the long passage of time, most palaces had collapsed, and many restriction arrays had eroded and stopped working.","In this vast small world, no one knew the size of this place and which dimension it was. Also, no one knew if the people who had ventured into this world were still in the previous world.","The sky was orange-red, as if it was lit by the setting sun. It was called a relic, but it looked more like a huge ancient battlefield.","Rusty weapons could be seen scattered all over the place.","The bells on the squares of the three saint factions sounded three times, signaling that it was the returning time of the cultivators who had gone into the Cultivation Realm.","Two cultivators of Yundian Upper Realm looked back subconsciously.","“Look! What’s that...?”","They looked back and saw a huge boulder in the depths of the relic rising slowly as if it were answering a summon. In the deepest part of the relic, the immortal palaces that no one had ever touched suddenly rose into the air!","...","Ding...","Mr. Fang grabbed the spiritual-artifact-style alarm clock and tossed it out, going back to sleep.","Li Xin’er had gotten up early. She had heard that new computers would come today and wondered when they would arrive since Mr. Fang hadn’t stepped out of the shop yet.","She walked downstairs in bafflement. Then, the first thing that she saw was a large group of people standing outside the glass door.","“Sir! Open the door!” Tang Yu and other young men were almost clinging on the door, afraid that they wouldn’t get seats if they came late.","Behind them, Xun Yuan yelled, “How come you’re so early today?!”","“I came here at six today!”","He glanced at the people before him. “When did that guy come?!”","Before Tang Yu stood a tall figure wearing a black cloak.","“How would I know...” people whispered behind them.","“It seems that he didn’t leave last night...”","“It’s opening!” Finally, Li Xin’er unlocked the door, and the players swarmed into the shop.","“How come the space inside has expanded so much?!” Upon entering the shop, someone exclaimed.","“It’s a spatial array. I’m surprised to see it in this small shop!”","“Awesome...”","They seemed to be people from the ancient families.","“You’re ignorant!” Some family masters scolded them. They didn’t visit the shop every day, but they would come here to study the Legend of the Sword and Fairy or StarCraft. Even if they didn’t come, the disciples of the ancient families would come and play games in the shop.","Three dignified-looking, middle-aged men ushered in a majestic, middle-aged man who was wearing a scholar headpiece and a red robe with dragon patterns. “Brother Xuanyuan, please come this way.”","The Xun Family Master scolded the disciples, “It’s just a spatial array. Shame on you for acting so startled.”","“Eh-hem...” The majestic, middle-aged man wearing the red dragon-patterned robe stepped into the shop. “Good. It’s just a spatial array. Don’t get startled.”","He appeared calm, looking extraordinary standing among the players who were dazed by the sight.","With measured steps, these middle-aged people walked toward the counter while glancing around at the layout of the shop.","At this moment, they heard another exclamation.","“What’s with this door?!” It was Tang Yu.","“What about it?” Many people heard his exclamation and looked over immediately.","Tang Yu had just walked out from the washroom. The moment he pushed open the door, he found that he was in a place resembling the previous shop, and he seemed to stand in the same position as before after sensing his spatial location.","However, the cashier before him changed to Li Wuya from Li Xin’er.","He retreated and entered again, finding him in the new shop.","“!!??” He couldn’t understand it!","He immediately walked back and opened the door again. He looked up and saw Li Wuya.","He walked out and then went in again. When he looked up, he was astonished to find himself in the new shop again!","“You guys, come and look at this door!” Tang Yu exclaimed again.","“Stop fussing!” Tang Ao, the Tang Family Master, said with disapproval since the other family masters were also watching. He stepped up and scolded, “Don’t fuss about the door! Have you forgotten my teachings?”","He’s showing such bad manners!","With a snort, Tang Ao glanced at the door handle that Tang Yu was still gripping before walking out. “What’s so strange about this door?”","He walked back in with disdain.","“Ugh?!”","“Where are they?!” Suddenly, he saw no one but Elder Li Wuya at the counter.","Immediately, he went out and then walked in again.","“??? Impossible... Are my eyes playing tricks on me?”","Again, he went out and came in.","The Xun Family Master and Wang Family Master’s faces twitched. “Brother Tang, what are you doing?!”","It’s shameful to act like this in front of so many people!","“No...” Tang Ao pointed at the door before him in bewilderment. “This door...”","“What’s about this door? What is so good about it?” They walked through the door in disdain.","– Ten seconds later –","Xuanyuan Qiu watched as the Xun Family Master and Wang Family Master walked in and out again and again.","“What are you guys doing there?!”","“...”","Three minutes later, Mr. Fang stretched and came down from his upstairs bedroom after washing up.","He instantly saw four middle-aged men and a large group of young people standing before the door in the corridor leading to the inside of the shop.","They pushed it open and walked in neatly in one row.","Soon, they walked out.","Then, they pushed the door open and walked in again in neat rows.","While they were doing this, they looked at the door up and down with great interest.","“Crazy guys...” Mr. Fang looked at them as if they were morons before walking into the shop.","“Sir!” They were totally dazed. As masters of big families, they just couldn’t figure out the secret of the door after studying it for so long!","Was it a kind of deceptive trick? Impossible! The person who could trick them like this wasn’t even born yet!","“This...” They walked up to Fang Qi with wide-open eyes. “What’s this thing?!”","“How come... I can walk into two shops through the same door?!”","Mr. Fang did some clumsy explanations...","Space-folding? Such a thing exists in the world?","“The senior in your shop has unrivaled knowledge in spatial arrays!”","“Hiss!”","“So powerful...!”","“No. I’ve got to find out how it’s done!”","They kept walking in and out of the door.","Mr. Fang couldn’t bear it anymore. “Are you going to play or not?!”"]},{"number":495,"title":"Chapter 495 - Who’s More Authentic?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Unlike the three saint factions which had an array disk leading to the Spiritual State, the cultivators of the Morning Star Sea Realm couldn’t build a teleportation array leading to the Spiritual State in a short time.","The cultivators who wanted to go to the Spiritual State must travel all the way to the continent where Dajin was situated.","It was not a short journey. Even for those people who had mastered the sword control technique and could travel at a greater speed than before, it would take a long while to reach their destination.","That was why the cultivators and warriors intending to take this journey all had high cultivation strengths; they had prepared for it for a long while. Now, they had set off.","...","Meanwhile, in the Martial Dao Field at the Heavenly Academy.","Inside the Heavenly Academy, there were cultivators learning spiritual spells and warriors learning the Martial Dao.","The Martial Dao Field was the place for practicing combat techniques, and many warriors in the academy were practicing in the field.","The warriors in the Heavenly Academy were quite famous all over the Spiritual State. After all, a Grand Emperor Warrior had come out from this academy.","According to the legends, he was a lord of all warriors and could break mountains and rivers with one fist, shatter the ground with one stomp, and defeat tens of thousands of elite soldiers with one thought.","Due to the existence of such a person, the warriors managed to hold themselves against cultivators and create a strong foothold in the Spiritual State which was dominated by the brilliant cultivation civilization.","This man created a path that all warriors wished to follow, making the Heavenly Academy one of the holy places for warriors in Spiritual State.","“Gabriel!” A furious yell sounded.","As the second son of the Frost Dragon Family Master, Lei Dazhuang’s original name was Gabriel. At level 6 of the King Warrior Realm, his strength was quite high among the warriors in his family.","For the ordinary warriors who couldn’t pass the Ancestral Warrior Realm all their lives, he was an astonishing genius for reaching the King Warrior Realm at such a young age.","More importantly, he had reached the late stage of the King Warrior Realm at such a young age, which was unthinkable in the Deserted Sea Realm.","He was even an elite compared to the warriors in the Spiritual State.","“I didn’t realize that the warriors of Spiritual State were so weak.” With a big and heavy saber that was as tall as a person on his shoulder, Gabriel looked down on several warriors of the Heavenly Academy who were lying on the ground. These warriors were sweating profusely due to the pain from their dislocated and unnatural-looking hand bones.","Walking out of the field, he saw the displeasure on Luo Piaoling’s face when the latter came over with a few disciples of his family. Gabriel said, “It’s not my fault!”","While shrugging, Gabriel snickered and clumsily said in the Spiritual State language, “I saw that they were practicing in the field and offered to have a match with them. They are as weak as girls with small swords like tooth-picks.”","“When Father sent me here to do some Martial Dao exchange, I thought that they were powerful. But now I know that I was mistaken; the warriors of the Spiritual State only have fancy moves that deal no damage. I think it’s a waste of my time by coming here!”","“Sister Sia,” Gabriel looked at the woman who had blond curly hair and was wearing silver light armor and said with a snicker, “I think we should go and tour Yuanyang City instead of rotting in this place. This place doesn’t deserve its reputation as a holy place for warriors!”","“Father said that even though the combat techniques in the Spiritual State are no match for those in our Ultimate West Realm, a Grand Emperor Warrior once came out of Heavenly Academy. I’m sure that this academy has its uniqueness even though it’s not our match.”","“What uniqueness? These people can’t beat us and even invited warriors from the Deserted Sea Realm to exchange understandings of the Martial Dao with us!” Obviously, he was displeased with the situation. “It’s a waste of our time.”","“Exchange? I think it’s more like teaching. Do they want us to teach them our powerful combat techniques?”","He looked even more contemptuous. “I, Gabriel, don’t have time to teach these undeserving students!”","When Gabriel said that, the other disciples of major families of the Ultimate West Realm also looked disdainful. They had heard about the Deserted Sea Realm and knew that it was a remote wasteland. What kind of warriors could that place have?","Gabriel thought that he could even beat cultivators from the Deserted Sea Realm, let alone warriors.","“Gabriel, didn’t they say that the warriors of the Deserted Sea Realm are very powerful?” A young man with red and brown curly hair snickered and said, “They can use something called Heavenly Sword and Saint Spiritual Sword Techniques? They can even use double-handed sword techniques.”","“Look at the warriors here. Do you think you can believe what they say?!” Gabriel said in disdain.","“Hahahaha!” His words instantly evoked laughter from others.","“Indeed. Even if they are just bluffing, they should at least be realistic.”","“Only warriors of our Ultimate West Realm inherited the techniques for double-handed broad swords and huge swords. The warriors of the Spiritual State can only stab around with needles. I’ll cut off my head if they can use proper double-handed sword techniques!”","“Hahahaha!”","Luo Piaoling slightly frowned.","“Do you believe it?” The cold and proud woman named Sia asked him.","“I don’t know why they say it,” Luo Piaoling shook his head and said, “But only people of our Ultimate West Realm can use powerful and proper techniques designed for broadswords and double-handed swords. Is it possible that the people of the Deserted Sea Realm also inherited such sword techniques?”","“I hope it’s true.” Under her blonde hair, Sia’s chiseled face looked soft, beautiful, valiant, and proud in the golden sunshine. “I’ll show the ignorant people of the Deserted Sea Realm what the authentic techniques are!”","...","[Beep. You obtained the achievement ‘First Stage Prosperity’","Expand the Jiuhua City Shop to 8,000 seats, the Half City Shop to 6,500 seats, and the Yuanyang City Shop to 1,000 seats. The seat occupancy rate has to be higher than 70% at peak times. Then, the achievement ‘First Stage Prosperity’ will be granted.","Achievement Reward: The right to sell iced red tea, and choose a movie or a game]","Mr. Fang hadn’t thought that he would obtain the achievement as soon as the second day after the expansions.","It must be noted that he could only choose a movie or a game with a power level lower than the current movies and games, which meant that Mr. Fang would only choose a movie or a game with special features.","In fact, the movie that Mr. Fang enjoyed the most was Resident Evil 1. After watching the movie, he had mastered everything about the close-range combat skill.","However, he didn’t get the same experience in Shu Mountain, The Matrix, and other TV Series.","In the other movies and TV Series, the players had to study and learn on their own.","In the System, was there another movie that could give the viewers many skills and a lot of combat experience as the Resident Evil 1 did?","The answer was yes; Mr. Fang had seen it many times – Final Fantasy VII: Advent Children.","Fang Qi glanced at the System Interface and found it was in the genre of magic fantasy.","Should I... try this one...?"]},{"number":496,"title":"Chapter 496 - Boss Not Running the Tour Bus?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","[Unlocking Final Fantasy 7: Advent Children; unlocking the right to sell iced red tea.]","There had been only one beverage, Coke, in the fridge beside the cabinets. After the right to sell iced red tea was unlocked, crystal-like, translucent glass bottles with floral engravings appeared in the fridge. They looked grander and more up-scale compared to Coke.","The size of the bottle was twice of a Coke bottle.","Fang Qi glanced at the System Interface. [Iced red tea can be taken outside the shop to be shared with friends; 30 crystals per one bottle]","“Ugh?” Mr. Fang was surprised since the customers hadn’t been allowed to take food out of the shop before. However, this iced tea could not only be shared with friends but be taken out of the shop as well.","At 30 crystals per bottle, its price was the most expensive among all the food and beverages! However, its volume was only twice that of a bottle of Coke.","Fang Qi studied the glass bottle that contained the iced red tea and found that it had a strengthened insulation array which could keep the liquid at a fixed temperature, which was probably why it could be taken out and was so expensive.","After all, regardless of how tasty Coke was, if one took it out and exposed it to the air for a while, it would lose its flavor and the stimulation to the taste buds after the bubbles disappeared. It would be reduced to an ordinary beverage. While bubbles and carbonation were easy to be lost and hard to keep after the seal was opened, iced red tea didn’t have this problem.","...","As a mild-tempered old man, Gu Tingyun was old enough to be Nalan Hongwu’s grandfather and had put the days of battle behind him long ago. Each day, he would discuss Dao with some old friends while tasting and appreciating tea. Nowadays, the Dao that they talked about contained many new things, but his life remained leisurely and simple.","He wasn’t a fan of wine but loved drinking tea; he had tasted 1,000-year-old rain dragon tea, spiritual flower tea, and even a tiny bit of celestial tea that was saved in an ancient celestial relic.","Today, when he entered the shop, he saw a new item ‘iced red tea’ on the small blackboard.","“Ugh? Sir, what’s this iced red tea?”","Mr. Fang pointed at the engraved glass bottles, which were much large than Coke bottle, in the fridge. “It’s in the big bottles.”","Everyone knew that this fridge was for; it was used to keep things cold.","Making tea was a slow process of boiling tea with a small fire; none of them had seen tea in a fridge before.","“Master, should we buy one bottle and try it?” Wang Xie asked tentatively.","“Okay!” Gu Tingyun nodded. “I’ll take a bottle of iced red tea!”","He wanted to have a taste of the iced tea!","After paying, he immediately took one bottle from the fridge. After screwing off the cap, he took out three small teacups of red sandalwood color.","The black-robed Daoist Zhou Mo exclaimed behind them, “These are Purple Sand Cloud Dragon Cups that Master has treasured for many years. Junior Brother, you’re in luck!”","Hearing his words, Gu Tingyu got a bit proud. “I wonder if the iced red tea deserves being contained in my teacups.”","“Gulp! Gulp!” At this moment, a strange sound came from nearby.","They turned around and saw that a big white deer was gulping down the iced red tea while holding the bottle with its hooves.","“Princess Your Highness, this iced red tea is so delicious! It can even recover my spiritual essence! Awesome!”","“Little Bell, you know nothing but eating. You’ll be so fat!” Then, Jiang Xiaoyue gulped down some tea as well.","“They don’t know how to appreciate good tea!”","“They remind me of cattle chewing on peonies!”","“No! That deer is wasting red tea!”","The three people looked at this uncouth way of drinking tea in contempt. How could one savor the true taste of tea this way?!","Wang Xie placed the small teacups in a row and poured tea into them with adept and professional movement.","“Wow. The tea has the color of embers; its fragrance is faint but lingering.” Gu Tingyu picked up a teacup and sniffed. “Good tea! I’m surprised that this shop can produce such good tea!”","“It must be a tea made by spiritual buds that are at least 1,000 years old. I wonder how great the tea maker is. Even though it is cooled, it refreshed my mind and relieved my fatigue when I smelled it. Excellent! Indeed excellent!”","“Maybe... just as that deer said, it can recover the spiritual essence in our bodies?” Wang Xie said in surprise.","“If that’s true, we can sip some of it when we’re fatigued from cultivating, and then...” the black-robed Daoist Zhou Mo said in joy.","“Well, this tea might be good for your cultivation.” Gu Tingyun nodded and sipped the tea as if he were savoring it carefully and trying to feel it.","“Master, what do you think of it?” The two asked immediately.","“Gulp! Gulp!” Gu Tingyu drank the rest tea in his cup.","The two exchanged a look. “...”","– One minute later –","“Two more bottles of iced red tea!”","“Gulp... Gulp...”","...","“Boss, a new movie was released today?!” The sharp-eyed Jiang Xiaoyue saw another new item.","While the players couldn’t switch from one game to another in a short time, the movies were different and only took them two to three hours to finish. If they found some movies to their likings, they would happily stop playing games for a couple of hours.","Some would even want to study the stuff shown in the movie, but it wasn’t Jiang Xiaoyue’s concern.","“Final Fantasy?” She blinked her big eyes, staring at the blackboard behind Mr. Fang. “How come the names all sound so strange...”","[Sir, are you doing the group tour today?] Su Tianji sent Fang Qi a message on QQ; she was always eager for such activities.","[Oh... I’m not running a tour bus for this movie. You guys can watch it by yourselves.]","Su Tianji asked, [Ugh? Why not? Is it because it’s not good? 😏]","[Come on! Give some clues to Big Sister! (Husky’s dumb face)]","Mr. Fang stretched, obviously just getting up from bed. “It’s a special movie that I got with great efforts. I want to watch it alone.”","“Boss wants to watch it by himself?!” As a smart girl, Jiang Xiaoyue immediately activated it, finding that it cost 100 crystals, much more expensive than other movies and games.","“So expensive?!”","The big white deer had tears on its face. “So expensive... should I buy it?”","It glanced at the small crystal bag in its arms.","“Well. I’ll watch it first, and you can watch it if I think it is good, okay? Little Bell?”","“What if it’s not good...”","“Then, I’ll give the despicable Boss a good lesson!” With her hands on her waist, Jiang Xiaoyue looked fierce. However, she found that Mr. Fang had begun watching the movie and didn’t spare her a glance.","“Humph! I’ll watch it too!” Then, she quickly went to watch the movie.","– In the Jiuhua City Shop –","“What’s happening with the shop owner?” A few people watched from behind Su Tianji.","He’s acting all mysterious. I wonder what this kid is up to. Su Tianji was sulky.","After thinking for a while, she got even more impatient with curiosity. Forget it! I’ll just watch it!"]},{"number":497,"title":"Chapter 497 - The Legendary Battle","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Endless dangers lay in the ocean, which was why the two cultivation worlds had rarely contacted each other in the last hundreds of years even though the ancestors of the three saint factions had known the existence of a prosperous cultivation world across the ocean.","Ocean storms and many unknown but powerful demon beasts in the ocean blocked the path of at least 99 percent of cultivators.","Booming thunders rumbled in the distance. The sky above the turbulent ocean waves was covered by gloomy dark clouds, and big raindrops were swept into the ocean by gusts.","At this moment, several brilliant sword energies shot across the void like lightning flashes.","Boom!","A thunderbolt struck dangerously close to these sword energies.","“Don’t fly too high!”","The sword energies flashed past the mountain-like ocean waves.","“We’ll be out of the storm zone soon!”","“Look out under you! Be careful of the demon beasts in the ocean!”","There were two groups of sword energies. One group of them were cultivators who were Daoists wearing black and white Daoist robes and beautiful women wearing white clothes. They stood at the front of the swords with their clothes flapping in the wind, looking like immortals.","They were people of the Nanhua Faction, Yimu Daoist Palace, and other forces in the Morning Star Sea Realm.","In the other group, the people were dressed in all kinds of clothes. These people included a black-clothed cultivator emitting chilly murderous spirit, a devilish, green-eyed woman wearing green clothes, and a white-haired young man with a smooth, handsome face.","They were cultivators from Half City.","“They all say that the outer sea is extremely dangerous, but it seems fine to me!” A middle-aged, black-robed man with black long hair said with a laugh, “I think it won’t take us long to reach the continent where Jiuhua City is situated.”","“Old Black, we’ll have a good match with the warriors of Dajin and see who deserves to be the Master of Sand City!”","“Hahahaha!”","“Be careful.” Mo Tianxing’s turbid eyes looked forward. “We know nothing about the outer sea. We must save our spiritual energy because there’s no land for us to take a break before we arrive.”","“Do you guys hear that?” Suddenly, Duan Yue of the Haoran Sword Faction said in a grave voice.","“There are sounds.”","With faint frowns, the cultivators listened carefully while flying forward. Sure enough, some faint sounds came with ocean winds.","It sounded like whispers at their ears or faint songs and gradually dispersed.","“Have you noticed that?!” Suddenly, someone said, “We’ve flown so long but are still at the edge of the storm zone!”","They looked up and saw that the sky was still covered by dark clouds.","...","– In the Jiuhua City Shop –","After Su Tianji began watching the new movie, only a few other cultivators and warriors who had abundant crystals followed her suit.","The Final Fantasy Series covered almost all elements of magic, technology, and cold weapons, which were the focus of the movie, Final Fantasy 7.","Since these cultivators had known about magic and sci-fi concepts, they understood the movie with the help of the introduction at the beginning of the movie.","It was a strange world where the Lifestream ran across the planet, giving life to everything in the world.","After humans transformed the Lifestream into an energy source through powerful technology, humans entered a period of great prosperity, and the creator of this technology, the Shinra Corporation, stood on the top of the world.","Of course, there were oppositions, but they were destroyed by brutal suppression.","Shinra had a group of special soldiers with the cells of Jenova, an extraterrestrial life-form that had come from outer space in the ancient times with the mission to destroy the planet.","A soldier named Sephiroth was the most talented one, but he hated Shinra when he found out that he was created in a horrible experiment. As time went by, his hatred spread to all the things in the world, and he planned to destroy the whole planet as revenge.","In the war lasting many, many years, one story came and went after another like radiant splashes in the long river of time. There were many epic legends and stories of heroes.","Finally, the planet ended the war with its own strength by spewing out the Lifestream, cleansing all the conflicts, desires and sorrow. The humans who survived until the end continued living in the ruins.","However, when the disaster passed, the war continued.","“Wow! This is awesome!” Jiang Xiaoyue was enthralled by the fierce battle at the beginning of the movie. It must be noted that the battle scenes were more real than the original version; it looked like a battle in the real world.","For example, the main character Cloud and the villain Sephiroth were like war machines, so their battle was extremely enthralling and hard to come by.","Before Fang Qi had traveled through space and time, the movie viewers and game players were ordinary people, and all the battles could be seen with the naked eye, regardless of how strong the characters were.","However, in the system version, except for some necessary slow-motion scenes, the speed, strength, and techniques weren’t altered and stayed the same as the levels in the real world.","Only real battles like these could benefit the players and increase their strength.","“They are all warriors... but these guys look like they can’t be killed, just like Dante in Devil May Cry...?” Su Tianji frowned as she watched.","She had a feeling that these techniques and battle experience were sealed in her mind. She had had the same feeling when she watched Resident Evil, from which she had mastered all the close-range combat skills afterward. She felt like she would probably know how to use the double-handed sword techniques after watching the movie.","“Ugh...? Does it work the same way as Resident Evil?” Eagerly, she continued watching.","Except for the ideas that the movie wanted to express, the main story was quite simple. The legendary soldier Sephiroth returned from the legends.","The battles escalated from combat between soldiers to the resurrection of Sephiroth until they came to the Legendary Battle!","“Young Master Song, is this movie good or not?” Lin Shao looked impatient.","At this moment, Song Qingfeng watched as Cloud hacked down from a height of 100 meters with a huge saber that was as tall as one man’s height.","The ground in the area cracked and then shattered with booming noises.","The horrifying energy spread out all over the place.","With silver hair fluttering in the wind, an extremely slim long blade had easily blocked this huge, double-handed saber!","Below the silver hair, a familiar face looked up slowly as if returning from the ancient past.","“F*ck! It’s awesome! Come here and look at this handsome guy!” Song Qingfeng exclaimed."]},{"number":498,"title":"Chapter 498 - Couldn’t Hold Back and Have to Mimic","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","The cultivators of the Morning Star Sea Realm called the vast ocean to their west, which few people had ever visited, the outer sea.","This area was fraught with sea monsters and demons. It had been a forbidden zone for humans since the ancient times.","“What demons are trying to mess with us?”","The faint singing sounds in the wind of the ocean intended to bring people into a deep dream.","“Guard your minds and concentrate!”","Among the group, some were elite disciples coming out for worldly experience.","Obviously, the unknown demons were quite powerful, and Mo Xian and the other disciples with lower cultivation strengths began to feel fuzzy. Although they had surpassed the True Lake Realm and were close to the Divine Ocean Realm, they were still much weaker than the others.","Frustrated, she glanced at Yue Yan beside her and said, “Junior Sister... how come you’re not affected?!”","Yue Yan was chanting, “Remain icy clear in mind; stay calm if the sky crashes down...”","“Junior Sister Liu, you feel nothing too?!” Mo Xian gaped at her junior sisters around her.","“Didn’t you watch Wind and Cloud?!”","“No...” Mo Xian was puzzled.","“Then, we can’t help you.”","“Ahh...!”","...","“What the heck is so awesome about this Final Fantasy?! What is dashing and handsome?”","Although the task only required Fang Qi to expand the Yuanyang City shop to 1,000 computers, Fang Qi had increased the seats to over 2,000 to accommodate the large number of disciples of other families and factions besides the ordinary customers and disciples of the ancient families.","Since each player got to play 8 hours each day, and the hours of operation of the shop was 16 hours a day, the shop could accommodate about 4,000 customers if each of them used up the 8-hour daily limit.","Due to the expansion, the players of Yuanyang City didn’t have to wait in line. No longer anxious for seats, some players stood behind Jiang Xiaoyue and watched the movie.","They heard Jiang Xiaoyue yell and scream all throughout the movie.","“Hey! Go and watch it by yourselves!” At this moment, Jiang Xiaoyue was watching the final battle between Cloud and Sephiroth. Enthralled, she sat straighter and wouldn’t budge for anything.","Both characters had the genes of Jenova which was famous for its ability to destroy planets. As the most elite soldiers, Cloud and Sephiroth’s saber and sword techniques were ultimately fast and clean. Sephiroth’s saber was like a perfect tool for killing; the slim and long blade danced without any tricks and weaknesses. Everything that the blade touched, including thick iron plates and even heavy boulders, was hacked open smoothly like tofu.","“Senior Sister, should we watch it or not?” Mu Qing asked angrily, “She is so enthralled that she is ignoring us! What is so good about it?”","At this moment, Gu Tingyu was enjoying iced red tea while holding a bottle in his arms.","“Wow!” he sighed with satisfaction.","“Ugh? Why are you all standing here?”","“We asked Junior Sister Xiaoyue whether Final Fantasy is good or not, but she is ignoring us!”","“Hmph! She only knows how to enjoy it herself!”","“Let’s go and watch it too!”","Tang Yu, Xun Yuan, and the others wondered, “Shall we...”","Gu Tingyun murmured, “Should I try it too?”","Immediately, they all began to watch the movie.","At this moment, the early viewers such as Su Tianji and Song Qingfeng had reached the end where the climax was.","As the most powerful existence amongst these soldiers, Sephiroth was called the legendary hero; he was the perfect product of the Jenova Project and had the horrifying power to destroy planets. Even though he only had less than half of his original power after his resurrection, his powerful combat techniques and horrifying battle experience struck despair into his opponents.","“So strong!” Song Qingfeng and the other viewers watched the scenes wide-eyed, thrilled by the battle full of bone-crushing punches and blood-inducing strikes.","“How come this person has wings?!” Su Tianji exclaimed and almost dropped the spicy stick that she was chewing in her mouth.","The long saber that was about three meters long casually stabbed forward and pierced the defense of Cloud’s huge, double-handed saber before going through the latter’s chest with vicious force, nailing him in mid-air.","When the last black feathered wing spread out, the audience felt that Sephiroth’s aura had grown to a horrifying new height!","The battle scenes were even more thrilling in the remake version. The legendary soldier had revealed a small part of his combat techniques that were designed for killing.","The blade slashed up.","As fast as lightning, the saber energies followed Cloud who had been thrown into the air. With muffled blade cries, the extremely long saber struck out eight times in the blink of an eye, moving like light flashes.","“This Sephiroth is dashing! Superb!”","“What is dashing again?!” Lin Shao and the others who hadn’t reached this part asked, “Isn’t Sephiroth a bad guy?”","“Keep watching. It’s awesome!”","“Ahh–!” Dong Qingli, a fan of all stories, wouldn’t miss any movies or TV Series. At this moment, she almost jumped up from her seat with a shriek.","“What’s so dashing?” A black shadow was hiding in a corner. Since a new movie came out today, he enjoyed it while sipping iced red tea.","The dark clouds in the sky spun above Sephiroth’s head like a huge vortex. In his one-winged angel form, Sephiroth stood in mid-air with his long saber while his silver hair fluttered in the strong wind. With his presence getting deeper and more horrifying like a bottomless abyss, he looked like a demonic god who had just fallen from Heaven.","“Pu~” Watching this scene, he almost spat out the red tea in his mouth.","For one instant, he felt like this was what a bad*ss antagonist should look like!","He had a feeling that he had worked hard in vain all these past years.","The battle continued. With the powerful healing ability of the genes of Jenova, Cloud could still continue the battle despite many setbacks. Now, he unleashed 120% of his combat force.","– In the final moment –","“What technique is this?!”","The cultivators and warriors who were watching the movie in the three shops almost yelled again at the same time.","Emitting a pale blue light, the huge blade in Cloud’s hand suddenly split.","Five blades surrounded the two from all directions as if they were alive and intelligent.","Cloud’s weapon, the ‘Fusion Sword’, was a big weapon consisting of six swords. Cloud transformed into a blurry shadow while the sword and sword energies hacked toward his rival from all directions.","Black feathers flew up into the sky. Even protected by his feathered wing, Sephiroth was severely wounded in the blink of an eye.","The viewers couldn’t see the two powerful soldiers in the sky; dark blue shadows and lights pierced the clouds.","“Both of them are so dashing!”","“I feel like I know how to use the giant sword techniques!” Song Qingfeng immediately ran out.","“I feel like I can also use the saber techniques!” Lin Shao followed him, practicing with his saber and creating whistling sounds.","“You guys know nothing!” With a snort, Su Tianji got a clothes pole from somewhere; it was indeed long. “Look at my sword strike!”","She copied the moves with which Sephiroth threw Cloud into the sky.","“Return my clothes pole if you are so capable!”"]},{"number":499,"title":"Chapter 499 - Escaped","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Master, senior sister seems to have been lured by the demon!”","“She’s going that way...”","“Gosh! How embarrassing!”","Before they could finish their words, they heard a furious yell, “Demon, where are you?! Take my Heavenly Mirror!”","Following the shout, a round mirror, that seemed to be made of gold and jade, flew out.","A white beam shot from the mirror, automatically locking one spot in the distant ocean.","The others’ faces turned dark, and they thought, Damn! We don’t even see the monster yet, yet he used the Heavenly Mirror already?","“Daoist Friend Duan... aren’t you going to reserve your spiritual essence...” The Xichi Spiritual Master was at a loss for words; she knew that Heavenly Mirror’s consumption of spiritual essence was horrifyingly high.","“It’s fine. My mimic of the Heavenly Mirror only has two functions, which are locking and searching! It’s fine!” Duan Yue laughed, “I’ve locked it down.”","“Watch my Ghost-God-Slaying Spell!” A fiery red sword energy struck out like a huge mountain. Instantly, dark-red bloody water surged up from the spot shone by the white light beam.","“Good sword technique!”","“Good spiritual treasure!”","They all looked smug while complimenting each other.","When the corpse which had been hacked into two halves floated to the surface of the ocean, they saw that it was a snake-like body with thin black hair on its head.","“This is...!?”","“What’s this?!” Everyone exchanged a look of bafflement.","This was not an ordinary demon; it was something none of the Divine Ocean Realm cultivators had ever seen before. More importantly, the demon’s presence was even more powerful than that of the Divine Ocean Realm. If not for the swift sword strike from Red Wing Daoist, it would have gotten away.","At this moment, the singing from the depths of the ocean got even gloomier and creepier, and more sound waves appeared and overlapped, greatly disturbing the mind of the low-leveled cultivators even though they kept chanting the Ice Heart Mental Technique.","“No! There are more!”","“That demon isn’t dead!” The demon which had just floated to the surface took this opportunity to dive back into the ocean.","“There are more than one! Everyone, be careful!”","The series of strange singing came from all directions, oozing endless hatred and murderous spirit.","Even the Divine Ocean Realm cultivators felt fuzzy and anxious, let alone those who were at the True Lake Realm.","“Damn it!” The hot-tempered Black Demon couldn’t bear it anymore. “All of you! Cover your ears!”","Instantly, Black Demon cast a spell. His black murderous spirit extended into the sky and suddenly created a gloomy blood-colored shadow.","The blood-colored shadow struck fear in everyone’s mind as soon as it appeared.","“Take my Blood Demon Roar!” Black Demon used his tremendous spiritual essence to condense the shape of the Youquan Blood Demon from Shu Mountain. This new spell, which mimicked the sensation of the Youquan Blood Demon’s roar in Shu Mountain, had been improved and was becoming complete.","Roar!","Boom! Boom! Boom! Boom!","The earth-shaking, ocean-moving roar split open the sea water, erupting huge waves to both sides. All the sounds in the region were crushed by this furious roar, and several clouds of blood mists exploded at the bottom of the ocean.","“Damn it!” Black Demon withdrew the technique and exhaled a mouthful of turbid air. “It’s finally quiet!”","Red Wing Daoist and Duan Yue exchanged a look, and their faces twitched a little.","“No! More of them are coming up!” Blood didn’t seem to drive away the demons. Instead, it seemed to stimulate their fierce nature.","The water boiled and the sand from the bottom of the ocean rose to the surface. Many black shadows swam in the turbulent waves.","“You guys! Quickly look down at the ocean!”","They seemed to see that an enormous black shadow was swimming up from the bottom.","“Hey! Watch my Innumerable Sword Scroll!” Many swords suddenly shot down from the sky.","“Great heavenly power, turn into godly lightning and follow the direction of my sword! Watch my Godly Sword Lightning-Controlling True Spell!” Lightning bolts gathered and struck down with booming noises.","“Ice Roar!” Many ice pallets crashed toward the bottom of the ocean.","“Ghost-God-Slaying Spell!” A red light rose like a mountain.","“Watch my Heavenly Mirror!” Duan Yue used his Heavenly Mirror again.","“Summon Godly Beast!” Someone raised his Dragon Fang Sword.","The godly beast appeared on the surface of the ocean.","Gulu... Gulu...","It sank into the ocean.","“...”","“Damn it! Watch my Heavenly Sword!”","A giant, horrifying godly sword was condensed in the sky.","In the rolling thunders in the sky, the cultivators all used the Innumerable Sword Scroll together, almost blocking out the sky with countless sword energies.","“Wu!” With a deep groan, the seawater surged, and the huge shadow swam back to the bottom of the ocean slowly.","It escaped!","...","Meanwhile, in the Yuanyang City Shop, Zong Wu, Gu Tingyun, and the others were also watching the new movie ‘Final Fantasy 7’.","The war finally came to an end. Cloud barely won the battle with his ultimate move ‘Omnislash’, and Sephiroth, who had just returned, was sent to the place where he belonged.","The people finally could walk out of the ruins, and the dark clouds scattered, revealing the sunshine that they hadn’t seen for a long time.","The bleak, dirty ruined cities full of tragic memories looked welcoming and beautiful in the temporary peace.","Perhaps people would rebuild the cities from the ruins, and perhaps the children and friends were waiting for the return of their hero ‘Cloud’.","Wars were cold. However, people could only feel the warmth of the scenes at the end of the story after witnessing the damage that the war had inflicted.","“Ahahahaha!” Castellan Zong Wu raced out of the shop as soon as he finished watching the movie. “I feel like I obtained so much understanding about battles!”","Taking out a weapon from his storage spiritual artifact, he started to practice and wave it wildly on the street.","“I feel like I’ve mastered many new battle techniques.”","“Hahaha! I feel so good!”","The passersby looked at him at a loss for words.","“Senior Sister!” Mu Qing said, “I feel like... I’ve suddenly understood many things.”","“So do I... It’s so powerful...” Yue Bai exclaimed.","“You’re right!” Tang Yu said with a laugh, “I feel like I can battle with warriors up-close!”","“I can’t wait to try them!” Rushing out of the shop, Xun Yuan picked up a weapon on the side and started swinging.","“Humph! Watch me!” Obviously, Jiang Xiaoyue had also learned many techniques.","“Me! Me! Me!” The big white deer ran out with happy shouts. After paying the activation fee with gritted teeth, it suddenly memorized many sword techniques and important basic knowledge after watching the movie.","It danced out of the door. “I can use the sword techniques too! I’ll show you!”","Just as it lifted its two hooves, it saw how the others were gripping the sword handles with both hands and then it looked back at its hooves.","“Wah!” It burst into tears.","..."]},{"number":500,"title":"Chapter 500 - Teleportation Array Is Finished; the Netizens Are Going to Meet","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Just as the ancient legends claimed, this voyage across the sea connecting the east and the west was full of dangers.","However, the travelers who were on this voyage across the ocean consisted of many grand cultivators with high cultivation strength from the Morning Star Sea Realm. The cultivators of Half City and the big factions such as the Nanhua Faction were led by Divine Ocean Realm cultivators. Also, the extremely fast speed of the sword control technique saved them many troubles and avoided fighting with demons and monsters in the ocean, making this journey a thrilling but safe trip.","As for the direction, it wasn’t a concern since the cultivators’ star-observing technique was more accurate than a compass.","It was the first alliance activity in the history of the cultivation world in the Morning Star Sea Realm, and its destination was the Spiritual State, the legendary continent with abundant spiritual essence, singing birds, and fragrant flowers.","The cultivators of Half City and the major factions decided to temporarily forgo their previous conflicts and be friendly to each other. So far, they got along well except for some minor arguments.","“Guys! Look over there!”","“It’s an island!”","“Ahh!” Mo Xian and the others exclaimed with joy.","They finally saw land after traveling for days.","“Are we there finally?!” Demonic Woman Ning Bi’s eyes brightened.","Many sword energies flashed across the blue sky with dragon-like roars; it was a heroic journey that would be recorded in the history of the Morning Star Sea Realm.","“Finally! Here we are!”","“Hurry! Take out the communication jade and see if we have any internet signal!” Mo Tianxing yelled excitedly.","“Use mine,” the white-haired young man said.","The Unbound King had a super advanced communication jade and downloaded QQ on it.","If they could log into QQ, then...","Everyone intently stared at the icon of a penguin on the virtual screen.","[Searching for networks...]","One second.","Two seconds.","Three seconds.","“The search found something?!”","“Login successful!”","“Oh my goodness! We logged in! We can connect to the networks of Jiuhua City!”","Mr. Fang glanced at the group chat om QQ.","What’s wrong? So many messages?!","In each group chap, messages flooded the screen.","Liu Ningyun said, [Jiuhua City! Here we come!]","Mo Xian chimed in, [<img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f60f.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F60F;\"> I’ll be in Spiritual State soon! Hahahaha! It’s my first trip out of the Morning Star Sea Realm.]","Ruan Ning said, [I’m furious. I have to watch the shop for the despicable Mr. Fang.]","Su Yao voiced her thought, [I’m so envious of them... I regret not cultivating hard enough...]","Obviously, she couldn’t come due to her low cultivation strength.","Yue Yan took a group photo and posted it in the group chat. [Dang! Dang! Dang! Look at this!]","It was a screenshot in which the people of Morning Star Sea Realm flew in the blue sky on swords above the cyan ocean.","Song Qingfeng said, [“F*ck?!]","Xu Zixin typed, [<img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f628.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F628;\"> Wow! Who’s this green-clothed beauty standing at the foremost of the group?!]","Nalan Mingxue said, [She’s the one who cosplayed Biyao last time.]","Black Demon said, [<img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f600.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F600;\"> Who was the person that told me to hit him through the internet cable? Here I am.]","Sitting before his computer, Song Qingfeng’s face darkened. “...”","Ji Wu said, [<img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f600.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F600;\"> Where are you now? I’ll send people of Dajin to officially welcome you!]","Ning Bi replied, [It’s not necessary.]","Mr. Fang asked, [You’ve arrived?]","Ning Bi said, [Of course, Big Sister is flying toward the continent. I’ll see you soon, little shop owner. <img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f609.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F609;\">]","Mr. Fang typed, [<img class=\"emoji\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/11/svg/1f633.svg\" alt=\"&#x1F633;\"> I’ll ask if the teleportation array is ready @Amiable Academy Master Gu.]","– Meanwhile, in the center of Jiuhua City –","Under the heavy guard of the Jiuhua Army was a huge and magnificent palace. In the center of the palace were complicated grooves in the ground. In the very center was a square-shaped platform on which inlaid an ancient-looking stone array disk.","The stone array disk had a diameter of a little over a dozen meters, and some complicated and mysterious patterns were engraved onto the surface.","Requested by many customers, Yuxu Mountain and Xuanzhong Manor had moved the teleportation array disks from their factions to Jiuhua City. In the future, they would use this array as the core and create teleportation arrays leading to different major factions.","Of course, Yuxu Mountain and Xuanzhong Manor offered this array on the condition that other factions must contribute money to build the teleportation arrays leading to Yuxu Mountain and Xuanzhong Faction, and these two arrays must be built before the others.","Around the teleportation array were slots that could fit spirit stones. Although it didn’t need people to activate the arrays at the destinations before using this array like how it was required for the small teleportation portals in Diablo 2, this teleportation array’s greatest disadvantage was its huge consumption of energy. Even with improvements, each activation would consume thousands of spirit stones.","“Put the demon beasts on it!” Jun Yanzi of the Wuwei Daoist Alliance, Gongshu Kuo of the Yundian Upper Realm, and artifact masters of Xuanzhong Manor and Yuxu Mountain had joined the project of repairing and testing the teleportation array.","Standing around the teleportation array, the cultivators looked solemn. It was the first operation of the new teleportation array.","For most of the cultivators of the Wuwei Daoist Alliance, this was their first time seeing the legendary teleportation array and operating it in person.","Several low-level demon beasts were immobilized and placed on the ancient stone disk that had a diameter of a little over a dozen meters.","While they kept putting in spirit stones, the teleportation array was activated under the movements of Jun Yangzi.","Cultivators of the Deserted Sea Realm and the cultivators of the Spiritual State who had joined the Teleportation Array Project stared at the array intently.","The grooves and engravings on the ground emitted pale blue spiritual light first.","“Back off!”","The spiritual light flowed along the grooves and engravings like water and gathered in the platform in the center before coming into the ancient-looking array disk.","Then, the spiritual light enveloped the few demon beasts.","Hum!","With strange deep sound, the people sensed that mystical changes happened inside the teleportation array. Meanwhile, the magnetic field activated by the spiritual essence was changing drastically.","The most obvious effect was that the signals of their communication jades faltered and strengthened repeatedly. Both the spiritual essence signals and electromagnetic signals dropped to the lowest point.","Then, they heard a strange whistling sound.","“Beep!”","The demon beasts standing on the teleportation array platform vanished!","– Meanwhile, in the teleportation array relic on Zixiao Mountain in the Spiritual State –","Several demon beasts suddenly appeared on the huge disk.","“We made it!”","Gu Tingyun uploaded a screenshot in the group chat. “The teleportation is a success! We’ll check if the demon beasts are harmed and teleport them back. If it goes well, we can teleport people.”","“Awesome!”","“We can finally meet our friends from the internet!”","“The cultivators of the Morning Star Sea Realm have arrived. Let’s go and meet them!”","Captain Yu Chi shouted in the group chat, [Brothers, let’s go and see how ugly that guy of the Black Demon Guards looks!]","Black Demon replied, [Get Lost! Dumb birds of the Jiuhua Army.]"]}]);
